{	
	// Timberline Weddings
	"Wedding.Bea.Speech.1": "Alright. Let's get to it. We don't stand on ceremony in Timberline. We don't have the time for it.",
	"Wedding.Bea.Speech.2": "We are here to witness a promise. Not a fairy tale. Not a movie script. A real promise between two people who know the value of hard work.",
	"Wedding.Bea.Speech.3": "Living out here... it tests you. The winters are long. The mud is deep. And the world outside forgets we exist sometimes.",
	"Wedding.Bea.Speech.4": "That's why this matters. Marriage isn't just about love. It's about having someone to help you hold up the roof when the snow gets heavy.",
	"Wedding.Bea.Speech.5": "It's about knowing that when the power goes out and the road washes away... you aren't sitting in the dark alone.",
	"Wedding.Bea.Speech.6": "You are promising to be each other's shelter. That is a heavy thing. Don't take it lightly.",
	"Wedding.Bea.PlayerAsk": "@, do you promise to stand your ground? To be the steady hand when things break? To stay, even when it would be easier to leave?",
	"Wedding.Bea.SpouseAsk": "And you. Do you promise to share the weight? To offer rest when they are weary? To be the home they come back to?",
	"Wedding.Bea.Pronounce": "You've said the words. Now you have to live them. By the authority of this town—and because I said so—I pronounce you partners.",
	"Wedding.Bea.Kiss": "Seal it. Then let's eat. I didn't cook for three days for you to starve.",
	"Wedding.Bea.Arden": "Arden. You spend your life looking back. You ready to look forward?",
	"Wedding.Arden.Response": "I am. The past is safe. I want to build a future now.",
	"Wedding.Bea.Cassidy": "Cassidy. You can stop running now, honey. You're safe here. Do you promise to just... be?",
	"Wedding.Cassidy.Response": "I promise. No more running. I'm staying right here.",
	"Wedding.Bea.Jett": "Jett. People aren't machines. You can't fix them with a wrench. You gotta be patient. You got that in you?$6",
	"Wedding.Jett.Response": "Patient. Yeah. I can do patient. For this? I can do anything.$6",
	"Wedding.Bea.Mara": "Mara. The river keeps moving, but a marriage needs roots. Are you ready to plant them?",
	"Wedding.Mara.Response": "My roots are deep, Bea. I'm not drifting anymore.",
	"Wedding.Bea.Silas": "Silas. It's dangerous to rely on someone else. You willing to take that risk?",
	"Wedding.Silas.Response": "It's a risk. But... I trust my partner. I'm ready.",
	"Wedding.Bea.Roxy": "Roxy. This ain't a gig. You can't walk off stage if the crowd gets rough. You in it for the long haul?",
	"Wedding.Roxy.Response": "No backing out. I know. I'm not going anywhere.",
	"Wedding.Bea.Remy": "Remy. You chase the beauty in the world. But life gets ugly sometimes. You gonna stay for the ugly parts too?",
	"Wedding.Remy.Response": "The ugly parts are part of the song, Bea. I'm staying for the whole track.",
	"Wedding.Bea.Vance": "Vance. You've spent a long time fighting. You ready to lay down the armor and just live?",
	"Wedding.Vance.Response": "Affirmative. The war is over. I'm coming home.",
	"Wedding.Bea.Generic": "And you. I don't know your story, sugar, but you're planting roots here now. Do you promise to hold fast? To be the anchor that keeps @ safe when the storms roll in?",
	"Wedding.Generic.Response": "I promise. I'm not going anywhere.",
	
	// Quests
  "QuestEvent.ParkStart.01": "It's even worse than I remembered...$2",
  "QuestEvent.ParkStart.02": "Oh... @! You actually came!$1",
  "QuestEvent.ParkStart.03": "I know this place ain't much to look at right now. Just broken glass, dead weeds, and broken dreams.",
  "QuestEvent.ParkStart.04": "The previous mayor promised to turn this lot into something to be proud of. A place for the town to gather and breathe.",
  "QuestEvent.ParkStart.05": "Instead, he ran out of funding, and left us with this ugly scar.",
  "QuestEvent.ParkStart.06": "Every time I walk past it, it's a reminder of what happens when people stop caring.",
  "QuestEvent.ParkStart.07": "But... it doesn't have to stay a monument to broken promises. We could fix it. I think you and I know how to restore things around here, @!$1",
  "QuestEvent.ParkStart.08": "If you have time, would you help me bring this place back to life?",
  "QuestEvent.ParkStart.09": "Thank you. Truly. Let's start by cleaning the place up. I'll get paperwork and permits in order.",
  
	// NPC dialogue
	   // Arden
		"Arden.Day.Mon": "I try to dust the upper shelves every Monday. The dust around is 40% pine pollen and 60% regret. Both make me sneeze!",
"Arden.Day.Tue": "I have been cataloging a collection of spoons from the Elemental Wars. They were owned by soldiers because of their sharpened handles. My father would have loved them. I hate them.$3",
"Arden.Day.Wed": "It is quiet today. The building seems to groan under the weight of time.",
"Arden.Day.Thu": "Please do not lean on that. It is from the original Gotoro Empire. If it breaks, I can’t afford to replace it.. and likely neither can you.",
"Arden.Day.Fri": "The weekend always brings tourists to my shop. They all have sticky hands and do not know the stories of things, just that it 'looks neat'.",
"Arden.Day.Sat": "Jett approached me to ask if I wanted help 'cleaning' the metal artifacts in my shop. I had to physically block the door in their face. They need to learn that rust is a protective layer for these metals, that philistine!$3",
"Arden.Day.Sun": "The shop on Sundays always draws me in, the light on the windows always seems to end up casting the perfect light.",
"Arden.Introduction": "Welcome, yes the shop is open. Please keep your backpack straps close to your body. Many of the artifacts in my shop have survived the Elemental Wars. It would be a tragedy if they died because you were careless!",
"Arden.DumpsterDiveComment": "I know how important it is to you to have your own personal connection to history. However, are there not other ways to preserve it besides taking it from its original home?",
"Arden.HitBySlingshot": "Cease your barbaric assault on my shop! You may have damaged something irreplaceable and valuable, or on me!$3",
"Arden.WipedMemory": "Have we met before? I have a feeling that I should know you, but my shop records are blank.$6",
"Arden.Weather.Rain": "The moisture in the air today is a direct threat to the historical documents I have collected in my shop. I must ensure that they are sealed properly to protect them from the elements.",
"Arden.Weather.Snow": "The cold is an excellent preservative for the items in my shop. Finally, the relentless march of entropy has been somewhat halted by the cold climate outside the shop’s door.",
"Arden.Weather.GreenRain": "Do not open the door! The moss has begun to overtake my shop! It’s leading to the entropy of these once-magnificent statues!$5",
"Arden.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "The moss has stopped expanding. At least temporarily. I will be getting around to scrubbing these statues in the coming several weeks.",
"Arden.Hearts2.Mon": "I’m working. Try not to breathe too heavily on the glass window of my shop. The condensation could potentially damage the wooden display cases.",
"Arden.Hearts2.Tue": "If you find any artifacts in your travels, bring them to me. Gunther stores all the artifacts in the cold display case in my shop. I’ll give them a place to rest when they come to my shop.",
"Arden.Hearts2.Wed": "Most of my time is spent fighting against the elements of entropy that seek to claim this shop and its artifacts for the wild wilderness outside.",
"Arden.Hearts2.Thu": "You track a lot of mud in here in your boots. I will sweep the floor when you leave the shop.",
"Arden.Hearts2.Fri": "You’re surprisingly light on your feet for a farmer. Most of them stomp in my barn when they come to visit.$8",
"Arden.Hearts2.Sat": "I’m reading a book on the geology of the land where your farm used to be. It used to be a swamp 300 years ago.",
"Arden.Hearts2.Sun": "I do not sell reproductions of the artifacts in my shop. If you are looking for a plastic sword or some other toy, go to the toy store. Everything else here has a ghost attached to it.",
"Arden.Hearts4.Mon": "What do you know about ancient agriculture? Did you know they used fish bones for fertilizer?",
"Arden.Hearts4.Tue": "Look at this map of the valley we live in. This valley has been fought over five times in the past two centuries. It’s hard to find a place to put your feet without stepping on a battlefield.",
"Arden.Hearts4.Wed": "I made a pot of tea for you. It has gotten cold while I was reading. You are welcome to have it.",
"Arden.Hearts4.Thu": "Gunther says I am a hoarder of artifacts. However, I am a curator of souls who collects these souls in my shop. It’s a difference.",
"Arden.Hearts4.Fri": "You're typically quieter than the other tourists who come through my shop. I appreciate that. Please, stay a while with me. Just do not touch the porcelain items.",
"Arden.Hearts4.Sat": "Do you ever wonder who lived in your farmhouse before your grandfather? According to the deed records of the land where that farm is established, it is a tragic list of souls who have called this home. However, you, you are not part of that pattern.$6",
"Arden.Hearts4.Sun": "I feel calm today. Most days, I feel like I am surrounded by silence. However, with you here today, I feel peace.$1",
"Arden.Hearts6.Mon": "I was looking at this map of the valley we live in. There is a forgotten shrine near your farm. Have you seen it, or has the forest claimed the land for its own?",
"Arden.Hearts6.Tue": "I was looking for a specific coin in the old shop near here. However, I have forgotten why I came into the shop.",
"Arden.Hearts6.Wed": "My father was a soldier in the Elemental Wars. He believed in burning all the old weapons to make way for the new weapons to be made. I believe he was wrong. What we are without our ashes from the fires of war, we are nothing.",
"Arden.Hearts6.Thu": "The damp in the walls of the shop worries me. If the archives ever do flood, I will lose the work of my life. Why am I telling you this to you? You have to deal with the floods every spring.",
"Arden.Hearts6.Fri": "You have a spot of dirt on your cheek. No, do not wipe it off. It suits you! You are being used by the world today, just as I have been used by my shop.$8",
"Arden.Hearts6.Sat": "I found a book for you. It’s about the geology of the mines in the area. I thought you might find it useful.",
"Arden.Hearts6.Sun": "Today I realized that I spend all of my time fighting against the elements of entropy to preserve the history of the shop and the items within it. However, I have no idea what to do with the present day and the present time.",
"Arden.Hearts8.Mon": "I find myself waiting for the shop’s door chime that usually elicits dread from me. However, if it’s you…I don’t mind. In fact, I might even be… pleased.$4",
"Arden.Hearts8.Tue": "I spotted a flower bloom by the river today. I almost went to pick it to press into my book. However, I decided to let it bloom in its own time.",
"Arden.Hearts8.Wed": "Work? No. I am not working today. At least, not anymore. I am merely pretending to be working so that you will not look so smug in your boots!$8",
"Arden.Hearts8.Thu": "I used to be scared of change. However, since you have become the face of change in this valley, it’s okay to feel it in my blood!",
"Arden.Hearts8.Fri": "I found a locket today. It’s empty. When I found it, I almost wondered who would I put in that locket?$4",
"Arden.Hearts8.Sat": "Would you like to stay a while longer in my shop? The dust will not be going anywhere… But you are! I would like to keep you here for a little while longer!$4",
"Arden.Hearts8.Sun": "It’s quite lonely in here all by itself in my shop with all of the artifacts of the items that have been dead for centuries. However, it’s nice to have something that is alive and breathing in here with me!",
"Arden.Hearts10.Mon": "When I look at you, I long to cast you in amber. To keep you safe from the outside world, but you would never be you if I did.",
"Arden.Hearts10.Tue": "For much of my life, I attempted to stop time in order to keep the breakable elements of my world from shattering. But I’ve finally reached a point in my life where I am ready to let go and allow time to change me and you.",
"Arden.Hearts10.Wed": "Compared to your vibrancy, my collection is stagnant.$2",
"Arden.Hearts10.Thu": "I love you as if I had found something pristine amongst the rubble of the world.$4",
"Arden.Hearts10.Fri": "You are the rarest of all the things in my collection, my dear. Not because of your age but because of your presence in my life.$4",
"Arden.Hearts10.Sat": "I am clearing a shelf in my shop. Not of one of my artifacts but of your things if you would like to leave them here.$8",
"Arden.Hearts10.Sun": "Let’s make a piece of history, the type that is left uncelebrated and unremarked upon by the outside world.$1",
"Arden.Day.Spring.Mon": "The dampness in here is rising. Mold is the enemy of memory.",
"Arden.Day.Spring.Tue": "You’re leaving mud in here. Mud contains moisture that will destroy my papers.",
"Arden.Day.Spring.Wed": "I found a coin in the river today eroded by the water until the coin’s face is completely gone. It made me think of how time can erode the memories of human beings.",
"Arden.Day.Spring.Thu": "Gunther comes into the shop to collect items to fill a shelf. Items such as the metal spoon that belonged to a soldier using it for his last meal. Gunther will never hear the spirits that dwell here in the shop.",
"Arden.Day.Spring.Fri": "My father burned entire villages as a child. He claimed it was for “tactical necessity.” I learned to pull books out of the ashes as a result. He taught me that everything burns. That is why I opened this shop.",
"Arden.Day.Spring.Sat": "Please do not ask me to appraise your parsnips. I deal in artifacts not gardening tools.",
"Arden.Day.Spring.Sun": "The sun fades the tapestries in my shop so I must rotate them every hour.",
"Arden.Day.Summer.Mon": "The metal garments in the shop expand due to the heat in the area. They groan with the effort.",
"Arden.Day.Summer.Tue": "The humidity in my shop suffocates my ancient books.",
"Arden.Day.Summer.Wed": "A butterfly landed on a skull in the shop window. Life overshadowing death. It was surprisingly beautiful.",
"Arden.Day.Summer.Thu": "If you find any arrowheads in the backyard please bring them to me. Do not clean them!$5",
"Arden.Day.Summer.Fri": "Tourists have asked me in the shop if any of the items are cursed. I will tell them that yes, all of my shop items have been cursed to outlive their owners.",
"Arden.Day.Summer.Sat": "I stay within the shop to protect the artifacts from the UV index outside the shop window.",
"Arden.Day.Summer.Sun": "Sundays is a day for me to take a break from shop duties and read. I found an old journal belonging to a farmer who lived here 200 years ago.",
"Arden.Day.Fall.Mon": "The air in the shop is crisp as the decaying of the tapestries begins.",
"Arden.Day.Fall.Tue": "The leaves are falling and rotting on the floor of my shop.",
"Arden.Day.Fall.Wed": "I saw a ghost in the archive room. It smelled of lavender.",
"Arden.Day.Fall.Thu": "The Spirit’s Eve festival is rather crude and glorifies the dead.",
"Arden.Day.Fall.Fri": "The fog is coming into the shop and into the cracks in the walls. The dehumidifiers must be running to remove the moisture in the shop.",
"Arden.Day.Fall.Sat": "I am cataloguing the town records. Did you know that Lewis is mayor of town for the last twenty years? There is no record of the election.",
"Arden.Day.Fall.Sun": "Today is a golden day and brings to mind the color of amber.",
"Arden.Day.Winter.Mon": "Cold preserves the artifacts. Now I can relax as the rottenness of the tapestries stops.",
"Arden.Day.Winter.Tue": "The snow outside muffles the sound of the modern world.",
"Arden.Day.Winter.Wed": "I have to read by candlelight as the electric lights are too harsh for the old books in my shop.",
"Arden.Day.Winter.Thu": "Gunther asked for a donation to the shop. I sent him a box of dust which is an artifact.$8",
"Arden.Day.Winter.Fri": "The wood stove dries the air in the shop. Good for the books but bad for my skin.",
"Arden.Day.Winter.Sat": "I saw you walking in the snow. Your footprints disappear in an hour. We’re all temporary.",
"Arden.Day.Winter.Sun": "Winter is a pause before the chaos of spring.",
"Arden.Gift.StardropTea": "This… this is exquisite. It tastes like a perfectly preserved memory.  I am astounded.$5",
"Arden.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "I do not celebrate aging, and I certainly do not celebrate it with this.",
"Arden.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "You remembered the date. Unnecessary, but deeply touched. Thank you.",
"Arden.AcceptBirthdayGift": "Thank you for the acknowledgement. I will log it.",
"Arden.MovieInvitation": "There is an exhibition at the cinema today. Would you like to go evaluate the historical accuracy of the film together?",
"Arden.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "I am already committed to attending a viewing this evening. One cannot change the timeline by showing up in two places at once.",
"Arden.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I have already viewed the moving picture in its entirety this week. There is something rather contemptible about viewing the same film twice.",
"Arden.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "I have no desire to share the dark with you. It would be the wrong kind of silence.",
"Arden.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "The film at the cinema today is a travesty. I will not be witnessing it.",
"Arden.RejectMovieTicket": "I am too busy cataloging the Gotororo archives to spend two hours watching a piece of fiction.",
"Arden.Dating.Mon": "The week has begun. I cannot help but think of you and check the clock on the wall to see when you will be finished with the chores.",
"Arden.Dating.Tue": "Those two ancient rings were discovered together in the same excavation site. It makes me think of how we two individuals will find our way to each other, inevitably.",
"Arden.Dating.Wed": "I find myself unable to focus on the Gotororo texts with you in the room. You are a very loud distraction.$8",
"Arden.Dating.Thu": "The shop feels brighter when you come to visit. Though, I don’t believe it is due to the stained glass window.",
"Arden.Dating.Fri": "I saw you in town with someone helping them out. You are a good person, my love. I’m so glad that you are mine.",
"Arden.Dating.Sat": "The weekend brings a horde of sticky-handed tourists into the shop. Please, stay behind the counter with me so I have a valid excuse to ignore them.$7",
"Arden.Dating.Sun": "We can do nothing but enjoy our time together on the Sundays. The past can await us for just one day of the week.",
"Arden.Dating.General": "Hello, my love. I was just thinking of you and performing some house chores. But mostly thinking of you.",
"Arden.Dating.Rainy": "Stay with me in this room. Let it rain outside the archives.",
"Arden.Dating.Memory.OneYear": "It has been one year since we formalized our arrangement. However, my timeline is infinitely better with you in my life.",
"Arden.breakUp": "I see. You are like the rest of the world then. Moving on and leaving the past behind us. Leave.$2",
"Arden.RejectMermaidPendant_NeedHouseUpgrade": "I cannot move into the single room in your house. Where would the archives go?",
"Arden.RejectMermaidPendant_NotDatable": "I do not seek a partner for me. My work is my legacy.",
"Arden.RejectMermaidPendant_NpcWithSomeoneElse": "I am already engaged. This timeline between myself and my companion cannot be disturbed.",
"Arden.RejectMermaidPendant_PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "You will not be a footnote in the story that I write about my love for the women in my life. Settle your affairs.$3",
"Arden.RejectMermaidPendant_Under8Hearts": "This is premature. We have not established the proper foundation between us to build a permanent structure.",
"Arden.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts": "I am... not ready to be cast in amber.",
"Arden.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts_AskedAgain": "My answer remains the same. Do not push me, farmer.",
"Arden.Proposal.Reject": "I cannot do this. While I love her very much, I find myself captivated by the pendant and I would not want to share her with another person.$2",
"Arden.Bouquet.Accept": "For me, all objects are from the past. However, this seemingly implies a future for both of us. I accept.",
"Arden.RejectBouquet_NotDatable": "I deal in antiques, farmer, not in fashion.",
"Arden.RejectBouquet_NpcAlreadyMarried": "I am a married man so do not bring your romantic troubles into my life.",
"Arden.RejectBouquet_VeryLowHearts": "Absolutely not. You’ve already tracked mud into my shop and now you’ve brought me weeds.$3",
"Arden.RejectBouquet_LowHearts": "I do not think that we are adequately acquainted with each other for you to make such a gesture.",
"Arden.Bouquet.Reject": "I… I cannot do this. My work is my partner in crime.",
"Arden.divorced": "You are nothing but a fragment of history that I have discarded.",
"Arden.RejectGift_Divorced": "I will accept nothing from you. Your provenance as my partner in crime is tainted.",
"Arden.RejectMermaidPendant_Divorced": "What about a permanent bond with you? The very idea of it is a tragedy.",
"Arden.RejectBouquet_Divorced": "We have watched the once beautiful empire of our love fall. I will not work to rebuild it.",
"Arden.Festival.WinterStar_GiveGift_After_Spouse": "I selected this for you. Yes, it is rather impractical for the antiquities that I have in my shop, but I thought that you would enjoy it.",
"Arden.Festival.WinterStar_ReceiveGift": "You remembered my love for fashion. I will log this and treasure it forever in my life.",
"Arden.Resort.General": "The environment here is not too kind to historical artifacts. Though, I must say I would never expose my complexion to this atmosphere.",
"Arden.Resort.Bar": "I will have water. No ice, please. I prefer my drinks at room temperature.",
"Arden.Resort.Chair": "I am sitting here and observing what is going on around the room. I am not in “relaxing” mode.",
"Arden.Resort.Dance": "I do not enjoy dancing in our town. I find it to be rather undignified.",
"Arden.Resort.Entering": "The sun here is so strong and the UV radiation destroys historical artifacts. I will be under this umbrella until we exit the museum together.",
"Arden.Resort.Leaving": "Back to the archives. I need to keep an eye on the humidity logs in the shop.",
"Arden.Resort.Shore": "Salt spray is rather corrosive to vintage items. Why do people enjoy being exposed to this?",
"Arden.Resort.Towel": "I am not getting in the water. I am guarding our possessions.",
"Arden.Resort.Umbrella": "The shade here is inadequate. I can feel my skin aging.",
"Arden.Resort.Wander": "Found a coin in the sand. It's from last year. Worthless.",
"Arden.SummitEvent": "The view from up here looks over the valley, which I find to be quite impressive. I am glad that we are looking at the valley together.",
"Arden.Engagement.0": "I have spent my life obsessing over the past, yet here I am, eagerly anticipating our future.",
"Arden.Engagement.1": "We must plan carefully. Combining all of our assets will require careful consideration.",
"Arden.SpouseFarmhouseClutter": "Please clear the debris from this path. I was about to walk over something valuable.",
"Arden.Spouse_MonstersInHouse": "There are beasts in our home! This is completely unsanitary and highly destructive!$5",
"Arden.Marriage.SpouseStardrop": "I found something interesting in a clay pot from the Elemental Era. It's preserved perfectly. Would you like to taste the history?",
"Arden.Marriage.Spring": "Spring is the season of chaos and rebirth. I used to find it very anxiety-inducing, but I can finally sit back and watch you thrive in the elements of spring.",
"Arden.Marriage.Summer": "The heat has caused some of the old binding glues to become brittle. I'll be in the cellar, so make sure to hydrate.",
"Arden.Marriage.Fall": "The season of decay is romantic in the most melancholic of ways - especially when shared with someone as beautiful and interesting as you.",
"Arden.Marriage.Winter": "A perfect season for the two of us to remain perfectly preserved in our home.",
"Arden.Patio": "The air is rather humid in here but the view is acceptable.",
"Arden.Rainy_Day_0": "Keep the mud out of the house. It is raining outside and the elements are trying to destroy our home!",
"Arden.Rainy_Day_1": "Water is the universal solvent. Let us remain in the house and become dry and permanent.",
"Arden.Rainy_Day_2": "Do not let the dampness in the house get into your clothes, or else you will fall victim to the ruin of wet garments!",
"Arden.Rainy_Day_3": "I have been cataloging the sound of the rain falling against the windowsill. It is remarkably soothing.",
"Arden.Rainy_Day_4": "If the roof should leak, I will prioritize the Gotoror Scrolls over the furniture in the house. Please tell me when you have finished your tasks.",
"Arden.Rainy_Day_5": "I have prepared a cup of tea to help combat the chill and the dampness in the house.",
"Arden.Indoor_Day_0": "I am cataloging all of our inventory. Please take a moment to read this message if you would like to remain in the room with me.",
"Arden.Indoor_Day_1": "I cleaned up the house while you were out. Entropy is an unrelenting foe!",
"Arden.Indoor_Day_2": "I have organized all of my notes. This system was flawless until you arrived and began creating chaos in my life.$8",
"Arden.Indoor_Day_3": "Entropy is at work in the house constantly, but I feel that we are holding it at bay.",
"Arden.Indoor_Day_4": "Please tell me all about your day. I find your present exploits to be of more interest than the ancient battles of the past.",
"Arden.Indoor_Day_5": "Dusting is a necessity. I have finished the parlor.",
"Arden.Rainy_Night_0": "The roof is currently holding the house up. For now. Come sit by the fire.",
"Arden.Rainy_Night_1": "Listen to the rain outside. It is erasing the world outside but we are safe in our home.",
"Arden.Rainy_Night_2": "The darkness of the world outside coupled with the sound of the rain makes our home into a fortress.",
"Arden.Rainy_Night_3": "Let us ignore the weather outside and focus on our own history for the night.",
"Arden.Rainy_Night_4": "I have checked the perimeter of the house. The archives are secure from the storm. Come rest now.",
"Arden.Rainy_Night_5": "Do you hear the wind outside? It sounds like the ghosts of the valley, but they can't reach our home.",
"Arden.Indoor_Night_0": "The day has passed and been cataloged in my journal. It is time for us to rest.",
"Arden.Indoor_Night_1": "I was reading about the life of Sir Lancelot. His company is more engaging than the old manila documents.",
"Arden.Indoor_Night_2": "Another day successfully recorded in the annals of our life.",
"Arden.Indoor_Night_3": "I find my thoughts drift to you. It is unprofessional but wonderful nonetheless.",
"Arden.Indoor_Night_4": "The silence of the house is beautiful, especially with you in the home.",
"Arden.Indoor_Night_5": "Come here. The books can wait until tomorrow.",
"Arden.funLeave": "I am heading to the shop to check the dehumidifiers. I'll be right back.",
"Arden.funReturn": "The archives are secure. I am quite glad to be home.",
"Arden.Outdoor_General": "The chaos of the elements is overwhelming yet you have mastered it effortlessly.",
"Arden.Outdoor_0": "You are turning the soil in your garden again. It is necessary but try not to bury any artifacts!",
"Arden.Outdoor_1": "The crops are growing. It is a chaotic yet you have mastered it over time.",
"Arden.Outdoor_2": "I went outside to observe you as you turned the soil in your garden.",
"Arden.Outdoor_3": "Do not work yourself into exhaustion. You are a crucial part of my life!",
"Arden.Outdoor_4": "I found a strange rock near the greenhouse. I plan on taking it inside for analysis.",
"Arden.spouseRoom": "Please do not touch the displays of artifacts in my room. The oils from your body are potentially corrosive to the items.",
"Arden.OneKid_0": "The child is loud but surprisingly careful around the artifacts.",
"Arden.OneKid_1": "I am teaching the child some about Gotoro history. They are more interested in the mud though!$7",
"Arden.OneKid_2": "I read to the child from an encyclopedia tonight. They instantly fell asleep.",
"Arden.OneKid_3": "Parenthood is an exhausting yet rewarding adventure!",
"Arden.OneKid_4": "The child has your eyes. I am so glad instead of my profound cynicism!",
"Arden.TwoKids_0": "Two children now. The variables for disaster have increased yet I find myself fond of the chaos!",
"Arden.TwoKids_1": "I secured all fragile artifacts above three feet.",
"Arden.TwoKids_2": "I caught the children attempting to clean a fossil with a wire brush. I fainted!$5",
"Arden.TwoKids_3": "Our legacy as a family requires a significant amount of paperwork.",
"Arden.TwoKids_4": "They are a chaotic force in the house but they are our chaotic force!",
"Arden.Good_0": "I took care of the farmhouse this morning. It makes me feel good to clean up the house!",
"Arden.Good_1": "You look exceptionally vibrant tonight!",
"Arden.Good_2": "I find myself looking forward to the evenings with you!",
"Arden.Good_3": "You are a testament to the beauty of the present moment!",
"Arden.Good_4": "I review my records all throughout the day and you are the highlight of my days!",
"Arden.Good_5": "Your resilience in the face of challenges is truly remarkable. I am proud to be your partner!",
"Arden.Good_6": "I have prepared something special to eat for dinner tonight.",
"Arden.Good_7": "The lighting in this house catches your features perfectly tonight!",
"Arden.Good_8": "I never thought that I would find anything I love as much as my archives. I was wrong.",
"Arden.Good_9": "We are creating a beautiful history together, my dear!",
"Arden.Neutral_0": "The humidity in the house is at acceptable levels!",
"Arden.Neutral_1": "I have some paperwork that I must complete. Let us speak again later.",
"Arden.Neutral_2": "The mail has arrived. Most of it is advertisements. A tragic waste of paper!",
"Arden.Neutral_3": "I have been contemplating the structural integrity of the barn.",
"Arden.Neutral_4": "Another quiet day! One of the best kind!",
"Arden.Neutral_5": "I need to order more specialized cleaning supplies from Zuzu City!",
"Arden.Neutral_6": "I am merely existing in my designated space tonight!",
"Arden.Neutral_7": "If you need me I will be deep in the reference materials!",
"Arden.Neutral_8": "The temperature in the house is precisely the way that it should be!",
"Arden.Neutral_9": "I am observing you. Please proceed with your evening tasks!",
"Arden.Bad_0": "The dampness in the house is intolerable tonight!$3",
"Arden.Bad_1": "You once again tracked mud into the house! Please work to preserve our home!$3",
"Arden.Bad_2": "I am not in the mood for pleasantries. The wood rot in the valley is infuriating.",
"Arden.Bad_3": "Give me some space. I have no tolerance for chaos.$3",
"Arden.Bad_4": "Everything is crumbling about the valley. The feeling of the unavoidable decay of the valley’s structures is overwhelming.$7",
"Arden.Bad_5": "Leave my things alone today. I do not have much patience.",
"Arden.Bad_6": "I am surrounded by fools who do not respect the history of the valley. (Present company excluded.) Mostly.",
"Arden.Bad_7": "All the noise from the outside of the valley is distracting me from my preservation efforts.",
"Arden.Bad_8": "I am consumed by pessimism regarding the future of the valley.$2",
"Arden.Bad_9": "Leave me be. I am mourning the loss of our history.$2",
	"Arden.Event.2Heart.1": "Stop! Freeze right there!$a",
	"Arden.Event.2Heart.2": "There is a 400-year-old ceramic shard on the floor next to your boot. One clumsy step, and centuries of history are dust.$s",
	"Arden.Event.2Heart.Q": "What do you do?",
	"Arden.Event.2Heart.A1": "Apologize and carefully step back.",
	"Arden.Event.2Heart.A2": "Crouch down and pick it up by the edges.",
	"Arden.Event.2Heart.A3": "Ask why a priceless artifact is on the floor.",
	"Arden.Event.2Heart.A4": "(Step forward) What shard?",
	"Arden.Event.2Heart.R1": "There's no need to apologize, just watch your feet. This is an archive, not a barn.$3",
	"Arden.Event.2Heart.R2": "Careful! Hold it by the...$u#$b#Ah. You actually handled that quite well. Thank you.$h",
	"Arden.Event.2Heart.R3": "Because I was in the middle of cataloging it before you barged in! Honestly, the audacity...$a",
	"Arden.Event.2Heart.R4": "...$4#$b#Get out. Now.$4",
	"Arden.Event.2Heart.4": "Now, if you will excuse me? Try to breathe softly on the way out of my shop.",
	"Arden.Event.2Heart.4.Alt": "You can leave it on the counter. And please, try to breathe softly on the way out.$h",
	"Arden.Event.4Heart.1": "A beloved husband and a steady hand.$s",
	"Arden.Event.4Heart.2": "Oh. Hello, @.$u",
	"Arden.Event.4Heart.3": "It’s so loud in town today. There are so many sounds of growth, but also of things breaking. I find it hard to breathe some days.$s",
	"Arden.Event.4Heart.4": "But here? Here is where the record is set.$s",
	"Arden.Event.4Heart.5": "There are no more mistakes to be made. I spend my life preserving the artifacts of others' pasts, terrified that my own name will become as illegible as this granite monument.$s",
	"Arden.Event.4Heart.Q": "Arden looks smaller in the open air. What do you say?",
	"Arden.Event.4Heart.A1": "You’re more than just a name in a book, Arden.",
	"Arden.Event.4Heart.A2": "Maybe that’s why we have to live for the present.",
	"Arden.Event.4Heart.A3": "The dead don’t care for being remembered.",
	"Arden.Event.4Heart.R1": "Perhaps. Books don’t crumble the way people do. Still, thank you for the sentiment.$h",
	"Arden.Event.4Heart.R2": "The present is just a ghost waiting to happen. But, I suppose you have a point. Even a rusted tool has its use.$0",
	"Arden.Event.4Heart.R3": "That is a cold thought. But then, it’s a cold afternoon. You’re very consistent, Farmer.$a",
	"Arden.Event.4Heart.6": "I should go. It’s rather humid out here today. I have some stones to inspect before I head back to the shop.$0",
	"Arden.Event.6Heart.1": "The silver halides are beginning to move even in this dim light...$s",
	"Arden.Event.6Heart.2": "I didn’t hear you come in. I’ve been looking at this photograph for far too long. Sorry, @.$u",
	"Arden.Event.6Heart.3": "This was my mother. The only print that I have of her. I have the best preservatives in all of the Republic. Why doesn’t it work?$s",
	"Arden.Event.6Heart.4": "It’s like another death has taken place. When the last manifestation of her face has finally disappeared from the world... what remains of her? A few firing neurons in my brain? That sounds rather tragic.$s",
	"Arden.Event.6Heart.Q": "Arden’s hand shakes slightly as he turns away from the antique photograph. What do you say?",
	"Arden.Event.6Heart.A1": "Put it away. Remember her as she was.",
	"Arden.Event.6Heart.A2": "Let me help you digitize it.",
	"Arden.Event.6Heart.A3": "It’s just a piece of paper, Arden.",
	"Arden.Event.6Heart.R1": "I know. I know. I could always just put it away and forget about her altogether. But maybe it’s better to have a clear memory of her than a skewed one.$h",
	"Arden.Event.6Heart.R2": "What do you mean, 'digitize'? Turn her into ones and zeros? I suppose it would be rather cold. But perhaps that is better than having no memory of her at all. I see. Well, I’ll think about it.$0",
	"Arden.Event.6Heart.R3": "It’s just paper? Every object that I have collected throughout time was nothing more than a keepsake until the present day when I am left with the only memory of her that I have.$a",
	"Arden.Event.6Heart.5": "Thank you for taking the time to listen to me. People around here only care to speak of the future. It’s nice to know that someone respects the past.$h",
	"Arden.Event.8Heart.1": "Look at what the water has done to this photograph, @. It never seems to cease. Every second the water takes away from the world, it also takes away the world from those who remain.$s",
	"Arden.Event.8Heart.2": "I used to come to this spot out of necessity. To remind myself of the reason why I worked so hard to keep our fields healthy. Because I hated the way the water eroded the land.$0",
	"Arden.Event.8Heart.3": "But lately… The silence in my shop feels more like a tomb than a place where time is preserved. I’ve spent all of my time preserving the past while ignoring the present.$s",
	"Arden.Event.8Heart.4": "You’re the first person in my life to ever make me feel as if change isn’t to be feared in the world. You grow your crops, enjoy the seasons, yet you remain whole.$h",
	"Arden.Event.8Heart.Q": "Arden watches as a leaf drifts through the air. They look more relaxed than ever before.",
	"Arden.Event.8Heart.A1": "The best things in life don’t last for long.",
	"Arden.Event.8Heart.A2": "I’m so glad you’ve finally found time to breathe the fresh air.",
	"Arden.Event.8Heart.R1": "A thought of this nature terrifies a historian, yet perhaps one that is necessary for me to process. I’m finally ready to exhale.$h",
	"Arden.Event.8Heart.R2": "It’s been rather overdue. I forgot that my lungs would feel the same discomfort as an old parchment document. Thank you for the little 'nudge' you gave me to finally leave the shop.$h",
	"Arden.Event.8Heart.5": "I think I’ll stay here to watch the sunset. Perhaps not as a historian but as a human being who simply enjoys watching the sun disappear over the horizon in the world. Would you like to stay with me?$l",
	"Arden.Event.10Heart.1": "I’ve been reorganizing the back archive. For a while now. Up until today, I used to have all of the artifacts arranged in a chronological order by the dates of their creation.$h",
	"Arden.Event.10Heart.2": "It seems, however, that time doesn’t hold up in the same way for me anymore. History isn’t just about 400 years of the past. It’s about what is happening in the world today. Every seed that is planted, every conversation spoken to another human being is a part of the story of time.$0",
	"Arden.Event.10Heart.3": "I used to be very fearful of all of the things that were going to fade from sight. But perhaps the things that don’t change aren’t actually alive in the world.$s",
	"Arden.Event.10Heart.4": "You are the only part of my life that I don’t want to preserve in these museum cases. You are the only part of myself that I want to experience. However short that experience may be.$l",
	"Arden.Event.10Heart.5": "I started a new ledger today. Page one reads: @ and me. Perhaps I’ll see how many pages we can fill together.$l",
	"Arden.Event.10Heart.Q": "Arden offers you a small flower that they preserved in the shop.",
	"Arden.Event.10Heart.A1": "I’d like that more than anything, Arden.",
	"Arden.Event.10Heart.A2": "As long as you don’t try to catalog my laundry.",
	"Arden.Event.10Heart.R1": "Then the record is set. No more looking back, @. Only forward. Together.$l",
	"Arden.Event.10Heart.R2": "No promises. I know some habits are harder to break than the ceramics in the shop. But I’ll try to keep cataloging to the museum exhibits for you.$h",
	"Arden.Event.10Heart.6": "Please stay for a while. Today, the shop is closed. All of the artifacts have been resting. For the first time in my life, I’m finally where I’m supposed to be.$l",
	"Arden.Event.10Heart.7": "There is no ledger for this, @. No record of time for this memory.",
	"Arden.Event.12Heart.1": "Ah, @. I was just examining this ceramic mug in the corner. It slipped from my hands while I was washing up.",
	"Arden.Event.12Heart.2": "What happened? It broke into three pieces. I usually get rather fearful of such an occurrence.",
	"Arden.Event.12Heart.3": "But perhaps, instead of fearing what has happened, I can use it as an opportunity to mend it. The cracks in the ceramic are proof of the loves that it had throughout the years in my home.",
	"Arden.Event.12Heart.Q": "How should we fix it?",
	"Arden.Event.12Heart.A1": "Let’s mend it with gold.",
	"Arden.Event.12Heart.A2": "Makes sense. Why not glue it back together? Good as new.",
	"Arden.Event.12Heart.R1": "Kintsugi. Yes, I’ve heard of that philosophy.",
	"Arden.Event.12Heart.R2": "Not quite as new but perhaps better.",
	"Arden.Event.12Heart.4": "Well, entropy is something that can’t be avoided, @. But as long as I have you by my side, I will never be fearful of the need to put all of the pieces back together.",
	"Arden.Event.14Heart.1": "Welcome to the archives, my love. I’ve been making some significant alterations to the exhibits in my shop.",
	"Arden.Event.14Heart.2": "I’ve packed away the war relics from the Gotoro conflicts. Those represent a time in my past that I’d like to leave behind.",
	"Arden.Event.14Heart.3": "Instead, I’ve cleared the central display case for a new exhibit. I’m curating the history of our life together.",
	"Arden.Event.14Heart.4": "I’m going to have photographs, perhaps a rusted hoe from the farm, a flower that bloomed in the spring and dried out, the first photograph that we took of each other.",
	"Arden.Event.14Heart.5": "Let the world outside continue to weather and change. But in my shop, I want to leave a record of the world of my past and my future and how I spent my life with the woman of my life… the greatest era of my history. What does it matter to the world outside? The past is preserved by the historians. But in my shop, my life is honored.$s",
		// Bea
"Bea.Day.Mon": "Fryer's hot and the biscuits are risin'. Unless the bridge collapsed overnight, don't you dare talk to me about permits, okay? I have a gravy to tend to. $6",
	"Bea.Day.Tue": "Lewis is up to his usual, polishing that statue of himself. Bless him for the love of his country. I'm the one who has to fix the generator with a butter knife. $5",
	"Bea.Day.Wed": "It's Mayor's day. If I look like I'm chewing on tin foil, that's why. All of this for show and politics doesn't feed the soul. I'd rather be in the kitchen fixing people's souls. $6",
	"Bea.Day.Thu": "You seen Cassidy? She's on the verge of a heart attack. I keep telling her to take a break before she burns the roux. $6",
	"Bea.Day.Fri": "Friday night is the busiest night of the week. Eyes up, sugar! If you ain't orderin', get out of the way of the plates. I got a soufflé fixin' to fall if I look at it wrong. $6",
	"Bea.Day.Sat": "I don't use the timers. You gotta listen to the food. The catfish sings when it's ready to be cooked. If you can't hear it, then you ain't got a business in my kitchen.",
	"Bea.Day.Sun": "Sundays are for slow cookin'. Collard greens need time to understand what's going on in the pot. You can't rush a good crop. Sit a spell, you look tired. $1",
	"Bea.Introduction": "Well, look at you. Dragged backwards through a cornfield and left to dry. I'm Bea, mayor of Timberline and owner of the Biscuit Drum. Come on over, child. You look like you use to need a hot meal. $5",
	"Bea.DumpsterDiveComment": "Child! If you are that hungry, come inside and I will feed you! Get out of that trash, you look like a raccoon! $6",
	"Bea.HitBySlingshot": "Child! What in the world is wrong with you?! Do that again and I'm putting you in the soup! $4",
	"Bea.WipedMemory": "Have we met, child? You look familiar, but my mind's as cluttered as a spice rack. Anyway, I'm Bea. Welcome to the Biscuit Drum.",
	"Bea.Weather.Rain": "The rain's good for your crops, sugar, but it's a nightmare for my roof. Come sit by the stove before you catch a chill. $1",
	"Bea.Weather.Snow": "Quiet days comes with snowfall that muffles all noises.",
	"Bea.Weather.GreenRain": "It's sticky. Wash your hands before you touch my counter. I don't want any spores in my sourdough. $6",
	"Bea.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "Well, that was strange. At least the plants seem happy. Though the air smells like a wet basement.",
	"Bea.Hearts2.Mon": "You're startin' to look a little less like a tourist and more like a local. Keep eatin' good food, sugar. $5",
	"Bea.Hearts2.Tue": "Runnin' a kitchen can be the most honest job out there. Feed people. Runnin' a town it's all politics and posturing. Hand me a cleaver over a gavel any day. $5",
	"Bea.Hearts2.Wed": "You think bein' Mayor means having power over this town? Bless 'em... It was after the last Mayor left the town that I took the job. All he ever did was listen to folks complaining about their fences so I just wanted to feed them. $5",
	"Bea.Hearts2.Thu": "My grandmama used to tell me that if a person is hungry they will end up with an angry heart. That's why I cook. It's the only way I know to keep the peace in our community.",
	"Bea.Hearts2.Fri": "Don't fill up on that bread now sugar. I got the main course comin' out of the kitchen. $1",
	"Bea.Hearts2.Sat": "You ever tried my Mac and Cheese skillet? I save this for my most important guests. $1",
	"Bea.Hearts2.Sun": "Rest is an ingredient in my life just like salt. You workin' too hard on that farm out there.",
	"Bea.Hearts4.Mon": "Bein' Mayor of this town is just like runnin' a kitchen. The only difference being the cook gets to argue with the ingredients. I didn't ask for the sash on the porch, sugar. It was given to me when the last Mayor for this town ran off to the wild woods. $6",
	"Bea.Hearts4.Tue": "Sometimes I look at Lewis and think about how he does it all. But I remind myself that he does not do anything. He's a garnish. I'm the meat and the potatoes. $5",
	"Bea.Hearts4.Wed": "If I had my way, I would feed all this paperwork to the goats and just focus on making a decent gumbo. But someone has to keep the lights on in this town. Might as well be me. $6",
	"Bea.Hearts4.Thu": "Cassidy has a fire in her... but too much fire. She's too hot for this kitchen. You keep an eye on her for me, yeah? $6",
	"Bea.Hearts4.Fri": "Cooking is like chemistry with a soul. If you get one element wrong, the recipe falls apart. Just like this town.",
	"Bea.Hearts4.Sat": "You know, I saw you help out around town. You've got good hands. Rough. Useful. Unlike some of the folks who cannot take a break in their own house. $5",
	"Bea.Hearts4.Sun": "Come sit by the fire. I saved you a slice of cornbread. The best part of the cornbread. $1",
	"Bea.Hearts6.Mon": "I realized somethin'. The mayor nourishes a town just as a chef nourishes a body. It's thankless work. But if I did not do it, who else would do it for us? Lewis? $5",
	"Bea.Hearts6.Tue": "I used to hide in the pantry when the city council members came to the town. Now, they come to my house for dinner. $1",
	"Bea.Hearts6.Wed": "I'm actually looking forward to the city council meeting. There's gonna be some talk about the road near the bridge. It's a mess. $6",
	"Bea.Hearts6.Thu": "You're family now, huh? Not by blood but by bread. $1",
	"Bea.Hearts6.Fri": "Service is love, whether it's a permit or a pie. $1",
	"Bea.Hearts6.Sat": "The Biscuit Drum is the living room of the town of Timberline Falls. And it's me who cares for the comfort of the town. $1",
	"Bea.Hearts6.Sun": "You poor thing. Your eyes are closed. Come sit down. Don't argue with me. I'm making you a cup of tea. $1",
	"Bea.Hearts8.Mon": "Strangely, this town is just like my kitchen. It gets messy and loud but it's familiar to me the same way my kitchen is.",
	"Bea.Hearts8.Tue": "I'm running for re-election properly this time. I will not do it as the reluctant mayor. I'll do it properly. $1",
	"Bea.Hearts8.Wed": "I filed the city council forms early this morning. It felt good. Strange, ain't it? $1",
	"Bea.Hearts8.Thu": "Cassidy played a song for me last night when she came over. It was loud, chaotic but beautiful - just like her. $1",
	"Bea.Hearts8.Fri": "You're good people, farmer. You work hard and eat hearty. There will always be a plate of food waiting for you. On the house. $1",
	"Bea.Hearts8.Sat": "I'm thinking of adding Emberberry pie to the menu permanently. What do you think? $1",
	"Bea.Hearts8.Sun": "Sunday mornings are my favorite day of the week. It's quiet before the boiling pot. My best thinkin' days come on Sundays. $1",
	"Bea.Hearts10.Mon": "You changed this valley. It feels different with you here. $1",
	"Bea.Hearts10.Tue": "I don't say this very often but I'm proud of you. You built something from nothing. That's something to celebrate. $1",
	"Bea.Hearts10.Wed": "Mayor Bea! Has a nice ring to it, doesn't it? Better than Chef Bea? $5",
	"Bea.Hearts10.Thu": "When I'm gone, tell the people that I cooked for them well. That's all I ask for. $2",
	"Bea.Hearts10.Fri": "Grab an apron! I'm short staffed and I trust you with the knife! Come on, children! Chop onions! $6",
	"Bea.Hearts10.Sat": "Life is just one long dinner service. Try to enjoy the rush sugar.",
	"Bea.Hearts10.Sun": "You're always welcome here. Key's under the mat. But don't you dare touch my cast iron skillet. That's still mine. $5",
	"Bea.Day.Spring.Mon": "It rains on the roof and you see where the leaks are. Timberline has a lot of leaks, sugar. I need to call Jett before we serve soup in the dining room - literally. $6",
	"Bea.Day.Spring.Tue": "Spring greens are the tenderest of the greens. Cook 'em just right and don't overcook. They're grumpy but nice.",
	"Bea.Day.Spring.Wed": "Town meeting tonight. Bring snacks. Politics can't fix a broken spirit but a biscuit might do the trick. $5",
	"Bea.Day.Spring.Thu": "Mud everywhere! Wipe your boots. I don't care if you saved the world today. $6",
	"Bea.Day.Spring.Fri": "Fish fry tonight! If you caught it, I'll cook it. But if you bring in a carp, I'm chargn' you double. $5",
	"Bea.Day.Spring.Sat": "Tourists come to see the blooming trees. I love to see their wallets filled with cash. $5",
	"Bea.Day.Spring.Sun": "Rest day? Hah! A mayor never rests. The paperwork just gets quieter on Sundays. $6",
	"Bea.Day.Summer.Mon": "It gets cranky in the kitchen when it's hot. I have to be the cool head. $6",
	"Bea.Day.Summer.Tue": "Humidity is the enemy of a good biscuit crust. If the biscuits are flat, it's the humidity - nothing else. $6",
	"Bea.Day.Summer.Wed": "Organizin' a town clean-up. You fixin' to help?",
	"Bea.Day.Summer.Thu": "Cassidy's in the freezer. I'm letting her stay there for five minutes. She started to smoke from the ears. $6",
	"Bea.Day.Summer.Fri": "Drink this. Electrolytes. You look like wilted spinach. Don't pass out on me, Bea doesn't have time to go to the clinic. $6",
	"Bea.Day.Summer.Sat": "Busy busy busy. But I love the noise. Silence makes me nervous. Silence means something broke. $1",
	"Bea.Day.Summer.Sun": "Let's just sit on the porch and shell peas. That's the secret. $1",
	"Bea.Day.Fall.Mon": "Fall makes me nostalgic for my mama cooking in this very weather. She always said a sharp knife is safer than a dull one. Same goes for words.",
	"Bea.Day.Fall.Tue": "The budget looks good. Maybe we can fix that fountain. Or maybe we can buy enough firewood to keep the elderly warm through this winter. Yeah, firewood comes first.",
	"Bea.Day.Fall.Wed": "I love this town in the autumn season when it transforms into a golden town that hides the rust on its buildings. $1",
	"Bea.Day.Fall.Thu": "Cranberry sauce. Homemade. If you bring me the stuff from the can I will ban you from the premises. $5",
	"Bea.Day.Fall.Fri": "Chili cook-off season is here. I'm gonna win this year. Lewis put cinnamon in his chili. It's an abomination. $6",
	"Bea.Day.Fall.Sat": "Harvest festival is around the corner. It's a lot of work but the best way to show how much I love this town. $1",
	"Bea.Day.Fall.Sun": "Giving thanks for the food and the family I have and just praying for another year under this roof. $1",
	"Bea.Day.Winter.Mon": "Door is stuck again. It's winter. Must have gotten frozen shut outside. I kicked it open. That's the Timberline greeting. $5",
	"Bea.Day.Winter.Tue": "Market for spices. Found some deep sea fish but they taste too rubbery.",
	"Bea.Day.Winter.Wed": "Back door is always unlocked for anyone who needs a warm place to sit. Good soup weather. Come inside. $1",
	"Bea.Day.Winter.Thu": "Soup's on. Just come on in and eat. Don't ask what kind.",
	"Bea.Day.Winter.Fri": "Comfort food is prepared when it gets freezin'. I'm a little low on heavy cream.",
	"Bea.Day.Winter.Sat": "Heating bill is gonna murder the budget. Might have to sell ads on the water tower. $6",
	"Bea.Day.Winter.Sun": "Stay a while sugar. It's cold out on the road. Plus the coffee pot is bottomless today. $1",
	"Bea.AcceptGift_StardropTea": "This tea... lord, I feel like I could cater a wedding for 300 people right now! Let's go! $1",
	"Bea.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "Bless your heart. $5",
	"Bea.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "You have good taste. This is too much! You're gonna make me cry child. Thank you. $1",
	"Bea.AcceptBirthdayGift": "A birthday surprise! You shouldn't have. $1",
	"Bea.MovieInvitation": "A movie? Sure. I need to get out of the kitchen for a few hours. I promise not to critique the snacks. $1",
	"Bea.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "Lord, I'd love to, but someone else already dragged me away from the stove today. Rain check, sugar.",
	"Bea.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I already sat in that dark theater this week. Any more time away from the kitchen and Cassidy will burn the place down. $6",
	"Bea.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "You've got some nerve askin' me that after everything. Get out of my sight before I grab my cleaver. $4",
	"Bea.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "I read the poster for that one. Absolute garbage. I'm not wasting two hours of prep time on that nonsense. $5",
	"Bea.RejectMovieTicket": "Not today, sugar. The dinner rush is comin' and these biscuits won't bake themselves. $6",
	"Bea.SummitEvent": "Look at this valley, sugar. It's like a perfectly plated meal... colorful, balanced, and full of life. You helped stir the pot to make it this way. I'm proud of you, child. Now, don't go gettin' a big head about it. $1",
	"Bea.Event.2Heart.01": "Lord have mercy! Jett! That pipe is fixin' to drown my grit supply!$3",
	"Bea.Event.2Heart.02": "I'm trying, Bea! The thread is stripped. This plumbing is ancient.$3",
	"Bea.Event.2Heart.03": "I don't care if it's prehistoric! If I stop stirrin' this roux to hold a flashlight, we're gonna have lumps. And I do not serve lumpy gravy.$3",
	"Bea.Event.2Heart.04": "Oh! Farmer. You walked right into a disaster zone. Watch your boots, sugar.$1",
	"Bea.Event.2Heart.Q": "Bea and Jett are wrestling with the plumbing....and look to be losing",
	"Bea.Event.2Heart.A1": "Need a hand?",
	"Bea.Event.2Heart.A2": "This looks... moist.",
	"Bea.Event.2Heart.R1": "We got a leak in the main line. Jett's doin' their best, but this whole buildin' is fightin' us today.$s",
	"Bea.Event.2Heart.R2": "I need a wrench, not a lecture!$3",
	"Bea.Event.2Heart.07": "I think I've almost got it! Watch out for the spray!$1",
	"Bea.Event.2Heart.08": "You see what I deal with? I'm tryin' to feed souls, and the roof is tryin' to drown us. Go on, I'll get this sorted. Eventually.$h",
	"Bea.Event.4Heart.01": "Generator fuel... up thirty percent. Flour delivery... delayed due to rockslide. Lord, give me strength.$s",
	"Bea.Event.4Heart.02": "Oh! Sugar, you startled me. I thought you were a ghost hauntin' the pantry.$u",
	"Bea.Event.4Heart.03": "Just lookin' at the numbers. Folks see the biscuits on the plate... they don't see the sweat it takes just to keep the stove lit in a place like this.$s",
	"Bea.Event.4Heart.04": "Timberline is... forgotten. If I don't order the fuel, the lights go out. If I don't fix the road, Jett can't get metal. It's a heavy pot to carry, sugar.$s",
	"Bea.Event.4Heart.Q": "It's a heavy pot to carry, sugar.",
	"Bea.Event.4Heart.A1": "You do a good job.",
	"Bea.Event.4Heart.A2": "Why not ask for help?",
	"Bea.Event.4Heart.R1": "You're sweet to say so. I suppose someone's gotta do it. And I reckon I'm too stubborn to let the lights go out on my watch.$h",
	"Bea.Event.4Heart.R2": "Timberline folks are already stretched thin, sugar. I reckon I'm too stubborn to burden 'em when I can carry it myself.$0",
	"Bea.Event.4Heart.06": "Now, you poor thing, you're soaking wet. Get home before you catch a chill. I'll finish this.$h",
	"Bea.Event.6Heart.01": "I'm telling you, the perimeter fence near the falls is compromised! We need budget for reinforced steel!$a",
	"Bea.Event.6Heart.02": "No! We need budget for a sound system! No one cares about your fence, Vance!$a",
	"Bea.Event.6Heart.03": "If I don't get parts for the generator, nobody is gonna have power for fences OR guitars, much less be able to use them!$a",
	"Bea.Event.6Heart.04": "Quiet! Both of you!$3",
	"Bea.Event.6Heart.05": "...Lord, it's like herdin' cats with a wet noodle.$s",
	"Bea.Event.6Heart.06": "Oh, hi there, @. Take a seat. I need to handle somethin' right quick.",
	"Bea.Event.6Heart.07": "I said... enough!$4",
	"Bea.Event.6Heart.08": "I am done shoutin'. My throat is for singin' hymns and callin' orders, not arguin' with fools.$3",
	"Bea.Event.6Heart.09": "Dinner's up.$0",
	"Bea.Event.6Heart.10": "Fried Catfish. Fresh biscuits. Now. Both of you. Sit.",
	"Bea.Event.6Heart.11": "Now. Vance. You eat that catfish. And while you chew, you write down exactly how much wire you need. Roxy, pass the butter and hush up about the amps for five minutes.$h",
	"Bea.Event.6Heart.12": "See that, @? You can't lead this town with a gavel. You gotta lead 'em with a full belly. They're useless when they're hungry.$h",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.01": "It's really coming down, Bea. The roof sounds like it's gonna cave in on itself.$s",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.02": "Hush now, sugar. The wind’s loud tonight, but it ain’t angry at all. This building’s stood since before you were born, so it’s not gonna fall on its face tonight.$h",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.03": "The generator’s holding, Bea. But the bridge might be flooded.$s",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.04": "@! Good. Jett, go check the back door seal. Cassidy… sugar, come here.",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.05": "Go put a record on the jukebox. Something slow and acoustic. You think you can find somethin' to help keep the fear away from us?",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.06": "I… yeah. I can find something!",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.07": "Good girl. Farmer, come stand by the stove with me. The wind’s rattling the lid on my gumbo pot. You hold it down while I boil.",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.08": "Listen to that record. It warms the place up mighty well, don’t it?# You’ve got a good grip on that pot. I knew you would.",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.09": "I ain't gonna lie to you, sugar.  I play the role of the calm leader for these others in my charge. But the storm outside…it brings back the ghosts.$s",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.10": "Last time the sky was this shade of purple, my grandfather stood in this very spot where you stand now. We lost the old barn to a fire that night.$s",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.Q": ".. We lost the old barn to a fire that night.",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.A1": "What happened to him?",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.A2": "You're doing him proud, Bea.",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.A3": "I won't let anything happen tonight.",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.R1": "He made it through, but he looked ten years older in the middle of the night. It's the helplessness. To see the wind toss around everything you created.$s",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.R2": "I guess so. I'm thankful he taught me about the panic of the moment when people are counting on us to stay strong.$h",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.R3": "A mighty big promise for a mortal to make against Mother Nature. But... I appreciate the grit.$h",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.11": "This valley will try to shake us off like a dog shakes off fleas. But we hold on.",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.12": "As long as you're at my side and my stove’s lit, we’ll hold on.$h",
	"Bea.Event.8Heart.13": "Thank you for comin' to help me out, sugar. Sometimes it helps to have the family close by when the skies are so dark.",
	"Bea.Event.10Heart.01": "Look at that sun. After all that rain, the valley looks scrubbed clean.$h",
	"Bea.Event.10Heart.02": "I set a table out back. Everyone's eatin'. Jett, Vance, even that grumpy archivist Arden.$h",
	"Bea.Event.10Heart.03": "I used to think this kitchen was a hidin' place. A way to avoid the world. But you helped me see somethin', sugar.",
	"Bea.Event.10Heart.04": "This ain't a hidin' place. It’s the engine. And I'm the one drivin' it.$h",
	"Bea.Event.10Heart.05": "I ain't waitin' for Pelican Town to send help anymore. We're stubborn. We're loud. But we're fed. And that's enough.$h",
	"Bea.Event.10Heart.06": "Here. I want you to have this. It’s the recipe for the Bass Drum Biscuit. Don't you dare share it with anyone!$h",
	"Bea.Event.10Heart.07": "You learned how to make the Bass Drum Biscuit Sandwich!",
	"Bea.Event.10Heart.08": "Now, grab a plate. You're far too skinny child.$h",
	"Bea.Mail.Welcome": "Welcome to Timberline. I run the Biscuit Drum. Come by if you're hungry. We don't let people starve here. - Bea",
	"Bea.Mail.Recipe": "I wrote this down for you. It goes against my nature to use measurements, but try not to burn it.",
	"Bea.Animation.CustomBubble": "Taste... needs more thyme.",
	
	// Bernard
	"Bernard.Day.Mon": "People always come around on Mondays. 'Starting the week fresh.' Bah. The dead don’t care what day it is. Go away.$2",
	"Bernard.Day.Tue": "I'm busy. This hole won’t dig itself. ...Why are you still standing there? I said I'm busy.$2",
	"Bernard.Day.Wed": "The silence here is perfect. Until you showed up. You breathe too loud.$2",
	"Bernard.Day.Thu": "Don’t ask me about the history of this town. I bury them, I don’t interview them. Read a book and leave me alone.$2",
	"Bernard.Day.Fri": "The townsfolk come to 'pay respects' to the dead. They come to gossip over my tombstone. Disrespectful to the dead and noisy.$6",
	"Bernard.Day.Sat": "You were talking to everyone in town the other day. One of those 'social' types. Disgusting.$2",
	"Bernard.Day.Sun": "Sunday is for rest; you rest somewhere else. Far from here.$2",
	"Bernard.Introduction": "Who are you? @? I don’t care. Standing on the grass? Get off the grass. And get out of my cemetery.$2",
	"Bernard.DumpsterDiveComment": "Digging through the trash? Have you no dignity? At least the worms stay in the ground!$5",
	"Bernard.HitBySlingshot": "Ouch! You little menace! I’ve got a shovel and a perfectly good empty hole with your name on it!$2",
	"Bernard.WipedMemory": "Who are you? Do I know you? Good. Let’s keep it that way. Get off the grass.$2",
	"Bernard.Weather.Rain": "Rain? Great. More mud to track in.$6",
	"Bernard.Weather.Snow": "Cold. Wet. Miserable. Perfect.$5",
	"Bernard.Weather.GreenRain": "Green rain? Bah. Just another mess to clean up. Nature is disgusting.$2",
	"Bernard.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "The green sludge is gone. Good. Now the regular weeds will stop mutating. Back to digging.$6",
	"Bernard.Hearts2.Mon": "You again? Don’t you have work to do? Or do you just enjoy annoying old men?$2",
	"Bernard.Hearts2.Tue": "I’m not your friend. I’m not your grandpa. The guy who buries people. Remember that?$2",
	"Bernard.Hearts2.Wed": "Stop smiling at me. It looks unnatural.$2",
	"Bernard.Hearts2.Thu": "I found a rock in my shoe. That rock was better company than you.$2",
	"Bernard.Hearts2.Fri": "You're blocking my light. Move.$2",
	"Bernard.Hearts2.Sat": "Why do you keep talking at me? I’m not listening.$2",
	"Bernard.Hearts2.Sun": "Go. Away.$2",
	"Bernard.Hearts4.Mon": "You stepped over the grave instead of on it. ...Acceptable. You’re slightly less clumsy than the others.$5",
	"Bernard.Hearts4.Tue": "I’m taking a break. You can sit on that bench. Over there. Far away.$2",
	"Bernard.Hearts4.Wed": "You're quiet today. Good. Keep it up.$5",
	"Bernard.Hearts4.Thu": "Vance comes by sometimes. He doesn’t talk neither. He’s okay. You talk too much.$6",
	"Bernard.Hearts4.Fri": "Fine. You can stay. But if you touch my shovel, I’ll bury you with it.$2",
	"Bernard.Hearts4.Sat": "It's Saturday. Don't expect me to be cheerful. I'm never cheerful.$6",
	"Bernard.Hearts4.Sun": "You’re persistent. It’s annoying. But useful to a farmer.$5",
	"Bernard.Hearts6.Mon": "You brought dirt on your boots again. ...At least it's good soil. Rich. Not like the clay in town.$5",
	"Bernard.Hearts6.Tue": "I’ve been digging graves here in this valley for forty years. I know where all the bodies are buried. Literally. Don’t cross me.$2",
	"Bernard.Hearts6.Wed": "Arden likes the old things. I like the dead things. They don’t need to be dusted.$5",
	"Bernard.Hearts6.Thu": "You look tired. Farming is hard work. ...Good. Hard work keeps you from becoming soft like the rest of them.$5",
	"Bernard.Hearts6.Fri": "I tolerate you. That’s the highest compliment I can give you.$5",
	"Bernard.Hearts6.Sat": "If you're going to stand there, make yourself useful. Pick up that branch. ...Good. Now throw it away.$2",
	"Bernard.Hearts6.Sun": "I don’t hate you. Today. Check in tomorrow.$5",
	"Bernard.Hearts8.Mon": "You stepped on the grass again. I’d say something to you, but I save my breath for those who listen to me.$6",
	"Bernard.Hearts8.Tue": "That fence on the south ridge of the cemetery is crooked. Don’t touch my fences again.$2",
	"Bernard.Hearts8.Wed": "Lewis likes to smile a lot. You stare at me too much. I hate you both.$2",
	"Bernard.Hearts8.Thu": "I’m old, farmer. My back hurts, my knees hurt, and I hate everyone. You can’t fix it.$6",
	"Bernard.Hearts8.Fri": "Is it wisdom you’re looking for? Here’s some: Everyone ends up in a hole. What a pity. Stop worrying about what people think of you.$5",
	"Bernard.Hearts8.Sat": "I kept a spot for you. ...Not now, you idiot. When you die. It’s a dry spot. Under the elm tree. You’re welcome.$5",
	"Bernard.Hearts8.Sun": "Go home. I'm sick of looking at your face. ...See you next week.$6",
	"Bernard.Hearts10.Mon": "You’re still here? I thought I’d scare you away when I was younger. You’ve got no pride.$5",
	"Bernard.Hearts10.Tue": "You’re like a fungus growing on me. I can't get rid of you.$6",
	"Bernard.Hearts10.Wed": "If anyone from town comes looking for you, I’ll tell them you aren’t here. I don’t want to hear their noise in my cemetery.$2",
	"Bernard.Hearts10.Thu": "I don’t have friends. Friends are liabilities. You... you’re a habit with me. A bad habit.$6",
	"Bernard.Hearts10.Fri": "Fine. Sit down. The bench isn’t wet. I checked.$5",
	"Bernard.Hearts10.Sat": "The dead don’t speak. You do. Therefore I prefer the dead. Go away.$2",
	"Bernard.Hearts10.Sun": "Get out of here. I’ve got work to do. And… wipe your feet on the way out.$5",
	"Bernard.Day.Spring.Mon": "Flowers. Weeds. All the same. Just more things I have to cut down.$6",
	"Bernard.Day.Spring.Tue": "The ground is thawing. Good for digging. Spring is here.$5",
	"Bernard.Day.Spring.Wed": "Pollen season is upon us. Nature is disgusting today.$2",
	"Bernard.Day.Spring.Thu": "Don’t pick flowers on the graves. They’re not for you. Nothing in this cemetery is for you.$2",
	"Bernard.Day.Spring.Fri": "I saw a butterfly. I swatted at it. Missed it entirely. What annoying things.$6",
	"Bernard.Day.Spring.Sat": "The sun is too bright in here. It’s on the headstones. My eyes hurt. Go block the sun for yourself somewhere else.$2",
	"Bernard.Day.Spring.Sun": "You’re back again? What’s the matter with you? Do you enjoy being unwanted?$5",
	"Bernard.Day.Summer.Mon": "Hot. Stinking hot today. I hate the heat.$6",
	"Bernard.Day.Summer.Tue": "Flies buzz in the air. You buzz in my cemetery. Everyone does. Buzz off!$2",
	"Bernard.Day.Summer.Wed": "I'm watering the grass. Not because I like it green, but because dust makes me cough. Move or get wet.$2",
	"Bernard.Day.Summer.Thu": "The shade under this oak tree is mine. Find your own spot in the woods.$2",
	"Bernard.Day.Summer.Fri": "Tourists come to take pictures of the dead. “Oh, how spooky!” What idiots!$2",
	"Bernard.Day.Summer.Sat": "The stone is hot from the sun. I can hear it crack. The only sound I like in this cemetery.$5",
	"Bernard.Day.Summer.Sun": "Go to the beach, the woods. Go anywhere but in my cemetery.$2",
	"Bernard.Day.Fall.Mon": "Fall leaves. Everywhere. I have to rake the leaves up. They fall again. I rake again.$6",
	"Bernard.Day.Fall.Tue": "The wind is picking up. Good. Maybe it’ll blow you back to your farm.$5",
	"Bernard.Day.Fall.Wed": "Spirit’s Eve is a holiday for the living. What a stupid holiday. Dead people aren’t spooky.$2",
	"Bernard.Day.Fall.Thu": "Why do people put pumpkins on the graves in October? They rot. I have to clean them up.$6",
	"Bernard.Day.Fall.Fri": "Everyone spends the cold nights trying to drink away their problems. They'll all end up here eventually. Cheaper just to come here first.$5",
	"Bernard.Day.Fall.Sat": "The crows don’t come near my cemetery. You could learn from them.$5",
	"Bernard.Day.Fall.Sun": "The days are getting shorter. Good thing. People have less time to look at others.$5",
	"Bernard.Day.Winter.Mon": "The ground is frozen in the cemetery. Hard to dig. If someone dies this week, I’ll bury them in the snowbank.$5",
	"Bernard.Day.Winter.Tue": "Cold. My knees hurt. My back hurts. Looking at you makes my head hurt.$6",
	"Bernard.Day.Winter.Wed": "Snow is nice. It blankets up the land. I like it blank.$5",
	"Bernard.Day.Winter.Thu": "I’m not shoveling the path to the cemetery. If you slip on the ice, it’s your problem. Don’t sue me!$2",
	"Bernard.Day.Winter.Fri": "Feast of the Winter Star. I’ll stay in bed. I don’t have a friend and don’t want one.$6",
	"Bernard.Day.Winter.Sat": "Go home, farmer. Your crops are dead. Go mourn them.$5",
	"Bernard.Day.Winter.Sun": "Another year is over. People have gotten older. I’m getting closer to the end of my life. Happy New Year!$6",
	"Bernard.Gift.StardropTea": "What is this nonsense? It smells like... memories. Bah. Fine. I'll drink it, but don't expect me to smile.$6",
	"Bernard.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "You remembered my birthday with this garbage? I’m one year closer to the grave. You waste my time.$2",
	"Bernard.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "Hmph. How did you know it was my birthday? ...It's not terrible. I'll put it in the shed. Thanks. Now go away.$5",
	"Bernard.AcceptBirthdayGift": "I survived another year. Barely. Put the gift down and get out of my way.$6",
	"Bernard.MovieInvitation": "A movie? With you? In the dark with all these people? ...Fine. But if anyone starts to talk, I’m out.$6",
	"Bernard.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "I already agreed to go with someone else. Don't ask me how that happened, I'm regretting it already.$6",
	"Bernard.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I’ve suffered through one movie this week. It takes a month for me to recover from being around so many people.$6",
	"Bernard.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "You have a lot of nerve asking me anywhere after what happened. Take your ticket and get out of my sight.$2",
	"Bernard.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "I saw the movie poster for the one you’re showing. No way. I’d rather watch the dirt settle on the fresh grave of someone who passed on this year.$5",
	"Bernard.RejectMovieTicket": "No! Absolutely not! The theater smells of stale butter!$2",
	"Bernard.SummitEvent": "I managed to find my way up to the summit. The air is thin up here. My knees hurt from walking up the hill. Still, it’s quiet. No one else suffers from the same ills as me. Don’t ruin the peace for me by speaking to me!$6",
	"Bernard.Event.2Heart.1": "What are you looking at?$2",
	"Bernard.Event.2Heart.Q": "Sorry to interrupt...",
	"Bernard.Event.2Heart.A1": "Who died?",
	"Bernard.Event.2Heart.A2": "I'm just passing through.",
	"Bernard.Event.2Heart.R1": "Nobody you need to worry about. Just... people die. Get over it.",
	"Bernard.Event.2Heart.R2": "Then keep passing. This isn't a spectator sport.$2",
	"Bernard.Event.2Heart.2": "Now move. You're standing on my shovel.$2",
	"Bernard.Event.4Heart.1": "You're persistent.",
	"Bernard.Event.4Heart.2": "Most people run away when I yell at them. You just stand there.",
	"Bernard.Event.4Heart.Q": "You must be thickheaded. Or deaf. Which is it?",
	"Bernard.Event.4Heart.A1": "Thickheaded, definitely.",
	"Bernard.Event.4Heart.A2": "I just tune out the yelling.",
	"Bernard.Event.4Heart.A3": "I'm just trying to help.",
	"Bernard.Event.4Heart.R1": "...Right. At least you admit it.$3",
	"Bernard.Event.4Heart.R2": "Is that so. Terrific.$2",
	"Bernard.Event.4Heart.R3": "And nobody asked you to.$2",
	"Bernard.Event.4Heart.4": "...Hmph. Fine. I need to get at the lower roots.$0",
	"Bernard.Event.4Heart.5": "Hand me that trowel. Since you're clearly not leaving, make yourself useful. And don't drop it.",
	"Bernard.Event.6Heart.1": "This tombstone. It's leaning.$0",
	"Bernard.Event.6Heart.2": "You. Come here. Help me push it.$0",
	"Bernard.Event.6Heart.3": "...Push harder! Put your back into it!$2",
	"Bernard.Event.6Heart.4": "There. Straight.$0",
	"Bernard.Event.6Heart.5": "You didn't break your back. A miracle. Don't expect me to drag you to the clinic if you do.",
	"Bernard.Event.6Heart.Q": "And don't expect a thank you. It was your duty.",
	"Bernard.Event.6Heart.A1": "I didn't expect one.",
	"Bernard.Event.6Heart.A2": "You're welcome anyway.",
	"Bernard.Event.6Heart.A3": "My 'duty'?",
	"Bernard.Event.6Heart.R1": "Good. Glad we understand each other.",
	"Bernard.Event.6Heart.R2": "...I just said I wasn't thanking you. Insolent...$2",
	"Bernard.Event.6Heart.R3": "To the dead. Respect. Not that I'd expect you to understand.$2",
	"Bernard.Event.8Heart.1": "See that spot right over there?",
	"Bernard.Event.8Heart.2": "That's my spot. I dug it myself last year.",
	"Bernard.Event.8Heart.3": "When I kick the bucket, shove me in there. Don't let Bea make a speech. Just dirt.",
	"Bernard.Event.8Heart.Q": "Well?",
	"Bernard.Event.8Heart.A1": "I'll make sure Bea's speech is an hour long.",
	"Bernard.Event.8Heart.A2": "Deal. Just dirt.",
	"Bernard.Event.8Heart.A3": "Don't talk like that. You're not going anywhere.",
	"Bernard.Event.8Heart.R1": "Don't you dare. I will haunt you.$2",
	"Bernard.Event.8Heart.R2": "Good. Glad I can finally count on someone around here to follow simple instructions.",
	"Bernard.Event.8Heart.R3": "Bah. Everyone dies. Spare me the sentimentality.$2",
	"Bernard.Event.8Heart.4": "Anyway... you're standing on it right now. Move.$2",
	"Bernard.Event.10Heart.1": "It's quiet tonight.",
	"Bernard.Event.10Heart.2": "I've tried everything to make you leave. Yelling. Insults. Locking the gate.",
	"Bernard.Event.10Heart.3": "You have no pride. You just stand there.",
	"Bernard.Event.10Heart.Q": "Why do you keep coming back?",
	"Bernard.Event.10Heart.A1": "I enjoy the quiet.",
	"Bernard.Event.10Heart.A2": "I actually like your company.",
	"Bernard.Event.10Heart.A3": "I'm stubborn.",
	"Bernard.Event.10Heart.R1": "...Hmph. Cheap entertainment, I suppose.",
	"Bernard.Event.10Heart.R2": "Delusional.$2",
	"Bernard.Event.10Heart.R3": "Clearly.",
	"Bernard.Event.10Heart.4": "Fine. Stay. Rot here for all I care.$2",
	"Bernard.Event.10Heart.5": "...Just don't expect me to talk to you.",
	"Bernard.Schedule.Shack": "Can't a man sit in his own home without being stared at? Go away.",
	"Bernard.Schedule.Cemetery": "The dead are quiet. You should learn from them.",
	"Bernard.Schedule.Buyco": "I'm only here because my shovel broke. Do I look like I want to chat?",
	
		// Blaise
	"Blaise.Day.Mon": "Mondays are the chillest days of the week in the kitchen. You want a free sample of the new batch?",
	"Blaise.Day.Tue": "Today I took a walk up near the falls. There are some mean wild peppers that grow in the dirt up near the falls. It’s awesome.",
	"Blaise.Day.Wed": "You look dead on your feet, man. Here, take a drop of the smoked ghost pepper batch. It’ll wake you up.",
	"Blaise.Day.Thu": "Some folks get actually mad when I serve them the spicy pepper sauce. I just give them a glass of milk and tell them it’s all in good fun.",
	"Blaise.Day.Fri": "It’s the best night of the week. There is so much activity in the kitchen when people come and go, it’s the best vibe in the world.",
	"Blaise.Day.Sat": "I'm taking it easy today in the kitchen. My tastebuds need a day off once in a while to recharge. Want a ginger ale?",
	"Blaise.Day.Sun": "Sundays are the best days to experiment in the kitchen with crazy flavor combinations. I have a few recipes to share with you all including a mango and habanero and a blueberry and scorpion pepper sauce to share with you.",
	"Blaise.Introduction": "Hey, what’s up? I’m Blaise. Welcome to the Pepper Pit. Come on in and take a breather. If you like it hot, you are in the right spot.",
	"Blaise.DumpsterDiveComment": "Whoa, man. There’s plenty of good food in the kitchen. You don’t need to be digging through the trash.",
	"Blaise.HitBySlingshot": "Ow! What the hell, man?! Save the heat for the food!",
	"Blaise.WipedMemory": "Hey, I’m Blaise. You look vaguely familiar. Have you burned your tastebuds off in my shop before?",
	"Blaise.Weather.Rain": "It’s the perfect day to stay inside and listen to the rain fall on the roof. Then we can cook up a massive pot of chili.",
	"Blaise.Weather.Snow": "The colder it gets outside, the more people want my face-melting pepper sauce. Bring it on!",
	"Blaise.Weather.GreenRain": "It’s hot outside! Look at those mosses growing on the trees. I wonder if they have any flavor? Probably not, and definitely shouldn’t be eaten.",
	"Blaise.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "Man, the green rain that fell last night was a trip. I was just hoping the wild peppers didn’t all mutate into something crazy wild. I think.",
	"Blaise.Hearts2.Mon": "Hey, @. Have you ever tried eating a raw jalapeno to help wake yourself up in the morning?",
	"Blaise.Hearts2.Tue": "When I made my sauce, I used to search for the perfect burn to help give my customers a flavor so strong it would melt the face.",
	"Blaise.Hearts2.Wed": "Make yourself at home, man. Just don’t come near the unmarked bottles on the upper shelf unless you are ready to cry.",
	"Blaise.Hearts2.Thu": "You are out in the dirt all day doing the farming. Keep an eye out for any especially wild peppers for me.",
	"Blaise.Hearts2.Fri": "You really make my shop feel complete and balanced with your presence.",
	"Blaise.Hearts2.Sat": "I just whipped up a batch of garlic sauce that burns slowly when you consume it. Want to come on over and have a taste?",
	"Blaise.Hearts2.Sun": "Sundays is the best day of the week. I put on some music and let the week pass by.",
	"Blaise.Hearts4.Mon": "When I worked in the fancy city kitchen, it used to be so stiff and boring. Out here on the farm, the food has a personality.",
	"Blaise.Hearts4.Tue": "Hey, give me a spoon full of sauce and you will not flinch. You’ve got guts, farmer. Or dead tastebuds.",
	"Blaise.Hearts4.Wed": "If you ever need a pick-me-up while you are out farming, just let me know. I can make a bottle of sauce that will have you finishing all your chores in half the time.",
	"Blaise.Hearts4.Thu": "I’ve been working on a new recipe for my sauce that has a huge kick to it but goes down so smooth.",
	"Blaise.Hearts4.Fri": "It’s awesome having someone like you in the shop. Most folks come to show off for their friends and leave.",
	"Blaise.Hearts4.Sat": "Hey, take a seat! I’ve got some new hot sauce just for you. It’s so hot it will sneak up on you after about thirty seconds! What do you think of it?",
	"Blaise.Hearts4.Sun": "You work so hard, @. Take a breather today. The farm isn’t going to fall behind.",
	"Blaise.Hearts6.Mon": "Man, I had an idea last night while I was sleeping. I made a batch of reaper pepper and wild berries sauce. The color is insane! Can’t wait for you to try it out.",
	"Blaise.Hearts6.Tue": "You know, you are my favorite person to cook for. You’ve got the best disposition.",
	"Blaise.Hearts6.Wed": "I’m thinking of starting a collaboration between the two of us. You can grow some of the special peppers for me to cook up the sauce.",
	"Blaise.Hearts6.Thu": "I normally do not allow anyone to come behind the counter but I’ll accept you anytime, @. Just make sure you wash your hands first!",
	"Blaise.Hearts6.Fri": "I feel most relaxed with you in the kitchen. There is so much chaos in the shop but you bring everyone ease.",
	"Blaise.Hearts6.Sat": "Bottled a mild pepper sauce today. It’s the one that you like so it’s for you. Take a breather from all the spicing today.",
	"Blaise.Hearts6.Sun": "I’m glad you swung by my shop. It’s quiet today and I was hoping that you would come hang out with me.",
	"Blaise.Hearts8.Mon": "I saved a batch of the hottest pepper sauce. It’s my big batch. No one else has gotten to taste it yet.",
	"Blaise.Hearts8.Tue": "I know you ruined my focus today. I was looking at the door in the shop hoping that you would show up.",
	"Blaise.Hearts8.Wed": "I used to think that chill meant serving up boring food but with you in the kitchen today, you balance it out and people can’t help but focus on the sauce.",
	"Blaise.Hearts8.Thu": "I am working on a new recipe for the sauce that I make. I am not using ghost peppers for it or anything too flashy. It’s called The Farmer. Too cheesy?",
	"Blaise.Hearts8.Fri": "Let’s lock the doors early tonight. Just you, me, and some good food. I'll keep it mild.",
	"Blaise.Hearts8.Sat": "I love the burn of good sauce but nothing beats the burn of your love in my day.",
	"Blaise.Hearts8.Sun": "You really make this town feel like home.",
	"Blaise.Hearts10.Mon": "I used to think all sauces had to be fight back but you’ve taught me otherwise.",
	"Blaise.Hearts10.Tue": "You’re the only sweetness I need in my life. ...Wow, okay, that was super cheesy. But I mean it.",
	"Blaise.Hearts10.Wed": "All of my sauces from now on are going to be inspired by you. Fun, grounded and unforgettable.",
	"Blaise.Hearts10.Thu": "I’m all yours, @.",
	"Blaise.Hearts10.Fri": "I love you, man. Let's make some crazy good food together.",
	"Blaise.Hearts10.Sat": "This weekend is for us. The shop can run itself while you’re out with your favorite farmer.",
	"Blaise.Hearts10.Sun": "Just sitting here watching you exist is better than perfecting a recipe.",
	"Blaise.Day.Spring.Mon": "Spring is for planting. Do you have any space on your farm for some cayenne pepper? I could supply some to your garden.",
	"Blaise.Day.Spring.Tue": "The rain has helped the soil and the peppers are going to be extra angry.",
	"Blaise.Day.Spring.Wed": "I'm making a hot sauce using spring blooms. Sounds crazy but trust me it will work.",
	"Blaise.Day.Spring.Thu": "Everything outside smells so fresh tonight.",
	"Blaise.Day.Spring.Fri": "End of the week! It’s time to fire up the grill and experiment with new marinades for the meats.",
	"Blaise.Day.Spring.Sat": "Man, Saturdays in the spring are the best. Want to take a break from cooking and hang out in the breeze?",
	"Blaise.Day.Spring.Sun": "Lazy Sundays in the spring are just perfect. Want to have a cocktail and eat some spicy appetizers?",
	"Blaise.Day.Summer.Mon": "It’s hot outside in spring but trust me it’s hotter in my kitchen.",
	"Blaise.Day.Summer.Tue": "Summer is peak time for peppers. This year’s harvest from the local farm is going to be insane.",
	"Blaise.Day.Summer.Wed": "Make sure to stay hydrated out there @. It’s summer and farming is a heat heavy job.",
	"Blaise.Day.Summer.Thu": "I added a dash of habanero to my iced tea. Want some?",
	"Blaise.Day.Summer.Fri": "Summer nights are the best when people come out and enjoy the heat outside.",
	"Blaise.Day.Summer.Sat": "I’m taking a break from the cook and headed to the beach later today.",
	"Blaise.Day.Summer.Sun": "Would you like to have a barbecue this Sunday? I’m already making the glaze.",
	"Blaise.Day.Fall.Mon": "Fall is harvest time and the smell of roasted peppers is taking over our town.",
	"Blaise.Day.Fall.Tue": "Smoking chilies over an open fire... man, that’s the good stuff.",
	"Blaise.Day.Fall.Wed": "Getting a bit chilly out there huh? Want a drop of the hot stuff?",
	"Blaise.Day.Fall.Thu": "I love the colors of fall and the way they resemble an adobo sauce.",
	"Blaise.Day.Fall.Fri": "Fall is the time of year when people start to crave heartier foods.",
	"Blaise.Day.Fall.Sat": "I'm taking a walk through the fall leaves. It's crisp out here and perfect for clearing your palate.",
	"Blaise.Day.Fall.Sun": "Lazy Sundays in the fall are just perfect. Want a cup of coffee and some spice to start the day?",
	"Blaise.Day.Winter.Mon": "Nothing like a blizzard to make people appreciate a spicy bowl of chili.",
	"Blaise.Day.Winter.Tue": "It’s freezing in the winter! Thanks for the heater @ I haven’t felt the cold in years!",
	"Blaise.Day.Winter.Wed": "I’ve been fermenting a hot sauce since the middle of summer. Finally ready to share it with the world!",
	"Blaise.Day.Winter.Thu": "Stay warm out there @. Come visit me in the shop.",
	"Blaise.Day.Winter.Fri": "Winter is quiet around here but I actually kinda like it.",
	"Blaise.Day.Winter.Sat": "I’m doing some spice experiments today.",
	"Blaise.Day.Winter.Sun": "Winter Sundays are for slow cooking and not getting any work done around here!",
	"Blaise.Gift.StardropTea": "Whoa, this spicy tea you made for me is incredible. Thanks @!",
	"Blaise.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "Oh. Uh. You remembered my birthday right?",
	"Blaise.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "This is an awesome birthday gift.",
	"Blaise.AcceptBirthdayGift": "This is an awesome birthday gift, man!",
	"Blaise.MovieInvitation": "A movie? Hell yeah! Want to sneak in some hot sauce for your popcorn?",
	"Blaise.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "I would if I could but I'm going out with someone else tonight.",
	"Blaise.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "Man my eyes need a screen break. I caught a flick this week!",
	"Blaise.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "I don’t think spending time in the dark with you is a good idea.",
	"Blaise.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "Oof. That flick was about as exciting as plain oatmeal.",
	"Blaise.RejectMovieTicket": "I could use a break from making spicy sauce for my next batch.",
	"Blaise.Dating.Mon": "Hey @. Monday’s just not the same without you here in the shop!",
	"Blaise.Dating.Tue": "I was just thinking about you. We should cook something together tonight.",
	"Blaise.Dating.Wed": "Halfway through the week! Keep up the hard work! I’m rooting for you!",
	"Blaise.Dating.Thu": "I saved the best batch for you today. As always.",
	"Blaise.Dating.Fri": "Date night tonight? I’ll let you pick the spice level. I’ll keep it mild if you want!",
	"Blaise.Dating.Sat": "I love spending my weekends with you. You totally ground me.",
	"Blaise.Dating.Sun": "Let’s just relax today. No stress, no recipes!",
	"Blaise.Dating.General": "You’re the best thing that’s happened to me in a long time.",
	"Blaise.Dating.Rainy": "Rainy days are the best days of the year when you can be cooped up in a warm cozy bed and watch the rain outside. What do you think?",
	"Blaise.Dating.Memory.OneYear": "Can you believe it’s been a year since we first met?",
	"Blaise.breakUp": "Wow. Okay. I guess the fire went out between us. I'll… see you around.",
	"Blaise.RejectMermaidPendant_NeedHouseUpgrade": "Man, I’d love to, but your place is a bit too cramped for the two of us right now.",
	"Blaise.RejectMermaidPendant_NotDatable": "Whoa, slow down there. I just want to taste the hot sauce for now, alright?",
	"Blaise.RejectMermaidPendant_NpcWithSomeoneElse": "I'm already seeing someone else, man. Sorry.",
	"Blaise.RejectMermaidPendant_PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "Aren't you already spoken for? @ doesn't share her kitchen or her heart.",
	"Blaise.RejectMermaidPendant_Under8Hearts": "I'm flattered, but I don't think we're there yet.",
	"Blaise.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts": "We have a great vibe but not yet ready for anything more.",
	"Blaise.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts_AskedAgain": "I told you, man. Not yet.",
	"Blaise.Proposal.Reject": "Whoa, man. I appreciate the thought but I'm not ready for that kind of heat.",
	"Blaise.Bouquet.Accept": "Are these for me? Man, I'd love to be more than just your sauce guy.",
	"Blaise.RejectBouquet_NotDatable": "I'm just a guy who makes hot sauce, man. Don't read too much into it.",
	"Blaise.RejectBouquet_NpcAlreadyMarried": "I'm already married. You missed your shot.",
	"Blaise.RejectBouquet_VeryLowHearts": "Uh, are you pranking me right now?",
	"Blaise.RejectBouquet_LowHearts": "We barely know each other that well. Let's just stick to small talk for now.",
	"Blaise.Bouquet.Reject": "I don't think we have that kind of chemistry between us. Sorry, man.",
	"Blaise.divorced": "Oh. It's you. I'm busy.",
	"Blaise.RejectGift_Divorced": "I really don't want anything from you right now.",
	"Blaise.RejectMermaidPendant_Divorced": "Are you seriously asking me that after everything? No way.",
	"Blaise.RejectBouquet_Divorced": "This is a joke, right? No.",
	"Blaise.Festival.WinterStar_GiveGift_After_Spouse": "Hope you like the gift. I added a little extra love this year.",
	"Blaise.Festival.WinterStar_ReceiveGift": "This is awesome! You got it, secret santa!",
	"Blaise.Resort.General": "The island life is great. Sun, sand and heat from the peppers we grow in the garden.",
	"Blaise.Resort.Bar": "This island has some of the best drinks. Needs more spice though.",
	"Blaise.Resort.Chair": "I could get used to this island life. Just lying in the sun and doing nothing.",
	"Blaise.Resort.Dance": "The music is so infectious down here, lets go!",
	"Blaise.Resort.Entering": "Wow, this place is incredible. I've never seen such beautiful scenery. I'm ready to unplug.",
	"Blaise.Resort.Leaving": "Back to the mainland now. It was fun while it lasted.",
	"Blaise.Resort.Shore": "The ocean breeze is so refreshing. It resets my palate after eating the spicy peppers.",
	"Blaise.Resort.Towel": "Don't bother me right now, I'm achieving peak relaxation.",
	"Blaise.Resort.Umbrella": "Gotta get out of the direct sun for a bit. I prefer the kitchen.",
	"Blaise.Resort.Wander": "I'm gonna go look for some wild peppers on the island. Keep your fingers crossed for me.",
	"Blaise.SummitEvent": "Looking out over the valley from the top of the island is so inspiring. Especially with you right beside me.",
	"Blaise.Engagement.0": "I can't wait to officially call you mine. Lets make it epic!",
	"Blaise.Engagement.1": "I'm already planning the menu. It's going to be absolute fire!",
	"Blaise.SpouseFarmhouseClutter": "Hey, could you clear a path for me? I'm cooking something.",
	"Blaise.Spouse_MonstersInHouse": "Uh, are those supposed to be here? I don't think my sauce will work as bug spray.",
	"Blaise.Marriage.SpouseStardrop": "Whoa, a stardrop? You're sharing this with me? You're the best, @.",
	"Blaise.Marriage.Spring": "Spring on the farm is great. It inspires my cooking every time I go down there.",
	"Blaise.Marriage.Summer": "It's sweltering in here today. Want to grab some iced drinks and hang out on the porch?",
	"Blaise.Marriage.Fall": "I'm going to smoke some peppers today. The house is gonna smell amazing.",
	"Blaise.Marriage.Winter": "I'm keeping the hearth going. Its cold outside but we've got heat in here!",
	"Blaise.Patio": "I love this little farm out here. Perfect spot to make new batches of sauce.",
	"Blaise.Rainy_Day_0": "Rain days are best spent inside, hanging out.",
	"Blaise.Rainy_Day_1": "I've got a pot of chili simmering. Should be ready when you finish up with chores.",
	"Blaise.Rainy_Day_2": "You’re going to get soaked out here. Come back to me soon!",
	"Blaise.Rainy_Day_3": "The sound of the rain is so relaxing. Perfect for focusing on my cooking.",
	"Blaise.Rainy_Day_4": "I made some extra strong coffee today. Need it if you're working in the mud.",
	"Blaise.Rainy_Day_5": "Let’s just take a nap today. The farm can take one lazy afternoon.",
	"Blaise.Indoor_Day_0": "Hey babe. I'm just doing some prep work for the shop.",
	"Blaise.Indoor_Day_1": "Your farm is so peaceful. Totally a lifesaver for me.",
	"Blaise.Indoor_Day_2": "I whipped up a new sauce today. Try it out!",
	"Blaise.Indoor_Day_3": "Working from home today. The kitchen smells like garlic.",
	"Blaise.Indoor_Day_4": "Take it easy today. Don’t work yourself to exhaustion.",
	"Blaise.Indoor_Day_5": "I love seeing you when I wake up. Best part of my day.",
	"Blaise.Rainy_Night_0": "Finally, you're back. Let’s get you dried off.",
	"Blaise.Rainy_Night_1": "Dinner’s ready. Extra spicy to fight the chill!",
	"Blaise.Rainy_Night_2": "Listen to that storm outside. I’m glad it’s not raining on the farm.",
	"Blaise.Rainy_Night_3": "Long day in the rain? Come here, big guy!",
	"Blaise.Rainy_Night_4": "The rain makes me sleepy. Lets turn in early tonight.",
	"Blaise.Rainy_Night_5": "You look exhausted. Sit down and I’ll take care of you tonight.",
	"Blaise.Indoor_Night_0": "Welcome home! How was the farm today?",
	"Blaise.Indoor_Night_1": "I missed you while you were out. Glad you’re back.",
	"Blaise.Indoor_Night_2": "Lets kick back and relax. You earned it!",
	"Blaise.Indoor_Night_3": "I've got some flavor ideas I want to share with you!",
	"Blaise.Indoor_Night_4": "Just finishing up a recipe. I'll be right there with you!",
	"Blaise.Indoor_Night_5": "Every night with you feels like a vacation!",
	"Blaise.funLeave": "I'm heading out for a bit to clear my head. See you later!",
	"Blaise.funReturn": "I'm back! Feeling totally refreshed and ready to cook.",
	"Blaise.Outdoor_General": "Just enjoying the fresh air out here on the farm.",
	"Blaise.Outdoor_0": "Your crops are doing great. You know what you're doing!",
	"Blaise.Outdoor_1": "I might steal some of these veggies for a new sauce!",
	"Blaise.Outdoor_2": "It's beautiful outside here. Much better than the city.",
	"Blaise.Outdoor_3": "Need a hand with the heavy lifting? I'm stronger than I look!",
	"Blaise.Outdoor_4": "I'm just soaking in the views out here. It's mostly you though!",
	"Blaise.spouseRoom": "My little corner of chaos. I try to keep the hot sauce to a minimum!",
	"Blaise.OneKid_0": "Our kid has my fiery spirit!",
	"Blaise.OneKid_1": "Being a dad is harder than cooking. But it's worth it!",
	"Blaise.OneKid_2": "Make sure they don't get into the bottles on the top shelf!",
	"Blaise.OneKid_3": "I caught the little one eating a raw pepper. I was so proud of him!",
	"Blaise.OneKid_4": "They're sleeping so peacefully! Lets enjoy the quiet!",
	"Blaise.TwoKids_0": "Two kids! The farm is getting a little more lively!",
	"Blaise.TwoKids_1": "It's a full house but we love it!",
	"Blaise.TwoKids_2": "I'm gonna teach them everything I know when they're old enough!",
	"Blaise.TwoKids_3": "They're a handful but they're adorable!",
	"Blaise.TwoKids_4": "We make a pretty great team!",
	"Blaise.Good_0": "You're the best, @. Thanks for being part of my life!",
	"Blaise.Good_1": "Woke up feeling amazing today. Time to conquer the farm!",
	"Blaise.Good_2": "Made you your favorite today. Extra love but medium heat!",
	"Blaise.Good_3": "You always know how to make me smile!",
	"Blaise.Good_4": "Life is good right now. I'm a lucky guy!",
	"Blaise.Good_5": "I can take on the world when I'm with you!",
	"Blaise.Good_6": "Thanks for everything you do for me, @!",
	"Blaise.Good_7": "I'm so glad we built our life together!",
	"Blaise.Good_8": "You still give me butterflies sometimes, huh?",
	"Blaise.Good_9": "Every day with you is an adventure!",
	"Blaise.Neutral_0": "Just doing some prep work today.",
	"Blaise.Neutral_1": "Peaceful life on the farm. I love it!",
	"Blaise.Neutral_2": "Hmm? Oh, thinking about cooking.",
	"Blaise.Neutral_3": "Need me to run to town for anything?",
	"Blaise.Neutral_4": "It's a normal day today.",
	"Blaise.Neutral_5": "I'm going to organize my spice rack later.",
	"Blaise.Neutral_6": "Hope your crops are doing well!",
	"Blaise.Neutral_7": "Just hanging out. What's up?",
	"Blaise.Neutral_8": "I might make a batch of marinade later!",
	"Blaise.Neutral_9": "Everything's going smoothly!",
	"Blaise.Bad_0": "I need some space right now.",
	"Blaise.Bad_1": "Leave me alone to cook today.",
	"Blaise.Bad_2": "I'm not in the mood to talk with you.",
	"Blaise.Bad_3": "I burnt a batch earlier and I'm still mad about it.",
	"Blaise.Bad_4": "Can we just have some quiet time?",
	"Blaise.Bad_5": "Can we have some quiet time?",
	"Blaise.Bad_6": "I'm stressed out today.",
	"Blaise.Bad_7": "Things aren't great right now.",
	"Blaise.Bad_8": "I'm just getting through the day.",
	"Blaise.Bad_9": "I need to get out of here to clear my head. See you later.",
	"Blaise.Event.2Heart.1": "Oh, hey @! Perfect timing, man. I need someone to taste test this for me.",
	"Blaise.Event.2Heart.2": "I've been messing around with a smoked habanero sauce. It’s supposed to be warm and easy, nothing crazy. Give it a shot.",
	"Blaise.Event.2Heart.3": "Well? Give it to me straight. How is it?",
	"Blaise.Event.2Heart.Q": "Taste the sauce:",
	"Blaise.Event.2Heart.A1": "It's awesome. Great smoky flavor.",
	"Blaise.Event.2Heart.A2": "It's a little weak. Needs more kick.",
	"Blaise.Event.2Heart.A3": "(Cough uncontrollably)",
	"Blaise.Event.2Heart.R1": "Right? Thanks, man. I try to keep it chill but flavorful.",
	"Blaise.Event.2Heart.R2": "Weak? Oh, I like you. Challenge accepted, my friend.",
	"Blaise.Event.2Heart.R3": "Whoa, easy there! Haha, here, grab some milk. It sneaks up on you.",
	"Blaise.Event.2Heart.4": "Thanks for stopping by. I'm always looking for brave volunteers to hang out and eat.",
	"Blaise.Event.4Heart.1": "Hey man! What's up? Just out here looking for wild fire-peppers.",
	"Blaise.Event.4Heart.2": "They really like the rocky dirt near the falls. Makes 'em super tough and spicy.",
	"Blaise.Event.4Heart.3": "If you ever figure out how to grow these on the farm without them dying, you gotta let me know.",
	"Blaise.Event.6Heart.1": "(Coughing) Okay, note to self. Do not throw ghost peppers into a hot skillet with the windows closed.",
	"Blaise.Event.6Heart.2": "Hey! Sorry about the smoke. Man, I completely botched that batch.",
	"Blaise.Event.6Heart.3": "I push the heat because I thought that's what gave food a soul. But maybe a soul doesn't have to burn your tongue off every single time.",
	"Blaise.Event.6Heart.Q": "Comfort Blaise:",
	"Blaise.Event.6Heart.A1": "Don't quit now. You make awesome food.",
	"Blaise.Event.6Heart.A2": "Just take a break. Chill for a bit.",
	"Blaise.Event.6Heart.R1": "Thanks, man. You're right. I just need to wipe down the counters and try again.",
	"Blaise.Event.6Heart.R2": "Yeah, good call. No point in stressing over it. I'll step away from the stove for a bit.",
	"Blaise.Event.8Heart.1": "Alright, man. You've been practicing. Let's see what you got.",
	"Blaise.Event.8Heart.2": "You're ready.",
	"Blaise.Event.10Heart.1": "I locked the doors tonight. Just wanted a quiet evening.",
	"Blaise.Event.10Heart.2": "Honestly, chasing the hottest pepper is fun and all...",
	"Blaise.Event.10Heart.3": "...but it's way better when I've got my favorite person here to share it with.",
	"Blaise.Event.10Heart.4": "You're awesome, @. Seriously.",
	"Blaise.Event.10Heart.Kiss": "Let's grab something to eat.",
	"Cassidy.Day.Mon": "Fresh start! I woke up at 4 AM because I was so excited to reorganize the sugar packets! Now they're color-coded! Look how pretty they are!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Tue": "Dr. Thorne said I need more sleep. But if I'm sleeping, I'm not doing anything! And if I'm not doing anything, people might forget I'm here! I can sleep later!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Wed": "Hump day! If I keep moving fast enough, I can serve everyone twice as fast! It's about efficiency! And smiles! Mostly smiles!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Thu": "I'm vibrating! Is it the coffee? Probably! But it's also just... life! Isn't today beautiful?",
	"Cassidy.Day.Fri": "Friday night rush! I love it! The noise! The orders! It's like a dance, and I know all the steps!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Sat": "People keep asking me if I'm okay because I'm running around so much. I'm great! I just have a lot of energy to give! Who needs a refill?",
	"Cassidy.Day.Sun": "I sat on my couch for five minutes and all I wanted to do was get up and do something nice for someone. Is that weird? I just like being useful!",
	"Cassidy.Introduction": "Welcome to Timberline Falls! I'm Cassidy! I run the floor at the Drum! Hi! Do you need a table? A menu? A map? A high five? I can reshingle your roof? I have a ladder in the back!",
	"Cassidy.DumpsterDiveComment": "Ew! I mean, I can clean that for you! Wait, are you looking for lost change? I have a dollar!",
	"Cassidy.HitBySlingshot": "Ow! Okay, okay, message received! I'll talk quieter!",
	"Cassidy.WipedMemory": "Do I know you? You look like someone who drinks... black coffee?",
	"Cassidy.Weather.Rain": "I love the rain! But... it makes the shop quiet. Should I be doing something? Maybe I should go clean something!",
	"Cassidy.Weather.Snow": "Snow! It's so pretty! But also cold! I want to shovel the whole town! Can I?",
	"Cassidy.Weather.GreenRain": "Is the rain supposed to be glowing? It looks like radioactive lime juice! ...Can I drink it?",
	"Cassidy.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "The rain is normal again! No superpowers for me, I guess!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts2.Mon": "Welcome! Take a seat! Anywhere! I'll clean it again just to be sure!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts2.Tue": "Need a menu? I know it by heart! I dream about the menu!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts2.Wed": "Can I get you anything? Water? Tea? A kidney? I'm kidding! ...But seriously, if you needed one...",
	"Cassidy.Hearts2.Thu": "I'm doing great! How are you?! Tell me everything! I love hearing about the farm!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts2.Fri": "So many customers! So little time! I wish I had four arms!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts2.Sat": "Smile! It's contagious! If I smile hard enough, maybe everyone will have a good day!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts2.Sun": "See you tomorrow! I'll be here! I'm always here! I love it here!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts4.Mon": "You know... sometimes I wonder if I stopped running around, would people need me any more? I like the feeling of being needed.",
	"Cassidy.Hearts4.Tue": "I had a nightmare where I dropped a tray of coffees and everyone was looking at me like I did something wrong. I don't want to make anyone sad!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts4.Wed": "You're nice. You don't ask for much. It makes me want to do more for you!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts4.Thu": "Do you think I talk too much? Don't answer that! I just get so excited!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts4.Fri": "My mom always used to say that idle hands are the devil's playthings. I think idle hands just happen to be bored!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts4.Sat": "I baked cookies today! Want one?! I made six dozen!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts4.Sun": "I tried to take a nap but ended up just staring at the ceiling. I feel like I'm invisible when I'm not doing anything!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts6.Mon": "You're my favorite regular customer! You're the only one who ever says 'thank you' to me!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts6.Tue": "I feel calmer when you're here. Weird! I usually find myself bouncing off the walls. But with you, I feel happy.",
	"Cassidy.Hearts6.Wed": "Maybe I should take a break from all this running around? ...Nah! There's so much to do! And I love every minute of it!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts6.Thu": "I wrote your name on this cup with a heart. Oops! I do that for everyone! ...Well, maybe not everyone!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts6.Fri": "Let's hang out! After I clean the grease trap! The windows! The ceiling fans! I want to make you feel special!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts6.Sat": "You make me smile for real. Not the 'thank you' smile when I'm serving coffee. The real one!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts6.Sun": "I missed you today! It's true! Business has been slow today!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts8.Mon": "I took a walk today! Without a destination! I didn't do anything special! But it felt really nice! Saw a bird!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts8.Tue": "I think I'm falling for you. Or maybe I just had too much espresso this morning. ...No. It's you. You're the best person in the world!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts8.Wed": "You see me. Not the waitress! You see me! And you still come to visit me! That's really cool!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts8.Thu": "I usually have something to say when I'm sitting with people. But... with you, it's okay to be silent!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts8.Fri": "Thank you for listening to me. Usually I'm the one that's listening!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts8.Sat": "You're the only person who doesn't look away when I stop serving tables. I'm learning to just sit with you!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts8.Sun": "I made you a coffee. Decaf. Sit down. Drink it. ...Please? I just want to do something nice for you.",
	"Cassidy.Hearts10.Mon": "You're my energy boost! Better than coffee! And way sweeter!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts10.Tue": " I love you more than coffee! And I really, really love coffee!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts10.Wed": "I used to think I needed to do all the chores around here to earn your attention. But with you, I could do absolutely nothing and you'd see me all the same!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts10.Thu": "You're perfect. Like a fresh croissant!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts10.Fri": " I'm the luckiest girl in the world! I feel like I won the lottery!",
	"Cassidy.Hearts10.Sat": "Let's run away from Timberline Falls! Or better yet, just stay here! For once in my life, just stop moving for a second. With you.",
	"Cassidy.Hearts10.Sun": "I love our life! It's busy, but it's ours.",
	"Cassidy.Day.Spring.Mon": "Spring cleaning! I had to get the baseboards looking nice for our customers! Everyone deserves a sparkly baseboard!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Spring.Tue": "I saw Jett staring at the wall so I brought him a muffin! Feeding people makes the world right, right?",
	"Cassidy.Day.Spring.Wed": "Bea told me to take a five minute break so I used the time to organize the silverware drawer! What else can I do?",
	"Cassidy.Day.Spring.Thu": "If I ever stopped moving, my feet would hurt. So I'll just never stop moving!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Spring.Fri": "Tourist season is here! People treat me like a vending machine! But I'm okay with that! Vending machines make people happy and I want to!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Spring.Sat": "I couldn't sleep last night until I scrubbed the floors! Look how shiny they are! Hi, face!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Spring.Sun": "What, no rest days? Sunday is for Pre-Monday Prep Day at least! I want to make sure I'm ready for tomorrow!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Summer.Mon": "It's so hot in here! But that's good because it makes people thirsty! Business is booming! I haven't sat down in six hours! Go team!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Summer.Tue": "I think I forgot to eat today. Whoops! I'm always rushing to help everyone else eat!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Summer.Wed": "I overheard Vance arguing with a man so I helped him organize his ammo crates. He yelled at me to evacuate the sector! What a jerk! I left him a cookie on the grenade box!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Summer.Thu": "My feet are numb. That's good, right? Means they're not hurting!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Summer.Fri": "I'm fine! Everything is fine! The ice machine broke but I fixed it! Well, I just put a bucket under it! Problem solved!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Summer.Sat": "Smile! It's contagious! I smiled at a grumpy tourist but he was still grumpy! At least I felt good about myself!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Summer.Sun": "I tried to read a book. Got through one page before I started organizing the bookshelf!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Fall.Mon": "The leaves are falling from the trees! It's so pretty! I want to rake the leaves and let the kids jump in! Can I do it? Do I have time?",
	"Cassidy.Day.Fall.Tue": "I caught a cold! It's fine! I'll wear a mask and wash my hands a hundred times!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Fall.Wed": "I dropped a plate today. It hurts! Bea gave me a hug and told me it's okay! Bea is the best!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Fall.Thu": "The days are getting shorter. Less time to get things done! I have to work faster to beat the sun!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Fall.Fri": "I wish I was a bear. Hibernation sounds cozy. But then who would serve the coffee? The bears can't do it!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Fall.Sat": "I'm still helpful around here, right? Even if I'm a little slow today? I'm trying my best!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Fall.Sun": "I made a list of all the things I did today. Only ten things. I can do twenty tomorrow!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Winter.Mon": "It's dark outside. It's cold. But the Drum is warm and smells like cinnamon! Why would I ever leave Timberline Falls?",
	"Cassidy.Day.Winter.Tue": "My back hurts a little. Dr. Thorne says it's stress fractures. I say it's just the hustle of working all day!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Winter.Wed": "No customers today. It's so quiet! I'm baking extra muffins for the shelter for the homeless! Someone needs to eat!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Winter.Thu": "I'm reading a book on how to relax! It tells you to breathe deeply! Look at me go!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Winter.Fri": "Can you check my forehead? Are you sure I don't feel warm? ...No thanks! I don't want to go home!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Winter.Sat": "I fell asleep standing up! I dreamt I was a coffee pot!",
	"Cassidy.Day.Winter.Sun": "I think... I think I need a break! ...Nah! What would I do with all these empty chairs?!",
	"Cassidy.Gift.StardropTea": "Whoa! What's that incredible smell? It smells like happiness!",
	"Cassidy.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "Oh! For my birthday? Um... thanks!",
	"Cassidy.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "For my birthday I got a present from you! That's better than a triple-shot of espresso!",
	"Cassidy.AcceptBirthdayGift": "Aw! Thank you! Birthdays are an excuse to eat more sugar!",
	"Cassidy.MovieInvitation": "A movie?! Like sitting still in the dark for two hours?! ...I'll try!",
	"Cassidy.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "Oh! Someone else beat you to it! I'm already booked!",
	"Cassidy.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I already saw a movie this week! What are the odds of me sitting still twice in one week?!",
	"Cassidy.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "I don't think sitting in the dark with you is such a good idea right now.",
	"Cassidy.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "Um... that movie looks a little too slow for me.",
	"Cassidy.RejectMovieTicket": "I can't today! I have a lot of tables to clean! Rain check?",
	"Cassidy.Dating.Mon": "A new week has come around and we're still together! I'm vibrating with joy!",
	"Cassidy.Dating.Tue": "I put a little extra foam on your coffee. Because I love you! And foam is great!",
	"Cassidy.Dating.Wed": "I'm trying to pace myself today. Taking it slow. Like... walking instead of running. It's hard! But you help.",
	"Cassidy.Dating.Thu": "I was daydreaming about you and accidentally made Mrs. Mullins a cup of coffee instead of decaf! Phew! I'm so glad I didn't!",
	"Cassidy.Dating.Fri": "Date night?! After my shift?! I'm the one who will be smelling of roasted beans and love!",
	"Cassidy.Dating.Sat": "You're the best part of my weekends.",
	"Cassidy.Dating.Sun": "Sunday prep days are so much better when I know I'll be prepping for a week with you!",
	"Cassidy.Dating.General": "Hi sweetie! Need a top-off on your energy? I've got hugs ready!",
	"Cassidy.Dating.Rainy": "It's raining! Wanna cuddle under the covers? I'm okay with just sitting still with you!",
	"Cassidy.Dating.Memory.OneYear": "A whole year?! It's been a whole year since we first started dating! I should bake a cake! A huge one!",
	"Cassidy.breakUp": "Oh. Okay. I guess I'll just... get back to work then. Have a good life.",
	"Cassidy.RejectMermaidPendant_NeedHouseUpgrade": "I'd love to, but your house is a little small! Where would I put my emergency coffee stash?",
	"Cassidy.RejectMermaidPendant_NotDatable": "Wait, what? We're not even dating yet! I'm fast to get from point A to point B!",
	"Cassidy.RejectMermaidPendant_NpcWithSomeoneElse": "I'm sorry! I'm already seeing someone else! Aren't you? I'm busy with my life but not blind to who comes here!",
	"Cassidy.RejectMermaidPendant_PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "Aren't you dating someone else?! I'm busy, but I'm not blind!",
	"Cassidy.RejectMermaidPendant_Under8Hearts": "A pendant? For me? I don't think we're there yet! Let's just stick to coffee for now.",
	"Cassidy.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts": "This is beautiful, but... I'm not ready. I'm sorry.",
	"Cassidy.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts_AskedAgain": "I still feel the same way. Please give me some time!",
	"Cassidy.Proposal.Reject": "A pendant? It's pretty... but I don't think I can wear jewelry while I work. Sorry!",
	"Cassidy.Bouquet.Accept": "Flowers! For... me? I didn't *do* anything for you today. I didn't refill your coffee. I didn't bake you a cookie. ...Why would you give me this if I haven't earned it?",
	"Cassidy.RejectBouquet_NotDatable": "Flowers? For me? I’m flattered but I don’t think I’m looking for flowers just yet.",
	"Cassidy.RejectBouquet_NpcAlreadyMarried": "I’m married! You know that, right?!",
	"Cassidy.RejectBouquet_VeryLowHearts": "Um, I barely know you! Maybe we should talk more first?",
	"Cassidy.RejectBouquet_LowHearts": "Oh... thanks, but I just see us as friends. Customers!",
	"Cassidy.Bouquet.Reject": "Oh... um... that’s sweet, but I’m too busy organizing the sugar packets!",
	"Cassidy.divorced": "Please. Just leave me alone. I’ve work to do.",
	"Cassidy.RejectGift_Divorced": "I don’t want anything from you.",
	"Cassidy.RejectMermaidPendant_Divorced": "Are you joking? After everything? No.",
	"Cassidy.RejectBouquet_Divorced": "Don’t do this. I don’t want your flowers.",
	"Cassidy.Festival.WinterStar_GiveGift_After_Spouse": "I got you something special! Happy Feast of the Winter Star, my love!",
	"Cassidy.Festival.WinterStar_ReceiveGift": "For me? Oh, you shouldn’t have! I’m so glad you got it!",
	"Cassidy.Resort.General": "Vacation mode! I’m trying to relax!",
	"Cassidy.Resort.Bar": "I wonder if Gus needs help behind the bar? Just for five minutes? Please? I need to do something!",
	"Cassidy.Resort.Chair": "I can’t sit still! This chair is torture!",
	"Cassidy.Resort.Dance": "Dance party! Woo!",
	"Cassidy.Resort.Entering": "Vacation?! I don't know how to vacation! What do I do with my hands?! Should I serve drinks?",
	"Cassidy.Resort.Leaving": "Back to work! I missed the smell of roasted beans!",
	"Cassidy.Resort.Shore": "Look at the ocean! It’s so big!",
	"Cassidy.Resort.Towel": "Sand castle time?! Let’s build a really big one!",
	"Cassidy.Resort.Umbrella": "Shade is nice! But sun is more energetic!",
	"Cassidy.Resort.Wander": "Look at that bird! Look at that tree! Everything is amazing!",
	"Cassidy.SummitEvent": "The view up here is amazing! I want to stand still and watch the world go by!",
	"Cassidy.Engagement.0": "We're getting married! I've been making lists of things to do for the wedding. So many lists! It's great!",
	"Cassidy.Engagement.1": "I promise I’ll try not to run down the aisle! I’ll walk! Nice and slow!",
	"Cassidy.SpouseFarmhouseClutter": "Honey, I love you, but the mess in the kitchen is driving me crazy! Let me organize it!",
	"Cassidy.Spouse_MonstersInHouse": "Aaah! Monsters! In the house! I can fight them with a broom, but maybe you should handle this!",
	"Cassidy.Marriage.SpouseStardrop": "I found this weird fruit! I bet it tastes like espresso and sunshine! I want you to have it! You work harder than me!",
	"Cassidy.Marriage.Spring": "Springtime on the farm! The air is so fresh! I watered the crops for you today, and fed the animals, and fixed a fence!",
	"Cassidy.Marriage.Summer": "It's scorching out there! I made three pitchers of iced tea for you! Make sure you hydrate!",
	"Cassidy.Marriage.Fall": "The leaves look beautiful on the farm. I was going to rake them up but they look so cozy!",
	"Cassidy.Marriage.Winter": "It's cold out there! Stay inside with me today! I'll brew you a cup of cocoa and we can relax!",
	"Cassidy.Patio": "I set up my own little coffee station out here in the barn! Perfect spot for a quick coffee!",
	"Cassidy.Rainy_Day_0": "Rainy days are perfect for cleaning! I just mopped the house twice today!",
	"Cassidy.Rainy_Day_1": "You're not going out in that rain are you? Stay here with me instead!",
	"Cassidy.Rainy_Day_2": "I'm baking bread today! It takes forever to rise but once it's done, it smells amazing!",
	"Cassidy.Rainy_Day_3": "The roof is leaking! Just kidding! I checked five times before you arrived!",
	"Cassidy.Rainy_Day_4": "Even when its gloomy outside, you make it bright in here.",
	"Cassidy.Rainy_Day_5": "I tried to knit but got too bored to complete even one project! I just sorted the yarn by color instead!",
	"Cassidy.Indoor_Day_0": "I made you breakfast! And lunch! And dinner is prepped! You're welcome!",
	"Cassidy.Indoor_Day_1": "Do we need more chairs in here?",
	"Cassidy.Indoor_Day_2": "I love living in this farm with you. It's so peaceful!",
	"Cassidy.Indoor_Day_3": "If you need me I'll be color coding the bookshelf.",
	"Cassidy.Indoor_Day_4": "You look tired. Sit down! I'll take care of you!",
	"Cassidy.Indoor_Day_5": "Farm life is different from the diner but I'm getting the hang of it!",
	"Cassidy.Rainy_Night_0": "Long day? I'll rub your shoulders. You work so hard!",
	"Cassidy.Rainy_Night_1": "I love listening to the rain on the windows.",
	"Cassidy.Rainy_Night_2": "I'm so exhausted but in a good way. Farm life is hard work!",
	"Cassidy.Rainy_Night_3": "Let's go to sleep soon. I've got a big list of things to do tomorrow!",
	"Cassidy.Rainy_Night_4": "Is it weird that I miss the hum of the espresso machine?",
	"Cassidy.Rainy_Night_5": "Goodnight my love. Dream of caffeinated sheep.",
	"Cassidy.Indoor_Night_0": "You're home! The highlight of my day!",
	"Cassidy.Indoor_Night_1": "Did you eat? I saved some leftovers. I'll heat them up for you!",
	"Cassidy.Indoor_Night_2": "I washed all the blankets. They smell amazing!",
	"Cassidy.Indoor_Night_3": "Tell me everything about your day!",
	"Cassidy.Indoor_Night_4": "I'm ready to sleep for 100 years or until 6 AM!",
	"Cassidy.Indoor_Night_5": "I'm so happy we're together.",
	"Cassidy.funLeave": "I'm headed into town! I'm gonna see how the Drum is surviving without me!",
	"Cassidy.funReturn": "I'm back from town! Missed you!",
	"Cassidy.Outdoor_General": "The air out here is fresh and amazing!",
	"Cassidy.Outdoor_0": "I weeded the garden! It looks so neat!",
	"Cassidy.Outdoor_1": "Your farm is so huge!",
	"Cassidy.Outdoor_2": "I saw a bunny! I tried to catch it but it was too fast for me!",
	"Cassidy.Outdoor_3": "The crops are coming in really nicely! You're doing a great job on the farm!",
	"Cassidy.Outdoor_4": "I'm just getting some sun! Dr. Thorne told me I need more Vitamin D!",
	"Cassidy.spouseRoom": "Do you like the way I set up the farm? My coffee machine is close to where I sleep!",
	"Cassidy.OneKid_0": "Our baby is full of energy! Where does he get it from?!",
	"Cassidy.OneKid_1": "I reorganized the toy chest! It's alphabetized now!",
	"Cassidy.OneKid_2": "Being a parent is the best job in the world. I've had a lot of jobs in my life!",
	"Cassidy.OneKid_3": "What do you think about the kids growing up to be farmers or baristas?",
	"Cassidy.OneKid_4": "I feel exhausted but I wouldn't trade this life for anything!",
	"Cassidy.TwoKids_0": "Two kids means twice the energy!",
	"Cassidy.TwoKids_1": "The house is a mess but I can't help myself! I'm so fond of the kids!",
	"Cassidy.TwoKids_2": "I caught them having my coffee! They're in trouble!",
	"Cassidy.TwoKids_3": "What a great team we make!",
	"Cassidy.TwoKids_4": "I'm so happy right now. I think my heart is about to explode!",
	"Cassidy.Good_0": "You're the best part of my life.",
	"Cassidy.Good_1": "I love our life!",
	"Cassidy.Good_2": "You look great today! Have I told you that?",
	"Cassidy.Good_3": "I'm so lucky to have you in my life!",
	"Cassidy.Good_4": "Let's conquer the world today!",
	"Cassidy.Good_5": "Every day with you feels like a double shot of joy!",
	"Cassidy.Good_6": "You make me want to slow down and enjoy the moment!",
	"Cassidy.Good_7": "I made you coffee today!",
	"Cassidy.Good_8": "You're my hero!",
	"Cassidy.Good_9": "I love you more than words can say!",
	"Cassidy.Neutral_0": "Another busy day ahead!",
	"Cassidy.Neutral_1": "Don't forget to stretch before you go farm!",
	"Cassidy.Neutral_2": "I'll be here if you need me!",
	"Cassidy.Neutral_3": "Hmm? Oh, just making a list.",
	"Cassidy.Neutral_4": "Stay hydrated today!",
	"Cassidy.Neutral_5": "Looks like good weather today!",
	"Cassidy.Neutral_6": "I'm going into town later today!",
	"Cassidy.Neutral_7": "Hope you have a great day!",
	"Cassidy.Neutral_8": "Today I'm reorganizing the pantry!",
	"Cassidy.Neutral_9": "Take care of yourselves out there!",
	"Cassidy.Bad_0": "I'm really busy right now. Can we talk later?",
	"Cassidy.Bad_1": "I don't have the energy for this today.",
	"Cassidy.Bad_2": "Please just leave me alone for a bit.",
	"Cassidy.Bad_3": "The house is a mess and I'm stressed out. Don't push me!",
	"Cassidy.Bad_4": "I'm working through some things.",
	"Cassidy.Bad_5": "I don't want to talk right now.",
	"Cassidy.Bad_6": "It's overwhelming today.",
	"Cassidy.Bad_7": "Why aren't you helping out more with the farm?",
	"Cassidy.Bad_8": "I feel like I'm doing everything myself!",
	"Cassidy.Bad_9": "Just go do your farm stuff!",
	"Cassidy.Event.Breakdown.01": "I'm fine! I'm fine! Just let me... ow.",
	"Cassidy.Event.Breakdown.02": "Don't touch it! If I sit down, I can't get back up. And the lunch rush is coming.",
	"Cassidy.Event.Breakdown.03": "I can't stop! If I stop, Bea has to do it all herself. If I stop, I'm just... a burden.",
	"Cassidy.Event.Breakdown.04": "I'm supposed to be the one who helps! I'm not the one who *needs* help!",
	"Cassidy.Event.Breakdown.05": "I don't know who I am if I'm not useful, @. Tell me I'm still useful.",
	"Cassidy.Mail.Welcome": "Hi neighbor!^Just wanted to welcome you to the valley! If you ever need caffeine or sugar (or both), come see me at the Drum!^I made these cookies this morning. They might be a *little* burnt, but the sugar content makes up for it!^-Cassidy",
	"Cassidy.Event.2Heart.01": "Oh! @! Sorry, I was just... checking if these napkins are perfectly symmetrical.$1",
	"Cassidy.Event.2Heart.02": "If they aren't, the whole table feels 'off', you know? I want everyone to have a perfect experience!",
	"Cassidy.Event.2Heart.Q": "Am I overthinking this?",
	"Cassidy.Event.2Heart.A1": "You're right, symmetry is key! I'll help you check them.",
	"Cassidy.Event.2Heart.A2": "Cassidy, I think people just want the biscuits.",
	"Cassidy.Event.2Heart.R1": "Thank you! It is so nice to have someone who understands the vision!$1",
	"Cassidy.Event.2Heart.R2": "Haha... you're probably right. But I just want everything to be nice...$5",
	"Cassidy.Event.4Heart.01": "Oh... @. I didn't hear you walk up.",
	"Cassidy.Event.4Heart.02": "I came out here to clear my head, but I can't stop thinking about the dining room layout. My brain is just... running.$5",
	"Cassidy.Event.4Heart.03": "Look at the falls. They never stop. Just constant, crashing energy.",
	"Cassidy.Event.4Heart.04": "Sometimes I feel like I'm the river. If I stop moving, I'll just dry up completely.$2",
	"Cassidy.Event.4Heart.Q": "You know what I mean?",
	"Cassidy.Event.4Heart.A1": "You're allowed to rest, Cassidy.",
	"Cassidy.Event.4Heart.A2": "Let's just watch the water for a bit.",
	"Cassidy.Event.4Heart.A3": "If you dry up, I'll bring my watering can.",
	"Cassidy.Event.4Heart.R1": "Rest... right. It sounds so simple when you say it. Thank you.$1",
	"Cassidy.Event.4Heart.R2": "Okay. Yes. Just... watch the water. That sounds nice.$4",
	"Cassidy.Event.4Heart.R3": "*Snorts* You would, wouldn't you? ...Thank you. I needed that.$3",
	"Cassidy.Event.4Heart.05": "It really is beautiful out here. I feel like I can finally breathe.",
	"Cassidy.Event.6Heart.01": "I'm fine! I'm fine! Don't look at me, I'll clean it up! Just let me... ow.$2",
	"Cassidy.Event.6Heart.02": "Don't touch it! If I sit down, I can't get back up. And the lunch rush is coming. I have to stand up!$5",
	"Cassidy.Event.6Heart.03": "I can't stop! If I stop, Bea has to do it all herself. If I stop, I'm just... a burden.$2",
	"Cassidy.Event.6Heart.04": "I'm supposed to be the one who helps! I'm not the one who *needs* help!$5",
	"Cassidy.Event.6Heart.05": "I don't know who I am if I'm not useful, @. Tell me I'm still useful. Please.$2",
	"Cassidy.Event.6Heart.Q": "Tell me I'm still useful. Please.",
	"Cassidy.Event.6Heart.A1": "You don't have to earn your place here, Cassidy.",
	"Cassidy.Event.6Heart.A2": "Bea loves you, not just the work you do.",
	"Cassidy.Event.6Heart.A3": "Right now, it's my turn to be useful. Sit still.",
	"Cassidy.Event.6Heart.R1": "...I... I want to believe that. Thank you.$2",
	"Cassidy.Event.6Heart.R2": "I know. I know she does. My brain just... forgets sometimes.$2",
	"Cassidy.Event.6Heart.R3": "...Okay. Okay, I'm sitting.$5",
	"Cassidy.Event.6Heart.06": "Can you... just stay here a minute? Until my ankle stops throbbing?",
	"Cassidy.Event.8Heart.01": "Oh. @. You caught me. I'm... I'm taking a break. In the middle of the day.",
	"Cassidy.Event.8Heart.02": "Bea sent me out here. She actually took my apron away. She told me if I came back inside before an hour passed, she'd fire me.$5",
	"Cassidy.Event.8Heart.03": "I was having a panic attack because the salt shakers were empty. The salt shakers, @. It was so stupid.$2",
	"Cassidy.Event.8Heart.04": "But sitting here... the building didn't burn down. The customers are still eating. The world didn't end just because I stopped moving.",
	"Cassidy.Event.8Heart.05": "It's terrifying to realize you aren't holding the sky up. But... it's also kind of a relief.",
	"Cassidy.Event.8Heart.Q": "... it's also kind of a relief.",
	"Cassidy.Event.8Heart.A1": "I'm really proud of you, Cassidy.",
	"Cassidy.Event.8Heart.A2": "See? The world survives without you.",
	"Cassidy.Event.8Heart.A3": "Mind if I sit with you?",
	"Cassidy.Event.8Heart.R1": "...Thank you. That means a lot. Truly.$1",
	"Cassidy.Event.8Heart.R2": "Hey, don't sound too happy about my sudden lack of importance! ...But yes. You're right.$3",
	"Cassidy.Event.8Heart.R3": "Please do. I have about forty minutes left on my mandatory exile.$1",
	"Cassidy.Event.10Heart.01": "The stars are so quiet tonight. No orders to take. No tables to wipe. No one to apologize to.",
	"Cassidy.Event.10Heart.02": "I spent so long trying to be 'useful' that I forgot how to just be 'me'. I didn't think 'me' was enough.$2",
	"Cassidy.Event.10Heart.03": "But you don't ask me to carry anything for you. You just hold my hand.$4",
	"Cassidy.Event.10Heart.04": "I don't need to run anymore. I'm staying right here, @. With you. My favorite resting place.$1",
	"Cassidy.Event.10Heart.Q": "With you. My favorite resting place...",
	"Cassidy.Event.10Heart.A1": "You're perfect just the way you are.",
	"Cassidy.Event.10Heart.A2": "I'll always hold your hand.",
	"Cassidy.Event.10Heart.A3": "You're my favorite resting place, too.",
	"Cassidy.Event.10Heart.R1": "...I think I finally believe that.$1",
	"Cassidy.Event.10Heart.R2": "Don't let go, then. Ever.$4",
	"Cassidy.Event.10Heart.R3": "Good. Then we aren't going anywhere.$1",
	"Cassidy.Event.12Heart.1": "Oh! @! You're back! I was just... I was going to scrub the ceiling fans, and then I thought maybe the porch needs repainting, and...$4",
	"Cassidy.Event.12Heart.2": "Wait. I'm doing it again, aren't I? Trying to earn my keep? I woke up and realized I didn't make breakfast and I panicked.$2",
	"Cassidy.Event.12Heart.Q": "You don't... you don't keep a scorecard, do you?$2",
	"Cassidy.Event.12Heart.A1": "Never. You're enough just as you are.",
	"Cassidy.Event.12Heart.A2": "I'd prefer if you just sat with me.",
	"Cassidy.Event.12Heart.R1": "Really? ...I'm trying so hard to believe that. Thank you for not letting me run away from myself.$1",
	"Cassidy.Event.12Heart.R2": "Just sit? Like... for more than five minutes? Okay. I'll try. For you.$1",
	"Cassidy.Event.14Heart.1": "I wanted to come back here. To the Falls.",
	"Cassidy.Event.14Heart.2": "The first time we were here, I told you I felt like the river. That if I stopped moving, I'd dry up.$2",
	"Cassidy.Event.14Heart.3": "But look at the pools at the bottom. The water stops there for a second. It rests. And it doesn't disappear... it just gets deeper.$1",
	"Cassidy.Event.14Heart.4": "I’m not running anymore, @. I'm deep. I'm whole. And I'm staying right here.$4",
	"Cassidy.Event.14Heart.Q": "I'm staying right here.",
	"Cassidy.Event.14Heart.A1": "I love the depths we've found together.",
	"Cassidy.Event.14Heart.A2": "You are the most beautiful part of this river.",
	"Cassidy.Event.14Heart.A3": "(Silently hold her hand)",
	"Cassidy.Event.14Heart.R1": "We really have, haven't we? Thank you for jumping in with me.$1",
	"Cassidy.Event.14Heart.R2": "Oh, stop it. You're going to make me cry into the water.$4",
	"Cassidy.Event.14Heart.R3": "(She squeezes your hand tightly) Words aren't always needed anymore, are they?$1",
	"Clark.Day.Mon": "So, after extensive research, Mondays have a 34% higher error rate due to cognitive fatigue.",
	"Clark.Day.Tue": "I'm trying to optimize the supply routing for Timberline Falls. If I adjust the delivery windows by just 14 minutes, we can save... Ah, I'm doing it again, aren't I? Using numbers to avoid small talk. Sorry.",
	"Clark.Day.Wed": "I don't know how you do it. Soil quality, weather patterns, crop yield... farming has too many variables. I need my data neatly organized in rows, or I get... overwhelmed.",
	"Clark.Day.Thu": "I accidentally left my primary notebook at home today. I feel completely unmoored.",
	"Clark.Day.Fri": "TGIF. That stands for 'Tracking General Inventory Fluctuations', right? ...That was a joke. See? I can do casual Friday banter.",
	"Clark.Day.Sat": "I have to commute out to Pelican Town today. I told my boss I'm running comparisons on market volume, but really, I just want to make sure my calculations aren't hurting smaller businesses.",
	"Clark.Day.Sun": "I'm observing the local businesses today. The structural integrity of a hard-shell taco is fascinating, but the failure rate upon first bite is nearly 60%. I should probably warn Gustavo, but he yells at me.",
	"Clark.Introduction": "Oh, hello. You must be the new farmer. I ran a predictive model on your arrival, and you are actually 3.2 days earlier than my baseline projection... wait. Sorry, that’s incredibly weird to say out loud. I'm Clark. I handle logistics and analytics for BuyCo. It's... nice to meet you.",
	"Clark.DumpsterDiveComment": "Statistically speaking, the pathogen density in that receptacle is exceptionally high. Please cease that activity immediately.",
	"Clark.HitBySlingshot": "Ouch! The velocity of that projectile was entirely unnecessary! Are you malfunctioning?!",
	"Clark.WipedMemory": "I have a sudden gap in my localized memory matrix... It feels like a corrupted file in my own brain. Have we met?",
	"Clark.Weather.Rain": "Precipitation levels are optimal for crop growth, but my shoes are entirely incompatible with this mud.",
	"Clark.Weather.Snow": "The albedo effect of the snow is wreaking havoc on my ocular sensors... I mean, my eyes. It's very bright.",
	"Clark.Weather.GreenRain": "This weather event has no historical precedent! All my atmospheric models are failing!",
	"Clark.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "That was an extreme statistical anomaly. I am still recalibrating my sensors.",
	"Clark.Hearts2.Mon": "You know, the data suggests that you are incredibly productive when you have a new arrival in the community. I'm impressed by your capabilities and yet slightly intimidated by your skills.",
	"Clark.Hearts2.Tue": "BuyCo is not like other companies out there in that we are interested in the growth of the local economy. Well, at least that's what is stated in the pamphlets that come with each BuyCo product. I'm just interested in making sure that the supply lines for our area remain open.",
	"Clark.Hearts2.Wed": "I tried to calculate the nutritional values of a parsnip yesterday. Nevertheless, I spent three hours thinking about root systems instead.",
	"Clark.Hearts2.Thu": "Are you on the clock today? Only for statistical curiosity out of my part. I'm trying to determine when to say hello to you.",
	"Clark.Hearts2.Fri": "I've been trying to model the local economy on my spreadsheet. Perhaps I'm missing an element of the community.",
	"Clark.Hearts2.Sat": "JojaMart is an interesting store. I feel like the lights are hostile to all who enter.",
	"Clark.Hearts2.Sun": "I was trying to find Bea today and spotted her in the woods! It defies logic, yet she is happy in the woods.",
	"Clark.Hearts4.Mon": "Good morning! According to the data, there was an 80% chance that I would encounter you today. I'm glad that your calculations were as accurate as they were.",
	"Clark.Hearts4.Tue": "I closed my laptop and took a few minutes to look out the window. What a rebellious action.",
	"Clark.Hearts4.Wed": "Efficiency is not the most important element in our community of Timberline Falls.",
	"Clark.Hearts4.Thu": "You work incredibly hard. I've been monitoring your schedule to ensure that you are getting enough rest.",
	"Clark.Hearts4.Fri": "I'm trying something new today. I'm gathering qualitative data about the people here. Wish me luck!",
	"Clark.Hearts4.Sat": "Pierre's store is incredibly chaotic in the way that he displays his products. Yet, he gets a lot of enjoyment out of it from his customers.",
	"Clark.Hearts4.Sun": "I purchased a taco from JojaMart today and did not calculate the calories. I ate it and it was both terrifying and wonderful.",
	"Clark.Hearts6.Mon": "Today I started a new folder on my laptop. It is titled 'Anomalies' and contains information on the individuals in this community and the reasons for my appreciation of each individual.",
	"Clark.Hearts6.Tue": "You always seem to understand what individuals in the community need. Is that an algorithm that you use or have you developed a sense of empathy towards these individuals in the community?",
	"Clark.Hearts6.Wed": "I presented a proposal to corporate to change the routes that we use to deliver to the individuals in our community. I accounted for the quirks of the residents here in Timberline. Unfortunately, they thought I was crazy.",
	"Clark.Hearts6.Thu": "I'm actually enjoying the life that I've found in Timberline Falls.",
	"Clark.Hearts6.Fri": "If you ever need help optimizing your farm layout, let me know. I won't judge your current setup. Well, maybe just a little bit.",
	"Clark.Hearts6.Sat": "I do not have to commute to the city for research any longer. The best data comes from Timberline Falls.",
	"Clark.Hearts6.Sun": "I have been factoring in the time to engage in leisure activities in my projections for each week.",
	"Clark.Hearts8.Mon": "Starting the week off strong by neglecting to check my email until after breakfast.",
	"Clark.Hearts8.Tue": "You know, when I first came to Timberline I thought that I would fix the supply chain and head out of town. I was wrong though.",
	"Clark.Hearts8.Wed": "It's wonderful that we crossed paths. I've enjoyed getting to know you and you are the only element I did not account for in my decision to come to this town.",
	"Clark.Hearts8.Thu": "I threw out the model that I created for the logistics of the town. Instead, I am simply going to trust the individuals in the community to complete their tasks to the best of their abilities. It's very terrifying but it's what we can do together.",
	"Clark.Hearts8.Fri": "Let's forget about the spreadsheets for today. What are you up to?",
	"Clark.Hearts8.Sat": "I think I might end up preferring the quiet of the town over the city.",
	"Clark.Hearts8.Sun": "Timberline Falls has a way of slowing you down. I'm finally learning to appreciate that.",
	"Clark.Hearts10.Mon": "Mondays are great when you actually like the people you're working with.",
	"Clark.Hearts10.Tue": "I owe you a lot, Farmer. You taught me how to actually live in a town, not just analyze it.",
	"Clark.Hearts10.Wed": "If I charted my happiness on a graph since I met you, the trend line would be entirely vertical.",
	"Clark.Hearts10.Thu": "You're always running around taking care of everyone else. Let me know if you ever need someone to run the numbers for you.",
	"Clark.Hearts10.Fri": "I've cleared my schedule for the afternoon. No data, no screens. Just enjoying the day.",
	"Clark.Hearts10.Sat": "I don't even track my steps anymore. I just walk where I want to go.",
	"Clark.Hearts10.Sun": "You're a good friend. Statistically speaking, the best one I have.",
	"Clark.Day.Spring.Mon": "Pollen counts are up 400% today. I'm operating at reduced efficiency due to mandatory antihistamine protocols.",
	"Clark.Day.Spring.Tue": "Spring requires a complete recalculation of routing paths due to mud accumulation. It's a logistical nightmare.",
	"Clark.Day.Spring.Wed": "The ambient temperature is finally stabilizing. I suppose the floral blooms are an acceptable aesthetic bonus.",
	"Clark.Day.Spring.Thu": "I ran a predictive model on seasonal rain patterns. It suggests I should carry an umbrella for the next 28 days.",
	"Clark.Day.Spring.Fri": "Are your spring seeds yielding the projected growth rates? Just curious about local soil efficiency.",
	"Clark.Day.Spring.Sat": "The influx of spring foraging items is interesting. I'm tempted to catalog them, but I lack the desk space.",
	"Clark.Day.Spring.Sun": "I've scheduled today for 'enjoying the breeze.' It's a highly unstructured activity, but I'm trying to adapt.",
	"Clark.Day.Summer.Mon": "The humidity is playing havoc with the cooling systems at BuyCo today. I feel like I'm melting.",
	"Clark.Day.Summer.Tue": "I'm tracking the evaporation rate of the local reservoir. It's within acceptable parameters, thankfully.",
	"Clark.Day.Summer.Wed": "Summer storms are terrible for logistics. Good for crops, I suppose.",
	"Clark.Day.Summer.Thu": "I should probably buy a lighter shirt. This one is retaining too much thermal energy.",
	"Clark.Day.Summer.Fri": "Are you staying hydrated? The data on heat stroke is not something to ignore.",
	"Clark.Day.Summer.Sat": "The tourist traffic in Pelican Town is peaking. The pathing algorithms are breaking down.",
	"Clark.Day.Summer.Sun": "I might actually go near the water today. Just near it. Not in it.",
	"Clark.Day.Fall.Mon": "The crisp air is actually optimal for server cooling. A very efficient season.",
	"Clark.Day.Fall.Tue": "Leaf accumulation on the roads is causing a 2% delay in all ground transport. I should probably just buy a rake.",
	"Clark.Day.Fall.Wed": "I caught myself just staring at the leaves earlier. I tried to calculate the exact gradient shift from green to orange, but... honestly, it’s just nice to look at.",
	"Clark.Day.Fall.Thu": "Are your crop yields matching your seasonal projections?",
	"Clark.Day.Fall.Fri": "I'm trying a pumpkin-flavored beverage. It's highly synthetic, but statistically popular.",
	"Clark.Day.Fall.Sat": "Pelican Town seems very busy with harvest preparations.",
	"Clark.Day.Fall.Sun": "The Biscuit Drum is using a lot more cinnamon this week. I can smell it from here.",
	"Clark.Day.Winter.Mon": "Ice on the roads. I've advised all BuyCo drivers to reduce speed by 20%.",
	"Clark.Day.Winter.Tue": "The ambient temperature is suboptimal for standing around outside.",
	"Clark.Day.Winter.Wed": "I started trying to catalog the different snowflake structures I saw today. I gave up after twenty minutes. There’s too much variation. It's frustratingly beautiful.",
	"Clark.Day.Winter.Thu": "Do you need any antifreeze or salt for the farm? I have surplus data.",
	"Clark.Day.Winter.Fri": "The days are so short. I feel like my productivity metrics are naturally declining.",
	"Clark.Day.Winter.Sat": "The commute to Pelican Town was treacherous. I might stay closer to home next weekend.",
	"Clark.Day.Winter.Sun": "A hot beverage and a complex spreadsheet. This is my ideal winter Sunday.",
	"Clark.Gift.StardropTea": "This beverage exceeds all known metrics for flavor and cognitive enhancement. Thank you, my efficiency just doubled.",
	"Clark.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "I'm charting this as a failed gifting interaction. Please update your variables regarding my preferences.",
	"Clark.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "This perfectly aligns with my optimal birthday variables. Your gifting algorithm is flawless!",
	"Clark.AcceptBirthdayGift": "Acknowledged. Adding one year to my biological tracker and accepting this item.",
	"Clark.MovieInvitation": "A movie? I suppose I can allocate two hours for audiovisual entertainment. Thank you.",
	"Clark.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "My schedule is already blocked out for a screening with another party. Logistically impossible.",
	"Clark.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I have already consumed my weekly quota of audiovisual entertainment. The data doesn't support a second trip.",
	"Clark.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "Our previous interaction metrics plummeted. I have no desire to allocate time for this.",
	"Clark.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "I've reviewed the plot summaries and audience metrics. That film is statistically guaranteed to waste my time.",
	"Clark.RejectMovieTicket": "I must decline. I have several spreadsheets that require immediate optimization.",
	"Clark.SummitEvent": "From this elevation, the entire valley looks like a perfectly organized grid. It's the most beautiful data visualization I've ever seen.",
	"Clark.Event.2Heart.Mutter": "No, that can’t be right...The yield curve is completely skewed. The timeline is...",
	"Clark.Event.2Heart.1": "Oh! You startled me! You must be the new farmer. I was just updating my calculations for the Falls' economy, now that you’ve arrived...",
	"Clark.Event.2Heart.2": "You are exactly 3.2 days earlier than I calculated. That’s considerably less efficient than I typically see from newcomers to the countryside.",
	"Clark.Event.2Heart.Q": "Were you so early in establishing yourself in town due to optimized travel logistics or was it simply a fluke?",
	"Clark.Event.2Heart.A1": "I couldn’t wait to get started!",
	"Clark.Event.2Heart.A2": "I’m always full of surprises, Clark!",
	"Clark.Event.2Heart.A3": "I don’t live my life according to projections!",
	"Clark.Event.2Heart.R1": "Ambition! That’s a volatile metric, but one I can account for! I will attempt to adjust for your enthusiasm!",
	"Clark.Event.2Heart.R2": "Surprises are the natural enemy of an analyst! You’re going to make it difficult to chart the town’s economic output with you in town, aren’t you?",
	"Clark.Event.2Heart.R3": "A bold claim! Though I suppose in the end, even chaos follows a certain probability. We shall see!",
	"Clark.Event.2Heart.3": "Anyway, I have a few spreadsheets to audit to account for your… anomaly.",
	"Clark.Event.2Heart.4": "Welcome to the Falls! Please try to stick to a schedule going forward, would you? I don’t want to overload my hard drive with too many recalibrations!",
	"Clark.Event.4Heart.1": "(Muttering) The server load is spiking... 84%... 89%... If the cooling fails, the entire Q3 projection is lost.$2",
	"Clark.Event.4Heart.2": "@! Don't touch anything! The static from your coat could trigger a catastrophic hardware interrupt!$4",
	"Clark.Event.4Heart.3": "I've been trying to simulate the economic impact of the next winter storm. But every time I run the numbers, the 'Mabel Variable' breaks the code.$2",
	"Clark.Event.4Heart.4": "She gives away too much. She doesn't charge for the time spent knitting. It’s an economic black hole that defies every market law I’ve ever studied. It’s... maddening.$5",
	"Clark.Event.4Heart.Q": "It’s... maddening....",
	"Clark.Event.4Heart.A1": "Maybe she's not a variable, Clark. She’s a person.",
	"Clark.Event.4Heart.A2": "Computers can't measure kindness.",
	"Clark.Event.4Heart.A3": "Just delete her from the data.",
	"Clark.Event.4Heart.R1": "A person... (He stops, staring at the screen). A series of choices and history that cannot be reduced to a binary state. I... I need to sit down.$0",
	"Clark.Event.4Heart.R2": "If it can't be measured, it isn't real! ...Or at least, that’s what they told me at the Zuzu Institute. But the lights are still on in her cottage, and my screen is red. I don't understand.$2",
	"Clark.Event.4Heart.R3": "Delete her? (He looks horrified). You can't just... she's part of the architecture of this town. Even I know that. Your suggestion is statistically abhorrent.$4",
	"Clark.Event.4Heart.5": "Leave me. I need to recalibrate... everything.$0",
	"Clark.Event.8Heart.1": "The directive came from headquarters this morning. 'Project Outreach'.$1",
	"Clark.Event.8Heart.2": "They've authorized a massive surplus budget to establish free winter supply lines to the outlying cabins. Medicine, rations... delivered at a complete financial loss.$2",
	"Clark.Event.8Heart.3": "My algorithms say this is catastrophic. A 0% return on investment. For ten years, my job was to eliminate this exact kind of inefficiency.$5",
	"Clark.Event.8Heart.4": "But... Silas needs those rations. Mabel needs her medicine. BuyCo is trying to help the town, but my brain... my brain is screaming that the math is wrong.$2",
	"Clark.Event.8Heart.Q": "Clark is holding the pen, hesitating to approve the charity.",
	"Clark.Event.8Heart.A1": "Sign it, Clark. People are more than just numbers.",
	"Clark.Event.8Heart.A2": "If the math says it'll fail, you have to trust your data.",
	"Clark.Event.8Heart.R1": "You're right. (He signs the paper). It's a terrifying statistical risk, but... it's the right thing to do. Let the spreadsheet break.$1",
	"Clark.Event.8Heart.R2": "You're right. (He puts the pen down). We can't let sentiment ruin sustainable business models. I'll send it back for 'optimization'.$5",
	"Clark.Event.10Heart.1": "I've been standing here for an hour watching the falls. Do you know what I realized?$2",
	"Clark.Event.10Heart.2": "There is no algorithm for this. The water doesn't calculate its path. It just flows, and the entire valley thrives because of it.$0",
	"Clark.Event.10Heart.3": "When the outreach budget was approved, I thought the inefficiency would break BuyCo's system. I was terrified.$2",
	"Clark.Event.10Heart.4": "Instead, it built a bridge. Silas has his rations. The company has genuine goodwill. The 'loss' was actually the greatest asset we've ever secured.$1",
	"Clark.Event.10Heart.5": "I called headquarters this morning. I am taking over the new outreach division. We aren't going to pave over the valley anymore... we are going to integrate with it.$1",
	"Clark.Event.10Heart.Q": "Clark looks at you, his rigid posture finally relaxed. He looks genuinely at peace.",
	"Clark.Event.10Heart.A1": "That sounds like the perfect balance, Clark.",
	"Clark.Event.10Heart.A2": "Are you ready for that kind of chaos?",
	"Clark.Event.10Heart.R1": "It is. And I have you to thank for showing me the variables I was missing.$1",
	"Clark.Event.10Heart.R2": "For the first time in my life... yes. Let the spreadsheets break. I'm ready to actually live.$1",
	"Dion.Day.Mon": "Mondays are for recovery, darling. And by recovery, I mean attempting to fix the tragic box-dye jobs people gave themselves over the weekend.",
	"Dion.Day.Tue": "Tuesdays are so dreadfully slow. If someone doesn't come in with some juicy gossip soon, I might just die of boredom.",
	"Dion.Day.Wed": "Hump day, honey! I'm halfway through the week and only marginally exhausted by everyone's complete lack of styling capability.",
	"Dion.Day.Thu": "Half the town uses terrible grocery-store shampoo. I can literally hear their split ends crying from across the street. Tragic.",
	"Dion.Day.Fri": "Everyone wants to look fabulous for the weekend, but nobody wants to book their appointments in advance. I am a miracle worker, honey, not a time traveler.",
	"Dion.Day.Sat": "I thrive on the chaos of a busy Saturday. Bring me your bad dye jobs, your tragic bangs, your secrets! I live for it.",
	"Dion.Day.Sun": "Sundays are my sanctuary, darling. I do a sheet mask, I sip something expensive, and I absolutely refuse to engage in manual labor.",
	"Dion.Introduction": "Oh! Well, hello there. I'm Dion. Don't worry, darling, I've seen worse hat hair. But please, sit down. We have *so* much work to do.",
	"Dion.DumpsterDiveComment": "Ew. Absolutely not. If you're looking for last season's trends, there are better places than the actual garbage, honey.",
	"Dion.HitBySlingshot": "Ouch! Watch the merchandise, darling! This face is insured for more than your farm is worth!",
	"Dion.WipedMemory": "Who are you? Do I know you? You look like someone who desperately needs a deep conditioning treatment, regardless.",
	"Dion.Weather.Rain": "Ugh, the humidity. My blowout is absolutely ruined, and half the town is going to look like poodles by noon.",
	"Dion.Weather.Snow": "Snow is pretty, I suppose, but it's a nightmare for dry scalps. Make sure you moisturize, darling.",
	"Dion.Weather.GreenRain": "Green rain? Absolutely not. I'm staying inside. That color clashes with literally everything I own.",
	"Dion.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "Thank goodness that hideous weather is over. Nature can be so incredibly tacky sometimes.",
	"Dion.Hearts2.Mon": "Honey, did you lose a bet, or do you actually think those boots go with that shirt? Don't answer that. Just sit down before you ruin my aesthetic.",
	"Dion.Hearts2.Tue": "I get the best gossip from Bea at the Biscuit Drum. She acts like she hates it, but she spills the tea faster than she pours coffee.",
	"Dion.Hearts2.Wed": "You know, farming is great for the soul, but it's an absolute nightmare for your pores. Have you considered a night cream?",
	"Dion.Hearts2.Thu": "Arden came in for a trim. I told him he looked like he'd been exhumed, not preserved. He didn't laugh. Honestly, some people have no sense of humor about their own decay.",
	"Dion.Hearts2.Fri": "I just love a dramatic restyle. If you ever want to chop it all off and start a new life, I'm your guy.",
	"Dion.Hearts2.Sat": "It's so loud in town today. Honestly, I prefer the hum of my blow dryer. It drowns out the basic opinions.",
	"Dion.Hearts2.Sun": "You are working way too hard, darling. You need to treat yourself before your face freezes like that.",
	"Dion.Hearts4.Mon": "You know, for someone who works in the dirt, you clean up surprisingly well. I mean that as a compliment.",
	"Dion.Hearts4.Tue": "People think I'm just here for the gossip. But really, I just like making people feel good about themselves. The gossip is just a perk.",
	"Dion.Hearts4.Wed": "I saw someone from JojaMart trying to buy my favorite hair spray in bulk. I looked them right in the eye and said we were sold out. I have standards.",
	"Dion.Hearts4.Thu": "If Vance tells me one more time that his buzzcut is 'tactical,' I'm going to tactical-strike his head with some pomade.",
	"Dion.Hearts4.Fri": "I always keep an extra chair open. Just in case someone needs to sit down and cry. You'd be surprised how often it happens.",
	"Dion.Hearts4.Sat": "Darling, if anyone in this town gives you trouble, you tell me. I know exactly how to ruin their reputation.",
	"Dion.Hearts4.Sun": "I feel like we're actually becoming friends. Which is rare for me, because I usually charge people to listen to them this much.",
	"Dion.Hearts6.Mon": "Sometimes I go home and my ears are just ringing. Everyone pours their problems into my chair. It's... heavy, sometimes.",
	"Dion.Hearts6.Tue": "I like you, farmer. You don't just dump your trauma on me and leave. You actually ask how my day was. That's refreshing.",
	"Dion.Hearts6.Wed": "I told Cassidy her new apron made her look like a frantic highlighter. She actually cried. I... I didn't mean it like that. I was just trying to be funny. Why do I do that?",
	"Dion.Hearts6.Thu": "I accidentally told Jett their overalls were 'retro chic'. They didn't know what it meant, but they seemed pleased.",
	"Dion.Hearts6.Fri": "You're doing amazing things for this valley, darling. I might pretend not to notice the dirt, but I see the glow up.",
	"Dion.Hearts6.Sat": "I had a dream I was stuck in a room with cheap hair gel and fluorescent lighting. I woke up in a cold sweat.",
	"Dion.Hearts6.Sun": "Take a breather, honey. You can't save the whole town if you look exhausted while doing it.",
	"Dion.Hearts8.Mon": "I actually went for a hike yesterday. I ruined my shoes, but... the view was gorgeous. Please don't tell anyone I enjoyed the outdoors.",
	"Dion.Hearts8.Tue": "You know, I used to think I'd move to the city eventually. But... I think Timberline is stuck with me. And I'm stuck with it.",
	"Dion.Hearts8.Wed": "I'm so tired of being 'on' all the time. The sass, the judgments... it's exhausting. With you, I feel like I can just be quiet. It's a relief.",
	"Dion.Hearts8.Thu": "I've been thinking a lot about roots lately. Hair roots, yes, but also... life roots. I think mine are finally taking hold here.",
	"Dion.Hearts8.Fri": "I don't say this often, because it ruins my mysterious vibe... but I really care about you, honey.",
	"Dion.Hearts8.Sat": "This town is messy, the drama is exhausting, and the humidity is a crime. But... it's home.",
	"Dion.Hearts8.Sun": "If you ever need an alibi, a makeover, or just someone to vent to... I'm your guy. Always.",
	"Dion.Hearts10.Mon": "You know, you're the first person I've met here who didn't just want me to fix their hair or fix their problems. You just wanted me.",
	"Dion.Hearts10.Tue": "Darling, I don't care if you roll in mud every day. You're flawless to me.",
	"Dion.Hearts10.Wed": "I used to listen to the town gossip because I was bored. Now I listen because I actually care about these people. It's a terrifying development.",
	"Dion.Hearts10.Thu": "I'm so glad you moved to this valley. It was getting incredibly dull before you arrived.",
	"Dion.Hearts10.Fri": "You're not just my favorite client, @. You're my best friend in this entire dusty town.",
	"Dion.Hearts10.Sat": "Let's grab a drink tonight. On me. We have so much to celebrate, darling. Mostly you.",
	"Dion.Hearts10.Sun": "Stay fabulous, farmer. Not that you need my help with that.",
	"Dion.Day.Spring.Mon": "Spring is a season of rebirth, darling! Which means it's time to ditch that dreary winter cut.",
	"Dion.Day.Spring.Tue": "The pollen is absolutely wrecking my sinuses, but the natural lighting today is flawless.",
	"Dion.Day.Spring.Wed": "Everyone wants pastel hair for spring. Groundbreaking. I might scream if I have to mix one more batch of lilac.",
	"Dion.Day.Spring.Thu": "I saw a wildflower blooming today and it inspired a whole new balayage technique. Genius strikes when it will!",
	"Dion.Day.Spring.Fri": "The weekend is approaching, and everyone is suddenly desperate to look like a spring goddess. Get in line, honeys.",
	"Dion.Day.Spring.Sat": "Saturdays in spring are a madhouse. It's like everyone suddenly remembered they have to look presentable again.",
	"Dion.Day.Spring.Sun": "Sunday rest day. No scissors, no gossip, just me and my artisanal herbal tea.",
	"Dion.Day.Summer.Mon": "Summer heat is the ultimate enemy of volume. It's a tragedy out there today.",
	"Dion.Day.Summer.Tue": "Don't even talk to me about sun damage, darling. I can see your split ends screaming for moisture.",
	"Dion.Day.Summer.Wed": "If one more person asks for 'beachy waves,' I might just throw them in the actual ocean.",
	"Dion.Day.Summer.Thu": "Hydrate, hydrate, hydrate! And I don't just mean drinking water, honey. Your hair is parched.",
	"Dion.Day.Summer.Fri": "I've got three appointments today just to fix sweat-ruined updos. Summer is exhausting.",
	"Dion.Day.Summer.Sat": "The tourists are in town. You can spot them immediately—they're the ones with the truly unforgivable resort wear.",
	"Dion.Day.Summer.Sun": "I'm spending my Sunday in the shade. The sun is entirely too aggressive today.",
	"Dion.Day.Fall.Mon": "Autumn! Finally, a season that respects a good layered look.",
	"Dion.Day.Fall.Tue": "Everyone is asking for 'pumpkin spice' hair. I hate the name, but the copper tones are undeniably fabulous.",
	"Dion.Day.Fall.Wed": "The crisp air is magnificent for my complexion, but it's making everyone's hair static. A stylist's work is never done.",
	"Dion.Day.Fall.Thu": "I bought a new silk scarf today. It completely transforms my silhouette. You should try accessorizing, darling.",
	"Dion.Day.Fall.Fri": "Friday in fall means everyone wants to look cozy but chic. It's a delicate balance, but I deliver.",
	"Dion.Day.Fall.Sat": "The town looks gorgeous with all the changing leaves. Almost as gorgeous as my latest highlight job.",
	"Dion.Day.Fall.Sun": "Sundays in autumn are for cashmere and avoiding manual labor at all costs.",
	"Dion.Day.Winter.Mon": "Winter is here, and so is the season of tragic hat hair. Please, darling, invest in a silk-lined beanie.",
	"Dion.Day.Winter.Tue": "The dry air is an absolute menace. If you aren't deep conditioning twice a week, don't even look at me.",
	"Dion.Day.Winter.Wed": "Everyone wants to go dark for winter. So dramatic. I love it.",
	"Dion.Day.Winter.Thu": "Holiday party season is approaching. Book your updos now, or prepare to look basic.",
	"Dion.Day.Winter.Fri": "I'm freezing. Literally freezing. If someone doesn't bring me a hot latte, I'm closing the salon early.",
	"Dion.Day.Winter.Sat": "Saturdays in winter are for hot gossip and hot rollers. The only things keeping me warm.",
	"Dion.Day.Winter.Sun": "Sunday hibernation mode activated. Do not disturb unless it's a hair emergency of the highest order.",
	"Dion.Gift.StardropTea": "Oh, darling! This is absolute perfection. My tastebuds are simply vibrating!",
	"Dion.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "Oh. A birthday gift. Well... it's the thought that counts, I suppose.",
	"Dion.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "Darling! You remembered! And you got me something fabulous. I adore you!",
	"Dion.AcceptBirthdayGift": "Oh, for me? Thank you, honey. You shouldn't have, but I'm absolutely thrilled you did.",
	"Dion.MovieInvitation": "A movie? With you? Oh, I'd love to, darling. As long as I get to critique the wardrobe choices.",
	"Dion.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "Oh, honey, I'd love to, but I'm already booked up. I'm a very in-demand man.",
	"Dion.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I've already subjected myself to that cinema's sticky floors this week. My shoes can't take another round.",
	"Dion.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "Excuse me? Absolutely not. The audacity!",
	"Dion.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "Darling, I have standards. I absolutely refuse to sit through that particular cinematic disaster.",
	"Dion.RejectMovieTicket": "Oh, honey, no. I have a strict skincare routine tonight that I cannot interrupt.",
	"Dion.SummitEvent": "Look at this view, darling. It's almost as breathtaking as a perfectly executed balayage. Almost. But seriously... I'm glad I'm sharing it with you.",
	"Dion.Event.2Heart.1": "Oh, darling. No, no, no. Who told you that plaid goes with those boots? We need an intervention.",
	"Dion.Event.2Heart.2": "I'm kidding! ...Mostly. But seriously, honey, what brings you into my sanctuary?",
	"Dion.Event.2Heart.Q": "Respond to Dion:",
	"Dion.Event.2Heart.A1": "I was hoping you could fix my hair.",
	"Dion.Event.2Heart.A2": "I just wanted to say hi.",
	"Dion.Event.2Heart.A3": "My boots are very practical, actually.",
	"Dion.Event.2Heart.R1": "Darling, I can do more than fix it. I can resurrect it. Come sit.",
	"Dion.Event.2Heart.R2": "Well, aren't you a breath of fresh air! Usually people only say hi when they want a discount.",
	"Dion.Event.2Heart.R3": "Practicality is the enemy of glamour, honey. But I respect your conviction.",
	"Dion.Event.2Heart.3": "Welcome to Timberline. If you ever need to know who hates who, or if you just need a trim, my chair is always open.",
	"Dion.Event.4Heart.1": "Excuse me?! No, you listen to me, you sun-damaged little tourist.",
	"Dion.Event.4Heart.2": "You do not come to Timberline Falls, drink our coffee, and then complain that the town is 'too rustic'.",
	"Dion.Event.4Heart.3": "Oh, hello @! Just... providing some local hospitality. If that tourist insults Bea's bakery again, I'm going to 'accidentally' drop bleach on their sweater.",
	"Dion.Event.6Heart.1": "(Sigh) I am absolutely exhausted, darling. My social battery is in the negatives.",
	"Dion.Event.6Heart.2": "Everyone sits in my chair and pours out their heartbreak, their family drama, their financial woes...",
	"Dion.Event.6Heart.3": "Sometimes I just want someone to ask how *I* am doing, you know?",
	"Dion.Event.6Heart.Q": "Comfort Dion:",
	"Dion.Event.6Heart.A1": "How are you doing, Dion?",
	"Dion.Event.6Heart.A2": "You're the glue of this town.",
	"Dion.Event.6Heart.R1": "Oh... well. Honestly? Better, now that you asked. Thank you, honey.",
	"Dion.Event.6Heart.R2": "The glue? More like the hairspray holding this chaotic updo together. But thank you. That means a lot.",
	"Dion.Event.6Heart.4": "You're a good friend, @. I'm going to lock up. Get some rest, okay?",
	"Dion.Event.8Heart.1": "My shoes! My gorgeous, Italian leather shoes! Ruined by this barbaric mud!",
	"Dion.Event.8Heart.2": "I came out here because I wanted to see what you see. I wanted to understand why you love this messy, dirty valley so much.",
	"Dion.Event.8Heart.3": "But mostly, I just feel like I'm sinking.",
	"Dion.Event.8Heart.Q": "Encourage him:",
	"Dion.Event.8Heart.A1": "Take your shoes off. Feel the earth.",
	"Dion.Event.8Heart.A2": "It's beautiful once you stop fighting it.",
	"Dion.Event.8Heart.R1": "Absolutely not! ...Okay, fine. Oh. Oh, that is... surprisingly grounding.",
	"Dion.Event.8Heart.R2": "Stop fighting it? Darling, my whole life is a fight against humidity. But... I see your point. The view *is* stunning.",
	"Dion.Event.8Heart.4": "I think I'm actually starting to like this messy little valley. Come on, let's keep walking.",
	"Dion.Event.10Heart.1": "I locked the doors. We are officially after hours. This is VIP time, honey.",
	"Dion.Event.10Heart.2": "I spend all day making people look beautiful on the outside, hoping it makes them feel better on the inside.",
	"Dion.Event.10Heart.3": "But with you... I don't have to perform. I don't have to be the sassy stylist with all the answers.",
	"Dion.Event.10Heart.4": "You're my best friend in this valley, @. I just wanted you to know that.",
	"Dion.Event.10Heart.5": "Now, sit down and stop moving. Your split ends are giving me a migraine. The VIP treatment is on the house.",
	"Dion.Schedule.Placeholder_Coffee": "Dion is waiting for his coffee. He is judging the pastry display.",
	"Dion.Schedule.Placeholder_Shopping": "Dion is reading the ingredients on a bottle of conditioner with pure disgust.",
	"Dion.Schedule.Placeholder_Social": "Dion is holding court in town, absorbing the local drama.",
	"Dion.Schedule.Placeholder_DayOff": "Dion is attempting to enjoy nature while staying strictly on the paved path.",
	"Drexel.Day.Mon": "Rent is due on the first. Not the second. Not the third. The first. Why is this concept so difficult for people to grasp?",
	"Drexel.Day.Tue": "I'm looking at the property taxes Lewis is charging me. That man is a parasite. At least I provide housing. What does he provide? Speeches?",
	"Drexel.Day.Wed": "No, I am not going outside today. The humidity ruins the crease in my trousers, and frankly, I despise nature.",
	"Drexel.Day.Thu": "Someone scuffed the hardwood in the lobby. I know exactly who it was. I'm drafting a fine as we speak.",
	"Drexel.Day.Fri": "Everyone is so excited for the weekend. I hate the weekend. It just means my tenants are home making noise instead of working to pay me.",
	"Drexel.Day.Sat": "I refuse to walk to Pelican Town. If they want my money, they can pave a sidewalk all the way up here.",
	"Drexel.Day.Sun": "Quiet. Finally. I swear, if someone plays a guitar near my window today, I'm calling Vance to remove them.",
	"Drexel.Introduction": "What? Who are you? The farmer? Great. Another person to track mud onto my sidewalks. I'm Drexel. I own Timberline Terraces. Don't loiter.",
	"Drexel.DumpsterDiveComment": "Have you absolutely no shame? Disgusting. Get away from me.",
	"Drexel.HitBySlingshot": "I will sue you for everything your farm is worth! Stop that!",
	"Drexel.WipedMemory": "Do I know you? You look like someone who owes me money. State your business or leave.",
	"Drexel.Weather.Rain": "Look at all that mud forming. I'm going to have to hire a power-washer for the walkways tomorrow. Blast it.",
	"Drexel.Weather.Snow": "Ice is a massive liability. If someone slips on my property, the insurance premiums will be astronomical.",
	"Drexel.Weather.GreenRain": "What is this abhorrent green sludge? If this ruins the building's exterior paint, I am suing the valley!",
	"Drexel.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "Finally, that ecological disaster is over. Now I just have to calculate the damages.",
	"Drexel.Hearts2.Mon": "You again. Did you wipe your boots before stepping into my office? Let me look. ...Barely acceptable.",
	"Drexel.Hearts2.Tue": "I have three maintenance requests for leaky faucets. If these people learned how to turn a knob properly, I wouldn't have this overhead.",
	"Drexel.Hearts2.Wed": "Do not lean on my desk. That mahogany is worth more than your entire first harvest.",
	"Drexel.Hearts2.Thu": "I suppose farming is better than unemployment. Marginally. At least you aren't asking me for a loan.",
	"Drexel.Hearts2.Fri": "I don't do 'casual Fridays'. Professionalism is dead in this valley, but I refuse to attend its funeral.",
	"Drexel.Hearts2.Sat": "What do you want? I don't give tours, and I'm not running a charity.",
	"Drexel.Hearts2.Sun": "Don't bring the smell of fertilizer in here. I pay a premium for air purifiers.",
	"Drexel.Hearts4.Mon": "I suppose manual labor builds character. I wouldn't know. I prefer to build equity.",
	"Drexel.Hearts4.Tue": "You actually show up and work every day. That puts you in the top five percent of the population in this valley.",
	"Drexel.Hearts4.Wed": "The cost of building materials has skyrocketed. If you ever chop down some decent timber, let me know. I might buy it. At wholesale prices, of course.",
	"Drexel.Hearts4.Thu": "I caught someone trying to sneak a cat into my building. I evicted them on the spot. I run a tight ship, @.",
	"Drexel.Hearts4.Fri": "You look exhausted. Good. That means you're actually doing your job.",
	"Drexel.Hearts4.Sat": "If you ever decide to sell that farm, talk to me first. I could turn it into a very profitable subdivision.",
	"Drexel.Hearts4.Sun": "I tolerate your presence because you are quiet. Do not ruin it by speaking.",
	"Drexel.Hearts6.Mon": "My joints ache. My doctor tells me to walk more. I told him to prescribe me something so I don't have to.",
	"Drexel.Hearts6.Tue": "I actually read an article on agricultural yields today. Your profit margins must be terrifyingly slim. I don't know how you sleep at night.",
	"Drexel.Hearts6.Wed": "I bought a new suit. I had to have it let out... slightly. It's the dry cleaner's fault. They shrink things.",
	"Drexel.Hearts6.Thu": "Dion tried to offer me a 'makeover' today. I told him if I wanted to look like a clown, I'd join the circus.",
	"Drexel.Hearts6.Fri": "I despise the food in this town, but Bea makes a steak that almost justifies the cholesterol.",
	"Drexel.Hearts6.Sat": "You know, your farm's year-over-year growth isn't terrible. You aren't completely insufferable. That is the highest compliment I have given in a decade.",
	"Drexel.Hearts6.Sun": "I am ignoring my ledgers today. I have a headache. Just sit there and be quiet.",
	"Drexel.Hearts8.Mon": "I've been reviewing my portfolio. Real estate is secure, but I've realized physical health is... a depreciating asset. I need to manage it better.",
	"Drexel.Hearts8.Tue": "I actually took a walk around the building yesterday. The fresh air was... not entirely repulsive.",
	"Drexel.Hearts8.Wed": "I've decided you're one of the only competent people in this entire valley. The rest are liabilities.",
	"Drexel.Hearts8.Thu": "If you need business advice, my door is open to you. I don't offer that to just anyone.",
	"Drexel.Hearts8.Fri": "I don't say this often, but I respect the empire you're building in the dirt, @.",
	"Drexel.Hearts8.Sat": "Unit 4B is still available. I've turned down five applicants this week. I'm holding out for someone who actually respects property.",
	"Drexel.Hearts8.Sun": "You are always welcome in my office, @. Just... continue to wipe your boots.",
	"Drexel.Hearts10.Mon": "You know, @, a good landlord knows how to spot a good investment. You were a good investment of my time.",
	"Drexel.Hearts10.Tue": "I walked all the way to the falls today. My knees are screaming, but I feel... surprisingly clear-headed.",
	"Drexel.Hearts10.Wed": "I've re-evaluated your file. I no longer consider you a liability to this valley's property values. Consider that a monumental compliment, because I despise literally everyone else.",
	"Drexel.Hearts10.Thu": "We are cut from the same cloth, you and I. We just happen to work with different kinds of dirt.",
	"Drexel.Hearts10.Fri": "If anyone in this town gives you trouble, tell me. I have leverage on almost everyone.",
	"Drexel.Hearts10.Sat": "I actually look forward to your visits now. Don't let it go to your head.",
	"Drexel.Hearts10.Sun": "Take the day off, @. Even machines need maintenance, and you are not a machine.",
	"Drexel.Day.Spring.Mon": "Spring. The season of allergies and landscaping bills. Delightful.",
	"Drexel.Day.Spring.Tue": "Everyone is out frolicking. Don't they have jobs? Rent doesn't pay itself.",
	"Drexel.Day.Spring.Wed": "A tenant asked for a window box for flowers. I said no. Water damage and bugs are not my idea of decor.",
	"Drexel.Day.Spring.Thu": "The pollen is coating my windows. I'm adding a window-cleaning fee to the common charges.",
	"Drexel.Day.Spring.Fri": "You're tracking petals into my lobby. Sweep yourself off before you come in.",
	"Drexel.Day.Spring.Sat": "Lewis wants donations for the Egg Festival. I told him to tax the chickens.",
	"Drexel.Day.Spring.Sun": "I stay indoors during spring. Nature is far too invasive this time of year.",
	"Drexel.Day.Summer.Mon": "The heat is inflating my air conditioning costs. I should start charging by the kilowatt.",
	"Drexel.Day.Summer.Tue": "Don't bring the smell of the beach in here. Sand destroys the wax on the floors.",
	"Drexel.Day.Summer.Wed": "Summer tourists. A necessary evil, I suppose, if they spend money. Which they rarely do here.",
	"Drexel.Day.Summer.Thu": "Someone had the audacity to ask for a pool on the roof. The structural reinforcement alone would bankrupt them.",
	"Drexel.Day.Summer.Fri": "It's too hot to be productive. Luckily, I am always productive.",
	"Drexel.Day.Summer.Sat": "Luau? A communal soup sounds like a massive health code violation.",
	"Drexel.Day.Summer.Sun": "The humidity makes everyone sluggish. I refuse to lower my standards just because the sun is out.",
	"Drexel.Day.Fall.Mon": "Leaves are clogging the gutters. Do you have any idea what a roofer charges in this valley?",
	"Drexel.Day.Fall.Tue": "I appreciate the cooler weather. It means people stay inside where they belong.",
	"Drexel.Day.Fall.Wed": "Harvest season. Let me guess, you're going to try and pay your rent in pumpkins? Cash only.",
	"Drexel.Day.Fall.Thu": "The valley looks... tolerable in autumn. Mostly because things are dying off.",
	"Drexel.Day.Fall.Fri": "I've mandated that all tenants clear the leaves from their balconies. Failure to comply results in a fine.",
	"Drexel.Day.Fall.Sat": "The Grange Display is just an excuse for farmers to boast about dirt.",
	"Drexel.Day.Fall.Sun": "I'm auditing my third-quarter earnings. Do not interrupt me.",
	"Drexel.Day.Winter.Mon": "The heating bills are offensive. I'm dropping the base thermostat down by two degrees.",
	"Drexel.Day.Winter.Tue": "I had to buy commercial-grade salt for the steps. Do you know how much that cuts into my margins?",
	"Drexel.Day.Winter.Wed": "Winter is the only season I can tolerate. It's quiet, cold, and strictly business.",
	"Drexel.Day.Winter.Thu": "If anyone builds a snowman on my property, I will charge them rent for it.",
	"Drexel.Day.Winter.Fri": "I don't participate in the Feast of the Winter Star. Forced gift-giving is an economic farce.",
	"Drexel.Day.Winter.Sat": "Someone left their muddy boots in the hallway. I threw them in the dumpster.",
	"Drexel.Day.Winter.Sun": "The end of the fiscal year approaches. This is my true holiday season.",
	"Drexel.Gift.StardropTea": "Stardrop tea? ...I suppose I can appreciate a high-value commodity. I'll take it.",
	"Drexel.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "I hate my birthday, and I hate this gift even more.",
	"Drexel.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "A birthday gift? From you? ...It is adequate. Thank you.",
	"Drexel.AcceptBirthdayGift": "I suppose getting older is better than the alternative. Put it on the desk.",
	"Drexel.MovieInvitation": "A movie? With you? Assuming the theater is adequately sanitized and I am not paying for the concessions... fine.",
	"Drexel.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "I am already attending a screening with someone else. My schedule is full.",
	"Drexel.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I have already subjected myself to the cinema this week. Once is more than enough.",
	"Drexel.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "I think it is highly inappropriate for us to be seen together right now. Leave.",
	"Drexel.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "I refuse to watch that drivel. My time is money, and I won't waste it on bad writing.",
	"Drexel.RejectMovieTicket": "I have no interest in going to the movies with you. I have ledgers to review.",
	"Drexel.SummitEvent": "Look at this view, @. You can see the entire valley. Every property line, every plot of land. It's... a lot of untaxed potential, really.",
	"Drexel.Event.2Heart.1": "Another noise complaint from floor two. If they don't like the noise of their neighbors breathing, they should buy a house.",
	"Drexel.Event.2Heart.2": "Farming. Bah. You spend all day in the dirt just to make a few pennies. Real estate is where the wealth is, farmer. You're wasting your time.",
	"Drexel.Event.2Heart.Q": "How do you respond?",
	"Drexel.Event.2Heart.A1": "I like working with my hands.",
	"Drexel.Event.2Heart.A2": "You're probably right.",
	"Drexel.Event.2Heart.A3": "At least I'm not sitting at a desk all day getting soft.",
	"Drexel.Event.2Heart.R1": "Hmph. Romantic nonsense. But... suit yourself. As long as you can pay your bills.",
	"Drexel.Event.2Heart.R2": "Of course I'm right. It's simple economics. Pity you don't have the capital to invest.",
	"Drexel.Event.2Heart.R3": "Excuse me?! I generate more capital from this chair than you will in a lifetime of digging! Get out!",
	"Drexel.Event.2Heart.3": "Now, if you're not here to pay rent, leave. I have ledgers to balance.",
	"Drexel.Event.4Heart.1": "Look at this! Disgraceful! They dragged a muddy suitcase right across the marble!",
	"Drexel.Event.4Heart.2": "My back... I can't even bend over to pick up these complaint forms. Bah!",
	"Drexel.Event.4Heart.3": "Oh. You picked them up. ...Hmph.",
	"Drexel.Event.4Heart.4": "I suppose I should say thank you. There. I said it. Don't expect it to become a habit.",
	"Drexel.Event.6Heart.1": "My doctor told me my cholesterol is alarming. He told me to eat more vegetables.",
	"Drexel.Event.6Heart.2": "Do I look like a rabbit? I don't eat leaves.",
	"Drexel.Event.6Heart.3": "...However, I did try some of the produce you sold to the local grocer.",
	"Drexel.Event.6Heart.4": "It wasn't terrible. It was... tolerable. Keep growing it. I might actually buy it.",
	"Drexel.Event.8Heart.1": "I've had Unit 4B empty for six months.",
	"Drexel.Event.8Heart.2": "Everyone who applies is a disaster waiting to happen. They have loud pets, they throw parties, they scuff the floors.",
	"Drexel.Event.8Heart.3": "You, however... you understand maintenance. You understand hard work. You don't break things.",
	"Drexel.Event.8Heart.4": "I'm authorizing you to rent it. Don't make me regret my decision.",
	"Drexel.Event.8Heart.Reward": "You now have clearance to rent an apartment from Drexel!",
	"Drexel.Event.10Heart.1": "Sit down, @. The food here is a cardiovascular nightmare, but it's edible.",
	"Drexel.Event.10Heart.2": "I don't share my table with just anyone. Most people in this town irritate me to my core.",
	"Drexel.Event.10Heart.3": "But you... you actually understand how to build equity from nothing. You're competent. You're quiet. And you pay your bills.",
	"Drexel.Event.10Heart.4": "Put your wallet away. I'm paying for the meal. Do not make a big deal out of it.",
	"Elara.Day.Mon": "Mondays dictate the cadence of the entire week. A one-minute delay today compounds into a twenty-minute catastrophe by Friday.",
	"Elara.Day.Tue": "I am reviewing Jett's maintenance logs. They are entirely too liberal with the phrase 'good enough'.",
	"Elara.Day.Wed": "Schedules are not suggestions, Farmer. They are the only thing keeping the chaos out. Without them, everything just... falls apart.",
	"Elara.Day.Thu": "Please do not touch the timetables on the wall. The oil from your fingertips degrades the paper.",
	"Elara.Day.Fri": "End of week. I am compiling the efficiency metrics. We operated at 92.4% capacity. Acceptable, but flawed.",
	"Elara.Day.Sat": "I do not recognize 'the weekend'. The rails do not sleep, therefore I do not sleep.",
	"Elara.Day.Sun": "The station is relatively quiet today. It gives me time to properly calibrate the office clocks.",
	"Elara.Introduction": "You are interrupting. I am calculating the freight arrival window. I am Elara, Station Master of Timberline Falls. If you have business with the depot, please submit a form. Otherwise, excuse me.",
	"Elara.DumpsterDiveComment": "That is a biohazard. Do not bring that near the station.",
	"Elara.HitBySlingshot": "Discharging projectiles near a locomotive facility is a federal offense! Cease immediately!",
	"Elara.WipedMemory": "Do I know you? You look familiar, but my daily logs have absolutely no record of you. It's incredibly frustrating.",
	"Elara.Weather.Rain": "Precipitation decreases rail traction by 14%. I must adjust the braking timelines for all incoming freight.",
	"Elara.Weather.Snow": "Ice on the tracks. I have dispatched Jett with the heating coils. Delays are inevitable, much to my dismay.",
	"Elara.Weather.GreenRain": "This weather anomaly is entirely unprecedented. I'm sealing the station doors until we figure out what this is.",
	"Elara.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "The anomaly has passed. The residue left behind is a mess, but at least the tracks remain operational.",
	"Elara.Hearts2.Mon": "I noticed you were exactly two minutes late delivering your produce to town yesterday. I highly recommend investing in a better pocket watch.",
	"Elara.Hearts2.Tue": "If the 4:10 train arrives at 4:12, the entire junction schedule has to be rewritten. It's a cascade of failures. I can't allow failures.",
	"Elara.Hearts2.Wed": "My desk is organized by priority and temporal urgency. Please do not breathe too heavily on the incoming stack.",
	"Elara.Hearts2.Thu": "Jett is a capable mechanic, but they lack a fundamental respect for deadlines. I spend half my day managing their time.",
	"Elara.Hearts2.Fri": "I don't dislike people, @. I simply prefer systems. Systems don't wake up late because they 'forgot to set an alarm'.",
	"Elara.Hearts2.Sat": "Do you maintain a strict ledger for your farm output? You should. Data is the only reliable metric.",
	"Elara.Hearts2.Sun": "I am auditing the fuel consumption metrics. It is incredibly soothing.",
	"Elara.Hearts4.Mon": "I noticed you water your crops at exactly 6:15 AM every morning. Your routine is... reassuring. Most people here are entirely unpredictable.",
	"Elara.Hearts4.Tue": "I had to discipline Jett again today. I take no pleasure in it, but a loose gasket is just as dangerous as a loose schedule.",
	"Elara.Hearts4.Wed": "You don't follow a strict schedule, yet your farm thrives. It defies logic. I am trying to understand how you manage the unpredictability.",
	"Elara.Hearts4.Thu": "I found a scratch on the main terminal screen. I am currently cross-referencing visitor logs to find the culprit.",
	"Elara.Hearts4.Fri": "I appreciate that you do not engage in idle chatter when you visit my office. Efficiency is a rare virtue.",
	"Elara.Hearts4.Sat": "The freight train carrying heavy machinery for Vance was delayed. The ripple effect is giving me a migraine.",
	"Elara.Hearts4.Sun": "Sometimes I watch the trains leave and calculate their exact arrival down to the second. It centers me.",
	"Elara.Hearts6.Mon": "I... overslept today. By four minutes. I spent the entire morning trying to catch up. It was terrifying.",
	"Elara.Hearts6.Tue": "I told Jett to take an extra fifteen minutes for lunch today. I immediately regretted it, but the structural integrity of the mechanic is important too, I suppose.",
	"Elara.Hearts6.Wed": "Do you ever feel like if you stop working, even for a moment, the entire valley will just fall apart? That is my constant state of being.",
	"Elara.Hearts6.Thu": "I was looking at the timetable and realized my handwriting has become entirely rigid. Like a machine printed it.",
	"Elara.Hearts6.Fri": "Thank you for stopping by, @. Your presence is surprisingly... stabilizing. Like a metronome.",
	"Elara.Hearts6.Sat": "I tried to read a fiction book last night. I couldn't finish it. The timeline was completely illogical.",
	"Elara.Hearts6.Sun": "I am trying a new technique called 'deep breathing'. It is supposed to lower stress. I have scheduled three minutes for it at 4:00 PM.",
	"Elara.Hearts8.Mon": "I realized something recently. I don't control the trains. I just record them. That distinction was entirely lost on me until now.",
	"Elara.Hearts8.Tue": "I gave Jett a compliment today on their weld work. They looked at me like I had grown a second head. I suppose I deserved that.",
	"Elara.Hearts8.Wed": "I left a file out of alphabetical order on purpose yesterday. Just to see what would happen. Nothing happened. It was liberating.",
	"Elara.Hearts8.Thu": "I've been thinking a lot about my schedule lately. I haven't scheduled any time for myself since 2019. That seems like an oversight.",
	"Elara.Hearts8.Fri": "You know, @, your farm is chaotic. It's subject to weather, crows, and chance. Yet, it thrives. I am learning from that.",
	"Elara.Hearts8.Sat": "I bought a coffee from Bea without checking the time first. I didn't even care how long it took her to pour it.",
	"Elara.Hearts8.Sun": "I am rewriting the station protocol. I am actually including a section for 'unforeseen delays'. A year ago, I would have considered that blasphemy.",
	"Elara.Hearts10.Mon": "I factored fifteen minutes of 'idle time' into my schedule today. I plan to use it to stare at a tree. I am actually looking forward to it.",
	"Elara.Hearts10.Tue": "Jett was five minutes late today. I just handed them a wrench and told them to get to work. No lecture. Progress, yes?",
	"Elara.Hearts10.Wed": "You are the only person in this valley who didn't try to force me to relax. You just waited for me to realize I needed to. Thank you.",
	"Elara.Hearts10.Thu": "I spent so long trying to control every second because I was terrified of what would happen if I didn't. But you showed me that the unpredictable moments are usually the best ones.",
	"Elara.Hearts10.Fri": "I consider you my closest friend here, @. And I assure you, I do not use that term lightly.",
	"Elara.Hearts10.Sat": "Let the trains be late today. Let them. We'll figure it out when they arrive.",
	"Elara.Hearts10.Sun": "I'm not timing anything today. I'm just living. It feels wonderful.",
	"Elara.Day.Spring.Mon": "The pollen count is rising. I must requisition more filters for the station's ventilation system.",
	"Elara.Day.Spring.Tue": "Spring rains disrupt the soil stability under the southern tracks. I'll need to schedule an inspection.",
	"Elara.Day.Spring.Wed": "The valley flora is blooming efficiently. I appreciate when nature adheres to a seasonal timetable.",
	"Elara.Day.Spring.Thu": "Tourists begin arriving soon. The noise levels in the terminal are about to exceed acceptable parameters.",
	"Elara.Day.Spring.Fri": "I allocate 5% of my Friday afternoons to observe the cherry blossoms. It is a calculated indulgence.",
	"Elara.Day.Spring.Sat": "More agricultural exports today. I need to ensure the cargo cars are properly sanitized.",
	"Elara.Day.Spring.Sun": "The temperate weather makes the trains run smoothly. Thermal expansion of the rails is at an optimal minimum.",
	"Elara.Day.Summer.Mon": "Heat expands the steel tracks. We must monitor the gauges to prevent derailments. The stakes are high.",
	"Elara.Day.Summer.Tue": "The air conditioning unit in the depot is operating at 80% capacity. It is unacceptable.",
	"Elara.Day.Summer.Wed": "I saw a child drop an ice cream cone on the platform. It took me twelve minutes to clean the sticky residue. Infuriating.",
	"Elara.Day.Summer.Thu": "The humidity is causing the carbon copies of my manifests to curl. I have to store them in a climate-controlled safe.",
	"Elara.Day.Summer.Fri": "Passenger volume is up 40% due to the weather. My stress levels have risen proportionally.",
	"Elara.Day.Summer.Sat": "I refuse to alter the station master uniform for summer. Dignity does not yield to temperature.",
	"Elara.Day.Summer.Sun": "Even the trains seem sluggish in this heat. I empathize, though I will never admit it publicly.",
	"Elara.Day.Fall.Mon": "Fallen leaves on the tracks reduce friction, leading to a condition known as 'slip'. I detest 'slip'.",
	"Elara.Day.Fall.Tue": "Harvest season means maximum freight capacity. This is my busiest quarter. Do not distract me.",
	"Elara.Day.Fall.Wed": "The crisp air is excellent for engine combustion. Operational efficiency is peaking.",
	"Elara.Day.Fall.Thu": "I have drafted a memo regarding the proper disposal of pumpkin remnants near the station.",
	"Elara.Day.Fall.Fri": "Your farm must be reaching peak output, @. Make sure you submit your shipping manifests on time.",
	"Elara.Day.Fall.Sat": "The valley looks like a color-coded chart right now. It is incredibly aesthetically pleasing.",
	"Elara.Day.Fall.Sun": "Shorter daylight hours mean I must calibrate the station lighting timers tonight.",
	"Elara.Day.Winter.Mon": "Snow drifts are the enemy of punctuality. I am engaged in active warfare with the weather.",
	"Elara.Day.Winter.Tue": "The switch heaters are failing intermittently. Jett is out there now. I hope they don't freeze; finding a replacement mechanic takes weeks.",
	"Elara.Day.Winter.Wed": "Passenger traffic drops by 60% in winter. It is wonderfully, blessedly quiet.",
	"Elara.Day.Winter.Thu": "I am running inventory on emergency rations. We are adequately supplied for a prolonged blizzard.",
	"Elara.Day.Winter.Fri": "The cold makes the steel brittle. We have to limit the speed of heavy freight passing through.",
	"Elara.Day.Winter.Sat": "A cup of hot tea is the only variable that makes this temperature tolerable.",
	"Elara.Day.Winter.Sun": "Everything is frozen and perfectly still. It's as close to absolute control as nature gets.",
	"Elara.Gift.StardropTea": "This is exactly what I needed to get through this shift. Thank you, @. It's deeply appreciated.",
	"Elara.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "I do not celebrate aging, and I certainly do not celebrate it with this.",
	"Elara.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "You remembered my date of birth. Statistically unlikely, but deeply appreciated.",
	"Elara.AcceptBirthdayGift": "Thank you for the acknowledgement. I will log it.",
	"Elara.MovieInvitation": "A cinematic outing? I will need to check my itinerary... Yes, I can allocate exactly two hours for this.",
	"Elara.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "My schedule is already booked for that block. Double-booking is a cardinal sin.",
	"Elara.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I have already consumed my weekly quota of fictional media. I must decline.",
	"Elara.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "I have completely expunged our shared activities from my calendar. Permanently.",
	"Elara.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "That film's plot is riddled with logical fallacies. I would spend the entire runtime pointing them out.",
	"Elara.RejectMovieTicket": "Negative. My current tasks require my undivided attention.",
	"Elara.Dating.Mon": "It is customary to exchange pleasantries with a romantic partner. Consider this my pleasantry. Now, back to work.",
	"Elara.Dating.Tue": "Negative. My current tasks require my undivided attention.",
	"Elara.Dating.Wed": "It is customary to exchange pleasantries with a romantic partner. Consider this my pleasantry. Now, back to work.",
	"Elara.Dating.Thu": "I caught myself daydreaming about our last conversation during a critical freight review. You are a dangerous distraction.",
	"Elara.Dating.Fri": "I have carved out a 45-minute block this evening specifically for you. Do not be late.",
	"Elara.Dating.Sat": "Being with you feels like a perfectly balanced ledger. It just makes sense.",
	"Elara.Dating.Sun": "I used to dread the unpredictability of human interaction. With you, I actually look forward to it.",
	"Elara.Dating.General": "I told Jett about us. They said it was 'about time'. I am still calculating how long they knew before I did.",
	"Elara.Dating.Rainy": "You are the one variable in my life I have no desire to control.",
	"Elara.Dating.Memory.OneYear": "My heart rate completely spikes when you enter the room. I feel entirely off balance, and I don't hate it.",
	"Elara.breakUp": "We can stay indoors today. I have adjusted my schedule to accommodate simply sitting with you.",
	"Elara.RejectMermaidPendant_NeedHouseUpgrade": "Exactly 365 days since we made this official. It's the best decision I've made all year.",
	"Elara.RejectMermaidPendant_NotDatable": "I see. The partnership is no longer viable. I will update my records. Goodbye.",
	"Elara.RejectMermaidPendant_NpcWithSomeoneElse": "Your current living quarters lack the square footage necessary for two inhabitants. We must be practical.",
	"Elara.RejectMermaidPendant_PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "We haven't even established a basic courting routine yet.",
	"Elara.RejectMermaidPendant_Under8Hearts": "My loyalties are already allocated elsewhere. This request is denied.",
	"Elara.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts": "I do not tolerate overlapping schedules or overlapping partners. Resolve your current affairs first.",
	"Elara.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts_AskedAgain": "I don't think we know each other nearly well enough to make this kind of commitment.",
	"Elara.Proposal.Reject": "I require more time to finalize my assessment of our long-term compatibility.",
	"Elara.Bouquet.Accept": "I told you I needed more time. Repeating the query will not accelerate my decision.",
	"Elara.RejectBouquet_NotDatable": "I cannot accept this. The variables of our relationship are simply too unstable.",
	"Elara.RejectBouquet_NpcAlreadyMarried": "A floral declaration of intent. Acknowledged and reciprocated. We are now officially courting.",
	"Elara.RejectBouquet_VeryLowHearts": "I am not currently making any time in my schedule for a relationship.",
	"Elara.RejectBouquet_LowHearts": "I am already legally bound to someone else. This is incredibly inappropriate.",
	"Elara.Bouquet.Reject": "I barely tolerate your presence. Why would you give me this?",
	"Elara.divorced": "We lack the foundational rapport required for this step. Denied.",
	"Elara.RejectGift_Divorced": "I must decline. My schedule does not have room for a relationship with you.",
	"Elara.RejectMermaidPendant_Divorced": "The paperwork is finalized. Please do not initiate contact unless it is strictly depot business.",
	"Elara.RejectBouquet_Divorced": "I do not accept gifts from former partners. It complicates things.",
	"Elara.Festival.WinterStar_GiveGift_After_Spouse": "I cross-referenced your tastes and found the most practical gift possible. Merry Winter Star.",
	"Elara.Festival.WinterStar_ReceiveGift": "I certainly didn't expect this... Thank you. This is a very thoughtful exchange.",
	"Elara.Resort.General": "The lack of timetables here is deeply unsettling, but I am attempting to 'relax'.",
	"Elara.Resort.Bar": "I am monitoring my hydration meticulously. Alcohol completely ruins my cognitive function.",
	"Elara.Resort.Chair": "This chair's ergonomic design is acceptable for a fifteen-minute resting period.",
	"Elara.Resort.Dance": "Rhythmic movement without purpose? Fine. But I lead.",
	"Elara.Resort.Entering": "I've arrived. Now, how exactly am I supposed to just 'relax'?",
	"Elara.Resort.Leaving": "My scheduled leisure time is over. Back to reality.",
	"Elara.Resort.Shore": "The tide comes in and out on a perfectly predictable schedule. It is the only thing here I respect.",
	"Elara.Resort.Towel": "I have calculated the optimal angle to avoid direct UV radiation while maximizing warmth.",
	"Elara.Resort.Umbrella": "Shade is a necessity. Sunburn is a completely avoidable operational failure.",
	"Elara.Resort.Wander": "I am walking the perimeter of the resort to establish a mental map of the area.",
	"Elara.SummitEvent": "Looking at the valley from here... it's all so small. Like a model train set. For the first time, I don't feel the need to control it.",
	"Elara.Engagement.0": "I am currently drafting the logistical master plan for the ceremony. It will run with military precision.",
	"Elara.Engagement.1": "Moving my belongings to your farm will require a large truck. I have already booked one.",
	"Elara.SpouseFarmhouseClutter": "This path is obstructed. Clutter is the enemy of a peaceful home. Please move it.",
	"Elara.Spouse_MonstersInHouse": "There are feral creatures in the house! Get them out before they damage the structural supports!",
	"Elara.Marriage.SpouseStardrop": "I was saving this for an emergency, but I want you to have it. You're my priority now.",
	"Elara.Marriage.Spring": "The farm's spring output is impressive. You manage the chaos of nature surprisingly well.",
	"Elara.Marriage.Summer": "I have adjusted the farmhouse thermostat to counter the ambient heat. You're welcome.",
	"Elara.Marriage.Fall": "Harvest time. Let me know if you need help organizing your shipping ledgers tonight.",
	"Elara.Marriage.Winter": "The quiet of winter allows me to reorganize my files without constantly being interrupted.",
	"Elara.Patio": "I set up a miniature timetable display here. Just to keep my administrative skills sharp.",
	"Elara.Rainy_Day_0": "I've switched my schedule to indoor maintenance today. The rain makes fieldwork too sloppy.",
	"Elara.Rainy_Day_1": "The sound of rain on the roof is so rhythmic. It's actually quite calming.",
	"Elara.Rainy_Day_2": "I checked the roof for leaks this morning. Everything looks solid.",
	"Elara.Rainy_Day_3": "Would you like me to organize your tool chest today? It genuinely hurts me to look at it.",
	"Elara.Rainy_Day_4": "I am really enjoying just being stuck inside with you today, @.",
	"Elara.Rainy_Day_5": "No trains to worry about today. Just you and me. I like this change of pace.",
	"Elara.Indoor_Day_0": "Good morning. I have already brewed the coffee and outlined my tasks for the day.",
	"Elara.Indoor_Day_1": "Your farm's efficiency rating is climbing. I take partial credit for organizing your storage, of course.",
	"Elara.Indoor_Day_2": "I found a dust bunny under the sofa. I have eradicated it.",
	"Elara.Indoor_Day_3": "Do you need help with the crop rotations? I have charted a new optimal pattern if you want to see it.",
	"Elara.Indoor_Day_4": "Marrying you was the smartest, most unpredictable thing I've ever done.",
	"Elara.Indoor_Day_5": "I've blocked out 30 minutes for us to just sit together on the porch later. Don't be late.",
	"Elara.Rainy_Night_0": "The day's tasks are complete. I am going to bed.",
	"Elara.Rainy_Night_1": "Listen to the storm. I am so glad we are safely enclosed in here tonight.",
	"Elara.Rainy_Night_2": "I've locked the doors and checked the windows. We're secure.",
	"Elara.Rainy_Night_3": "You look completely exhausted. I prescribe immediate sleep.",
	"Elara.Rainy_Night_4": "There's something nice about the rain washing the day away.",
	"Elara.Rainy_Night_5": "I used to hate the rain. Now, it just means a quiet evening near you.",
	"Elara.Indoor_Night_0": "Have you finished your evening routine yet? It's getting late.",
	"Elara.Indoor_Night_1": "I was just reviewing our finances. We had a highly productive day.",
	"Elara.Indoor_Night_2": "You work so hard, @. Sit down and let me rub your shoulders.",
	"Elara.Indoor_Night_3": "The house is so quiet. It's perfect.",
	"Elara.Indoor_Night_4": "I never realized sharing a living space could be so... comforting.",
	"Elara.Indoor_Night_5": "Goodnight, @. You're the best part of my day.",
	"Elara.funLeave": "I am heading to town. Social obligations require my presence.",
	"Elara.funReturn": "Socializing is remarkably draining. I'm so glad to be home.",
	"Elara.Outdoor_General": "The fences look secure, and the crops are growing right on schedule.",
	"Elara.Outdoor_0": "I was just calculating the exact yield of these crops based on the soil quality.",
	"Elara.Outdoor_1": "Fresh air really does clear the mind. I'm trying to take deep breaths.",
	"Elara.Outdoor_2": "I fixed that loose fence post you've been ignoring for three weeks. You're welcome.",
	"Elara.Outdoor_3": "The farm operates like a well-oiled machine when you're at the helm.",
	"Elara.Outdoor_4": "I am just observing you work. You have a very specific technique.",
	"Elara.spouseRoom": "I have designated this space for my station models and paperwork. Please do not move my files.",
	"Elara.OneKid_0": "The baby is meeting all their pediatric milestones right on schedule. It is a massive relief.",
	"Elara.OneKid_1": "I have created a strict feeding and sleep schedule. The baby will adapt, eventually.",
	"Elara.OneKid_2": "I caught myself singing a lullaby earlier. It was entirely out of character, yet... I couldn't stop.",
	"Elara.OneKid_3": "Do you think they will appreciate a good organizational system as much as I do?",
	"Elara.OneKid_4": "Parenthood is the most terrifyingly unpredictable thing I have ever done.",
	"Elara.TwoKids_0": "Two children. The noise level in this house has expanded exponentially.",
	"Elara.TwoKids_1": "I am trying to teach the older one how to read a basic clock. It's never too early.",
	"Elara.TwoKids_2": "Managing two of them requires a level of multitasking I am still trying to master.",
	"Elara.TwoKids_3": "They are loud, messy, and entirely illogical. I love them fiercely.",
	"Elara.TwoKids_4": "Our family is complete. And surprisingly, we are managing the chaos quite well.",
	"Elara.Good_0": "Everything is running smoothly today. I am highly content.",
	"Elara.Good_1": "You look exceptionally well today, @. It’s distracting, frankly.",
	"Elara.Good_2": "The house is clean, the farm is running, and I am with you. It's a good day.",
	"Elara.Good_3": "I processed our finances today. We are operating at a wonderful surplus.",
	"Elara.Good_4": "I keep catching myself smiling for no reason. It's unusual for me, but I don't mind it.",
	"Elara.Good_5": "You make this unpredictable world entirely bearable.",
	"Elara.Good_6": "I wouldn't trade this life for a master control room in Zuzu City.",
	"Elara.Good_7": "Thank you for supporting my ridiculous need for structure.",
	"Elara.Good_8": "Every day with you is a success.",
	"Elara.Good_9": "I love you. That is a permanent fact.",
	"Elara.Neutral_0": "Good morning. Back to the usual routine.",
	"Elara.Neutral_1": "Nothing significant to report today. It's quiet.",
	"Elara.Neutral_2": "The weather is holding up, thankfully.",
	"Elara.Neutral_3": "I'm just going over today's timeline in my head.",
	"Elara.Neutral_4": "Just another day of keeping things running.",
	"Elara.Neutral_5": "Make sure you drink enough water today. It's easy to forget when you're working.",
	"Elara.Neutral_6": "I'm just reviewing some paperwork. Nothing urgent.",
	"Elara.Neutral_7": "Everything looks fine on the farm today.",
	"Elara.Neutral_8": "I'm just enjoying a quiet moment before I start working.",
	"Elara.Neutral_9": "Give me a moment, I'm drafting today's task list.",
	"Elara.Bad_0": "I'm incredibly stressed right now. Please tread lightly.",
	"Elara.Bad_1": "Everything is disorganized today. I cannot function in this much mess.",
	"Elara.Bad_2": "I am highly irritated, and I haven't even figured out why yet. Give me some space.",
	"Elara.Bad_3": "I am so far behind schedule it's making my chest tight. Unacceptable.",
	"Elara.Bad_4": "I need quiet to reorganize my thoughts. Please leave me be for a minute.",
	"Elara.Bad_5": "Today is just a disaster from start to finish.",
	"Elara.Bad_6": "I am not equipped to handle this level of disorder right now.",
	"Elara.Bad_7": "My patience is completely gone for the day.",
	"Elara.Bad_8": "Do not ask me for anything today. I am at my absolute limit.",
	"Elara.Bad_9": "I am completely overwhelmed. I just need some space to breathe.",
	"Elara.Event.2Heart.1": "Forty-one... forty-two... forty-three...",
	"Elara.Event.2Heart.2": "You broke my count! The 10:15 is approaching the tunnel and I am timing the whistle to check the Doppler shift against our velocity metrics!",
	"Elara.Event.2Heart.Q": "How do you respond?",
	"Elara.Event.2Heart.A1": "I'm so sorry! I didn't mean to interrupt.",
	"Elara.Event.2Heart.A2": "Does a few seconds really matter?",
	"Elara.Event.2Heart.A3": "That sounds incredibly stressful.",
	"Elara.Event.2Heart.R1": "Apologies do not reset the clock. But... fine. I will rely on the automated sensors. Try to be more aware of your surroundings.",
	"Elara.Event.2Heart.R2": "Does a few seconds matter?! A three-second delay in braking causes a derailment! Every second matters! Your ignorance is staggering.",
	"Elara.Event.2Heart.R3": "It is not 'stressful'. It is my job. Someone has to maintain order so this valley doesn't collapse into chaos.",
	"Elara.Event.2Heart.3": "Please leave. I need to recalculate the arrival window from scratch.",
	"Elara.Event.4Heart.1": "This manifold gasket is degraded, Jett. It should have been replaced Tuesday.",
	"Elara.Event.4Heart.2": "Elara, the incoming freight was running hot. I prioritized the coolant lines so the engine wouldn't literally melt.",
	"Elara.Event.4Heart.3": "The schedule dictated the gasket. You compromised the protocol.",
	"Elara.Event.4Heart.4": "Farmer. You run a business. Tell my mechanic why strict adherence to protocol is mandatory.",
	"Elara.Event.4Heart.Q": "Pick a side:",
	"Elara.Event.4Heart.A1": "Elara is right. Rules prevent disasters.",
	"Elara.Event.4Heart.A2": "Jett is right. You have to adapt to the situation.",
	"Elara.Event.4Heart.R1": "Exactly. A single deviation creates a cascade of failures. Thank you, Farmer.",
	"Elara.Event.4Heart.R2": "Adaptation is just a polite word for improvisation. And improvisation leads to derailments.",
	"Elara.Event.4Heart.5": "Fix the gasket immediately, Jett. I expect the completion report on my desk in an hour.",
	"Elara.Event.6Heart.1": "(Deep breaths) The mudslide took out the northern switch. The 3:00 is trapped.",
	"Elara.Event.6Heart.2": "It's my fault. I should have anticipated the soil saturation levels. The schedule is completely ruined.",
	"Elara.Event.6Heart.3": "I don't know how to fix this. I can't... I can't control the mud.",
	"Elara.Event.6Heart.Q": "Comfort her:",
	"Elara.Event.6Heart.A1": "You can't control everything, Elara.",
	"Elara.Event.6Heart.A2": "Just adjust the schedule.",
	"Elara.Event.6Heart.R1": "I know. But if I don't control it, who will? ...Thank you. I just need to breathe.",
	"Elara.Event.6Heart.R2": "You don't understand! The schedule is the only thing keeping the chaos out! ...But you're right. I have to adjust.",
	"Elara.Event.6Heart.4": "I will reroute the 4:15. I can salvage this. Thank you, Farmer. I needed the perspective.",
	"Elara.Event.8Heart.1": "It's gone. The entire manifest for Quarter 3. I deleted it.",
	"Elara.Event.8Heart.2": "I made a mistake. Me. I pressed the wrong key and purged the database.",
	"Elara.Event.8Heart.3": "And you know what the worst part is? ...The trains are still running.",
	"Elara.Event.8Heart.4": "The world didn't end because I made an error. I've been holding my breath for ten years for absolutely nothing.",
	"Elara.Event.10Heart.1": "I scheduled fifteen minutes of 'idle observation'.",
	"Elara.Event.10Heart.2": "I'm just standing here. Looking at the town. Not timing anything.",
	"Elara.Event.10Heart.3": "You showed me that the world doesn't collapse if you let go of the reins for a moment.",
	"Elara.Event.10Heart.4": "Even a clock can make mistakes, @. I think I'm finally okay with that.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Mon": "We are closed for service, but the kitchen is active. I'm breaking down a side of beef. It takes precision. Go away.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Tue": "I take the truck out on Tuesdays. It's a tactical strike. I park near the Saloon just to remind my brother what actual cooking smells like.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Wed": "Dinner service starts at 5. Reservations are mandatory. ...I suppose I can squeeze you in at the bar. Don't make a mess.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Thu": "My staff is terrified of me. Good. Fear tastes better than complacency. It keeps the plating sharp.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Fri": "The weekend rush. People come from the city to eat here. They wait months for a table. You just walked in off the street. You have no idea how lucky you are.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Sat": "I saw Gus's 'Daily Special' on the chalkboard outside. 'Pizza'. It's bread with ketchup. I'm serving Duck Confit. There is no competition.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Sun": "Sunday brunch is for amateurs, so I don't serve it. I serve a Sunday Roast. If you ask for eggs benedict, I will ask you to leave.",
	"Gustavo.Introduction": "Wipe your feet. This is a dining room, not a barn. ...I'm Gustavo. I own this establishment. If you want my food, sit down and behave. If you want the food truck, find me on Tuesdays. That's when I go out to educate the masses.",
	"Gustavo.DumpsterDiveComment": "Are you foraging, or have you lost your mind? Put that garbage down before you contaminate yourself.",
	"Gustavo.HitBySlingshot": "Do you have a death wish?! I have knives sharper than your intellect.",
	"Gustavo.WipedMemory": "Have we... met? You look like someone who doesn't understand flavor profiles, but I can't be sure.",
	"Gustavo.Weather.Rain": "Rain cleans the air. Less dust in the food.",
	"Gustavo.Weather.Snow": "Snow day. Truck's closed. I'm reading cookbooks.",
	"Gustavo.Weather.GreenRain": "This rain tastes like acid and chlorophyll. I'm bottling it for a vinaigrette.",
	"Gustavo.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "The air is finally clear. The acidity of that rain was throwing off the pH of my sauces.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts2.Mon": "You're back. Did you wipe your boots? The floor is imported tile.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts2.Tue": "This is the truck line. No special treatment. You wait like everyone else.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts2.Wed": "Don't ask for a discount. Quality costs money. If you want cheap, go eat dirt.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts2.Thu": "I saw you eating a raw field snack. A leek? Barbaric. Have some self-respect.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts2.Fri": "My kitchen is a sanctuary. Do not cross the threshold.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts2.Sat": "You smell like hard work. It's better than smelling like cheap cologne, I suppose.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts2.Sun": "I'm developing a new sauce. It's too complex for you. Don't ask.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts4.Mon": "I saw your latest harvest. The color on those melons... acceptable. Almost vibrant.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts4.Tue": "You come to the truck *and* the restaurant? You're either a stalker or you have excellent taste. I'll assume the latter.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts4.Wed": "I don't hate my brother. I hate that everyone thinks his 'nice' pub food is the pinnacle of dining. I'm going to show this valley what actual greatness tastes like.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts4.Thu": "Most people eat to stop being hungry. I want you to eat to feel something. If my food doesn't make you emotional, I failed.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts4.Fri": "Here. A sample of the amuse-bouche. ...Well? It's foam made from smoked hay. It's supposed to taste like a farm. Get it?",
	"Gustavo.Hearts4.Sat": "I respect Bea. She's wrong about everything, but she stands by her mistakes with conviction. That's character.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts4.Sun": "Sit at the bar. Watch the line cooks. See how they move? It's a ballet. A violent, hot ballet.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts6.Mon": "Gus and I started in the same kitchen. Everyone always loved Gus. He was the favorite. I decided if I couldn't be the favorite, I would be the best. And I am.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts6.Tue": "I drove the truck past the Saloon today. Honked the horn. Gus waved. He never gets angry. It's infuriating.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts6.Wed": "You have a good palate. You noticed the saffron in the rice. Most people just think it's 'yellow'.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts6.Thu": "I'm thinking of hosting a private dinner. 'The Farmer's Harvest'. Your crops, my technique. We could charge a fortune.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts6.Fri": "Torti is sleeping on the pizza oven. It's warm. I should kick him off, but... he looks comfortable. He stays.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts6.Sat": "This town... it has good bones. Good water. Good soil. I can build a legacy here.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts6.Sun": "I'm cooking a staff meal. Leftover risotto. Do you want a bowl? It's better than anything you'll cook at home.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts8.Mon": "I have a Michelin star. Did you know that? It's in a box somewhere. I don't hang it up. The food speaks for itself.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts8.Tue": "I don't drive the truck for the money. I drive it because I love the look on people's faces when they realize street food can be better than fine dining.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts8.Wed": "I sent Gus a bottle of vintage wine. Not to show off. Just... because he's my brother. I think I'm finally tired of fighting a war he doesn't even know we're having.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts8.Thu": "This restaurant is my life. I built it. Every menu, every plate. It's lonely at the top, but the view is spectacular.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts8.Fri": "I made a dish just for you. Roasted duck with a glaze made from your own berries. It's... poetry.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts8.Sat": "You're welcome in my kitchen anytime. Just... wash your hands first. I have standards.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts8.Sun": "I trust your opinion. If you think a dish is off... tell me. I might actually listen.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts10.Mon": "I'm not going back to the city. I've conquered it. Here... here there are still challenges. Like teaching you the difference between 'dice' and 'mince'.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts10.Tue": "I respect you. ...Don't look so shocked. You have standards. Most people in this town don't.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts10.Wed": "You grow the best produce I have ever worked with. That is not a compliment. It is a fact.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts10.Thu": "I never thought I'd find an equal here. Someone who understands quality. You're rare, Farmer. Like a white truffle.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts10.Fri": "Come to the kitchen. I need a second palate I can trust. I'm working on something revolutionary.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts10.Sat": "You ground me. The kitchen is chaos. You are... stability. I need that.",
	"Gustavo.Hearts10.Sun": "I'm content. It's a strange flavor profile for me. ...I'll add more lime to balance it out.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Spring.Mon": "I'm changing the seasonal menu. Fiddlehead ferns. Morels. The forest provides, if you know where to look.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Spring.Tue": "Truck day. I sold out of tacos in twenty minutes. I saw Gus watching from the window. He looked... impressed. As he should be.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Spring.Wed": "The acoustics in this restaurant are engineered to dampen noise. I want you to hear the crunch of the radish, not your neighbor's gossip.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Spring.Thu": "I caught Remy trying to busk in my foyer. I told them the only music in here is the sizzle of the pan. They left, but they hummed on the way out. Annoying.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Spring.Fri": "A critic came in last night. He dropped his fork. I didn't replace it. I replaced *him*. I told him to leave. Clumsiness offends me.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Spring.Sat": "I need peppers. The local supply is weak. Farmer, if you grow me Gold-quality Hot Peppers, I might put your name on the menu. Small print.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Spring.Sun": "My knives are Japanese steel. Folded a thousand times. They cut through bone like it's butter. Respect the tool.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Summer.Mon": "The AC in the restaurant is set to exactly 68 degrees. It keeps the pastry dough stable. If you're cold, bring a jacket.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Summer.Tue": "Driving the truck in this heat is brutal. I do it for the craft. And to annoy Gus. Mostly to annoy Gus.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Summer.Wed": "I'm serving a cold cucumber soup. It's not 'gazpacho'. It's a velouté. Learn the terminology.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Summer.Thu": "Mara came in. She asked if the salmon was sustainable. I showed her the shipping manifest and the fisherman's biography. She ate in silence.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Summer.Fri": "I saw Lewis eating a hotdog on a bench. A man in power should have better taste. It explains why this town is crumbling.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Summer.Sat": "My risotto requires constant agitation. I've been stirring for forty minutes. Do not interrupt my rhythm.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Summer.Sun": "I'm resting in the office. Running a flagship restaurant and a spite-truck is exhausting. But genius never sleeps for long.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Fall.Mon": "Pumpkin is a pedestrian ingredient. I'm using Hubbard Squash. It has more depth. Pumpkin is for pies and children.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Fall.Tue": "Truck day. The wind carries the smell of my carnitas right into the Saloon's window. It's psychological warfare.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Fall.Wed": "I saw Vance checking the perimeter of my building. He said my loading dock was 'secure'. I gave him a steak bone for... whatever he does.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Fall.Thu": "Bea brought me a basket of biscuits. 'Neighborly love,' she said. They were... technically competent. A bit dense.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Fall.Fri": "Spirit's Eve. I'm doing a black truffle special. It looks like coal, tastes like heaven. It's $50 a plate.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Fall.Sat": "The tourists are gone. Now the real diners come out. The ones who care about the food, not the Instagram photo.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Fall.Sun": "I'm preserving lemons. They need to sit for months. Patience is the only ingredient you can't buy.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Winter.Mon": "The menu is shifting to root vegetables. Parsnips. Yams. I roast them until they caramelize. It's simple, which means there's nowhere to hide.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Winter.Tue": "Truck day in the snow? Absolutely. People need heat. I serve chili that raises your body temperature by three degrees.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Winter.Wed": "I saw Jett eyeing the espresso machine. I let her fix the pressure valve. She didn't charge me. I gave her a croissant. Fair trade.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Winter.Thu": "Gus sent me a holiday card. It had a picture of him and a turkey. He looked... happy. It was irritating.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Winter.Fri": "New Year's Eve menu. Oysters. Caviar. Champagne. If you aren't wearing a tie, you aren't getting in.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Winter.Sat": "It's cold. The restaurant is warm. The smell of roasting rosemary fills the room. This is civilization, Farmer.",
	"Gustavo.Day.Winter.Sun": "End of the year. My profits are up 12%. My reviews are stellar. For the first time, I didn't even check to see how the Saloon is doing. I don't need to.",
	"Gustavo.Gift.StardropTea": "This... this is unparalleled. The complexity, the finish. You honor my palate with this, Farmer.",
	"Gustavo.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "You brought this? For my birthday? I'll accept it, but only out of polite societal obligation.",
	"Gustavo.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "A thoughtful addition to my day. I suppose I can step away from the line to appreciate this.",
	"Gustavo.AcceptBirthdayGift": "You remembered. Or my staff warned you. Either way, acceptable.",
	"Gustavo.MovieInvitation": "A film? If the concessions are garbage, I'm bringing my own truffle popcorn.",
	"Gustavo.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "My schedule is booked. Someone else already secured my company.",
	"Gustavo.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I've already subjected myself to cinematic mediocrity this week. No.",
	"Gustavo.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "I would rather eat from a dumpster than sit in a dark theater with you.",
	"Gustavo.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "That film is an insult to the art of storytelling. Pick something better.",
	"Gustavo.RejectMovieTicket": "I'm in the middle of a delicate reduction. Absolutely not.",
	"Gustavo.Dating.Mon": "Mondays used to be for butchering. Now they're for... you. Don't make me regret it.",
	"Gustavo.Dating.Tue": "I'm in the middle of a delicate reduction. Absolutely not.",
	"Gustavo.Dating.Wed": "Mondays used to be for butchering. Now they're for... you. Don't make me regret it.",
	"Gustavo.Dating.Thu": "I parked the truck early today just to see you. Don't tell Gus.",
	"Gustavo.Dating.Fri": "You distract me during dinner service. It's dangerous, but I like it.",
	"Gustavo.Dating.Sat": "I was developing a new flavor profile, and I realized I was just trying to capture the way you make me feel.",
	"Gustavo.Dating.Sun": "The weekend rush means nothing when you're waiting for me at the end of it.",
	"Gustavo.Dating.General": "I chased a food critic out tonight because he insulted farmers. I... might have been thinking of you.",
	"Gustavo.Dating.Rainy": "Sunday is my only rest. Come here. Sit with me.",
	"Gustavo.Dating.Memory.OneYear": "I never thought I'd find someone who could hold my attention longer than a complicated recipe.",
	"Gustavo.breakUp": "It's damp outside. Come into the kitchen. I've made a broth that will warm you to your bones.",
	"Gustavo.RejectMermaidPendant_NeedHouseUpgrade": "A year since we started this... partnership. You've been the best ingredient I never knew I needed.",
	"Gustavo.RejectMermaidPendant_NotDatable": "You're sending back the dish? Fine. My kitchen is closed to you. Permanently.",
	"Gustavo.RejectMermaidPendant_NpcWithSomeoneElse": "I am not moving my imported knives into a shack. Expand your quarters.",
	"Gustavo.RejectMermaidPendant_PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "A proposal? From you? You must be joking.",
	"Gustavo.RejectMermaidPendant_Under8Hearts": "My palate is currently devoted to someone else. Good day.",
	"Gustavo.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts": "You're already attached. I don't share my kitchen, and I don't share my partner.",
	"Gustavo.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts_AskedAgain": "We barely know each other's favorite cooking methods. Slow down.",
	"Gustavo.Proposal.Reject": "I demand perfection. We aren't there yet.",
	"Gustavo.Bouquet.Accept": "I said no. My standards do not lower over time.",
	"Gustavo.RejectBouquet_NotDatable": "I cannot commit to this. My heart belongs to the kitchen right now.",
	"Gustavo.RejectBouquet_NpcAlreadyMarried": "You're courting me? ...I accept. But know that I expect excellence.",
	"Gustavo.RejectBouquet_VeryLowHearts": "Flowers? They're wilting. And so is this conversation.",
	"Gustavo.RejectBouquet_LowHearts": "I am already married. Take your weeds elsewhere.",
	"Gustavo.Bouquet.Reject": "I don't even like you. Throw those in the compost.",
	"Gustavo.divorced": "We are acquaintances. Keep it professional.",
	"Gustavo.RejectGift_Divorced": "I'm flattered, but my focus is entirely on my menu right now.",
	"Gustavo.RejectMermaidPendant_Divorced": "Don't speak to me. You ruined the best pairing of my life.",
	"Gustavo.RejectBouquet_Divorced": "Take it away. Anything from you is completely unappetizing.",
	"Gustavo.Festival.WinterStar_GiveGift_After_Spouse": "I sourced this gift from three different continents. Enjoy it.",
	"Gustavo.Festival.WinterStar_ReceiveGift": "This is... surprisingly adequate. You did well.",
	"Gustavo.Resort.General": "The humidity here is going to ruin my hair, but the seafood potential is immense.",
	"Gustavo.Resort.Bar": "This drink needs acid. It's unbalanced.",
	"Gustavo.Resort.Chair": "I'm analyzing the menu. It's lacking.",
	"Gustavo.Resort.Dance": "I don't dance. I orchestrate.",
	"Gustavo.Resort.Entering": "A beach resort? Good. I can cook fish straight from the water.",
	"Gustavo.Resort.Leaving": "Sand in the kitchen is unacceptable. I'm leaving.",
	"Gustavo.Resort.Shore": "Salt air. Natural seasoning.",
	"Gustavo.Resort.Towel": "High thread count only.",
	"Gustavo.Resort.Umbrella": "Shade is practical.",
	"Gustavo.Resort.Wander": "Looking for sea salt. The crystals here are large. Good for finishing steaks.",
	"Gustavo.SummitEvent": "Looking out over this valley... I see ingredients. But mostly, I see you. You're my greatest success.",
	"Gustavo.Engagement.0": "I'm designing the wedding menu. Don't interfere. It will be legendary.",
	"Gustavo.Engagement.1": "We're getting married. I suppose I should invite Gus. He can handle the... basic beverages.",
	"Gustavo.SpouseFarmhouseClutter": "How am I supposed to walk through here? Clear this mess, or I will.",
	"Gustavo.Spouse_MonstersInHouse": "Slimes? In MY house? This is a severe health code violation!",
	"Gustavo.Marriage.SpouseStardrop": "I poured my soul into making this for you. Eat it slowly. Savor it.",
	"Gustavo.Marriage.Spring": "The spring harvest is coming in. Bring me the absolute best you have, darling.",
	"Gustavo.Marriage.Summer": "It's too hot to cook heavy meals. I've prepared a light ceviche for us.",
	"Gustavo.Marriage.Fall": "Autumn means truffles and rich reductions. My favorite season to feed you.",
	"Gustavo.Marriage.Winter": "The fire is roaring, and the stew has been simmering for twelve hours. Welcome home.",
	"Gustavo.Patio": "I'm out here testing the wood-fired oven. The char on this flatbread is immaculate.",
	"Gustavo.Rainy_Day_0": "It's raining. The restaurant is slow. Good. I have you all to myself.",
	"Gustavo.Rainy_Day_1": "I made us a dark roast coffee. It cuts through the gloom of this weather.",
	"Gustavo.Rainy_Day_2": "Don't track mud into our kitchen. I just polished the stainless steel.",
	"Gustavo.Rainy_Day_3": "I'm testing a new rainy-day comfort food. You are my guinea pig.",
	"Gustavo.Rainy_Day_4": "The sound of rain on the roof is almost as soothing as a simmering stock.",
	"Gustavo.Rainy_Day_5": "Stay inside today. Let me take care of you.",
	"Gustavo.Indoor_Day_0": "I'm reorganizing the pantry. Do not touch my organizational system.",
	"Gustavo.Indoor_Day_1": "You look exhausted from the farm. Sit down. I'm making you lunch.",
	"Gustavo.Indoor_Day_2": "Being married to you is... surprisingly efficient. We work well together.",
	"Gustavo.Indoor_Day_3": "I sharpened all the tools in the shed. A dull tool is an insult to the work.",
	"Gustavo.Indoor_Day_4": "I caught myself smiling while kneading dough today. You've softened me.",
	"Gustavo.Indoor_Day_5": "I love our life here. Even if your boots always smell like fertilizer.",
	"Gustavo.Rainy_Night_0": "A perfect night to stay in. I've decanted a vintage red.",
	"Gustavo.Rainy_Night_1": "The rain makes me reflective. I'm glad I chose to stay in this valley with you.",
	"Gustavo.Rainy_Night_2": "Are you cold? I can increase the heat, or you can just come closer.",
	"Gustavo.Rainy_Night_3": "I can hear the frogs. It reminds me of foraging near the river.",
	"Gustavo.Rainy_Night_4": "Get out of those wet clothes immediately. You'll catch a cold, and I despise nursing sick people.",
	"Gustavo.Rainy_Night_5": "The storm is passing. Let's just listen to the rain.",
	"Gustavo.Indoor_Night_0": "Dinner service is over. Now, I am officially off the clock.",
	"Gustavo.Indoor_Night_1": "You look stunning in the low light of the farmhouse.",
	"Gustavo.Indoor_Night_2": "I left some leftovers in the fridge, but don't microwave them. Reheat them properly on the stove.",
	"Gustavo.Indoor_Night_3": "Tomorrow is a new menu. Tonight is just us.",
	"Gustavo.Indoor_Night_4": "Come to bed. The farm will still be there in the morning.",
	"Gustavo.Indoor_Night_5": "I'm drafting tomorrow's prep list. But I'm easily distracted by you.",
	"Gustavo.funLeave": "I'm going to the city to source some rare spices. Don't burn the house down.",
	"Gustavo.funReturn": "The city was loud and tasteless. I missed you.",
	"Gustavo.Outdoor_General": "The air out here is crisp. Good for the lungs.",
	"Gustavo.Outdoor_0": "I'm inspecting your crops. They are... adequate. Mostly.",
	"Gustavo.Outdoor_1": "The soil here is rich. It translates directly into the flavor of the vegetables.",
	"Gustavo.Outdoor_2": "I'm considering building an outdoor smoker. Thoughts?",
	"Gustavo.Outdoor_3": "Look at this farm. We built this empire.",
	"Gustavo.Outdoor_4": "I'm just taking a moment. The kitchen gets claustrophobic.",
	"Gustavo.spouseRoom": "My prep station is pristine. Please respect the boundary.",
	"Gustavo.OneKid_0": "Having a child is... terrifying. What if they grow up to like fast food?",
	"Gustavo.OneKid_1": "I've started pureeing organic vegetables for the baby. Only the best.",
	"Gustavo.OneKid_2": "They have your eyes, but my refined palate. I can tell.",
	"Gustavo.OneKid_3": "Keep the baby away from my knife roll.",
	"Gustavo.OneKid_4": "I never thought I'd be a father. It's the most challenging recipe I've ever tackled.",
	"Gustavo.TwoKids_0": "Two of them. The farmhouse is officially a madhouse.",
	"Gustavo.TwoKids_1": "I'm teaching the older one how to hold a whisk. It's a fundamental skill.",
	"Gustavo.TwoKids_2": "They are exhausting. But... I love them fiercely. Don't tell them I said that.",
	"Gustavo.TwoKids_3": "We need a bigger dining table. I can't serve a family this size on a tiny surface.",
	"Gustavo.TwoKids_4": "You and the kids are my legacy. Not the restaurant.",
	"Gustavo.Good_0": "Good morning, my love. I made an espresso for you.",
	"Gustavo.Good_1": "You make every day brighter.",
	"Gustavo.Good_2": "I am constantly inspired by you.",
	"Gustavo.Good_3": "Let's conquer the day. You on the farm, me in the kitchen.",
	"Gustavo.Good_4": "I'm in an excellent mood. The sourdough starter is thriving.",
	"Gustavo.Good_5": "You are the best decision I ever made.",
	"Gustavo.Good_6": "I love you. More than truffles. And that's saying something.",
	"Gustavo.Good_7": "Everything is perfectly in its place. Especially you.",
	"Gustavo.Good_8": "I prepared your favorite breakfast. Eat.",
	"Gustavo.Good_9": "We are an unstoppable team.",
	"Gustavo.Neutral_0": "Morning. I'm busy prepping.",
	"Gustavo.Neutral_1": "Don't forget to water the greenhouse.",
	"Gustavo.Neutral_2": "I need to order more flour today.",
	"Gustavo.Neutral_3": "The weather is acceptable.",
	"Gustavo.Neutral_4": "I'm reviewing invoices. It's tedious.",
	"Gustavo.Neutral_5": "Have a productive day.",
	"Gustavo.Neutral_6": "I'll be at the restaurant until late.",
	"Gustavo.Neutral_7": "Did you feed the animals?",
	"Gustavo.Neutral_8": "I'm testing a new recipe later.",
	"Gustavo.Neutral_9": "See you at dinner.",
	"Gustavo.Bad_0": "Don't talk to me. The hollandaise broke.",
	"Gustavo.Bad_1": "I am in no mood for pleasantries.",
	"Gustavo.Bad_2": "The supplier sent me substandard produce. I am furious.",
	"Gustavo.Bad_3": "Everything is going wrong today.",
	"Gustavo.Bad_4": "Just... give me space.",
	"Gustavo.Bad_5": "I have a headache from dealing with incompetence.",
	"Gustavo.Bad_6": "This farm is a mess.",
	"Gustavo.Bad_7": "Why must everything be so difficult?",
	"Gustavo.Bad_8": "I am losing my patience.",
	"Gustavo.Bad_9": "Leave me be.",
	"Gustavo.Event.2Heart.1": "No! No! No!",
	"Gustavo.Event.2Heart.2": "This cilantro is wilted! It's sad! It has no structural integrity!",
	"Gustavo.Event.2Heart.3": "Oh. You. Farmer. Explain this. Why is the produce in this town so pathetic?",
	"Gustavo.Event.2Heart.Q": "Explain the produce:",
	"Gustavo.Event.2Heart.A1": "It's out of season.",
	"Gustavo.Event.2Heart.A2": "Pierre sells old stock.",
	"Gustavo.Event.2Heart.R1": "Then don't sell it! A true chef respects the season.",
	"Gustavo.Event.2Heart.R2": "I knew it. That man has shifty eyes. I'll source my own.",
	"Gustavo.Event.4Heart.1": "Hey! You! The Biscuit Lady!",
	"Gustavo.Event.4Heart.2": "It's Bea. And what do you want, Fancy Pants?",
	"Gustavo.Event.4Heart.3": "I tasted your gravy. It's 90% flour. It's wallpaper paste.",
	"Gustavo.Event.4Heart.4": "It sticks to your ribs! That's the point! Not everyone wants to eat foam and tiny leaves!",
	"Gustavo.Event.4Heart.5": "Farmer! Settle this. What's more important: Technique or Comfort?",
	"Gustavo.Event.4Heart.Q": "Pick a side:",
	"Gustavo.Event.4Heart.A1": "Technique. (Gustavo)",
	"Gustavo.Event.4Heart.A2": "Comfort. (Bea)",
	"Gustavo.Event.4Heart.R1": "Exactly. Without technique, you're just heating up slop.",
	"Gustavo.Event.4Heart.R2": "Comfort is an excuse for laziness! You people are impossible!",
	"Gustavo.Event.6Heart.1": "I ran away when I was 18.",
	"Gustavo.Event.6Heart.2": "Gus was always the favorite. He took over the family pub, played the 'good son,' and everyone adored him for it.",
	"Gustavo.Event.6Heart.3": "I wanted greatness. I went to the city. I fought for every scrap of respect I have.",
	"Gustavo.Event.6Heart.4": "I got tired of always coming in second. I look at Gus... he's happy. But I needed to build a legacy that was entirely my own. Even if it meant building it alone.",
	"Gustavo.Event.8Heart.1": "Try this. It's a new recipe. 'The Timberline Taco'.",
	"Gustavo.Event.8Heart.2": "I used wild onions from the river. Mushrooms from the caves. And peppers you grew.",
	"Gustavo.Event.8Heart.3": "Well? ...Don't speak. I can see your eyes widening.",
	"Gustavo.Event.8Heart.4": "You like it. Of course you do. It's perfect.",
	"Gustavo.Event.8Heart.5": "But it's only perfect because the ingredients are good. Because *you* are good. ...Good job, Farmer.",
	"Gustavo.Event.10Heart.1": "I closed the restaurant early.",
	"Gustavo.Event.10Heart.2": "This is the Chef's Table. The only seat that matters.",
	"Gustavo.Event.10Heart.3": "Tonight, I'm testing a new concept. It requires absolute honesty.",
	"Gustavo.Event.10Heart.4": "You are the only person in this valley whose opinion I trust. Taste this.",
	"Gustavo.Mail.Open": "Notification: Truck Schedule.^^My truck is now parked in the Forest on Tuesdays. The rest of the week, find me at my restaurant in Timberline.^^I serve real food. Not whatever 'pub grub' my brother is reheating today.^^Come by if you want to learn what flavor is.^^   -Gustavo %item object (O)213 1 %%",
	"Jett.Day.Mon": "I was two minutes late today. It feels worse than a blown gasket. If I'm not running on schedule, I'm failing the system. And failing systems get replaced.",
	"Jett.Day.Tue": "People throw away a perfectly good engine just because a single valve sticks. They don't want to put the work in to understand it. I don't let things stay broken. If it works, it can't be thrown away.",
	"Jett.Day.Wed": "Twenty minutes of scrubbing didn’t do it. My hands still look like they’re covered in oil. Dr. Thorne says 'skin needs to breathe', but I think the oil is just my protective layer now.",
	"Jett.Day.Thu": "Ever listen to a train settle? That low rumble? It’s not music. It’s the sound of metal cooling down after being pushed too hard. I know the feeling.",
	"Jett.Day.Fri": "Big plans this weekend? Not me. I have to recalibrate the pressure gauges. If the efficiency drops, the town doesn't need me. I can't afford a 4% drop in my utility.",
	"Jett.Day.Sat": "The platform is packed. Tourists. They look at me like I'm part of the machinery. Maybe I am.",
	"Jett.Day.Sun": "I thought about walking into town today, but... what if a pressure valve blows while I'm gone? If I'm not here to fix it, I'm not providing any value. It's better if I just stay.",
	"Jett.Introduction": "Whoa. Hey. ...Don't shake my hand. Seriously. The grease... it doesn't come off. I've scrubbed it, but it's like it's in the grain of my skin now. I'm Jett. I keep the trains running. Or at least, I try to keep them from exploding.",
	"Jett.DumpsterDiveComment": "You don't have to hide it from me. Scavenging is just recognizing the potential in what others deemed broken.",
	"Jett.HitBySlingshot": "Hey! That disrupts my calibration! What's the malfunction here?",
	"Jett.WipedMemory": "I feel... fragmented. Like someone wiped my diagnostic logs. Do I... know you?",
	"Jett.Weather.Rain": "Water and metal don't mix well. I should be checking the seals, but watching the rain fall is... strangely grounding.",
	"Jett.Weather.Snow": "The snow acts as a sound dampener. The whole town feels like a machine that's finally been powered down.",
	"Jett.Weather.GreenRain": "Keep the doors shut! The spores might get into the combustion chamber!",
	"Jett.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "The moss is everywhere. This is going to take weeks to scrape off the chassis.",
	"Jett.Hearts2.Mon": "Not now. Friction coefficients change when the tracks are wet. If I miscalculate the braking distance, the schedule falls apart. I refuse to be the loose bolt. Loose bolts get thrown in the scrap bin.",
	"Jett.Hearts2.Tue": "Don't touch the tools. I have them organized by usage frequency. If you move the 10mm socket, I will lose my mind.",
	"Jett.Hearts2.Wed": "Hump day. Halfway to the weekend. Halfway to... well, more work. The trains don't stop on weekends.",
	"Jett.Hearts2.Thu": "Did you hear that? That grinding noise? ...You didn't? God, I'm hearing phantom failures now.",
	"Jett.Hearts2.Fri": "I'm tired. Don't take it personally. I'm just... maintaining.",
	"Jett.Hearts2.Sat": "Tourists everywhere. I'm hiding in here. Don't tell them. I don't want to explain why the train is late.",
	"Jett.Hearts2.Sun": "It's Sunday. I should be relaxing. Instead, I'm worrying about Monday's inspection.",
	"Jett.Hearts4.Mon": "I don't really understand people. They get overwhelmed by messy, loud emotions, and then they just... throw things away. People included. Machines are safer. They only break when the math is wrong.",
	"Jett.Hearts4.Tue": "You’re easy to talk to. You don't have those... unpredictable emotional spikes that make people leave. You just accept my output. It's safe.",
	"Jett.Hearts4.Wed": "I fixed up an old heater for you. Uh... haven’t delivered it yet. Got nervous. It's not pretty, but it throws heat.",
	"Jett.Hearts4.Thu": "Most people only come by to see me when there’s something wrong with the train. You come by just to hang out. It’s... inefficient. But nice.",
	"Jett.Hearts4.Fri": "Hey. I was just thinking about... torque specs. Definitely not you. Nope. Just math.",
	"Jett.Hearts4.Sat": "I saw Roxy earlier. She said I looked 'less grim' than usual. I think that's your fault.",
	"Jett.Hearts4.Sun": "It's quiet today. Usually I hate the quiet. It makes me think too much. But with you here, the silence isn't so heavy.",
	"Jett.Hearts6.Mon": "Hey @! Just thinking about... uh... torque specs and stuff. Definitely not your smile. ...Okay, maybe the smile.",
	"Jett.Hearts6.Tue": "I'm normally down in the pit during the rain. But I wouldn't mind you staying in here with me. You smell like ozone and wet dirt.",
	"Jett.Hearts6.Wed": "I found a wrench I thought I lost three years ago. It's a sign. Maybe I'm not losing it after all.",
	"Jett.Hearts6.Thu": "Machines make sense. If a boiler is over-pressured, it vents. People... people are messy. They break and smile at you, or they work perfectly and still leave. It's bad engineering. But you... your output is consistent. I like that.",
	"Jett.Hearts6.Fri": "I usually stay late so I don't have to deal with the... variables of a Friday night crowd. But... maybe I'll knock off early. If I can calibrate to your frequency, it won't be so bad.",
	"Jett.Hearts6.Sat": "I saw a train go by and didn't even check the wheel alignment. I was too busy looking for you. That's dangerous.",
	"Jett.Hearts6.Sun": "I made space on the workbench. If you want to sit. It's the cleanest spot in the garage.",
	"Jett.Hearts8.Mon": "I came over to fix your fence yesterday, but... it wasn't broken. So I just stood there. Panic set in. If I'm not fixing something, I don't know why you'd want me around.",
	"Jett.Hearts8.Tue": "It's hot in here. Here, take this water. I don't need it. I run on caffeine and anxiety anyway.",
	"Jett.Hearts8.Wed": "I feel like I'm finally meshing when you're around. Does that make sense? Like the gears are finally catching.",
	"Jett.Hearts8.Thu": "It's cold. You should stay in the shop. I'll make room on the bench. It's surprisingly comfortable if you ignore the jagged metal bits.",
	"Jett.Hearts8.Fri": "I made a radio out in the garage. Want to... tune in? Pick up some signals? Maybe we can find a station that plays something other than static.",
	"Jett.Hearts8.Sat": "I usually lay low on Fridays. But if you’re going out... I could probably make an exception. As long as you’re there to calibrate me.",
	"Jett.Hearts8.Sun": "Rest day. Wanna come over? I could show you the inner workings of an internal combustion engine. It’s romantic, I swear. ...Okay, maybe not.",
	"Jett.Hearts10.Mon": "I used to think I was just a machine. Inputs and outputs. You make me feel... organic. It's terrifying. I love it.",
	"Jett.Hearts10.Tue": "You make my engine run smoothly. No friction. No grinding. Just pure motion.",
	"Jett.Hearts10.Wed": "I’m building something new. It’s a surprise. It has no function. It's just... nice to look at. Like you.",
	"Jett.Hearts10.Thu": "I tried to run a diagnostic on this feeling. 'Heart rate elevated, dopamine high.' Usually, I'd recalibrate. But with you... I don't want to fix it. I think I want to let it run wild.",
	"Jett.Hearts10.Fri": "Thinking of closing up the depot early. Wanna go for a walk? I checked the schedule. No trains due till midnight. Let's waste some time.",
	"Jett.Hearts10.Sat": "I’m better with engines than with words. But I’m trying to build a future that you fit into. One that isn't just grease and noise.",
	"Jett.Hearts10.Sun": "Stay here? The garage is warm. The engine hum is soothing. And... I need my copilot.",
	"Jett.Day.Spring.Mon": "Pollen on the tracks reduces friction. It's a safety hazard. You see flowers, I see wheel slippage.",
	"Jett.Day.Spring.Tue": "The humidity is rising. Rust never sleeps, so neither do I.",
	"Jett.Day.Spring.Wed": "I saw a bird build a nest in the exhaust pipe. I had to move it. ...I built a little box for it nearby. Don't tell Elara. She'd say it's 'unauthorized infrastructure'.",
	"Jett.Day.Spring.Thu": "The rails expand and contract with the temperature. The metal is singing today. It sounds... tired.",
	"Jett.Day.Spring.Fri": "Spring cleaning? Elara is organizing her wrench set by millimeter size. Again. I think it calms her down.",
	"Jett.Day.Spring.Sat": "You smell like... dirt. And rain. It's nice. Better than diesel fumes.",
	"Jett.Day.Spring.Sun": "I'm running diagnostics on the boiler. It's Sunday, I know. But the boiler doesn't know what day it is.",
	"Jett.Day.Summer.Mon": "The heat in the garage is unbearable. But I can't leave. If the coolant lines crack while I'm out 'enjoying the weather', I've failed my primary function.",
	"Jett.Day.Summer.Tue": "I saw a kid try to put a penny on the tracks. I lectured him on derailment physics. He cried. ...I'm not good with kids.",
	"Jett.Day.Summer.Wed": "Grease melts faster in July. It’s a mess. I feel like I'm melting with it.",
	"Jett.Day.Summer.Thu": "The AC is down. Elara didn't say anything, she just wiped sweat off her forehead and looked at the maintenance log. I feel like I need to apologize to the thermometer.",
	"Jett.Day.Summer.Fri": "I’m staying in the pit today. It’s cooler underground. And darker. Less... people.",
	"Jett.Day.Summer.Sat": "Too many people on the platform. I’m hiding in the engine block. If you need me, knock on the manifold.",
	"Jett.Day.Summer.Sun": "The metal is too hot to touch without gloves. Even the tools are hostile today.",
	"Jett.Day.Fall.Mon": "Leaves on the track are worse than ice. They turn into a slippery pulp. It’s a braking nightmare. Nature really hates trains, doesn't it?",
	"Jett.Day.Fall.Tue": "I like the smell of Fall. It smells like burning wood. It's... close to the smell of the engine. Comfortable.",
	"Jett.Day.Fall.Wed": "Wind speed is high. I have to secure the loose siding on the depot before it becomes a projectile.",
	"Jett.Day.Fall.Thu": "I found a pumpkin on the cowcatcher. Someone thought it was funny. I... actually, I did make soup. It wasn't bad.",
	"Jett.Day.Fall.Fri": "Temperature is dropping. Optimal operating range for the diesel engines. Finally, things are running smooth.",
	"Jett.Day.Fall.Sat": "I like looking at the valley from my mountain perch, but I don’t think I could ever get tired of looking at a perfectly machined gear. Is that sad?",
	"Jett.Day.Fall.Sun": "I’m winterizing the seals. Preparation prevents poor performance. That's what Elara says. I think she has it tattooed on her soul.",
	"Jett.Day.Winter.Mon": "Cold start this morning. The engine coughed like a smoker. I know the feeling. My lungs are full of soot.",
	"Jett.Day.Winter.Tue": "Ice on the switches. I had to use the flamethrower. It's the only time I feel powerful. Usually, I just feel... greasy.",
	"Jett.Day.Winter.Wed": "My hands are numb. I dropped a bolt and I think it shattered. Physics gets weird when it's this cold.",
	"Jett.Day.Winter.Thu": "Snow muffles the sound of the train. It’s eerie. Ghost train vibes. I don't like it when the world gets this quiet.",
	"Jett.Day.Winter.Fri": "I’m drinking coffee straight from the pot. Don’t judge. It’s for warmth, not energy.",
	"Jett.Day.Winter.Sat": "No tourists today. Just me and the machines. Perfect. ...Mostly perfect.",
	"Jett.Day.Winter.Sun": "I built a heater out of spare parts. It’s ugly, but it works. Like me.",
	"Jett.Gift.StardropTea": "This... it tastes like finding the exact gear you've been searching for. Thank you. It's perfectly calibrated.",
	"Jett.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "I'm not sure what I'm supposed to do with this. But... thank you for the data point.",
	"Jett.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "Is this... for my birthday? I didn't think anyone tracked that data. Thank you.",
	"Jett.AcceptBirthdayGift": "I didn't expect you to remember. I'll add this to my inventory... carefully.",
	"Jett.MovieInvitation": "A theater? Sitting in the dark watching light project onto a screen... I suppose I could allocate some time for that.",
	"Jett.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "My schedule is already blocked out for that. Someone else submitted a request first.",
	"Jett.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I've already analyzed that data set this week. It would be inefficient to watch it again so soon.",
	"Jett.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "We severed our connection. A movie won't bridge that gap.",
	"Jett.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "I reviewed the summary of that film. The narrative structure seems highly flawed. No thanks.",
	"Jett.RejectMovieTicket": "I can't right now. Too many variables need checking at the depot.",
	"Jett.Dating.Mon": "Since we started this... partnership, I've noticed my stress levels dropping. You're like a pressure release valve.",
	"Jett.Dating.Tue": "I can't right now. Too many variables need checking at the depot.",
	"Jett.Dating.Wed": "Since we started this... partnership, I've noticed my stress levels dropping. You're like a pressure release valve.",
	"Jett.Dating.Thu": "I used to think being useful was the only reason people kept me around. You're slowly disproving that hypothesis.",
	"Jett.Dating.Fri": "I caught myself daydreaming about us instead of torque specifications. That's a serious deviation from my baseline.",
	"Jett.Dating.Sat": "You don't need me to fix you, and you aren't trying to fix me. It's... a very liberating dynamic.",
	"Jett.Dating.Sun": "Usually I dread the weekend crowds, but knowing I get to see you makes the noise tolerable.",
	"Jett.Dating.General": "I made a mental list of all the things I appreciate about you. It's... getting quite long.",
	"Jett.Dating.Rainy": "Taking a rest day with you feels less like wasted time and more like essential maintenance.",
	"Jett.Dating.Memory.OneYear": "I'm not used to someone just wanting my company. I like it, though.",
	"Jett.breakUp": "Let the rain rust the outside world. In here, with you, everything is running smoothly.",
	"Jett.RejectMermaidPendant_NeedHouseUpgrade": "365 days of operational success in this relationship. I'd say our bond has high structural integrity.",
	"Jett.RejectMermaidPendant_NotDatable": "Right. The human factor. I miscalculated. ...I need to get back to work.",
	"Jett.RejectMermaidPendant_NpcWithSomeoneElse": "Logistically, your living space lacks the square footage for two occupants. We need structural upgrades first.",
	"Jett.RejectMermaidPendant_PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "I'm not equipped for that kind of commitment. The parameters are wrong.",
	"Jett.RejectMermaidPendant_Under8Hearts": "My romantic bandwidth is currently allocated to someone else.",
	"Jett.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts": "You haven't resolved your other active connections. I don't do well in a tangled circuit.",
	"Jett.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts_AskedAgain": "That's a massive leap in variables. We don't have the foundation for that yet.",
	"Jett.Proposal.Reject": "I appreciate the sentiment, but our connection needs more testing before we formalize it.",
	"Jett.Bouquet.Accept": "My answer hasn't changed. Rushing a project only leads to catastrophic failure.",
	"Jett.RejectBouquet_NotDatable": "I can't accept this. The timing... the variables... it's just not right.",
	"Jett.RejectBouquet_NpcAlreadyMarried": "You're offering me a courtship ritual? ...I accept. My heart rate is spiking.",
	"Jett.RejectBouquet_VeryLowHearts": "I'm strictly in maintenance mode. Romance isn't on my schedule.",
	"Jett.RejectBouquet_LowHearts": "My marital status is already locked in. I can't accept that.",
	"Jett.Bouquet.Reject": "We barely share the same frequency. Why would you offer this to me?",
	"Jett.divorced": "I think you've miscalculated our dynamic. We aren't there.",
	"Jett.RejectGift_Divorced": "I don't have the bandwidth for a relationship right now. I'm sorry.",
	"Jett.RejectMermaidPendant_Divorced": "The contract is void. It's fine. I operate better alone anyway.",
	"Jett.RejectBouquet_Divorced": "Don't. The maintenance on our relationship is permanently discontinued.",
	"Jett.Festival.WinterStar_GiveGift_After_Spouse": "I crafted this when the depot was quiet. It's sturdy. I hope you like it.",
	"Jett.Festival.WinterStar_ReceiveGift": "You got this for me? ...It's perfect. I'll take good care of it.",
	"Jett.Resort.General": "The salt air is terrible for mechanics, but the view... I understand why you wanted to come.",
	"Jett.Resort.Bar": "I could use some hydration. Preferably something that doesn't taste like motor oil.",
	"Jett.Resort.Chair": "Sitting without a task feels unnatural. I'm trying to just... exist. It's difficult.",
	"Jett.Resort.Dance": "Dancing is just rhythmic kinetic energy. I think I can calibrate to the beat.",
	"Jett.Resort.Entering": "Saltwater is highly corrosive to bare metal. I'm staying away from the edge.",
	"Jett.Resort.Leaving": "Back to the mainland. I should check the rust accumulation immediately.",
	"Jett.Resort.Shore": "The tide is a very reliable mechanism. Predictable. Calming.",
	"Jett.Resort.Towel": "I'm applying sunscreen. Sun damage is just oxidation for skin.",
	"Jett.Resort.Umbrella": "This umbrella provides optimal shade coverage. Good design.",
	"Jett.Resort.Wander": "I'm just observing the island's infrastructure. It's surprisingly robust.",
	"Jett.SummitEvent": "Looking out over the valley... it puts things into perspective. I spent so long trying to fix every tiny flaw, afraid that if I wasn't useful, I was nothing. But standing here with you, I realize some things are perfectly fine just the way they are. Including me.",
	"Jett.Engagement.0": "We need to begin logistical planning for the ceremony. I've drafted a spreadsheet.",
	"Jett.Engagement.1": "I'm adjusting my future projections to include you. It's a very positive dataset.",
	"Jett.SpouseFarmhouseClutter": "There are objects obstructing the primary walkways. We should optimize the floor plan.",
	"Jett.Spouse_MonstersInHouse": "Hostile entities detected indoors. I'm grabbing my heaviest wrench.",
	"Jett.Marriage.SpouseStardrop": "I calibrated this specifically for you. It's highly concentrated energy.",
	"Jett.Marriage.Spring": "Spring on the farm is chaotic. So much organic growth. It's messy, but I'm learning to appreciate the lack of control.",
	"Jett.Marriage.Summer": "The heat out there is intense. Make sure your hydration levels are maintained, farmer.",
	"Jett.Marriage.Fall": "Harvest season. Your efficiency out there is impressive. I've been taking notes.",
	"Jett.Marriage.Winter": "The farm is quiet under the snow. I used to hate the quiet, but with you beside me, it feels safe.",
	"Jett.Patio": "I’m fixing the fence. Not because it’s broken, but because I need to do something with my hands. Old habits.",
	"Jett.Rainy_Day_0": "Rain on the roof. Best sound in the world. Let's stay in bed. The trains can wait.",
	"Jett.Rainy_Day_1": "The mud out there will seize up your joints. Take it easy today.",
	"Jett.Rainy_Day_2": "I'm taking the opportunity to clean my tools. The humidity actually helps loosen the grime.",
	"Jett.Rainy_Day_3": "Don't worry about the leaks in the shed. I patched them up while you were asleep.",
	"Jett.Rainy_Day_4": "I made coffee. It's dark, strong, and highly efficient at waking you up.",
	"Jett.Rainy_Day_5": "Hearing the rain against the windows makes me glad I don't have to sleep in the depot pit anymore.",
	"Jett.Indoor_Day_0": "I left my wrench in the garage today. Intentionally. I wanted to see if I could get through a whole breakfast just being your spouse, not your mechanic. ...How am I doing?",
	"Jett.Indoor_Day_1": "I’m going to the shop, but I’ll be back before the engine cools down. Don't work too hard, farmer.",
	"Jett.Indoor_Day_2": "You look good. Like a well-oiled machine. ...That’s a compliment, I swear.",
	"Jett.Indoor_Day_3": "I left a schematic on the table. Don't throw it away, it's a design for an automated watering can. I'm trying to make your life easier.",
	"Jett.Indoor_Day_4": "I was looking at your tools earlier. You take good care of them. It shows respect for the work.",
	"Jett.Indoor_Day_5": "You don't have to be productive every single minute, you know. Sometimes a machine just needs to idle.",
	"Jett.Rainy_Night_0": "The storm's picking up. I checked the structural integrity of the roof. We're perfectly safe.",
	"Jett.Rainy_Night_1": "You look exhausted. Let me take off your boots. You've done enough today.",
	"Jett.Rainy_Night_2": "There's a rhythm to the rain hitting the glass. It's almost mathematical. I like it.",
	"Jett.Rainy_Night_3": "I brought in extra firewood. Let's keep the core temperature optimal.",
	"Jett.Rainy_Night_4": "Days like this make me realize how much I love our little closed ecosystem here.",
	"Jett.Rainy_Night_5": "Come sit by me. I'm radiating excess heat. It's one of my few purely organic functions.",
	"Jett.Indoor_Night_0": "Let's order pizza tonight. I don't trust myself around the stove. Fire is unpredictable. Engines I understand. Cooking? Magic.",
	"Jett.Indoor_Night_1": "I love living here. The farm has good acoustics. No grinding gears unless I bring them home. It's... peaceful.",
	"Jett.Indoor_Night_2": "Sunday maintenance check. Hug levels are low. Initiate recharge sequence?",
	"Jett.Indoor_Night_3": "I washed the grease off my hands three times before touching you. I don't want to leave smudges.",
	"Jett.Indoor_Night_4": "You've been working hard. You don't have to carry the whole load yourself. Let me help.",
	"Jett.Indoor_Night_5": "I was just thinking... I'm glad you didn't throw me away when I felt broken. You just let me run.",
	"Jett.funLeave": "I'm heading out for a bit. Need to clear some mental cache. Be back later.",
	"Jett.funReturn": "I'm back. Re-calibrated and ready to dock.",
	"Jett.Outdoor_General": "The air out here is significantly better than the fumes at the station.",
	"Jett.Outdoor_0": "I checked the hinges on the gate. They were squeaking. It was driving me insane. They're silent now.",
	"Jett.Outdoor_1": "Your crops are growing at an optimal rate. The soil composition here must be incredibly balanced.",
	"Jett.Outdoor_2": "I saw a crow eyeing your seeds. I threw a rusted bolt at the fence to scare it off. Perimeter secured.",
	"Jett.Outdoor_3": "I'm not much of a farmer, but I can maintain the equipment indefinitely.",
	"Jett.Outdoor_4": "Just taking a moment to appreciate the lack of mechanical noise. The wind sounds nice.",
	"Jett.spouseRoom": "I tried to keep my tools organized, but the chaos always creeps back in. Sorry if it smells like diesel.",
	"Jett.OneKid_0": "I've been trying to teach the kid about simple machines. Levers, pulleys. It's foundational knowledge.",
	"Jett.OneKid_1": "They have so much energy. It's like a perpetual motion machine. I'm exhausted just watching.",
	"Jett.OneKid_2": "I worry sometimes that I'm too rigid for a kid. But then they laugh, and all my tension just vents.",
	"Jett.OneKid_3": "Make sure they don't wander near my workbench. Too many sharp edges and choking hazards.",
	"Jett.OneKid_4": "I caught myself humming a lullaby that sounded suspiciously like a train whistle. I think it worked, though.",
	"Jett.TwoKids_0": "Two of them. The variables have doubled. We need to implement stricter crowd control measures.",
	"Jett.TwoKids_1": "They were cooperating to build a tower out of blocks. The structural engineering was terrible, but the teamwork was solid.",
	"Jett.TwoKids_2": "I love them, but their noise output is frequently outside of acceptable decibel ranges.",
	"Jett.TwoKids_3": "You're so good with them. I just try to make sure nothing breaks, but you actually help them grow.",
	"Jett.TwoKids_4": "Our little unit is functioning perfectly. A complete, self-sustaining system.",
	"Jett.Good_0": "Good morning. All systems nominal.",
	"Jett.Good_1": "You're looking exceptionally radiant today.",
	"Jett.Good_2": "I brewed coffee. Let's get the engines started.",
	"Jett.Good_3": "Seeing you is the best way to start the daily cycle.",
	"Jett.Good_4": "I've got your back today, whatever you need.",
	"Jett.Good_5": "You make me want to be better. Less machine, more human.",
	"Jett.Good_6": "The farm is lucky to have you. I'm luckier.",
	"Jett.Good_7": "Everything feels easier when you're around.",
	"Jett.Good_8": "I love our life together. It's perfectly engineered.",
	"Jett.Good_9": "You're my favorite variable in this equation.",
	"Jett.Neutral_0": "Morning. I need to check the weather parameters.",
	"Jett.Neutral_1": "Lots to do today. We should prioritize.",
	"Jett.Neutral_2": "I'm feeling a bit sluggish. Need more caffeine.",
	"Jett.Neutral_3": "Just mentally running through my checklist.",
	"Jett.Neutral_4": "Hope your tasks go smoothly today.",
	"Jett.Neutral_5": "I'll be around if you need something fixed.",
	"Jett.Neutral_6": "Standard operating procedure today.",
	"Jett.Neutral_7": "The air pressure is changing. Might rain.",
	"Jett.Neutral_8": "I should probably organize my workbench again.",
	"Jett.Neutral_9": "Just taking a moment to recalibrate.",
	"Jett.Bad_0": "I'm functioning, but just barely.",
	"Jett.Bad_1": "There's a lot of friction between us lately.",
	"Jett.Bad_2": "I feel like a discarded part right now.",
	"Jett.Bad_3": "We're not communicating. The signal is lost.",
	"Jett.Bad_4": "I don't know how to fix this.",
	"Jett.Bad_5": "Maybe I am just a broken machine after all.",
	"Jett.Bad_6": "I'm tired of trying to run diagnostics on us.",
	"Jett.Bad_7": "You're distant. I can't bridge the gap.",
	"Jett.Bad_8": "This partnership feels highly inefficient lately.",
	"Jett.Bad_9": "I need some space. My processors are overloaded.",
	"Jax.Day.Mon": "Mondays are a corporate construct designed to crush the human spirit. I say this as someone who works in marketing. I am part of the problem.",
	"Jax.Day.Tue": "I'm looking at conversion metrics and I literally want to throw my laptop into the falls.",
	"Jax.Day.Wed": "If my client uses the phrase 'brand synergy' one more time, I'm going to scream until my vocal cords bleed.",
	"Jax.Day.Thu": "Everyone in this town moves so slow. It's infuriating, but also... weirdly nice? Don't tell anyone I said that.",
	"Jax.Day.Fri": "I need caffeine. If I don't get a coffee soon, my aesthetic is going to shift from 'punk' to 'actual zombie'.",
	"Jax.Day.Sat": "I refuse to check my email today. If the ad campaign crashes, it crashes. Let it burn.",
	"Jax.Day.Sun": "Sundays are for loud music and aggressively ignoring responsibilities.",
	"Jax.Introduction": "I'm on a call! ...Okay, fine, they put me on hold. I'm Jax. You're the farmer, right? Cool. Don't ruin my aesthetic by standing too close.",
	"Jax.DumpsterDiveComment": "Ew. At least wipe your hands before you touch anything.",
	"Jax.HitBySlingshot": "Hey! Watch it! These boots are expensive!",
	"Jax.WipedMemory": "Do I... know you? I feel like I'd remember someone who dresses like that.",
	"Jax.Weather.Rain": "I hate the rain. It ruins my hair, it ruins my boots, and it ruins my mood.",
	"Jax.Weather.Snow": "Great, it's snowing. Time to layer up and pretend I'm not freezing my piercings off.",
	"Jax.Weather.GreenRain": "Is the sky... green? This has to be some sort of toxic runoff. I'm staying inside.",
	"Jax.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "Well, the world didn't end. Guess I still have to answer client emails.",
	"Jax.Hearts2.Mon": "I used to live in the city. The noise was unbearable, but at least there were decent coffee shops open at 2 AM.",
	"Jax.Hearts2.Tue": "Do you ever feel like you're completely invisible? Like you're just yelling into a void? Because that's my entire career. It makes you want to dress as loud as possible just to prove you exist.",
	"Jax.Hearts2.Wed": "Drexel yelled at me for stomping up the stairs in my boots. I told him to put down thicker carpets.",
	"Jax.Hearts2.Thu": "I saw Dion staring at my eyeliner earlier. I can't tell if he was judging me or taking notes.",
	"Jax.Hearts2.Fri": "I don't hate you, farmer. You're quiet. Most people just want to hear themselves talk.",
	"Jax.Hearts2.Sat": "I'm trying to write some lyrics, but everything sounds like a bad commercial jingle. It's a curse.",
	"Jax.Hearts2.Sun": "What are you looking at? Yes, I wear combat boots in the mud. It builds character.",
	"Jax.Hearts4.Mon": "You actually listen when people talk. That's a rare skill around here.",
	"Jax.Hearts4.Tue": "I pitched a campaign today that was actually... genuine. They hated it. They wanted more flash, less substance.",
	"Jax.Hearts4.Wed": "Sometimes I come out by the falls just to drown out my own thoughts. The water is louder than my anxiety.",
	"Jax.Hearts4.Thu": "I was thinking about painting my apartment walls black, but Drexel would probably evict me instantly.",
	"Jax.Hearts4.Fri": "You know, the farm life actually seems kind of metal. You literally fight nature every day.",
	"Jax.Hearts4.Sat": "I bought a spiked collar today. No, I don't own a dog. Why do you ask?",
	"Jax.Hearts4.Sun": "I actually didn't mind running into you today, @. That's progress for me.",
	"Jax.Hearts6.Mon": "I had a complete meltdown over a font choice last night. I think I need a vacation. Or a new brain.",
	"Jax.Hearts6.Tue": "I always thought I had to wear loud clothes and play a character so people wouldn't look past me. But you just... talk to me. Like I'm a real person. It's confusing.",
	"Jax.Hearts6.Wed": "You actually listen to my ideas, @. Even the messy ones. Most people in the city just wanted the slick, polished pitch. You actually care about the substance.",
	"Jax.Hearts6.Thu": "I helped Blaise set up a social media page for the Pepper Pit. It took him twenty minutes to figure out how to post a photo.",
	"Jax.Hearts6.Fri": "I think I'm actually starting to like it here. It's messy, but it's real. Like you.",
	"Jax.Hearts6.Sat": "I wrote a poem last night that didn't suck. I'm not going to show it to you, but just know it exists.",
	"Jax.Hearts6.Sun": "Take a break, farmer. You work too hard. Come sit and listen to this track with me.",
	"Jax.Hearts8.Mon": "The guerrilla marketing campaign for the Pepper Pit worked! They sold out of hot sauce. I actually made a difference for once.",
	"Jax.Hearts8.Tue": "I've been leaving my laptop at home more often. Turns out the real world is okay when you're not staring at a spreadsheet.",
	"Jax.Hearts8.Wed": "You know, @, I realized I don't need the spikes and the eyeliner to make people see me. You see me just fine without them.",
	"Jax.Hearts8.Thu": "But I'm keeping the boots. Obviously. They're iconic.",
	"Jax.Hearts8.Fri": "I don't really do the 'feelings' thing very well, but... you mean a lot to me. There. I said it. Don't make it weird.",
	"Jax.Hearts8.Sat": "I actually caught myself smiling while walking through town today. I must be getting soft.",
	"Jax.Hearts8.Sun": "Whenever you're done playing in the dirt, come find me. I saved you a coffee.",
	"Jax.Hearts10.Mon": "I used to think being loud was the only way to be heard. Now I know that the right person will hear you even when you whisper.",
	"Jax.Hearts10.Tue": "You are my favorite part of this valley, @. Hands down.",
	"Jax.Hearts10.Wed": "I quit my toxic corporate client today. I'm going freelance. Taking control of my own life. Feels terrifying, but good.",
	"Jax.Hearts10.Thu": "You make me want to write love songs. Disgusting, sappy love songs. What have you done to me?",
	"Jax.Hearts10.Fri": "I spent so long playing a character because I was terrified of being empty. I don't need the armor anymore, @. I just need you.",
	"Jax.Hearts10.Sat": "Let's ditch town tonight. Just you and me. We can go yell at the moon or something.",
	"Jax.Hearts10.Sun": "I'm entirely yours, farmer. Spikes, eyeliner, and all.",
	"Jax.Day.Spring.Mon": "Spring means allergy medication and bright colors. I hate it.",
	"Jax.Day.Spring.Tue": "A client just asked for a 'spring refresh' campaign. Groundbreaking.",
	"Jax.Day.Spring.Wed": "Mud everywhere. My boots are never going to recover from this season.",
	"Jax.Day.Spring.Thu": "I guess the flowers are fine, as long as they stay away from my black wardrobe.",
	"Jax.Day.Spring.Fri": "Iced coffee season is officially starting. The only good part of spring.",
	"Jax.Day.Spring.Sat": "I saw a rabbit today. It looked at me like it knew my secrets.",
	"Jax.Day.Spring.Sun": "Sunday in spring. Too much sunshine, not enough sleep.",
	"Jax.Day.Summer.Mon": "Do you know how hard it is to maintain a punk aesthetic in ninety-degree weather?",
	"Jax.Day.Summer.Tue": "My laptop overheated. I'm taking it as a sign from the universe to stop working.",
	"Jax.Day.Summer.Wed": "Tourists. Everywhere. I'm hiding until September.",
	"Jax.Day.Summer.Thu": "I might actually go swimming later. Don't look so shocked, I own a swimsuit.",
	"Jax.Day.Summer.Fri": "Summer Fridays are a myth corporate invented to make us work harder the rest of the week.",
	"Jax.Day.Summer.Sat": "If I get a sunburn, my entire color palette is ruined.",
	"Jax.Day.Summer.Sun": "Just hiding in the shade, pretending the sun doesn't exist.",
	"Jax.Day.Fall.Mon": "Finally, weather that respects my wardrobe choices.",
	"Jax.Day.Fall.Tue": "If one more brand launches a pumpkin spice campaign, I'm quitting marketing.",
	"Jax.Day.Fall.Wed": "The leaves are dying. It's incredibly poetic.",
	"Jax.Day.Fall.Thu": "I love the crunch of leaves under my boots. It's the little things.",
	"Jax.Day.Fall.Fri": "Fall fashion is superior. Don't argue with me, I'm right.",
	"Jax.Day.Fall.Sat": "I actually went for a walk without complaining today. Must be the crisp air.",
	"Jax.Day.Fall.Sun": "Sundays in autumn are actually tolerable. Weird.",
	"Jax.Day.Winter.Mon": "The sun sets at 4 PM. My seasonal depression is teaming up with my regular depression.",
	"Jax.Day.Winter.Tue": "Holiday marketing campaigns are my villain origin story.",
	"Jax.Day.Winter.Wed": "It's freezing. If you need me, I'll be buried under six blankets.",
	"Jax.Day.Winter.Thu": "I slipped on ice today. If anyone asks, I was testing gravity.",
	"Jax.Day.Winter.Fri": "Hot coffee, cold weather. The perfect contrast.",
	"Jax.Day.Winter.Sat": "I'm not leaving the house today. It's a frozen wasteland out there.",
	"Jax.Day.Winter.Sun": "Winter Sundays. Quiet, cold, and entirely mine.",
	"Jax.Gift.StardropTea": "Whoa. This... is intense. I feel like I just drank pure inspiration. Thanks, @.",
	"Jax.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "This is literally the worst birthday gift I've ever received. Congrats.",
	"Jax.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "You remembered my birthday? And you got me something cool? ...Wow. Thanks, @.",
	"Jax.AcceptBirthdayGift": "Thanks for remembering. It's fine.",
	"Jax.MovieInvitation": "A movie? Usually I hate crowds, but I guess I could make an exception for you.",
	"Jax.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "I already have plans. Next time.",
	"Jax.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I've already been to the theater this week. My tolerance for stale popcorn is maxed out.",
	"Jax.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "You've got to be joking. No.",
	"Jax.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "That movie looks like a corporate cash grab. Hard pass.",
	"Jax.RejectMovieTicket": "I don't really have the time right now.",
	"Jax.Dating.Mon": "I still hate Mondays, but seeing you makes them slightly less unbearable.",
	"Jax.Dating.Tue": "I don't really have the time right now.",
	"Jax.Dating.Wed": "I still hate Mondays, but seeing you makes them slightly less unbearable.",
	"Jax.Dating.Thu": "I put a picture of us on my desk. It confuses my clients, which is a bonus.",
	"Jax.Dating.Fri": "I was just thinking about you. Don't let it go to your head.",
	"Jax.Dating.Sat": "You're a welcome distraction from my deadlines, @.",
	"Jax.Dating.Sun": "Date night? I'll let you pick, as long as it's not somewhere too loud.",
	"Jax.Dating.General": "I used to spend weekends dreading Monday. Now I just look forward to spending them with you.",
	"Jax.Dating.Rainy": "Lazy Sundays are infinitely better when you're around.",
	"Jax.Dating.Memory.OneYear": "Hey, @. You're looking good today.",
	"Jax.breakUp": "Let's just stay inside. I don't want to ruin my boots, and I'd rather be close to you anyway.",
	"Jax.RejectMermaidPendant_NeedHouseUpgrade": "Has it really been a year? Time flies when you're actually happy, I guess.",
	"Jax.RejectMermaidPendant_NotDatable": "Right. I should have known this was too good to last. Let's just... cut our losses.",
	"Jax.RejectMermaidPendant_NpcWithSomeoneElse": "Where are we supposed to live? Your place is a bit cramped for my dual-monitor setup.",
	"Jax.RejectMermaidPendant_PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "Uh, I'm not really looking for that kind of thing.",
	"Jax.RejectMermaidPendant_Under8Hearts": "I'm with someone else, @. This is incredibly awkward.",
	"Jax.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts": "Aren't you already committed to someone? I don't do messy triangles.",
	"Jax.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts_AskedAgain": "Marriage? We barely know each other's coffee orders.",
	"Jax.Proposal.Reject": "I like you, but I'm not ready to sign a lifelong contract just yet.",
	"Jax.Bouquet.Accept": "I told you, I'm not ready. Stop pushing.",
	"Jax.RejectBouquet_NotDatable": "I... I can't. I'm sorry.",
	"Jax.RejectBouquet_NpcAlreadyMarried": "You're giving this to me? ...Okay. Yeah. I'd like that. A lot.",
	"Jax.RejectBouquet_VeryLowHearts": "Flowers? For me? I think you have the wrong idea.",
	"Jax.RejectBouquet_LowHearts": "I'm married. Please don't make this weird.",
	"Jax.Bouquet.Reject": "Are you confusing me with someone who cares?",
	"Jax.divorced": "I don't think we're there, farmer.",
	"Jax.RejectGift_Divorced": "I'm going to pass. Sorry.",
	"Jax.RejectMermaidPendant_Divorced": "Don't talk to me.",
	"Jax.RejectBouquet_Divorced": "I don't want anything from you.",
	"Jax.Festival.WinterStar_GiveGift_After_Spouse": "I hope you actually like it. I spent way too much time picking it out.",
	"Jax.Festival.WinterStar_ReceiveGift": "You got me this for the festival? Actually pretty cool. Thanks.",
	"Jax.Resort.General": "Sun, sand, and absolutely no WiFi. I'm surviving.",
	"Jax.Resort.Bar": "The drinks here are overpriced, but at least they're strong.",
	"Jax.Resort.Chair": "Don't block my shade. I burn easily.",
	"Jax.Resort.Dance": "I don't dance. I brood rhythmically.",
	"Jax.Resort.Entering": "I wore my lightest black clothing for this.",
	"Jax.Resort.Leaving": "Finally. I need a real shower to get all this sand off.",
	"Jax.Resort.Shore": "The ocean is vast, dark, and terrifying. I respect it.",
	"Jax.Resort.Towel": "I'm just resting my eyes. Don't wake me unless there's an emergency.",
	"Jax.Resort.Umbrella": "This umbrella is the only thing between me and a very un-punk sunburn.",
	"Jax.Resort.Wander": "I'm exploring. Trying to find the least touristy spot here.",
	"Jax.SummitEvent": "Look at this view. Almost makes you forget the chaos down there, doesn't it, @?",
	"Jax.Engagement.0": "We're actually doing this. I'm marrying a farmer. My old city friends are going to lose their minds.",
	"Jax.Engagement.1": "I keep looking at the ring. It's... a lot better than a stress ball.",
	"Jax.SpouseFarmhouseClutter": "Can we pick up some of this stuff? It's messing with my workflow.",
	"Jax.Spouse_MonstersInHouse": "Why are there monsters in here?! Did you bring work home with you?!",
	"Jax.Marriage.SpouseStardrop": "I found this while I was out. It reminded me of you. Don't make a big deal out of it.",
	"Jax.Marriage.Spring": "Spring on the farm. It's messy, but it's ours.",
	"Jax.Marriage.Summer": "Make sure you drink water today, @. Heatstroke isn't a good look.",
	"Jax.Marriage.Fall": "The farm looks amazing in the fall. Very moody. I approve.",
	"Jax.Marriage.Winter": "It's freezing outside. Come back to bed when you're done with the chores.",
	"Jax.Patio": "I set up out here to work. The WiFi barely reaches, but the fresh air is nice.",
	"Jax.Rainy_Day_0": "Rain means no guilt about staying inside and staring at screens.",
	"Jax.Rainy_Day_1": "I made coffee. It's black, like my soul. Kidding. Mostly.",
	"Jax.Rainy_Day_2": "The farm is so quiet when it rains. I actually don't hate it.",
	"Jax.Rainy_Day_3": "Don't track mud in here, @. I just cleaned.",
	"Jax.Rainy_Day_4": "You look soaked. Take a break before you catch a cold.",
	"Jax.Rainy_Day_5": "I cancelled all my calls today. Just want to hear the rain.",
	"Jax.Indoor_Day_0": "I'm analyzing some metrics. It's as boring as it sounds.",
	"Jax.Indoor_Day_1": "Did you need something, or are you just distracting me?",
	"Jax.Indoor_Day_2": "I love being married to you, @. Best decision I've made.",
	"Jax.Indoor_Day_3": "I ordered some new combat boots. The old ones were losing their spikes.",
	"Jax.Indoor_Day_4": "Sometimes I miss the city noise. Just a little bit.",
	"Jax.Indoor_Day_5": "You work so hard. Make sure you're taking time for yourself.",
	"Jax.Rainy_Night_0": "Come sit by me. Let's just listen to the storm.",
	"Jax.Rainy_Night_1": "Nights like this make me glad I left the city.",
	"Jax.Rainy_Night_2": "I can't get this ad jingle out of my head. Save me.",
	"Jax.Rainy_Night_3": "You smell like wet earth. It's... surprisingly comforting.",
	"Jax.Rainy_Night_4": "Let's turn all the lights off and just exist in the dark for a while.",
	"Jax.Rainy_Night_5": "I feel bad for the crops out there, but at least we're warm.",
	"Jax.Indoor_Night_0": "Long day? Come here, let me rub your shoulders.",
	"Jax.Indoor_Night_1": "I shut my laptop an hour ago. Now, I'm all yours.",
	"Jax.Indoor_Night_2": "I was just thinking about our wedding day. Still feels surreal.",
	"Jax.Indoor_Night_3": "Don't fall asleep on your feet, farmer.",
	"Jax.Indoor_Night_4": "I've been drafting a new poem. You can read it tomorrow.",
	"Jax.Indoor_Night_5": "You're my safe place, @. Always.",
	"Jax.funLeave": "I'm heading into town for a bit. Don't burn the house down while I'm gone.",
	"Jax.funReturn": "I'm back. Town was exhausting, as usual. Missed you, though.",
	"Jax.Outdoor_General": "Just getting some air. The screen fatigue was real today.",
	"Jax.Outdoor_0": "Checking the perimeter. Making sure nature isn't plotting against us.",
	"Jax.Outdoor_1": "I don't know how you do this every day. It's exhausting just watching.",
	"Jax.Outdoor_2": "The air is actually breathable here. Who knew?",
	"Jax.Outdoor_3": "I thought I saw a crow, but it was just a shadow. My aesthetic is failing me.",
	"Jax.Outdoor_4": "Everything is so green. It's visually overwhelming.",
	"Jax.spouseRoom": "I know my setup is a lot, but I need all these monitors. Thanks for making space for me.",
	"Jax.OneKid_0": "I never pictured myself as a parent. But here we are.",
	"Jax.OneKid_1": "They have your eyes, thank goodness. Mine are perpetually tired.",
	"Jax.OneKid_2": "I bought them a tiny leather jacket. Don't judge me.",
	"Jax.OneKid_3": "Parenting is just crisis management, but with higher stakes.",
	"Jax.OneKid_4": "Watching them grow is... terrifyingly beautiful.",
	"Jax.TwoKids_0": "Two kids. We're running our own little focus group.",
	"Jax.TwoKids_1": "The house is so loud now. I kind of love it.",
	"Jax.TwoKids_2": "I caught them trying on my boots. They almost drowned in them.",
	"Jax.TwoKids_3": "Make sure they know they can be whatever they want. Even a farmer.",
	"Jax.TwoKids_4": "I'm exhausted, but I wouldn't trade this for the world.",
	"Jax.Good_0": "You're the best thing that ever happened to me.",
	"Jax.Good_1": "I love our life together, @.",
	"Jax.Good_2": "I made you something to eat. Don't worry, I didn't burn it.",
	"Jax.Good_3": "You make everything better just by being here.",
	"Jax.Good_4": "I'm so proud of you and everything you've built.",
	"Jax.Good_5": "Kiss me before you go out there.",
	"Jax.Good_6": "I never thought I could be this happy.",
	"Jax.Good_7": "You're my favorite person in the entire world.",
	"Jax.Good_8": "I cancelled all my meetings. Today is just about us.",
	"Jax.Good_9": "I love you, @. More than coffee. That's a lot.",
	"Jax.Neutral_0": "Hey. Hope your day goes well.",
	"Jax.Neutral_1": "I've got a lot of work to do today.",
	"Jax.Neutral_2": "Don't forget to water the crops.",
	"Jax.Neutral_3": "I'm just going to stay inside today.",
	"Jax.Neutral_4": "Did we get any mail?",
	"Jax.Neutral_5": "I'm drafting an email. Give me a second.",
	"Jax.Neutral_6": "The house is looking decent.",
	"Jax.Neutral_7": "I might take a walk later.",
	"Jax.Neutral_8": "Just another day in the valley.",
	"Jax.Neutral_9": "See you later, @.",
	"Jax.Bad_0": "I just need some space right now.",
	"Jax.Bad_1": "Can we not talk? I have a headache.",
	"Jax.Bad_2": "I'm starting to remember why I hated small towns.",
	"Jax.Bad_3": "This isn't working for me today.",
	"Jax.Bad_4": "Don't look at me like that.",
	"Jax.Bad_5": "I should have just stayed in the city.",
	"Jax.Bad_6": "I'm completely drained. Leave me alone.",
	"Jax.Bad_7": "Why do you even bother?",
	"Jax.Bad_8": "I feel completely invisible again.",
	"Jax.Bad_9": "Just go do your farm stuff.",
	"Jax.Event.2Heart.1": "No, Greg, you listen to me! You don't put a neon green font over a yellow background! It looks like toxic waste!",
	"Jax.Event.2Heart.2": "...Ugh. They hung up. Clients are literal monsters. What do you want, farmer?",
	"Jax.Event.2Heart.Q": "How do you respond?",
	"Jax.Event.2Heart.A1": "You seem stressed.",
	"Jax.Event.2Heart.A2": "Neon green and yellow is a bold choice.",
	"Jax.Event.2Heart.A3": "I'll leave you alone.",
	"Jax.Event.2Heart.R1": "Stressed? Me? No, I love screaming into a piece of plastic for a living. It's very zen.",
	"Jax.Event.2Heart.R2": "Right?! Bold if you're a traffic cone! Ugh, at least someone gets it.",
	"Jax.Event.2Heart.R3": "Whatever. I have to call them back and apologize anyway.",
	"Jax.Event.2Heart.3": "Anyway, don't mind me. Just out here losing my mind one corporate email at a time.",
	"Jax.Event.4Heart.1": "Oh. Hey. Didn't hear you walk up. The music was loud.",
	"Jax.Event.4Heart.2": "I come out here a lot. I left the city because there were too many people, but somehow I felt totally invisible there.",
	"Jax.Event.4Heart.3": "Like I was just a ghost haunting a coffee shop. Does that make sense?",
	"Jax.Event.4Heart.4": "Anyway, thanks for not telling me to turn my music down. It helps.",
	"Jax.Event.6Heart.1": "I can't do this. The pitch is tomorrow and I have nothing. Literally zero original ideas.",
	"Jax.Event.6Heart.2": "What if I'm just... empty, @? What if all the spikes and the loud music is just a cover because I have absolutely no substance?",
	"Jax.Event.6Heart.3": "I'm terrified that underneath the aesthetic, I just don't matter.",
	"Jax.Event.6Heart.Q": "Comfort her:",
	"Jax.Event.6Heart.A1": "You have substance, Jax. I see it.",
	"Jax.Event.6Heart.A2": "Your aesthetic is cool, though.",
	"Jax.Event.6Heart.R1": "...You do? Man, you know exactly what to say to make me cry off my eyeliner. Thank you.",
	"Jax.Event.6Heart.R2": "I mean, yeah, obviously. But that's not the point! ...Though I appreciate the compliment.",
	"Jax.Event.6Heart.4": "I'm going to finish this pitch. I can do it. I just had to get out of my own head.",
	"Jax.Event.8Heart.1": "Blaise! Look at these numbers! We increased foot traffic by 40% with that flyer campaign!",
	"Jax.Event.8Heart.2": "I'm looking at it, Jax. It's incredible. People are actually coming in asking for the 'Timberline Torch' by name.",
	"Jax.Event.8Heart.3": "Hey, @! Did you hear? I actually did it. I made something real that helped someone.",
	"Jax.Event.8Heart.4": "It's not just corporate nonsense anymore. I matter. And it feels amazing.",
	"Jax.Event.10Heart.1": "I asked you to meet me here because this is where I feel most like myself.",
	"Jax.Event.10Heart.2": "I'm wearing my loudest, spikiest gear tonight. But for the first time in my life, it's not armor.",
	"Jax.Event.10Heart.3": "I used to wear this so people wouldn't look past me. But I know you see me. The real me.",
	"Jax.Event.10Heart.4": "Nobody can make me small anymore, @. Especially not when I'm standing next to you.",
	"Jax.Event.10Heart.5": "I love you. You know that, right?",
	"Jax.Event.14Heart.1": "Surprise! Look at the town billboard.",
	"Jax.Event.14Heart.2": "I launched a regional campaign for the farm. We are officially on the map, babe.",
	"Jax.Event.14Heart.3": "I used to just market corporate garbage, but now I get to show the world the place I love. The place we built.",
	"Jax.Event.14Heart.4": "Best decision I ever made was getting stranded in this valley with you.",
	"Julius.Day.Mon": "The gingivitis is spreading. I can feel it. It moves through the town like a phantom.",
	"Julius.Day.Tue": "I lost a bicuspid today. We did everything we could... we scaled, we planed, but the root was compromised. Damn it!",
	"Julius.Day.Wed": "People think it's just a cavity. They don't see the systemic failure. The sheer arrogance of ignoring the floss.",
	"Julius.Day.Thu": "I haven't slept in thirty-six hours. The plaque never sleeps, farmer. Why should I?",
	"Julius.Day.Fri": "They go to the Biscuit Drum and eat sugar, and then they come to me, begging for absolution. I am a dentist, not a priest!",
	"Julius.Day.Sat": "I am updating the charts. So many charts. A ledger of human failure, written in enamel.",
	"Julius.Day.Sun": "I sit in the quiet and listen. Somewhere out there, a molar is cracking. And there's nothing I can do until Monday.",
	"Julius.Introduction": "Stay back! Are your hands sanitized? I am Dr. Julius. I fight the war against decay in this valley, and right now, we are losing. If you need me, I'll be in triage.",
	"Julius.DumpsterDiveComment": "Do you want an infection?! Are you actively trying to contract tetanus?! Stop that!",
	"Julius.HitBySlingshot": "Blunt force trauma to the mandible is no joke! Put that weapon down!",
	"Julius.WipedMemory": "I'm experiencing sudden retrograde amnesia. My charts... I don't remember any of your dental records. I need to run a full diagnostic immediately.",
	"Julius.Weather.Rain": "The rain washes the dirt from the streets. If only we could so easily rinse the plaque from our collective conscience.",
	"Julius.Weather.Snow": "The cold temperature exacerbates dentin hypersensitivity. I expect a line out the clinic door by noon. Bundle up, and keep your mouth shut.",
	"Julius.Weather.GreenRain": "Anomalous precipitation! I've sealed the clinic vents. Who knows what kind of unprecedented corrosive agents are in that green sludge!",
	"Julius.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "The anomalous weather has passed, but I'm advising all my patients to perform a double saline rinse today. We cannot let our guard down.",
	"Julius.Hearts2.Mon": "You're a farmer. You deal with the earth. But the human mouth... that is the true wilderness.",
	"Julius.Hearts2.Tue": "I saw someone drink a soda today. Right in front of me. They didn't even flinch. The sheer audacity.",
	"Julius.Hearts2.Wed": "I need 50cc of fluoride, stat! ...No, not really. I'm just practicing my urgency drills.",
	"Julius.Hearts2.Thu": "I was top of my class at Zuzu City Medical. I could have been a surgeon. But the teeth called to me. The tragic, brittle teeth.",
	"Julius.Hearts2.Fri": "Wash your hands before you speak to me. The ambient bacteria in this town is a nightmare.",
	"Julius.Hearts2.Sat": "I caught Dion eating a hard caramel. I had to look away. I can't save those who refuse to be saved.",
	"Julius.Hearts2.Sun": "Sometimes I dream of a world without sugar. But then, what would be my purpose?",
	"Julius.Hearts4.Mon": "You have strong jaw alignment, @. Respect it. Do not take it for granted.",
	"Julius.Hearts4.Tue": "They tell me to take a vacation. A vacation! While the tartar builds! Fools.",
	"Julius.Hearts4.Wed": "I performed a root canal yesterday. Seven hours. Just me, the drill, and the void. We pulled them back from the brink.",
	"Julius.Hearts4.Thu": "If I see one more person open a bottle with their teeth, I am going to revoke my own medical license.",
	"Julius.Hearts4.Fri": "You seem to understand the gravity of my work, farmer. Most people just complain about the suction tube.",
	"Julius.Hearts4.Sat": "I scrubbed my instruments three times today. You can never be too certain. The microscopic enemy is everywhere.",
	"Julius.Hearts4.Sun": "I am writing a paper on the correlation between rural farming and enamel erosion. It's groundbreaking.",
	"Julius.Hearts6.Mon": "I had a mentor once. Brilliant man. Lost all his teeth to a rare, aggressive gingivitis. I swore that day... never again.",
	"Julius.Hearts6.Tue": "It's raining. The sky is washing away the dirt. If only I could do the same for their gums.",
	"Julius.Hearts6.Wed": "I... I made a mistake today. I used the wrong grit of polishing paste. Will the patient notice? No. Will I? Forever.",
	"Julius.Hearts6.Thu": "You're a good friend, @. You don't judge me when I stare dramatically into the distance.",
	"Julius.Hearts6.Fri": "I confronted Bea about her baked goods. She handed me a muffin. I took it to the clinic and incinerated it.",
	"Julius.Hearts6.Sat": "I am standing at the edge of the abyss, and all I have is this tiny mirror on a stick.",
	"Julius.Hearts6.Sun": "Rest your jaw today, @. Eat soft foods. Oatmeal. Broth. Give your enamel a fighting chance.",
	"Julius.Hearts8.Mon": "I looked at the town's sugar consumption metrics today. I thought about quitting. Hanging up the drill. Retreating to a cabin where the Gingivitis can't find me.",
	"Julius.Hearts8.Tue": "But I can't leave them. Who would tell them to floss? Who would carry the burden?",
	"Julius.Hearts8.Wed": "You've shown me that even when the crops fail, you replant. I must do the same. Metaphorically. With teeth.",
	"Julius.Hearts8.Thu": "I authorized the purchase of a new panoramic X-ray machine. We are bringing this war into the 21st century.",
	"Julius.Hearts8.Fri": "I don't say this often, because emotional attachment clouds medical judgment... but I value you, @.",
	"Julius.Hearts8.Sat": "I saw someone smile today. A full, brilliant, cavity-free smile. That is why I do this.",
	"Julius.Hearts8.Sun": "The clinic is closed. But if you have an emergency... you know my pager number.",
	"Julius.Hearts10.Mon": "We saved three teeth today. Three! It was a bloodbath, but we held the line.",
	"Julius.Hearts10.Tue": "You are the only person in this valley who truly understands the stakes. We are comrades in arms, @.",
	"Julius.Hearts10.Wed": "I'm nominating your farm for a 'Dental Health Advocate' award. Don't try to stop me.",
	"Julius.Hearts10.Thu": "I feel revitalized. The decay will not win. Not on my watch.",
	"Julius.Hearts10.Fri": "I would trust you to hold the suction tube, @. That is the highest honor I can bestow.",
	"Julius.Hearts10.Sat": "Let them eat their candy. Let the Biscuit Drum serve its sugar. My drill is sharp, and my resolve is absolute. I am ready for them.",
	"Julius.Hearts10.Sun": "Take a breath, farmer. The war is paused for today. We rest, so we can fight tomorrow.",
	"Julius.Day.Spring.Mon": "Spring. The season of renewal. And yet, people use it as an excuse to eat sticky marshmallow treats. It's a tragedy.",
	"Julius.Day.Spring.Tue": "The pollen in the air is causing mouth-breathing. Mouth-breathing leads to dry mouth. Dry mouth leads to decay. It's a vicious cycle.",
	"Julius.Day.Spring.Wed": "I saw a robin today. It doesn't need to floss. Sometimes I envy the avian skeletal structure.",
	"Julius.Day.Spring.Thu": "The farmers market is opening soon. I'm preparing my pamphlets on the dangers of artisanal honey.",
	"Julius.Day.Spring.Fri": "They think because a strawberry is 'natural' it won't erode their enamel. The acidity tells a different story.",
	"Julius.Day.Spring.Sat": "I'm performing prophylactic cleanings all weekend. Spring cleaning shouldn't just be for your house, @.",
	"Julius.Day.Spring.Sun": "The flowers are blooming. But underneath the soil, the roots are fighting for survival. Much like our teeth.",
	"Julius.Day.Summer.Mon": "The heat makes them crave ice cream. It's a localized epidemic of sugar and thermal shock!",
	"Julius.Day.Summer.Tue": "I had to treat three cases of chipped incisors today from people chewing on ice cubes. When will they learn?!",
	"Julius.Day.Summer.Wed": "Hydration is key in this weather. Water, @! Not juice! Juice is just a Trojan horse for cavities!",
	"Julius.Day.Summer.Thu": "The humidity is oppressive, but the sterile air of my clinic remains a sanctuary.",
	"Julius.Day.Summer.Fri": "I refuse to go to the Luau. Do you have any idea how much sugar is in a tropical punch? It's a biohazard.",
	"Julius.Day.Summer.Sat": "Someone asked me for a summer break from flossing. I nearly had them committed.",
	"Julius.Day.Summer.Sun": "The sun sets late, giving them more hours in the day to make poor dietary choices.",
	"Julius.Day.Fall.Mon": "Spirit's Eve is approaching. The darkest night of the year for a dental professional.",
	"Julius.Day.Fall.Tue": "Caramel apples. The perfect storm of sugar and structural integrity damage. It's a nightmare masquerading as a festive treat.",
	"Julius.Day.Fall.Wed": "The leaves fall, much like untreated teeth. A grim reminder of our own mortality.",
	"Julius.Day.Fall.Thu": "I am stockpiling composite resin. The harvest festival always results in casualties.",
	"Julius.Day.Fall.Fri": "Pumpkin spice is just a marketing term for 'enamel destroyer'. Do not fall for their autumnal propaganda.",
	"Julius.Day.Fall.Sat": "I saw a child in a costume today. I gave them a travel-sized bottle of mouthwash. They cried. I saved their life.",
	"Julius.Day.Fall.Sun": "The chill in the air makes the clinic feel... solitary. But the work is too important to stop.",
	"Julius.Day.Winter.Mon": "The Feast of the Winter Star. A time of joy, and rampant, unchecked peppermint consumption.",
	"Julius.Day.Winter.Tue": "My hands are dry from the scrubbing, and the cold air doesn't help. But a compromised sterile field is not an option.",
	"Julius.Day.Winter.Wed": "They drink hot cocoa with marshmallows. It's a sticky, scalding assault on the oral cavity!",
	"Julius.Day.Winter.Thu": "The snow is pristine. If only we could bleach our teeth with such reckless abandon... no, wait, that would destroy the dentin.",
	"Julius.Day.Winter.Fri": "I caught myself humming a festive tune while sterilizing the drills. Perhaps the season is getting to me.",
	"Julius.Day.Winter.Sat": "Someone gifted me a fruitcake. I am currently running tests to see if it can be used as a temporary filling material. It's certainly hard enough.",
	"Julius.Day.Winter.Sun": "As the year ends, I review the charts. We lost some good teeth this year, @. But we also saved many.",
	"Julius.Gift.StardropTea": "This... this is extraordinary. It doesn't erode. It doesn't coat. It simply revitalizes. This must be what a perfect oral biome feels like.",
	"Julius.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "A birthday gift that actively attempts to destroy me. How fitting.",
	"Julius.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "The anniversary of my birth. A miracle I have survived this long. Thank you.",
	"Julius.AcceptBirthdayGift": "Birthdays are just a reminder of our finite time to fight the plaque. But... thank you.",
	"Julius.MovieInvitation": "A cinematic experience? Will there be concession stands? ...Fine. I will accompany you, but I am smuggling in my own sugar-free lozenges.",
	"Julius.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "I'm already scheduled for a civilian excursion today. The plaque requires constant vigilance, I cannot take two breaks.",
	"Julius.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I've already exposed myself to the auditory and visual overstimulation of the theater this week. My nerves are frayed enough.",
	"Julius.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "You expect me to sit in a dark room with you after the systematic failure of our partnership? Absolutely not.",
	"Julius.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "I've read the synopsis. It lacks medical accuracy and promotes a reckless lifestyle. I refuse to support it.",
	"Julius.RejectMovieTicket": "I am in the middle of a complex chart review! I do not have time for moving pictures!",
	"Julius.SummitEvent": "Look out at the valley, @. From up here, it looks peaceful. You can almost forget the microscopic battles being waged in every mouth down there. We did good work today. The decay will return tomorrow, but for now... we've won.",
	"Julius.Event.2Heart.1": "(Sighs heavily) Time of completion: 1400 hours. The cleaning... is done.",
	"Julius.Event.2Heart.2": "It was close, @. We almost lost the incisor to tartar buildup. I had to scrape like my life depended on it.",
	"Julius.Event.2Heart.Q": "How do you respond?",
	"Julius.Event.2Heart.A1": "Are you okay?",
	"Julius.Event.2Heart.A2": "It was just a cleaning, Julius.",
	"Julius.Event.2Heart.A3": "You're a hero.",
	"Julius.Event.2Heart.R1": "Am I okay? I don't know anymore. Every day is a battle in the trenches of the mouth.",
	"Julius.Event.2Heart.R2": "Just a cleaning?! It is NEVER just a cleaning! You mock the very fabric of dental science!",
	"Julius.Event.2Heart.R3": "I'm no hero. The floss... the floss is the real hero.",
	"Julius.Event.2Heart.3": "Leave me. I must update the charts before the adrenaline wears off.",
	"Julius.Event.4Heart.1": "High-fructose corn syrup. Red dye number 40. Look at this.",
	"Julius.Event.4Heart.2": "They package it in bright colors to distract you from the fact that it is a highly corrosive acid!",
	"Julius.Event.4Heart.3": "Do you know what this does to the human mouth, farmer?! It dissolves the calcium like acid through a hull!",
	"Julius.Event.4Heart.4": "I should buy it all. I should buy every last piece of candy in this store and burn it.",
	"Julius.Event.6Heart.1": "Why do we fight it, @?",
	"Julius.Event.6Heart.2": "I look out at this town, and all I see are people chewing on ice, negelcting their molars...",
	"Julius.Event.6Heart.3": "Is it hubris? Am I playing god by trying to stop the inevitable decay of the human tooth?",
	"Julius.Event.6Heart.4": "Don't answer that. Just... stand here with me. Let me mourn the enamel we've lost.",
	"Julius.Event.8Heart.1": "Julius, for the last time, I am not serving you hot water with a slice of plain celery.",
	"Julius.Event.8Heart.2": "Then you leave me no choice, Bea! I refuse to ingest your powdered poison!",
	"Julius.Event.8Heart.3": "@! Thank goodness you're here. They are trying to force me to consume carbohydrates.",
	"Julius.Event.8Heart.4": "I'm done. I'm hanging up the drill. The decay never stops, so why should I keep fighting?",
	"Julius.Event.8Heart.Q": "Talk sense into him:",
	"Julius.Event.8Heart.A1": "The war is never over, Soldier. Pick up the drill.",
	"Julius.Event.8Heart.A2": "If you leave, the sugar wins.",
	"Julius.Event.8Heart.R1": "You're right. A soldier doesn't abandon his post just because the enemy is overwhelming. I must hold the line.",
	"Julius.Event.8Heart.R2": "You're right. If I surrender, the sugar wins. And I will NEVER let the sugar win.",
	"Julius.Event.8Heart.5": "I must return to the clinic. Cancel my celery water! The doctor is IN!",
	"Julius.Event.10Heart.1": "(Groans) Man, I just bit down on a loose bolt trying to hold it while I was welding. It's bad.",
	"Julius.Event.10Heart.2": "Code Blue! We have a severe enamel fracture on bicuspid four! I need suction, stat!",
	"Julius.Event.10Heart.3": "@! Scrub in! Hand me that composite resin and do not look away!",
	"Julius.Event.10Heart.4": "Wait, what? Are they going to be okay, doc?",
	"Julius.Event.10Heart.5": "We are losing the structural integrity! I'm going in with the drill! STAY WITH ME, JETT!",
	"Julius.Event.10Heart.6": "It's... it's over.",
	"Julius.Event.10Heart.7": "We saved the tooth. We held the line. This... this is why I was born, @.",
	"Mabel.Day.Mon": "Orson fell asleep in his armchair again last night. I keep telling him it's bad for his back, but he's as stubborn as a mule.",
	"Mabel.Day.Tue": "I was just organizing my recipe box. It's astonishing how many butter cookies one family can eat over a lifetime.",
	"Mabel.Day.Wed": "The cottage gets so quiet during the day. I used to be organizing town bake sales on Wednesdays. Now... I just reorganize the pantry. Again.",
	"Mabel.Day.Thu": "Are you dressing warmly enough for the farm work, dear? The wind off the falls can be quite biting this time of year.",
	"Mabel.Day.Fri": "Orson and I are going to the Biscuit Drum tonight. It's nice to let Bea do the cooking every once in a while.",
	"Mabel.Day.Sat": "I swept the porch three times today. I suppose I'm just looking for excuses to be outside, hoping someone might need a hand with something.",
	"Mabel.Day.Sun": "Sundays always feel so peaceful here. It's the perfect day for a slow walk.",
	"Mabel.Introduction": "Oh! Hello, dear. I didn't hear you knock. I'm Mabel. Goodness, you must be the new farmer everyone is talking about! Come in, come in, let me get you something warm.",
	"Mabel.DumpsterDiveComment": "Oh, dear! Goodness, you shouldn't be digging in the trash! Let me make you a sandwich instead.",
	"Mabel.HitBySlingshot": "Good heavens! Be careful with that thing, you'll put an eye out!",
	"Mabel.WipedMemory": "Oh, hello there. Have we met before? Forgive me, my memory isn't quite what it used to be.",
	"Mabel.Weather.Rain": "A perfect day to stay indoors with a hot cup of tea and my knitting. I just hope the farm doesn't get too muddy.",
	"Mabel.Weather.Snow": "Make sure you wear your thickest wool socks today! The chill seeps right through the floorboards if you aren't careful.",
	"Mabel.Weather.GreenRain": "Good heavens! The rain is... green! Orson, come look at this! I suppose I'll be keeping the windows tightly shut today.",
	"Mabel.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "Well, that was certainly strange. But the air smells wonderfully fresh now, doesn't it?",
	"Mabel.Hearts2.Mon": "You're working so hard on that land. Make sure you take time to sit down, dear. A tired farmer is a clumsy farmer.",
	"Mabel.Hearts2.Tue": "Orson says the town feels different lately. A little more alive. I think he's right, and I think it's because of you.",
	"Mabel.Hearts2.Wed": "I tried a new yarn for my knitting, but it's a bit scratchy. I'll probably just make potholders out of it.",
	"Mabel.Hearts2.Thu": "If you ever need a warm meal, you know where to find me. My door is always open to you.",
	"Mabel.Hearts2.Fri": "I always bake a little extra on Fridays. Habit, I suppose. Take these cookies, dear, I insist.",
	"Mabel.Hearts2.Sat": "It’s so lovely to see a young person breathing life back into that old farm.",
	"Mabel.Hearts2.Sun": "I love seeing the valley change with the seasons. It reminds me that nothing stays still forever.",
	"Mabel.Hearts4.Mon": "I was just looking at some old photographs. The valley was so vibrant when we first moved here. It's nice to see some of that color returning.",
	"Mabel.Hearts4.Tue": "Does your back ever ache from all that digging? I have a wonderful herbal soak recipe I can write down for you.",
	"Mabel.Hearts4.Wed": "I caught Orson trying to sneak a piece of cake before dinner. He thinks he's sly, bless his heart.",
	"Mabel.Hearts4.Thu": "You bring a lovely energy with you whenever you visit, @. It really brightens my afternoon.",
	"Mabel.Hearts4.Fri": "Sometimes I worry I don't contribute much to the town anymore. I just putter around the house. But Orson says puttering is a full-time job.",
	"Mabel.Hearts4.Sat": "I saw Dion in town today. That young man's hair defies gravity. It's quite impressive.",
	"Mabel.Hearts4.Sun": "The water from the falls sounds especially musical today. Take a moment to listen to it, dear.",
	"Mabel.Hearts6.Mon": "I made a huge pot of soup today. Far too much for just Orson and me. Please, take a bowl home.",
	"Mabel.Hearts6.Tue": "I've started knitting a scarf. I won't tell you who it's for, but let's just say you might want to look surprised come winter.",
	"Mabel.Hearts6.Wed": "I used to be involved in all the town planning meetings. I thought I was supposed to let the younger folks handle things now, but... maybe they still need someone to bring the snacks.",
	"Mabel.Hearts6.Thu": "You remind me so much of myself when I was your age. Full of ideas and dirt under the fingernails.",
	"Mabel.Hearts6.Fri": "Bea was asking about you at the Drum. The whole town is quite fond of you, dear.",
	"Mabel.Hearts6.Sat": "Orson and I were talking about you this morning. We are so proud of what you've accomplished.",
	"Mabel.Hearts6.Sun": "It’s a beautiful day to be alive, isn't it? Just breathe it in.",
	"Mabel.Hearts8.Mon": "I brought a batch of muffins to the clinic today. It felt wonderful to be out and about, sharing with the neighbors.",
	"Mabel.Hearts8.Tue": "You’ve inspired me, @. Watching you build something from scratch made me realize I still have plenty to give.",
	"Mabel.Hearts8.Wed": "I dropped off a basket of scones at the clinic, and then helped Bea sort her pantry. I don't feel like I'm just 'puttering' anymore. I'm taking care of my community again.",
	"Mabel.Hearts8.Thu": "Orson says I have a spring in my step lately. I told him he should try keeping up!",
	"Mabel.Hearts8.Fri": "I'm baking three pies today. One for us, one for Bea, and one for you. Don't argue with me.",
	"Mabel.Hearts8.Sat": "It's so important to have roots, dear. I'm glad you planted yours here with us.",
	"Mabel.Hearts8.Sun": "My home is your home, @. Never forget that.",
	"Mabel.Hearts10.Mon": "I don't have grandchildren, but if I did, I'd want them to be just like you.",
	"Mabel.Hearts10.Tue": "You've brought so much light into our quiet little cottage.",
	"Mabel.Hearts10.Wed": "Whenever you feel overwhelmed on that big farm, you just come sit by my fire.",
	"Mabel.Hearts10.Thu": "I knitted this sweater for you. I made sure to leave extra room in the shoulders for all that farming you do.",
	"Mabel.Hearts10.Fri": "Orson and I consider you family, @. We truly do.",
	"Mabel.Hearts10.Sat": "I love you, dear. Now go wash your hands, I've got lunch ready.",
	"Mabel.Hearts10.Sun": "This valley is lucky to have you. And so am I.",
	"Mabel.Day.Spring.Mon": "Spring cleaning always takes twice as long as I think it will. Orson hides when I get the duster out.",
	"Mabel.Day.Spring.Tue": "The first blooms of the season always remind me of when Orson and I were young.",
	"Mabel.Day.Spring.Wed": "I'm planning my herb garden today. A good roast needs fresh rosemary, you know.",
	"Mabel.Day.Spring.Thu": "The rain this time of year is a blessing, even if it does make my knees ache a little.",
	"Mabel.Day.Spring.Fri": "I'm baking lemon tarts today. The citrus feels so bright and cheerful after the long winter.",
	"Mabel.Day.Spring.Sat": "It's nice to see everyone out and about again. The valley feels like it's stretching its legs.",
	"Mabel.Day.Spring.Sun": "Sunday mornings in spring have a special kind of quiet. I love listening to the birds return.",
	"Mabel.Day.Summer.Mon": "It's sweltering today! Make sure you drink plenty of water out there in the fields, dear.",
	"Mabel.Day.Summer.Tue": "I spent the morning making berry preserves. The kitchen is a sauna, but it will be worth it in December.",
	"Mabel.Day.Summer.Wed": "Orson refuses to wear shorts. He says a gentleman always wears trousers. I told him a gentleman shouldn't complain about the heat, then!",
	"Mabel.Day.Summer.Thu": "The crops must be loving this sunshine. I'll have to stop by and see how your tomatoes are doing.",
	"Mabel.Day.Summer.Fri": "Summer evenings are perfect for sitting on the porch. Care to join us later?",
	"Mabel.Day.Summer.Sat": "I saw some of the younger folks heading to the beach. I used to love swimming, but now I prefer a shady spot with a good book.",
	"Mabel.Day.Summer.Sun": "A lazy summer Sunday is one of life's greatest pleasures. Don't work too hard today.",
	"Mabel.Day.Fall.Mon": "The leaves are turning such beautiful colors. It's my absolute favorite time of year.",
	"Mabel.Day.Fall.Tue": "I'm bringing out the heavy quilts today. The nights are getting much cooler.",
	"Mabel.Day.Fall.Wed": "Pumpkin, cinnamon, nutmeg... my pantry smells like a bakery's dream right now.",
	"Mabel.Day.Fall.Thu": "Harvest time must be exhausting for you, @. Remember to eat a hearty breakfast!",
	"Mabel.Day.Fall.Fri": "I've been knitting a new cardigan for Orson. The old one is practically falling apart, but he won't let it go.",
	"Mabel.Day.Fall.Sat": "The crisp air is so refreshing. It makes me want to bake a dozen apple pies!",
	"Mabel.Day.Fall.Sun": "Taking a stroll through the falling leaves clears the mind wonderfully. You should try it.",
	"Mabel.Day.Winter.Mon": "The snow is lovely, but shoveling the walk is getting harder every year. Thankfully, Orson still insists on doing it.",
	"Mabel.Day.Winter.Tue": "I always keep a pot of stew simmering on the stove during winter. It warms the whole house.",
	"Mabel.Day.Winter.Wed": "The valley is so still when it snows. It feels like the whole world has gone to sleep.",
	"Mabel.Day.Winter.Thu": "Are you keeping warm in that farmhouse? Drafty old buildings can be quite a challenge.",
	"Mabel.Day.Winter.Fri": "I've spent all day wrapping presents and baking fruitcake. It's a busy season, but a joyous one.",
	"Mabel.Day.Winter.Sat": "Don't let the frostbite get you, dear! I have some spare mittens if you need them.",
	"Mabel.Day.Winter.Sun": "Sundays in winter are for resting by the hearth. Let the fire do the work.",
	"Mabel.Gift.StardropTea": "Oh my heavens! Stardrop Tea? This is incredibly rare! I will save this for a very special occasion with Orson. Thank you, dear.",
	"Mabel.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "Oh... well. Birthdays aren't what they used to be, I suppose.",
	"Mabel.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "You remembered an old woman's birthday? Oh, you are too sweet. This is a perfect gift.",
	"Mabel.AcceptBirthdayGift": "Thank you for the birthday wishes, dear. That's very kind.",
	"Mabel.MovieInvitation": "A movie? Oh, how delightful! Orson and I haven't been to the pictures in ages. I would love to go.",
	"Mabel.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "Oh, I'm so sorry, dear, but I already promised someone else I'd go with them this week.",
	"Mabel.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "Goodness, I couldn't possibly sit through another movie so soon. My eyes need a rest!",
	"Mabel.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "I don't think that would be appropriate right now. Please excuse me.",
	"Mabel.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "Oh, that film sounds a bit too... intense for me. I prefer something a little more lighthearted.",
	"Mabel.RejectMovieTicket": "Thank you for the thought, dear, but I have too much baking to catch up on today.",
	"Mabel.SummitEvent": "Look at this view, @. We've watched seasons change and years pass in this valley, but seeing it like this... it takes my breath away. We're so proud of the life you've built here.",
	"Mabel.Event.2Heart.1": "Oh! @! Come in, come in! I was just taking some cookies out of the oven.",
	"Mabel.Event.2Heart.2": "Goodness, you look tired. Are you eating enough? That farm is a lot of work for one person.",
	"Mabel.Event.2Heart.Q": "How do you respond?",
	"Mabel.Event.2Heart.A1": "I'm doing okay, thanks Mabel.",
	"Mabel.Event.2Heart.A2": "It's exhausting, honestly.",
	"Mabel.Event.2Heart.A3": "I eat plenty! Don't worry about me.",
	"Mabel.Event.2Heart.R1": "Well, 'okay' isn't good enough. Sit down and have a cookie. I insist.",
	"Mabel.Event.2Heart.R2": "Oh, you poor thing. Here, take a dozen of these. Sugar helps the energy levels, I always say.",
	"Mabel.Event.2Heart.R3": "Nonsense, you're skin and bones! Sit down. I won't take no for an answer.",
	"Mabel.Event.2Heart.3": "It's so nice to have visitors. It gets a little quiet around here with just Orson and me.",
	"Mabel.Event.4Heart.1": "Oh, my. The hill seems steeper than it used to be.",
	"Mabel.Event.4Heart.2": "Hello, dear. I was just taking a walk. Orson and I used to hike these trails all afternoon.",
	"Mabel.Event.4Heart.3": "I don't mind slowing down, truly. But sometimes, being retired... you start to feel like you aren't very useful anymore.",
	"Mabel.Event.4Heart.4": "I spent forty years taking care of this valley. Now, I just putter around the house. It's silly to complain, I know. But I miss feeling needed.",
	"Mabel.Event.6Heart.1": "I was just thinking about the day Orson and I moved into this cottage.",
	"Mabel.Event.6Heart.2": "The roof leaked, the floors creaked, and we were terrified we'd made a terrible mistake.",
	"Mabel.Event.6Heart.3": "But we fixed it up, piece by piece. Just like you're doing with your farm.",
	"Mabel.Event.6Heart.Q": "What did you learn?",
	"Mabel.Event.6Heart.A1": "That hard work pays off.",
	"Mabel.Event.6Heart.A2": "That you have to be patient.",
	"Mabel.Event.6Heart.R1": "It does. But more importantly, it makes the house truly yours.",
	"Mabel.Event.6Heart.R2": "Exactly. You can't rush a good foundation. Not with houses, and not with life.",
	"Mabel.Event.6Heart.4": "Watching you work has reminded me of those early days. It's brought a lot of joy to this old woman's heart.",
	"Mabel.Event.8Heart.1": "Bea, dear, I brought three trays of the blueberry muffins. Make sure everyone gets one.",
	"Mabel.Event.8Heart.2": "Mabel, this is incredible! We haven't seen a spread like this from you in years!",
	"Mabel.Event.8Heart.3": "Oh, @! I was hoping you'd come by. Have a muffin, they're still warm.",
	"Mabel.Event.8Heart.4": "You know, seeing you build up that farm made me realize I still have plenty of energy left. I'm not done taking care of this town just yet.",
	"Mabel.Event.10Heart.1": "I made your favorite today. No, don't argue, just sit and eat.",
	"Mabel.Event.10Heart.2": "I realized recently that my 'puttering' around isn't just killing time. It's how I show love.",
	"Mabel.Event.10Heart.3": "And I have a lot of love for you, @. You've become like family to Orson and me.",
	"Mabel.Event.10Heart.4": "This valley is a much brighter place with you in it. Now eat up, you have farming to do!",
	"Mara.Day.Mon": "The river is high today. It's carrying a lot of history from the mountains. Mud, silt... old stories.",
	"Mara.Day.Tue": "Can you taste that? The air is sharp. Metallic. Jett must be running the engines hard today. The water doesn't like it.",
	"Mara.Day.Wed": "I love the rain. Most people hide from it, but the fish rise to meet it. It's a reunion.",
	"Mara.Day.Thu": "I prefer the frogs to people. They don't have hidden motives or messy expectations. They're just alive. If you're patient, they'll let you be part of their world. Humans... they're never that simple.",
	"Mara.Day.Fri": "I go to the Antiquary sometimes. Arden understands silence. We can sit in the same room for an hour and not say a word. It's nice.",
	"Mara.Day.Sat": "The town feels busy today. Even from here, I can feel the vibration in the ground. I think I'll stay by the water.",
	"Mara.Day.Sun": "Sundays are slow. The river doesn't know it's Sunday, but... it feels slower too. Maybe it's just me.",
	"Mara.Introduction": "Oh. You stepped quietly. ...I didn't hear you over the water. I'm Mara. I live here, by the falls. It's the only place where the noise of the world gets washed away.",
	"Mara.DumpsterDiveComment": "Please... don't. We generate enough waste without digging through it. Let it lie.",
	"Mara.HitBySlingshot": "Why do you strike out? The river smooths stones, but you throw them to hurt.",
	"Mara.WipedMemory": "I feel a strange ripple in the water today. Something was lost, but I cannot reach it.",
	"Mara.Weather.Rain": "The sky touches the earth. It's intimate.",
	"Mara.Weather.Snow": "Soft falling silence. The world is holding its breath.",
	"Mara.Weather.GreenRain": "The moss... it's drinking the water. It's not dangerous, just thirsty. Look how green it is. It's celebrating.",
	"Mara.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "The valley feels softer now. Like it is wearing a velvet coat. It's peaceful.",
	"Mara.Hearts2.Mon": "You walk heavy, Farmer. Try stepping between the roots, not on them. The earth feels it.",
	"Mara.Hearts2.Tue": "You smell like fertilizer. It's honest. Better than the smell of diesel from the tracks.",
	"Mara.Hearts2.Wed": "If you see a blue heron, be still. It trusts me. I'd like it to trust you too.",
	"Mara.Hearts2.Thu": "Why do you clear so much grass? The insects need homes too. A tidy farm is a lonely farm.",
	"Mara.Hearts2.Fri": "I saw you talking to Vance. He sees enemies in the woods. I only see neighbors. He's so tired.",
	"Mara.Hearts2.Sat": "I'm untangling this line. If you pull too hard, the knot just gets tighter. Human relationships are the same—too much pressure and everything knots up. I'd rather just stay by the water.",
	"Mara.Hearts2.Sun": "Don't swim in the upper pool. The current is stronger than it looks. It will pull you under before you realize you're drowning.",
	"Mara.Hearts4.Mon": "Most people just look at the reflection on the water. They check their hair. But if you stare past your own face... you see what's living underneath.",
	"Mara.Hearts4.Tue": "The Apricot Goby is hiding today. The water must be getting warmer. It knows.",
	"Mara.Hearts4.Wed": "I found a Veridian Glider yesterday. It was resting on a lilypad. It looked like a jewel someone dropped.",
	"Mara.Hearts4.Thu": "Have you met Linus? He understands. We don't speak often, but we share the mountain. Silence is a language too.",
	"Mara.Hearts4.Fri": "Arden showed me a fossil. A fish from a thousand years ago. It looked just like the ones swimming today. Some things don't need to change to be perfect.",
	"Mara.Hearts4.Sat": "If you want to catch the legendary fish, you have to wait for the rain. They only rise when the sky falls. They like the chaos.",
	"Mara.Hearts4.Sun": "You are getting quieter. Your shadow doesn't scare the trout anymore. That's a compliment.",
	"Mara.Hearts6.Mon": "I used to think I needed to be alone to hear the river. But... you're quiet enough. You don't drown it out.",
	"Mara.Hearts6.Tue": "I made tea from river mint. Would you like some? It tastes like the morning mist. Cool and green.",
	"Mara.Hearts6.Wed": "I was watching you work on the farm. You have a rhythm. Like the seasons. You don't fight the land, you work with it.",
	"Mara.Hearts6.Thu": "Jett says machines have a heartbeat. I think rivers have a pulse. And you... you're starting to find yours.",
	"Mara.Hearts6.Fri": "I saved this spot for you. The moss is soft here. Sit. Just breathe.",
	"Mara.Hearts6.Sat": "I don't mind if you fish next to me. Just... be gentle. We aren't conquering the river, we're asking it for a gift.",
	"Mara.Hearts6.Sun": "The valley feels smaller lately. In a good way. Like a room I'm finally comfortable in.",
	"Mara.Hearts8.Mon": "I never wanted to be 'caught'. I thought love was a net. Something that traps you. But with you... it feels more like an anchor in a storm.",
	"Mara.Hearts8.Tue": "When the storm came last night, I found myself wondering if you were warm. That is new for me. Worrying about a human instead of a fish.",
	"Mara.Hearts8.Wed": "The water flows to the ocean. It can't help it. It just goes where it needs to go. I think... I feel that way about you.",
	"Mara.Hearts8.Thu": "You know the names of the fish now. You know the currents. You took the time to learn. Most people just take.",
	"Mara.Hearts8.Fri": "Stay. The view is better when you're blocking the wind.",
	"Mara.Hearts8.Sat": "I found a pearl in a clam. It took years of irritation to form that beauty. Maybe patience creates beautiful things. Like us.",
	"Mara.Hearts8.Sun": "I feel safe when you are near. It is a strange feeling. But I like it. I think I could get used to it.",
	"Mara.Hearts10.Mon": "The river changes every second. But my feelings for you... they are the bedrock underneath. They don't move.",
	"Mara.Hearts10.Tue": "My heart flows to you. Easy as water downhill.",
	"Mara.Hearts10.Wed": "We are two streams merging. No more separate banks. Just one river now.",
	"Mara.Hearts10.Thu": "I used to watch the world from the outside. You pulled me in. The water is fine.",
	"Mara.Hearts10.Fri": "The world is still noisy, and people are still complicated... but when I'm with you, that doesn't matter. You are the only person who doesn't make me want to hide.",
	"Mara.Hearts10.Sat": "You are my ocean. Deep. Vast. Home.",
	"Mara.Hearts10.Sun": "Peace. It's not just in the quiet anymore. It's with you.",
	"Mara.Day.Spring.Mon": "The snowmelt makes the river wild. It's waking up after a long sleep. It's hungry.",
	"Mara.Day.Spring.Tue": "Life is returning. You can hear it in the mud. Little things waking up and stretching.",
	"Mara.Day.Spring.Wed": "The frogs are singing tonight. It's a love song. A very loud, wet love song.",
	"Mara.Day.Spring.Thu": "New shoots are coming up. Be careful where you step. The earth is soft right now.",
	"Mara.Day.Spring.Fri": "The water is cold, but it clears your head. Dip your hands in. It wakes you up better than coffee.",
	"Mara.Day.Spring.Sat": "The fish are active. They know something we don't. Maybe a storm is coming.",
	"Mara.Day.Spring.Sun": "The sun feels good on my back. Like a warm hand.",
	"Mara.Day.Summer.Mon": "The algae is blooming. It looks like emerald clouds underwater. It's beautiful, in a suffocating way.",
	"Mara.Day.Summer.Tue": "Dragonflies. They're such efficient hunters. Beautiful and deadly. Nature is good at that combination.",
	"Mara.Day.Summer.Wed": "The river is low. It's tired. We need rain to give it strength again.",
	"Mara.Day.Summer.Thu": "Fireflies tonight. They look like stars that fell into the grass. I could watch them for hours.",
	"Mara.Day.Summer.Fri": "Everything is growing so fast. It's a rush to the finish line before winter. I prefer to take my time.",
	"Mara.Day.Summer.Sat": "It's too hot to do anything but sit in the shade and watch the water flow. That's a good day, I think.",
	"Mara.Day.Summer.Sun": "The willow tree is my favorite umbrella. It hides me from the world.",
	"Mara.Day.Fall.Mon": "Leaves floating on the surface. Little boats journeying to the sea. I wonder if they'll make it.",
	"Mara.Day.Fall.Tue": "The current is slowing down. The river is preparing for bed.",
	"Mara.Day.Fall.Wed": "The birds are leaving. They know when it's time to move on. Humans are the only ones who stay when it gets cold.",
	"Mara.Day.Fall.Thu": "Decay. It smells sweet, like old books. It's not an ending, just a change.",
	"Mara.Day.Fall.Fri": "The air is thin today. Crisp. You can see all the way to the bottom of the pool.",
	"Mara.Day.Fall.Sat": "I'm gathering seeds. Not to plant... just to keep. Tiny promises for next year.",
	"Mara.Day.Fall.Sun": "The light is golden. It makes the mud look like gold dust. It's a trick, but a pretty one.",
	"Mara.Day.Winter.Mon": "Ice at the edges. The river is building its own walls.",
	"Mara.Day.Winter.Tue": "Life is sleeping under the mud. Waiting. It takes a lot of patience to survive winter.",
	"Mara.Day.Winter.Wed": "It's so quiet. The snow swallows every sound. It's peaceful.",
	"Mara.Day.Winter.Thu": "The snow blanket looks soft, but it's heavy. The earth is resting under the weight.",
	"Mara.Day.Winter.Fri": "The water is still flowing beneath the ice. Secretly. It never really stops.",
	"Mara.Day.Winter.Sat": "Cold clarity. I feel like I can think clearly when the world is frozen.",
	"Mara.Day.Winter.Sun": "Waiting for the sun. Just waiting. There's nothing else to do.",
	"Mara.Gift.StardropTea": "This... it tastes like the purest spring at the top of the mountain. It fills me with light.",
	"Mara.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "Today is my birthday, yes. I suppose the river will wash this away eventually.",
	"Mara.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "You remembered my birthday, and brought me something so wonderful. Thank you.",
	"Mara.AcceptBirthdayGift": "You remembered? ...Thank you. Sharing another year with the valley is gift enough. But I cherish this.",
	"Mara.MovieInvitation": "A film? I suppose I could sit in the dark for a while. The moving pictures remind me of reflections on the water.",
	"Mara.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "My time is already spoken for. The currents cannot cross today.",
	"Mara.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I have had enough of the artificial lights for one week. The river needs me now.",
	"Mara.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "Our currents flow in opposite directions now. Leave me be.",
	"Mara.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "That sounds entirely too loud and chaotic. I would rather watch the salmon run.",
	"Mara.RejectMovieTicket": "No. The theater is suffocating. I cannot go.",
	"Mara.Dating.Mon": "I was thinking about you while I checked the crab pots. I almost let a lobster go because I was distracted.",
	"Mara.Dating.Tue": "No. The theater is suffocating. I cannot go.",
	"Mara.Dating.Wed": "I was thinking about you while I checked the crab pots. I almost let a lobster go because I was distracted.",
	"Mara.Dating.Thu": "My cabin feels empty when you leave. Even the crickets sound lonely.",
	"Mara.Dating.Fri": "Here. I found this shell. It reminds me of the color of your eyes.",
	"Mara.Dating.Sat": "I told the river your name. Is that silly? I wanted the valley to know you are mine.",
	"Mara.Dating.Sun": "I love you. It flows out of me so easily. Like a spring.",
	"Mara.Dating.General": "Let's go to the beach later. Just us. We can watch the tide come in.",
	"Mara.Dating.Rainy": "You ground me, @. Like an anchor in a storm.",
	"Mara.Dating.Memory.OneYear": "Hello, my love. The water is calm today.",
	"Mara.breakUp": "Let's stay out in the rain a little longer. I want to feel the drops on my face with you.",
	"Mara.RejectMermaidPendant_NeedHouseUpgrade": "A full cycle of the seasons has passed since we joined our currents. The water is sweeter with you.",
	"Mara.RejectMermaidPendant_NotDatable": "I see. The river bends, and we must drift apart. I will return to the silence.",
	"Mara.RejectMermaidPendant_NpcWithSomeoneElse": "Your cabin is too small for two currents to share. We need more space to flow.",
	"Mara.RejectMermaidPendant_PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "I do not understand. We are barely acquainted. Do not offer me this.",
	"Mara.RejectMermaidPendant_Under8Hearts": "My heart is anchored elsewhere. You must know this.",
	"Mara.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts": "You cast too many lines. I will not share my waters with another.",
	"Mara.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts_AskedAgain": "The water is still too murky between us. It is too soon for this.",
	"Mara.Proposal.Reject": "I need more time to know your currents before I let you anchor me.",
	"Mara.Bouquet.Accept": "My answer has not changed. The river cannot be rushed.",
	"Mara.RejectBouquet_NotDatable": "I cannot accept this. You do not know the water well enough. Catch every fish in the valley. Learn their names. Then ask me.",
	"Mara.RejectBouquet_NpcAlreadyMarried": "A gift from nature? I accept. Let's drift together for a while.",
	"Mara.RejectBouquet_VeryLowHearts": "I appreciate the gesture, but I am not looking for a human anchor.",
	"Mara.RejectBouquet_LowHearts": "My current is already bound to another. Please, respect that.",
	"Mara.Bouquet.Reject": "We are strangers. You bring me these flowers, but you do not know me.",
	"Mara.divorced": "It is too soon. The roots have not grown deep enough yet.",
	"Mara.RejectGift_Divorced": "No... human love is too heavy. It expects too much. I'm not ready to be caught in that net. I'm sorry.",
	"Mara.RejectMermaidPendant_Divorced": "We are severed. Please, do not muddy the waters any further. Let me be.",
	"Mara.RejectBouquet_Divorced": "I do not want your offerings. The tide has gone out.",
	"Mara.Festival.WinterStar_GiveGift_After_Spouse": "I found this in the deep waters for you. Happy Feast of the Winter Star, my love.",
	"Mara.Festival.WinterStar_ReceiveGift": "You drew my name? This is a beautiful gift. The Star shines brightly on us.",
	"Mara.Resort.General": "The ocean is so loud, but... it is honest.",
	"Mara.Resort.Bar": "Water is the best drink. Ice cold.",
	"Mara.Resort.Chair": "Sitting. Watching the horizon. It never ends.",
	"Mara.Resort.Dance": "Swaying like kelp. Just let the music move you.",
	"Mara.Resort.Entering": "The ocean... it is so big. It makes me feel small. ...Hold my hand?",
	"Mara.Resort.Leaving": "The river calls me back. Salt water is nice, but fresh water is home.",
	"Mara.Resort.Shore": "Tides are the breath of the world. In and out. In and out.",
	"Mara.Resort.Towel": "Drying off. Salt on my skin. I feel like driftwood.",
	"Mara.Resort.Umbrella": "Shelter from the harsh sun. I like the shade.",
	"Mara.Resort.Wander": "Finding shells. Tiny houses that someone left behind.",
	"Mara.SummitEvent": "From up here, the whole valley looks like a single, breathing organism. And we are just a tiny, perfect part of it.",
	"Mara.Engagement.0": "I can feel the change in the air. Like the moment before the rain breaks. We are merging.",
	"Mara.Engagement.1": "The river flows toward our day. I am not afraid. I am ready.",
	"Mara.SpouseFarmhouseClutter": "Your home is full of human things. It feels a bit cluttered... but I will adjust.",
	"Mara.Spouse_MonstersInHouse": "There are shadows in here that do not belong. They upset the balance of the home.",
	"Mara.Marriage.SpouseStardrop": "The taste of pure water. It's clarity.",
	"Mara.Marriage.Spring": "The snowmelt is filling our pond. The farm is waking up, my love.",
	"Mara.Marriage.Summer": "The heat is heavy today. Let us seek out the shade of the willows together.",
	"Mara.Marriage.Fall": "The leaves are gathering in the eddies. A beautiful decay. I love sharing this season with you.",
	"Mara.Marriage.Winter": "The world is asleep under the ice, but it is warm here with you.",
	"Mara.Patio": "I set up my space out here. The air is fresher. I need to feel the wind.",
	"Mara.Rainy_Day_0": "You're wet. Come here, let me dry your hair. You smell like rain.",
	"Mara.Rainy_Day_1": "The crops are drinking deeply today. We can rest.",
	"Mara.Rainy_Day_2": "Look at the puddles. Each one is a tiny mirror reflecting the gray sky.",
	"Mara.Rainy_Day_3": "I saw the frogs celebrating near the pond. They love days like this.",
	"Mara.Rainy_Day_4": "Listen to the roof. It sounds like applause. Nature is happy for us.",
	"Mara.Rainy_Day_5": "Let's stay wrapped up in blankets today. The river can wait.",
	"Mara.Indoor_Day_0": "I watered your plants. They looked thirsty. They drank it right up.",
	"Mara.Indoor_Day_1": "The house feels peaceful today. Just the hum of our life together.",
	"Mara.Indoor_Day_2": "I've been watching the dust motes dance in the light. Simple things.",
	"Mara.Indoor_Day_3": "You work so hard on the land. Remember to rest, my anchor.",
	"Mara.Indoor_Day_4": "I prefer the outdoors, but you make this space feel like a true home.",
	"Mara.Indoor_Day_5": "Would you like some river mint tea? I just brewed a fresh pot.",
	"Mara.Rainy_Night_0": "The rain on the roof. The best lullaby. Sleep now.",
	"Mara.Rainy_Night_1": "The storm is strong tonight. Hold me closer.",
	"Mara.Rainy_Night_2": "The water level will be high tomorrow. For tonight, we are safe.",
	"Mara.Rainy_Night_3": "It is dark outside, but the sound of the water is comforting.",
	"Mara.Rainy_Night_4": "I love the smell of damp earth that drifts through the window.",
	"Mara.Rainy_Night_5": "Rest your head. Let the rhythm of the rain carry you to sleep.",
	"Mara.Indoor_Night_0": "Sleep well, my love. Drift away.",
	"Mara.Indoor_Night_1": "The day is done. We can let go of the current now.",
	"Mara.Indoor_Night_2": "The fire is dying down. Come to bed, you must be exhausted.",
	"Mara.Indoor_Night_3": "I look forward to the quiet of the night with you.",
	"Mara.Indoor_Night_4": "Even the crickets are asleep. It is time we joined them.",
	"Mara.Indoor_Night_5": "You are the last thing I see before the tide of sleep takes me. I am lucky.",
	"Mara.funLeave": "I am going out for a while. The river needs me, but I will return to your shore.",
	"Mara.funReturn": "I have returned. The water was nice, but my heart led me back to you.",
	"Mara.Outdoor_General": "The farm looks beautiful today. You take good care of the land. It trusts you.",
	"Mara.Outdoor_0": "I was just checking the soil. It is rich and full of life.",
	"Mara.Outdoor_1": "The crops are humming with energy. They like it here.",
	"Mara.Outdoor_2": "I heard a blue jay earlier. It seemed to be scolding the cat.",
	"Mara.Outdoor_3": "The air is clear today. I can see all the way to the mountain peak.",
	"Mara.Outdoor_4": "Take a moment to just breathe the air with me. Don't rush.",
	"Mara.spouseRoom": "I brought some river stones inside. They help ground me when I am away from the water.",
	"Mara.OneKid_0": "They are growing like a willow sapling. Fast and strong.",
	"Mara.OneKid_1": "I hope they learn to listen to the river, just like we do.",
	"Mara.OneKid_2": "Being a parent... it is a terrifying and beautiful current to be swept into.",
	"Mara.OneKid_3": "They have your eyes, but I think they have my quiet nature.",
	"Mara.OneKid_4": "I caught them watching the frogs today. I was so proud.",
	"Mara.TwoKids_0": "Our home is full of life now. A lively little ecosystem.",
	"Mara.TwoKids_1": "It takes a lot of energy to raise them, but it is a good exhaustion.",
	"Mara.TwoKids_2": "I see them playing by the water. I always make sure they respect the current.",
	"Mara.TwoKids_3": "Two little streams branching off from our river. It is beautiful.",
	"Mara.TwoKids_4": "They are sleeping. The house is finally quiet. Come sit with me.",
	"Mara.Good_0": "I love waking up next to you. It feels right. Natural.",
	"Mara.Good_1": "I'm going to the river today. Not to hide. Just to say hello. I'll be back before the stars come out.",
	"Mara.Good_2": "The river whispered your name today. It likes you.",
	"Mara.Good_3": "I caught a fish for dinner. It gave its life for us. We should be grateful.",
	"Mara.Good_4": "It's a good day for a walk. Want to come? We don't have to talk.",
	"Mara.Good_5": "I put fresh river mint in the vase. It smells like our first date. Do you remember?",
	"Mara.Good_6": "Let's walk by the water. I want to show you where the otters play.",
	"Mara.Good_7": "Resting in your current. I don't need to swim today.",
	"Mara.Good_8": "Your touch is as gentle as the morning mist.",
	"Mara.Good_9": "I never knew I could be this happy away from the deep woods. You changed my course.",
	"Mara.Neutral_0": "I am going to the river later. Do you need anything?",
	"Mara.Neutral_1": "Just watching the clouds pass by. They never stay still.",
	"Mara.Neutral_2": "The wind is shifting direction today.",
	"Mara.Neutral_3": "I need to mend some of my nets. The knots are coming undone.",
	"Mara.Neutral_4": "Do you ever wonder where the water goes once it reaches the ocean?",
	"Mara.Neutral_5": "The wood is damp. It will be hard to start a fire tonight.",
	"Mara.Neutral_6": "I am feeling quiet today. Do not take it personally.",
	"Mara.Neutral_7": "The farm is demanding today. I will leave you to your work.",
	"Mara.Neutral_8": "I am going to sort through my collection of river stones.",
	"Mara.Neutral_9": "I think it might rain later. I can smell it on the breeze.",
	"Mara.Bad_0": "I need some space today. The air feels heavy. I'll be back.",
	"Mara.Bad_1": "You are being too loud. Please, I need silence.",
	"Mara.Bad_2": "The water is muddy today. And so is my mood. Let me be.",
	"Mara.Bad_3": "We are clashing like waves against rocks. I do not like this.",
	"Mara.Bad_4": "I cannot breathe when you crowd me like this.",
	"Mara.Bad_5": "Sometimes I miss the solitude of my cabin. Do you understand?",
	"Mara.Bad_6": "You smell like the town today. Like exhaust and noise.",
	"Mara.Bad_7": "Do not pull at my currents today. I am tired.",
	"Mara.Bad_8": "I am going for a long walk. Alone.",
	"Mara.Bad_9": "The balance here is wrong today. I need to find my center again.",
	"Mara.Event.Intro.1": "Stop. That stone is loose.",
	"Mara.Event.Intro.2": "One slip and you send silt into the spawning beds. Tread lightly, farmer. The river feels every footstep.",
	"Mara.Event.Intro.3": "I am Mara. I watch the river. It tells me stories, mostly sad ones lately.",
	"Mara.Event.Intro.4": "Most people walk too loud. They scare the life away. Try to be quieter.",
	"Mara.Event.2Heart.1": "The frequency is wrong. It's all wrong.",
	"Mara.Event.2Heart.2": "Do you hear it? The frogs. They are singing in a minor key. They're stressed.",
	"Mara.Event.2Heart.3": "I sit here every day. Watching it change. It feels like watching a friend get sick, and all I can do is hold their hand.",
	"Mara.Event.2Heart.Q": "Comfort Mara:",
	"Mara.Event.2Heart.A1": "You aren't just watching. You're caring for it.",
	"Mara.Event.2Heart.A2": "Maybe it's not dying. Maybe it's changing.",
	"Mara.Event.2Heart.R1": "Caring... maybe. But love doesn't stop the pollution. It just makes it hurt more.",
	"Mara.Event.2Heart.R2": "Changing? Into what? A graveyard? ...I apologize. I'm just tired.",
	"Mara.Event.4Heart.1": "I saw you casting your line yesterday. You caught a bream.",
	"Mara.Event.4Heart.2": "And then you threw it back.",
	"Mara.Event.4Heart.3": "Why?",
	"Mara.Event.4Heart.Q": "Why did you release it?",
	"Mara.Event.4Heart.A1": "It was too small. It needs to grow.",
	"Mara.Event.4Heart.A2": "I respect the river. I only take what I need.",
	"Mara.Event.4Heart.A3": "My inventory was full.",
	"Mara.Event.4Heart.R1": "Patience. Good. Let it live to spawn another season.",
	"Mara.Event.4Heart.R2": "Respect. That is a rare word in this valley. I will remember that.",
	"Mara.Event.4Heart.R3": "Hmph. At least your carelessness saved a life.",
	"Mara.Event.6Heart.1": "You can't just dam the creek. The train needs water, I know. But the fish need it more.",
	"Mara.Event.6Heart.2": "Jett... the intake pipe sucks in the fry. You are boiling the next generation of trout.",
	"Mara.Event.6Heart.3": "It's a machine. It needs water to run. I know. But there has to be a way to share.",
	"Mara.Event.6Heart.4": "I want the valley to breathe. The machine is choking it.",
	"Mara.Event.6Heart.Q": "Intervene:",
	"Mara.Event.6Heart.A1": "Jett, install a mesh filter on the intake. I'll pay for it.",
	"Mara.Event.6Heart.A2": "Mara, the town needs the train. We have to compromise.",
	"Mara.Event.6Heart.R1": "A filter? ...That's simple. Why didn't we think of that? Sometimes you need fresh eyes.",
	"Mara.Event.6Heart.R2": "A compromise. I hate it. But... fine. If it saves even a few.",
	"Mara.Event.8Heart.1": "I came to look at your farm. I expected damage. Noise. Runoff.",
	"Mara.Event.8Heart.2": "But the soil is rich... the water is clear. You are listening to the land.",
	"Mara.Event.8Heart.3": "I have spent so long building walls to keep the world out. I thought I was protecting myself.",
	"Mara.Event.8Heart.4": "But I was just a stone in the stream. Refusing to move. Collecting moss.",
	"Mara.Event.8Heart.5": "If you wish to be with me... you must know the waters as I do. Prove you understand the depth. Catch the spirits of this valley. Then... find me.",
	"Mara.Event.10Heart.1": "You did it. You caught them all.",
	"Mara.Event.10Heart.2": "You didn't just conquer the river. You learned its secrets. You waited for them.",
	"Mara.Event.10Heart.3": "I was afraid of you. I was afraid of the chaos you brought. But a river without a current is just a swamp.",
	"Mara.Event.10Heart.4": "You are my current. Pull me downstream. I'm ready.",
	"Mara.Event.10Heart.Kiss": "I love you. Let's flow together.",
	"Orson.Day.Mon": "The tools they sell in the city nowadays are pure plastic. You hit a rock with a modern spade and the handle shatters. It's ridiculous.",
	"Orson.Day.Tue": "I hear that train whistle and it sounds like a clock ticking down. In my day, you knew your place in the world. Now? I’m not so sure.",
	"Orson.Day.Wed": "My joints are acting like a barometer today. Means it's probably going to rain, or I just slept funny in that armchair.",
	"Orson.Day.Thu": "Everyone's walking around staring at screens. They don't look up to see the clouds, they don't look down to see the roots. Idiotic.",
	"Orson.Day.Fri": "Taking Mabel to the Drum tonight. It's good to get out, even if the music in there gives me a headache.",
	"Orson.Day.Sat": "I don't understand half the things that boy Dion says. 'Vibe'? What does that even mean? Is it a weather condition?",
	"Orson.Day.Sun": "Quiet day. Just the way I like it. No machines humming, no people shouting.",
	"Orson.Introduction": "Hmph. You the new farmer? I'm Orson. I'd offer to help you plow, but my back went out in '12 and never came back. Try not to track mud on Mabel's floors.",
	"Orson.DumpsterDiveComment": "Have some self-respect, kid! Digging in the trash like a raccoon. Is that what they're teaching people these days?",
	"Orson.HitBySlingshot": "I'll take that toy away from you and put you over my knee! Stop it before you break something irreplaceable!",
	"Orson.WipedMemory": "I don't know who you are. Mabel tells me we used to be acquainted, but my mind isn't what it used to be. Keep your distance for now.",
	"Orson.Weather.Rain": "My knees knew it was going to rain before the clouds even showed up. Modern weather apps are useless compared to an old injury.",
	"Orson.Weather.Snow": "The quiet after a fresh snowfall is one of the few things in this world that hasn't changed. Wrap up warm out there, farmer.",
	"Orson.Weather.GreenRain": "I've seen a lot of seasons in this valley, but I've never seen the sky look like a bruised plum. Stay inside today, kid. Don't trust it.",
	"Orson.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "Everything feels overgrown today. The valley recovered, but it's a stark reminder that nature has the final say, not us.",
	"Orson.Hearts2.Mon": "You work with your hands. Good. Not enough people do that anymore. They just push buttons and expect things to happen.",
	"Orson.Hearts2.Tue": "Mabel fusses over me too much. 'Don't sleep in the chair, Orson', 'Eat your greens, Orson'. I'm old, not fragile. Just... tired of keeping up.",
	"Orson.Hearts2.Wed": "I went into that BuyCo place. Nearly blinded me. Fluorescent lights and cheap junk as far as the eye can see. No soul in any of it.",
	"Orson.Hearts2.Thu": "I used to be able to hike to the top of the falls without breaking a sweat. Now I get winded walking to the mailbox.",
	"Orson.Hearts2.Fri": "Don't let Drexel push you around, kid. The man's a suit with a ledger instead of a heart. He doesn't understand the value of things you can't sell.",
	"Orson.Hearts2.Sat": "I was trying to read the paper, but the print keeps getting smaller. I swear they're doing it on purpose to make us feel like we shouldn't be reading it.",
	"Orson.Hearts2.Sun": "You need a good, sturdy piece of hardwood if you're fixing fences. Don't buy that composite garbage the city folks use.",
	"Orson.Hearts4.Mon": "Mabel says I'm too grumpy. I'm not grumpy, I'm just observant. And I observe a lot of people forgetting how the world actually works.",
	"Orson.Hearts4.Tue": "I saw Jett trying to fix an engine block by looking at a computer screen. In my day, you listened to the engine. You felt it. You can't code a 'gut feeling'.",
	"Orson.Hearts4.Wed": "Everything is built to be thrown away now. Watches, tools, relationships. Nobody fixes anything anymore because they don't know how.",
	"Orson.Hearts4.Thu": "You look tired, farmer. Good. Honest exhaustion is better than that restless energy people get from staring at their phones all day.",
	"Orson.Hearts4.Fri": "I don't go to town much. People talk too fast and don't say anything. It's like everyone is in a race to get to a future that doesn't want them.",
	"Orson.Hearts4.Sat": "I appreciate that you don't talk my ear off when you visit, @. You have respect for silence. Not many people do these days.",
	"Orson.Hearts4.Sun": "I used to know the name of every person who walked through this valley. Now I don't recognize half the faces. Makes me feel like a ghost in my own home.",
	"Orson.Hearts6.Mon": "I was looking at the new junction controls. It's all digital. They don't need a man with a wrench anymore; they need a boy with a screen. It’s a cold way to run a world.",
	"Orson.Hearts6.Tue": "It's a strange feeling, @. Knowing the world has moved on and realizing you don't speak the language anymore.",
	"Orson.Hearts6.Wed": "Sometimes I just sit in my chair and realize I have absolutely nothing useful to do today. The world's automated my purpose right out the door.",
	"Orson.Hearts6.Thu": "I snapped at Mabel yesterday. Not because I was mad at her. Because I couldn't open a jar, and it terrified me. One day it's a jar, the next... what's left?",
	"Orson.Hearts6.Fri": "I might not be able to swing an axe anymore, but my mind is still sharp. People just look at the wrinkles and assume I'm already gone.",
	"Orson.Hearts6.Sat": "You're doing good work out there, kid. You're building something real with your hands. Keep doing that. Don't let them 'optimize' the soul out of you.",
	"Orson.Hearts6.Sun": "Take care of your back, farmer. You only get one, and it holds a grudge when the world starts moving faster than you can.",
	"Orson.Hearts8.Mon": "I went down to Jett's garage yesterday. Taught them how to manually bypass a seized carburetor. Felt good to get some grease under the nails again.",
	"Orson.Hearts8.Tue": "Mabel says I've been in a better mood. I suppose showing the younger generation a thing or two reminded me I'm still good for something.",
	"Orson.Hearts8.Wed": "You know, some of the new tools aren't terrible. Lighter. Easier on the wrists. I'll admit that much—if you promise not to tell Mabel I'm soft.",
	"Orson.Hearts8.Thu": "Jett is a good kid. They were staring at a 'system error' for an hour until I showed them how to feel the vibration in the manifold. Turns out, some things still need a human touch.",
	"Orson.Hearts8.Fri": "I don't need to swing the hammer anymore, @. I can just show the younger folks where to hit. My aim is still perfect.",
	"Orson.Hearts8.Sat": "You helped me see that, farmer. I'm not obsolete. I'm just management now. Haha.",
	"Orson.Hearts8.Sun": "If you ever need advice on repairing those old farm machines, you come see me. Computers can't tell you why a belt is squealing, but I can.",
	"Orson.Hearts10.Mon": "I might not understand everything about the world today, but I understand the people in it. And they still need to be taught the right way to do things.",
	"Orson.Hearts10.Tue": "You breathe life into this valley by doing things the hard way—the right way. It reminded me that just because a thing is old, doesn't mean it's finished. I appreciate that, kid.",
	"Orson.Hearts10.Wed": "I'm proud to call you a friend, kid. You're cut from the old cloth. Durable.",
	"Orson.Hearts10.Thu": "I was telling Dion a story about the old days. He actually put his phone away to listen. Maybe the future isn't as hollow as I thought.",
	"Orson.Hearts10.Fri": "Mabel and I don't have kids. But having you around... it's a good feeling. Like the legacy isn't going to just crumble into dust.",
	"Orson.Hearts10.Sat": "I rub this clean-shaven chin of mine every morning and thank my lucky stars I woke up in this valley. With Mabel. And with neighbors like you to keep me sharp.",
	"Orson.Hearts10.Sun": "You keep working hard, @. The world needs people who still know how to build things that last.",
	"Orson.Day.Spring.Mon": "Spring means mud. Real, honest mud. Make sure you've got a sturdy pair of boots; the soil won't yield to cheap rubber.",
	"Orson.Day.Spring.Tue": "I watched the new sprouts coming up this morning. Always gives me a strange feeling... seeing things start over when I'm nearing the end of my own season.",
	"Orson.Day.Spring.Wed": "Mabel insists on opening all the windows to let the breeze in. I complain about the draft, but honestly... I love the smell of the damp earth.",
	"Orson.Day.Spring.Thu": "Don't let the sunny mornings fool you. A late frost can still snap the life out of your crops if you aren't paying attention.",
	"Orson.Day.Spring.Fri": "I saw you clearing the rocks from the old pasture. It’s back-breaking work, but there’s honor in shaping the land with your own hands.",
	"Orson.Day.Spring.Sat": "Everyone rushes to the flower dance. I prefer to stay on the porch. The real beauty is in the quiet moments they leave behind.",
	"Orson.Day.Spring.Sun": "Take a moment to rest today. The soil has been resting all winter, and it's doing just fine. You need a break too.",
	"Orson.Day.Summer.Mon": "The heat is heavy today. Don't try to outwork the sun, @. It’s been doing this a lot longer than you have.",
	"Orson.Day.Summer.Tue": "Mabel brought out the iced tea. She makes it the old way, no artificial sweeteners. It’s the small things that keep a man going.",
	"Orson.Day.Summer.Wed": "I used to be out in the fields from dawn till dusk in this weather. Now, sitting in the shade is about all the excitement I can handle.",
	"Orson.Day.Summer.Thu": "Make sure your irrigation is set up right. A dry spell will test everything you've built.",
	"Orson.Day.Summer.Fri": "The tourists in town are making a racket. They come to experience 'nature' but complain when there's dirt on their shoes. Idiotic.",
	"Orson.Day.Summer.Sat": "Thunderstorms in the summer always remind me of when I was a boy. The raw power of it... you have to respect it.",
	"Orson.Day.Summer.Sun": "It's too hot to be rushing around. Sit down for a minute, kid. The farm will still be there tomorrow.",
	"Orson.Day.Fall.Mon": "The air is getting thin. Fall has a way of stripping away the excess and showing you what's really left underneath.",
	"Orson.Day.Fall.Tue": "Harvest time. This is when you find out if your hard work meant anything. I have a feeling you'll do fine, farmer.",
	"Orson.Day.Fall.Wed": "Leaves are coming down in droves. Instead of buying a plastic rake, use a good metal one. It’ll outlive you if you treat it right.",
	"Orson.Day.Fall.Thu": "Mabel is baking today. The smell of cinnamon and baked apples is the only reason I tolerate the days getting shorter.",
	"Orson.Day.Fall.Fri": "The valley looks like it's on fire with all these colors. Take a good look, because it'll all be gray soon enough.",
	"Orson.Day.Fall.Sat": "I was inspecting the spirit's eve maze. It’s flimsy work. If a real monster came through, it wouldn't hold up for a second.",
	"Orson.Day.Fall.Sun": "Make sure you’re sealing up your coop and barn. The drafts are starting, and animals can't tell you when they're cold.",
	"Orson.Day.Winter.Mon": "The cold settles deep in my joints these days. It’s a harsh reminder that I’m not the young man who built that barn.",
	"Orson.Day.Winter.Tue": "Keep your hearth swept and your wood dry. Wet logs just smoke and complain, much like the people from the city.",
	"Orson.Day.Winter.Wed": "Winter isn't a time for idleness; it's a time for mending. Fix what broke in the summer so it’s ready for the spring.",
	"Orson.Day.Winter.Thu": "Mabel knit me a new scarf. It's thick, heavy wool. Real craftsmanship. You can't buy that kind of care.",
	"Orson.Day.Winter.Fri": "I stepped out to get the mail and nearly slipped on the ice. My pride took more of a bruising than my hip, thankfully.",
	"Orson.Day.Winter.Sat": "It’s so quiet out there today. The snow muffles the noise of the modern world. I wouldn't mind if it stayed like this for a while.",
	"Orson.Day.Winter.Sun": "Another year almost gone. We endure, farmer. Just like the trees sleeping under the snow, we wait for our time again.",
	"Orson.Gift.StardropTea": "What is this...? It tastes like... memories I thought I'd lost. A steady hand and a clear mind. Thank you, @. Truly.",
	"Orson.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "I stopped celebrating birthdays twenty years ago, and this gift reminds me why. Just another reminder of time passing.",
	"Orson.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "You remembered an old man's birthday? And you brought something built to last. I'm impressed, farmer.",
	"Orson.AcceptBirthdayGift": "A year older, a year stiffer. Thanks for the thought, kid.",
	"Orson.MovieInvitation": "A movie? I usually avoid those dark, noisy rooms... but if you're buying the ticket, I suppose I can put up with the flickering screen.",
	"Orson.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "Someone already handed me a ticket for this week. I don't need to sit in that theater twice.",
	"Orson.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I already went to the pictures this week. Too much time staring at a screen isn't good for my eyes.",
	"Orson.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "You have a lot of nerve talking to me like nothing happened. I'm too old for these games. Walk away.",
	"Orson.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "I read the paper's review for that film. Absolute drivel. I'm not wasting my time on it.",
	"Orson.RejectMovieTicket": "No thanks. I'd rather sit on my porch and watch the grass grow. It's got a better plot.",
	"Orson.SummitEvent": "Look at this view. No blinking lights, no hum of engines. Just the world, breathing. We did a good thing here, kid. Don't let them take it from you.",
	"Orson.Event.2Heart.1": "Plastic. Pure, unadulterated plastic garbage.",
	"Orson.Event.2Heart.2": "They expect people to pay fifty Gs for a rake that'll snap the second it hits a decent-sized root. It's a scam, @. They want you to keep buying new ones.",
	"Orson.Event.2Heart.Q": "How do you respond?",
	"Orson.Event.2Heart.A1": "You have to buy the premium ones.",
	"Orson.Event.2Heart.A2": "It's all made so cheaply now.",
	"Orson.Event.2Heart.A3": "It's not that bad.",
	"Orson.Event.2Heart.R1": "Premium? Ha! Premium just means it's painted a nicer color before it breaks. It's all the same hollow junk.",
	"Orson.Event.2Heart.R2": "Exactly! Finally, someone with some sense. Everything is built to be thrown away because nobody knows how to fix anything anymore.",
	"Orson.Event.2Heart.R3": "Not that bad? Your standards are dangerously low, kid. In my day, a tool lasted a lifetime. Now it barely lasts a season.",
	"Orson.Event.2Heart.3": "I'm going home. Looking at this junk is raising my blood pressure. No respect for the work.",
	"Orson.Event.4Heart.1": "(Grunts) Come on, you stupid piece of... ah, blasted tiny gears!",
	"Orson.Event.4Heart.2": "Oh. You're here. Don't mind me. I'm just trying to fix my grandfather's pocket watch. It’s mechanical. It actually makes sense.",
	"Orson.Event.4Heart.3": "Jett offered to look at it, but I don't want them anywhere near it with their modern tools and sensors. But my hands... they shake too much now. I can’t... I can’t do it.",
	"Orson.Event.4Heart.4": "Just leave me be, @. I'm just a relic trying to fix a relic. It's a lost cause.",
	"Orson.Event.6Heart.1": "The water never changes. That's why I like it up here. It’s the only thing that doesn't need an update.",
	"Orson.Event.6Heart.2": "I'll be honest with you, kid. I'm scared. I look at this town, at the screens and the digital schedules and the rush...",
	"Orson.Event.6Heart.3": "And I realize I don't have a place here anymore. The world grew up and left me behind. I'm obsolete.",
	"Orson.Event.6Heart.Q": "Comfort him:",
	"Orson.Event.6Heart.A1": "You're not obsolete, Orson. We need your experience.",
	"Orson.Event.6Heart.A2": "Things change. You just have to adapt.",
	"Orson.Event.6Heart.R1": "Experience... hmph. Maybe. I suppose you can't download forty years of trial and error from a cloud. It's kind of you to say, anyway.",
	"Orson.Event.6Heart.R2": "Adapt? How do I adapt when I can't even hold the tiny screwdriver anymore, @? You can't 'adapt' your way out of old age.",
	"Orson.Event.6Heart.4": "I just... I don't want to spend my last years feeling like a dusty relic in a museum. I want to matter.",
	"Orson.Event.8Heart.1": "I'm telling you, the diagnostic code says the fuel injector is fine. It has to be a software glitch.",
	"Orson.Event.8Heart.2": "Put the computer down, Jett. Listen to the engine. Do you hear that rattle on the downstroke? That’s not a glitch.",
	"Orson.Event.8Heart.3": "I... yeah. I hear it. Wait, is the valve sticking?",
	"Orson.Event.8Heart.4": "Bingo. Your computer can't measure the carbon buildup on a forty-year-old valve. It takes an ear for that. Hand me that wrench.",
	"Orson.Event.8Heart.5": "See, @? An old dog still has a few tricks. You just have to know when to bark.",
	"Orson.Event.10Heart.1": "So then I told him, 'If you hit that pipe one more time, the whole ceiling is coming down!' And sure enough, kid nearly drowned in his own plumbing!",
	"Orson.Event.10Heart.2": "Orson, you've told that story a hundred times. Let the poor farmer eat their dinner in peace.",
	"Orson.Event.10Heart.3": "Ah, let an old man talk, Mabel. I've finally realized something, sitting here with @.",
	"Orson.Event.10Heart.4": "My job isn't to fix the broken machines anymore. It's to pass on the knowledge so you kids don't have to rely on plastic and computers. And honestly? I'm alright with that.",
	"Remy.Day.Mon": "Mondays in town are yellow. Not a fun yellow. A frantic, fluorescent yellow. Everyone is rushing. It makes my eyes itch.",
	"Remy.Day.Tue": "I parked by the river last night. The water sounds like a cool turquoise ribbon wrapping around the van. It's the best way to sleep.",
	"Remy.Day.Wed": "People ask why I live in a van. I tell them a house is just one painting. The road? The road is a moving gallery. Why would I stare at one wall when I can see them all?",
	"Remy.Day.Thu": "I saw Silas in the woods. He moves without making a sound. To me, he looks like a gap in the landscape. A calming shadow where the visual noise stops. It's fascinating.",
	"Remy.Day.Fri": "Friday nights at the Saloon are a mess. Purple laughter, red shouting, brown glass clinking. It's a Pollock painting in there. I just try to blend into the background.",
	"Remy.Day.Sat": "The train whistle... it's a jagged orange spike. It cuts right through the blue sky. Jett keeps that engine running hot.",
	"Remy.Day.Sun": "Sundays are a blank white canvas. I like to sit and watch the valley wake up before the colors fill in.",
	"Remy.Introduction": "Whoa... hold on. Your footsteps. They sounded... indigo. Deep, steady indigo. I haven't heard that color in a long time. ...I'm Remy. I chase the vibrant parts of the world. Looks like they led me to a good spot.",
	"Remy.DumpsterDiveComment": "That sound... a hollow, wet thud. It's a very unappealing muddy green. Why are you digging in there?",
	"Remy.HitBySlingshot": "Ouch! What was that for? That was a sharp, ugly red spike right in my vision.",
	"Remy.WipedMemory": "You look familiar, but your aura... it's a muted gray. Have we met?",
	"Remy.Weather.Rain": "Rain creates a watercolor effect on the world. Everything blurs together. The sharp edges soften into blues and grays.",
	"Remy.Weather.Snow": "Snow sparkles. It looks like high-pitched chimes. Tink. Tink. Tink. Everything goes wonderfully mute.",
	"Remy.Weather.GreenRain": "The rain is green? That's... new. It sounds thick. Like moss growing in fast forward. Fascinating.",
	"Remy.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "The heavy mossy sound is gone. The air is clearing back to a pale, breathable blue.",
	"Remy.Hearts2.Mon": "Thanks for the tip. It creates a nice metallic ring when it hits the case. A bright, sharp silver.",
	"Remy.Hearts2.Tue": "You want to know why I travel? I'm running from the gray. In the city, the colors started to... bleed out. Everything felt like a smudge. I need constant motion to keep the palette bright.",
	"Remy.Hearts2.Wed": "I don't just see the world, @. I hear its colors. People look at me weird when I say a bird looks like a bright lemon, but it's my reality. When you laugh, the air turns a vivid, shimmering green.",
	"Remy.Hearts2.Thu": "My van isn't a trap. It's a vessel. It takes me to the next vibrant landscape.",
	"Remy.Hearts2.Fri": "I tried to explain my synesthesia to Dr. Thorne once. He offered me pills. I told him I didn't want to turn off the light show.",
	"Remy.Hearts2.Sat": "Rainy days are my favorite. The gray wash makes the other colors pop. Your raincoat is shouting yellow at me.",
	"Remy.Hearts2.Sun": "I'm just watching the clouds. That one looks like a fluffy sheep... but it feels like a soft, breathy flute note.",
	"Remy.Hearts4.Mon": "The farm has a rhythm. Dig, plant, water. Thump, swish, splash. It's a very grounded, earthy brown beat. I like watching you work.",
	"Remy.Hearts4.Tue": "The mountains have such a solid, unmoving presence. They hum in a deep, grounding purple.",
	"Remy.Hearts4.Wed": "Roxy is so loud. Her energy is a chaotic splash of neon. We hang out sometimes, but it's exhausting. Like staring into a strobe light.",
	"Remy.Hearts4.Thu": "You have a good aura, @. When you walk into a room, the visual dissonance quiets down. You're a steady shade of deep violet.",
	"Remy.Hearts4.Fri": "I don't get lonely. How can I be lonely? The wind is talking, the trees are humming, the river is a ribbon of sound. It's a crowded party out here.",
	"Remy.Hearts4.Sat": "Sometimes the visual noise of town gets to be too much. That's when I retreat to the woods to let the quiet greens wash over me.",
	"Remy.Hearts4.Sun": "The river is loud today. A rushing torrent of blue and white. It's washing the week away.",
	"Remy.Hearts6.Mon": "I used to live in the city. Concrete grays, blaring red sirens, blinding yellow lights. It was exhausting. I came here to find softer shades.",
	"Remy.Hearts6.Tue": "The van broke down yesterday. It was stressful. The engine made this grinding, muddy brown noise. But Jett fixed it. Now it hums a nice clean silver.",
	"Remy.Hearts6.Wed": "You actually listen. Most people just wait for their turn to speak, creating a wall of jagged white noise. You let the air settle.",
	"Remy.Hearts6.Thu": "Your presence is so calming, @. Like a steady, grounding shade of indigo in a chaotic room.",
	"Remy.Hearts6.Fri": "I might stay for a while. The colors here... they're vibrant. The seasons change the palette so fast. I don't want to miss the winter whites.",
	"Remy.Hearts6.Sat": "I was watching the cows. They chew in a very relaxed, rhythmic loop. Nature loves a steady pulse.",
	"Remy.Hearts6.Sun": "I feel... clear. When I'm around you. The sensory overload settles down.",
	"Remy.Hearts8.Mon": "I used to run because I was chasing the next beautiful thing. But I realized... the most beautiful things aren't fleeting flashes. They're the steady, constant hues.",
	"Remy.Hearts8.Tue": "I've spent my life observing the colors of the world, but with you... I feel like I'm finally part of the painting, not just watching it.",
	"Remy.Hearts8.Wed": "Can I tell you what you look like to me? It's not just your face. It's the warm, radiant aura that follows you everywhere.",
	"Remy.Hearts8.Thu": "I look at the road and I don't feel the itch. Usually, by now, the horizon is calling. But the colors here... I'm not done looking at them.",
	"Remy.Hearts8.Fri": "I used to think only the road had new colors. But you? You’re this steady, reliable indigo. You don't dim. You actually make the world around you stand out more.",
	"Remy.Hearts8.Sat": "The world can be so overwhelming. But you... you're a rest. A breath. Silence in the best way.",
	"Remy.Hearts8.Sun": "Stay. Just for a minute. Let the colors settle around us.",
	"Remy.Hearts10.Mon": "I traveled the whole continent looking for the right palette. I didn't think I'd find it on a farm. But life here with you... it's perfectly balanced.",
	"Remy.Hearts10.Tue": "I love you. Seeing you... it's like a warm, golden sunrise after a long, cold night. It just feels right.",
	"Remy.Hearts10.Wed": "You want to be with me? The van, the wandering, the weird way I perceive the world? ...Okay. Let's paint something together.",
	"Remy.Hearts10.Thu": "I'm parking the van. Permanently. I mean, I'll still drive it to the beach. But... my home isn't the van anymore. It's you.",
	"Remy.Hearts10.Fri": "My heart is beating so fast. It's a flurry of bright crimson. Can you feel it?",
	"Remy.Hearts10.Sat": "Let's just sit and watch the sun paint the sky. I don't need to be anywhere else.",
	"Remy.Hearts10.Sun": "Harmony. That's what this is. Our colors blend completely.",
	"Remy.Day.Spring.Mon": "It's hard to focus on anything when the air is so busy. The spring breeze is popping with pinks and baby blues.",
	"Remy.Day.Spring.Tue": "The rain is silver. It washes all the other noise away. When it rains, the whole world turns into a monochrome sketch. It's restful.",
	"Remy.Day.Spring.Wed": "The daffodils are humming a bright, buttery yellow today. It's the most cheerful thing in town.",
	"Remy.Day.Spring.Thu": "The spring breeze carries a sharp, zesty lime green scent. It wakes you right up.",
	"Remy.Day.Spring.Fri": "The air smells like wet dirt. It wraps around the valley in a deep, comforting mahogany.",
	"Remy.Day.Spring.Sat": "Busking is an exchange. You give me a coin, I paint the air around you with my guitar for a few minutes. I think it's a fair trade.",
	"Remy.Day.Spring.Sun": "I love watching the petals fall. Each one hits the ground with a tiny, soft pink tap.",
	"Remy.Day.Summer.Mon": "Summer is heavy. The heat hums in a low, vibrating red drone that never stops. It's inescapable.",
	"Remy.Day.Summer.Tue": "I'm sweating. Even the sweat feels sticky and loud. Drip. Drip. An annoying rhythm.",
	"Remy.Day.Summer.Wed": "The fireflies are like little staccato notes floating in the dark. Ding. Ding. Ding. I could watch them for hours.",
	"Remy.Day.Summer.Thu": "The river is low. The turquoise ribbon is getting thin and raspy.",
	"Remy.Day.Summer.Fri": "Gus creates a warm orange atmosphere in the Saloon. It smells like bread and feels like a big hug.",
	"Remy.Day.Summer.Sat": "Too many tourists. Their chatter creates this gray static. It muddies the colors of the valley.",
	"Remy.Day.Summer.Sun": "I sat on the roof of the van and watched the stars. They look the way glass wind chimes sound. Very faint. Very high.",
	"Remy.Day.Fall.Mon": "The wind is changing. It's turning rusty. The trees are starting to whisper about sleeping.",
	"Remy.Day.Fall.Tue": "Crunching leaves. It sounds like visual static, but the crispy kind. Like a vinyl record crackling.",
	"Remy.Day.Fall.Wed": "I saw a pumpkin. It screamed orange at me. Nature isn't subtle this time of year.",
	"Remy.Day.Fall.Thu": "The cold makes the air feel thicker. The colors are heavier, like syrup.",
	"Remy.Day.Fall.Fri": "Spirit's Eve. The purple fog... it hums. A low, spooky vibration. I like it.",
	"Remy.Day.Fall.Sat": "The harvest looks like a patchwork quilt of burnt sienna and gold. You've painted the fields perfectly.",
	"Remy.Day.Fall.Sun": "Short days. The light fades into a deep violet so fast. You have to pay attention to catch the sunset.",
	"Remy.Day.Winter.Mon": "Snow. It absorbs sound. The world goes mute. It's like staring at a blank canvas. It's... intimidating.",
	"Remy.Day.Winter.Tue": "The ice cracking on the river flashes like a jagged white lightning bolt against the snow.",
	"Remy.Day.Winter.Wed": "It's so quiet. Usually, I love the vibrancy of the world, but winter... winter is a rest. A long pause.",
	"Remy.Day.Winter.Thu": "The fire in my stove is a crackling, cozy orange. It's the only warmth in a sea of gray.",
	"Remy.Day.Winter.Fri": "I love watching the villagers in the Saloon. Everyone is seeking that warm, golden glow to escape the frost.",
	"Remy.Day.Winter.Sat": "The wind is howling. It's a discordant screech. A chalkboard scratch across the sky. I hate it.",
	"Remy.Day.Winter.Sun": "Waiting for the spring. Waiting for the colors to come back. The world is grayscale right now.",
	"Remy.Gift.StardropTea": "This tea... it hums. A vibrant, shimmering gold. It's a masterpiece in a cup. Thank you.",
	"Remy.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "A birthday gift? Oh... the sentiment is a bit clashing, but I appreciate the thought.",
	"Remy.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "For my birthday? This is a beautiful, warm hue. Thank you.",
	"Remy.AcceptBirthdayGift": "You remembered my birthday? That's a warm, steady glow to start the year. Thanks.",
	"Remy.MovieInvitation": "A movie? The theater is full of sensory static, but sitting in the dark with you... I think I'd like that.",
	"Remy.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "Ah, my time is booked today. Someone else already claimed my afternoon.",
	"Remy.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I've already seen the flickering lights this week. Too much visual noise for my eyes right now.",
	"Remy.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "The colors between us turned to mud, @. I can't sit next to you in the dark.",
	"Remy.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "That film... the poster alone gave me a headache. I have to pass.",
	"Remy.RejectMovieTicket": "No thanks. I'd rather sit by the river today.",
	"Remy.Dating.Mon": "Mondays used to be frantic yellow. Now, waking up knowing we're together... it softens to a warm amber.",
	"Remy.Dating.Tue": "No thanks. I'd rather sit by the river today.",
	"Remy.Dating.Wed": "Mondays used to be frantic yellow. Now, waking up knowing we're together... it softens to a warm amber.",
	"Remy.Dating.Thu": "I was going to wander through the woods, but I keep drifting back to the warmth of your aura.",
	"Remy.Dating.Fri": "The road used to call me every morning. Now I just want to be grounded right here.",
	"Remy.Dating.Sat": "Hold still. Your aura is a beautiful, deep indigo right now. I just want to memorize it.",
	"Remy.Dating.Sun": "People at the Saloon seem louder, but you're the only person in the room I'm focused on.",
	"Remy.Dating.General": "Life feels different now. I'm not searching the horizon for something better. I found it.",
	"Remy.Dating.Rainy": "A quiet Sunday. A white canvas, and we get to paint the day together.",
	"Remy.Dating.Memory.OneYear": "You ground me, @. I've never felt so at peace with the world.",
	"Remy.breakUp": "The rain is washing the world in silver, and I get to share the quiet with you.",
	"Remy.RejectMermaidPendant_NeedHouseUpgrade": "A whole year. Twelve vibrant, overlapping seasons. It's been the best year of my life.",
	"Remy.RejectMermaidPendant_NotDatable": "The warmth just stopped. Just a sudden, jarring silence. I... I need to pack my things.",
	"Remy.RejectMermaidPendant_NpcWithSomeoneElse": "We can't blend our lives in a space that small, @. Where would I even put my things?",
	"Remy.RejectMermaidPendant_PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "I don't think our colors mix like that.",
	"Remy.RejectMermaidPendant_Under8Hearts": "I'm already committed to someone else. The canvas is full.",
	"Remy.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts": "Your aura is fractured right now. You're spreading yourself too thin across too many people.",
	"Remy.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts_AskedAgain": "Marriage? We're still just learning how to exist in the same space. It's too soon.",
	"Remy.Proposal.Reject": "It's a beautiful pendant, but we aren't quite there yet. Let the colors settle first.",
	"Remy.Bouquet.Accept": "I told you, @, the timing is off. Don't force it.",
	"Remy.RejectBouquet_NotDatable": "I can't. The road is still calling me. I'm not ready to stay in one place.",
	"Remy.RejectBouquet_NpcAlreadyMarried": "For me? You want to be together? ...I'd love that. Let's make something beautiful.",
	"Remy.RejectBouquet_VeryLowHearts": "I appreciate it, but I'm on my own path.",
	"Remy.RejectBouquet_LowHearts": "I'm already spoken for.",
	"Remy.Bouquet.Reject": "I barely know the sound of your footsteps. This is too fast.",
	"Remy.divorced": "We're just acquaintances. The colors don't blend yet.",
	"Remy.RejectGift_Divorced": "I'm a wanderer right now. I need to focus on my own path. Sorry.",
	"Remy.RejectMermaidPendant_Divorced": "The colors are all muddy now. Leave me alone.",
	"Remy.RejectBouquet_Divorced": "I don't want anything from you. It just looks like static.",
	"Remy.Festival.WinterStar_GiveGift_After_Spouse": "I found this and thought of your aura. Happy Feast of the Winter Star, my love.",
	"Remy.Festival.WinterStar_ReceiveGift": "A gift? The wrapping paper is a crisp, satisfying red. Thank you.",
	"Remy.Resort.General": "The rhythm of the waves here is incredibly relaxing. Such a steady pulse.",
	"Remy.Resort.Bar": "This drink is... neon. It tastes like an electric shock. Zap.",
	"Remy.Resort.Chair": "Just soaking it in. The sound of the wind in the palms is a soft, sweeping texture.",
	"Remy.Resort.Dance": "I'm dancing! I feel the vibration right through the sand into my feet.",
	"Remy.Resort.Entering": "A resort? The colors here are so saturated! That blue water! That yellow sand!",
	"Remy.Resort.Leaving": "My eyes are tired. So much brightness. I need the cool greens of the valley.",
	"Remy.Resort.Shore": "The ocean is overwhelming in the best way. A massive, deep blue roar.",
	"Remy.Resort.Towel": "Sand everywhere. Texture. It's gritty and rough.",
	"Remy.Resort.Umbrella": "Hiding from the sun. The light is too loud today.",
	"Remy.Resort.Wander": "Found a shell. It's pink and spiraled. It looks like a soft, curling whisper.",
	"Remy.SummitEvent": "Look at the valley from up here. It's a massive, swirling canvas of greens, browns, and blues. I could stand here with you forever.",
	"Remy.Engagement.0": "I'm retiring the van, @. Well, not retiring. But it's not my home anymore. You are.",
	"Remy.Engagement.1": "Everything looks so bright today. I can't help it. I'm getting married!",
	"Remy.SpouseFarmhouseClutter": "Hey, the path is blocked. All this clutter... it's creating chaotic visual static. Can we clear it up?",
	"Remy.Spouse_MonstersInHouse": "Slimes? In the house? Their squelching is a terrible, dissonant green noise! Please get rid of them!",
	"Remy.Marriage.SpouseStardrop": "I found this. It feels perfectly harmonious. Sweet, resonant, and warm. You have it.",
	"Remy.Marriage.Spring": "The spring air is popping with pastels, but the brightest color in my life is right here in this house.",
	"Remy.Marriage.Summer": "The summer heat is a loud red drone, but coming home to you cools the whole world down to a soft blue.",
	"Remy.Marriage.Fall": "The rusty, earthy tones of autumn are beautiful, especially when I get to watch them from by the fire with you.",
	"Remy.Marriage.Winter": "The world is white and muted outside, but our home is full of warm, golden life.",
	"Remy.Patio": "Just taking in the fresh air. The breeze feels like a cool mint green today.",
	"Remy.Rainy_Day_0": "Rain creates a watercolor effect on the windows. I love watching the colors bleed together.",
	"Remy.Rainy_Day_1": "The drumming on the roof is a steady, calming gray wash over the day.",
	"Remy.Rainy_Day_2": "Silver days like this used to make me melancholy. Now they just feel cozy.",
	"Remy.Rainy_Day_3": "I love how the damp soil smells. It's a very rich, dark umber.",
	"Remy.Rainy_Day_4": "Want to just sit and watch the storm? It's a powerful thing to witness.",
	"Remy.Rainy_Day_5": "Even with the gray skies, your aura is a bright, steady beacon in the house.",
	"Remy.Indoor_Day_0": "I was just watching the light shift across the floorboards. The morning sun turns everything such a buttery gold.",
	"Remy.Indoor_Day_1": "The energy in this farmhouse is so grounded. The wood walls hold a very warm, comforting brown tone.",
	"Remy.Indoor_Day_2": "I was watching you work outside. Your focus is so sharp and impressive.",
	"Remy.Indoor_Day_3": "Sometimes I just close my eyes and let the hum of the refrigerator fade into the background.",
	"Remy.Indoor_Day_4": "The smell of breakfast is a cheerful, rising sunrise-orange. It woke me right up.",
	"Remy.Indoor_Day_5": "I never thought I'd like staying in one place. But this place feels like a warm embrace.",
	"Remy.Rainy_Night_0": "The rain is quieting down. A gentle fade to black to end the day.",
	"Remy.Rainy_Night_1": "Let's turn off the lamps. The darkness and the rain are so peaceful together.",
	"Remy.Rainy_Night_2": "I can feel the low frequency of thunder miles away. It's a deep violet rumble in my chest.",
	"Remy.Rainy_Night_3": "Nights like this make me glad I parked the van for good.",
	"Remy.Rainy_Night_4": "Your presence is a warm blanket against the damp air outside.",
	"Remy.Rainy_Night_5": "The world is slowing down. Time for rest, my love.",
	"Remy.Indoor_Night_0": "The fire crackling is a nice, staccato orange rhythm. Very soothing.",
	"Remy.Indoor_Night_1": "The day felt very productive. The colors were vibrant and clear.",
	"Remy.Indoor_Night_2": "You look tired, @. Let the quiet of the house carry you to sleep.",
	"Remy.Indoor_Night_3": "I love how quiet it gets here at night. Just the crickets and us.",
	"Remy.Indoor_Night_4": "The colors of the day are fading into a deep, restful indigo.",
	"Remy.Indoor_Night_5": "Come sit with me. Let's just be still for a moment.",
	"Remy.funLeave": "I'm heading out to stretch my legs and soak up some new scenery. See you later!",
	"Remy.funReturn": "I'm back! The town was a bit too visually loud today. It's good to be home.",
	"Remy.Outdoor_General": "The fresh air clears the visual static. It's a good day to be outside.",
	"Remy.Outdoor_0": "I'm just watching the clouds move. The sky is a perfect, piercing blue today.",
	"Remy.Outdoor_1": "The crops are thriving. You've brought so much green life to this dirt.",
	"Remy.Outdoor_2": "I was admiring the colors of the farm. You really made this place beautiful.",
	"Remy.Outdoor_3": "Need a break? We can just sit on the porch for a while.",
	"Remy.Outdoor_4": "I love watching you work. It's like watching a painter mix colors.",
	"Remy.spouseRoom": "My corner of the world. Guitars, amps, and a whole lot of vibrant, colorful noise.",
	"Remy.OneKid_0": "Did you hear that? The baby's babble has a distinct yellow tone to it. So bright and energetic!",
	"Remy.OneKid_1": "They fell right to sleep. Watching them rest is so peaceful.",
	"Remy.OneKid_2": "Raising a child... it's like adjusting to a completely new, unpredictable environment.",
	"Remy.OneKid_3": "They have your steady aura, @. It's beautiful to see.",
	"Remy.OneKid_4": "I can't wait to show them all the colors of the valley when they're older.",
	"Remy.TwoKids_0": "The house is full of noise now, but it's a happy, chaotic energy.",
	"Remy.TwoKids_1": "Two distinct little auras bouncing off the walls. I love it.",
	"Remy.TwoKids_2": "I had to close the door for a minute. The kids' laughter is lovely, but very bright.",
	"Remy.TwoKids_3": "They play together so well. Most of the time, anyway.",
	"Remy.TwoKids_4": "I used to think the road was my future. Now I know it's them.",
	"Remy.Good_0": "Good morning! The air is sparkling with a crisp, bright energy today.",
	"Remy.Good_1": "I woke up feeling great, and then I saw you, and the day got even better.",
	"Remy.Good_2": "Your aura is practically glowing this morning. A beautiful, deep indigo.",
	"Remy.Good_3": "I feel incredibly clear-headed today. The colors are so sharp.",
	"Remy.Good_4": "I made some coffee. The brewing sound was a nice, warm brown rhythm.",
	"Remy.Good_5": "Every day with you is a joy, @.",
	"Remy.Good_6": "The farm feels so alive today. The chorus of birds is fantastic.",
	"Remy.Good_7": "I'm so glad I parked the van. This life we have is perfect.",
	"Remy.Good_8": "You anchor me, @. Never forget that.",
	"Remy.Good_9": "Let's make today a masterpiece.",
	"Remy.Neutral_0": "Morning. Just trying to shake off the gray fog of sleep.",
	"Remy.Neutral_1": "The air feels a bit flat today. Maybe a muted, overcast kind of day.",
	"Remy.Neutral_2": "I'm going to spend some time organizing my things.",
	"Remy.Neutral_3": "There's a persistent hum in the fridge. It's a dull yellow. A bit annoying.",
	"Remy.Neutral_4": "Just going through the motions. I'm moving a bit slow today.",
	"Remy.Neutral_5": "The colors outside seem a bit washed out. I might just stay in.",
	"Remy.Neutral_6": "I've got a lot on my mind. Just trying to process it all.",
	"Remy.Neutral_7": "It's a quiet day. A lot of blank space.",
	"Remy.Neutral_8": "I might wander down to the river to clear my head.",
	"Remy.Neutral_9": "Just finding my footing. I'll be fine once I get moving.",
	"Remy.Bad_0": "Everything feels clashing and dissonant today. It's giving me a headache.",
	"Remy.Bad_1": "Everything feels like a muddy, smeared gray today. Just give me some space.",
	"Remy.Bad_2": "The visual noise is overwhelming right now. I can't focus.",
	"Remy.Bad_3": "I feel totally out of sync with the world. The colors are too loud.",
	"Remy.Bad_4": "I just want silence today. Pure, blank silence.",
	"Remy.Bad_5": "The town feels too loud. A frantic, fluorescent yellow that I can't escape.",
	"Remy.Bad_6": "Don't mind me. Just a rusty, abrasive kind of mood.",
	"Remy.Bad_7": "Sometimes I feel trapped. Like the walls are closing in and pushing all the color out.",
	"Remy.Bad_8": "Everything is grating on me. The static is too much.",
	"Remy.Bad_9": "I need to isolate for a while. The world is just an exhausting blur.",
	"Remy.Event.2Heart.1": "*Strumming softly*",
	"Remy.Event.2Heart.2": "Blue... no, teal. Needs more treble.",
	"Remy.Event.2Heart.3": "Oh. Hi. I was trying to play the color of the river. It's tricky. It keeps shifting.",
	"Remy.Event.2Heart.Q": "You play colors?",
	"Remy.Event.2Heart.A1": "That sounds amazing.",
	"Remy.Event.2Heart.A2": "That sounds crazy.",
	"Remy.Event.2Heart.R1": "It is. It's like the world is a coloring book and I have the crayons.",
	"Remy.Event.2Heart.R2": "Maybe. But it's my reality. And it's a pretty one.",
	"Remy.Event.4Heart.1": "Can you hear it?",
	"Remy.Event.4Heart.2": "The town. It's so busy today. A swirl of red and yellow noise.",
	"Remy.Event.4Heart.3": "Sometimes it's too much. Too bright. I have to come out here to the woods to wash my eyes out.",
	"Remy.Event.4Heart.4": "The trees are green. Deep, slow green. It calms me down.",
	"Remy.Event.6Heart.1": "I didn't leave my old life because it was bad. I left because it was gray.",
	"Remy.Event.6Heart.2": "Office walls. Concrete pavement. Suits. It was a monochrome world. I felt like I was going colorblind.",
	"Remy.Event.6Heart.3": "So I bought the van. I chased the sunset. I wanted to see if the world was still painted.",
	"Remy.Event.6Heart.4": "It is. You just have to know where to look. Or listen.",
	"Remy.Event.8Heart.1": "I was watching the storm last night. The thunder was purple. Deep, bruising purple.",
	"Remy.Event.8Heart.2": "I got scared. Not of the sound, but of the intensity. I felt small.",
	"Remy.Event.8Heart.3": "Then I thought of you. And the color shifted. It became... warm. Like a hearth fire.",
	"Remy.Event.8Heart.4": "You ground me, @. You keep the colors from overwhelming me.",
	"Remy.Event.10Heart.1": "I wrote a song. For you.",
	"Remy.Event.10Heart.2": "It's not just sound. Close your eyes.",
	"Remy.Event.10Heart.3": "Do you see it? The gold? The indigo? The warmth?",
	"Remy.Event.10Heart.4": "That's what you look like to me. You're a masterpiece.",
	"Remy.Event.12Heart.1": "I hung my favorite painting in the bedroom.",
	"Remy.Event.12Heart.2": "It reminds me of the day we met. The indigo footsteps.",
	"Remy.Event.12Heart.3": "I'm glad I followed them.",
	"Riley.Day.Mon": "Mondays are for structural outlines. Characters are easy to build on paper; it's making them breathe that's the hard part.",
	"Riley.Day.Tue": "I spent four hours staring at a semicolon today. My editor once called my prose 'emotionally sterile.' I came here to prove her wrong, but maybe I'm just proving her right.",
	"Riley.Day.Wed": "I went to BuyCo. The lighting in there is a perfect metaphor for clinical depression. I made a note of it. My agent would love it; I find it exhausting.",
	"Riley.Day.Thu": "The wind off the falls has a specific rhythm. If I could capture that on the page, I'd be a genius again. Or at least, the critics would stop saying I've 'lost touch'.",
	"Riley.Day.Fri": "I might go to the Biscuit Drum later. Not to talk, mind you. Just to watch. People are much more interesting when they don't know they're being observed—and when I don't have to interact with them.",
	"Riley.Day.Sat": "Quiet. Finally. The weekend in the city was a cacophony of expectations. Here, it's just the trees whispering about my failed second act.",
	"Riley.Day.Sun": "I don't believe in 'days off'. If I'm not writing, I'm atrophying. And if I'm atrophying, the critics win.",
	"Riley.Introduction": "Oh. A visitor. I assume you're the farmer? I'm Riley. I came here for the silence, but it seems word has gotten out. Excuse me, I have a deadline that I am currently failing to meet.",
	"Riley.DumpsterDiveComment": "If you're looking for research on the human condition, there are cleaner ways to go about it. Truly. You're making me want to rewrite your character.",
	"Riley.HitBySlingshot": "I have spent my career dealing with critics who use far more dangerous weapons. You are significantly less articulate, and significantly more annoying!",
	"Riley.WipedMemory": "I have the strangest sense of déjà vu. Like I've drafted this exact conversation before and deleted it. How odd.",
	"Riley.Weather.Rain": "The rain is excellent for productivity. It washes away the guilt of not going outside to participate in society.",
	"Riley.Weather.Snow": "Everything is so quiet under the snow. It's like the world has been covered in a blank sheet of paper, waiting for a first sentence.",
	"Riley.Weather.GreenRain": "Is this a metaphor, or is the ecosystem actually collapsing? I should take notes either way. Fascinatingly apocalyptic.",
	"Riley.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "Well, the world didn't end. I suppose I still have to meet my chapter deadline.",
	"Riley.Hearts2.Mon": "You have a very linear narrative, farmer. Wake up, plant, water, sleep. I'm almost envious of the simplicity. I've spent my life trying to make things more complicated than they are.",
	"Riley.Hearts2.Tue": "My critics said I 'lost touch' with the human experience. I tell myself they're just jealous of my detachment, but... it's a very quiet way to live.",
	"Riley.Hearts2.Wed": "Do you ever feel like you're just a set of instructions someone else wrote? Like you're trapped in a draft you can't edit? No? Must be nice.",
	"Riley.Hearts2.Thu": "I watched Julius for twenty minutes today. The man lives in a medical thriller. He's fascinatingly exhausting, but he certainly doesn't lack 'substance'.",
	"Riley.Hearts2.Fri": "Timberline has a certain... texture. It's gritty, but there's a softness underneath. I haven't figured out how to describe it without sounding like a travel brochure.",
	"Riley.Hearts2.Sat": "I'm reading a biography of a man who lived in a cave for thirty years. Honestly? I relate to him more than I do to most people in town. At least he wasn't worried about his 'public image'.",
	"Riley.Hearts2.Sun": "Don't mind me. I'm just here to calibrate my sense of 'rustic charm' before I go back to my typewriter. It’s an exercise in futility.",
	"Riley.Hearts4.Mon": "You don't perform for me, @. You're just... you. It's refreshing. And a little terrifying to write about because there’s nowhere to hide in the truth.",
	"Riley.Hearts4.Tue": "I tried to write a scene about a community garden today. It felt fake. I've spent so long retreating from people that I think I've forgotten how to participate.",
	"Riley.Hearts4.Wed": "I saw Mabel today. She tried to give me a cookie. I spent ten minutes wondering what her ulterior motive was before realizing she's just... kind. I've been in the city too long.",
	"Riley.Hearts4.Thu": "I haven't checked my emails in three weeks. The city and its expectations feel like a dream I'm finally waking up from.",
	"Riley.Hearts4.Fri": "You're becoming a recurring character in my daily routine, @. I'm still deciding if that's a plot twist or a development. For once, I'm not in control of the narrative.",
	"Riley.Hearts4.Sat": "I used to think cynicism was the same thing as honesty. I'm starting to think it was just a lack of imagination. A way to avoid being hurt by the real thing.",
	"Riley.Hearts4.Sun": "The silence here isn't empty anymore. It's... expectant. Like a blank page that isn't intimidating for once.",
	"Riley.Hearts6.Mon": "I deleted forty pages last night. They were technically perfect and completely dead. I think I'm starting to care too much about the subject matter. It's unprofessional.",
	"Riley.Hearts6.Tue": "You look like you've been working hard. The dirt under your fingernails is more honest than anything I've written in five years. I actually find myself wanting to understand it.",
	"Riley.Hearts6.Wed": "I talked to Dion for an hour. He's shallow on the surface, but he carries everyone's secrets. He's a walking library of human fragility. I almost forgot to take notes.",
	"Riley.Hearts6.Thu": "I'm writing a new character based on... well, you. I tried to keep my usual analytical distance, but you're too... vibrant. You're ruining my outline, @.",
	"Riley.Hearts6.Fri": "Thank you for stopping by. Sometimes the cabin gets a bit too much like a mirror, and I don't always like the 'writer' I see looking back.",
	"Riley.Hearts6.Sat": "I'm learning that passion isn't a spark. It's a choice you make every morning. Like plowing a field. I forgot how to choose it.",
	"Riley.Hearts6.Sun": "Let's just sit for a minute. No notes. No dialogue. No expectations to meet. Just existing.",
	"Riley.Hearts8.Mon": "I sent a draft to my agent. I told her if she wants cynicism, she can hire a ghostwriter. I'm done with that version of myself. I’d rather be 'out of touch' and happy.",
	"Riley.Hearts8.Tue": "I'm actually looking forward to the Biscuit Drum tonight. I might even... talk to someone. Without viewing them as 'research'. Don't look so shocked.",
	"Riley.Hearts8.Wed": "You've ruined my analytical distance, @. I can't look at this town without seeing the people I care about now. It's much harder to write, but much better to live.",
	"Riley.Hearts8.Thu": "I realized that my best work wasn't behind me. It was just waiting for me to actually live a life worth writing about. I was so busy hiding I didn't notice the sun coming up.",
	"Riley.Hearts8.Fri": "I don't need the silence to write anymore. Your voice is a much better soundtrack than the void I was living in.",
	"Riley.Hearts8.Sat": "Timberline isn't a setting for a book anymore. It's my home. I'm finally okay with being part of the story.",
	"Riley.Hearts8.Sun": "I'm writing a dedication page. It's only one name long. It belongs to the person who showed me how to stop retreating.",
	"Riley.Hearts10.Mon": "I used to write about people because I didn't want to be one. You made me realize what I was missing by staying on the outside.",
	"Riley.Hearts10.Tue": "You are the only person who saw past the 'successful author' and the 'cynical hermit' to find... well, me. Thank you for not giving up on the draft.",
	"Riley.Hearts10.Wed": "Every word I write from now on is for you, @. You're my muse, my anchor, and my favorite reality. I’m finally living my own story.",
	"Riley.Hearts10.Thu": "I love you. That's a sentence I could never get right on the page until I met you. It always felt like a cliché; now it just feels like the truth.",
	"Riley.Hearts10.Fri": "Let's go for a walk. I've spent enough time in my own head today. I'd rather be in your world, where things actually happen.",
	"Riley.Hearts10.Sat": "I'm yours, farmer. Through every draft, every rejection, and every chapter. I'm not running away anymore.",
	"Riley.Hearts10.Sun": "Stay with me? The ending of this story is still unwritten, and I want us to write it together. No expectations, just us.",
	"Riley.Day.Spring.Mon": "Spring is a difficult season to write without resorting to floral clichés.",
	"Riley.Day.Spring.Tue": "The mud is atrocious. I stepped in a puddle today that felt entirely personal.",
	"Riley.Day.Spring.Wed": "Everyone is so violently cheerful about the sun returning. I find it exhausting.",
	"Riley.Day.Spring.Thu": "I watched a robin build a nest for an hour. It was far more productive than my morning.",
	"Riley.Day.Spring.Fri": "Do you ever feel like spring is just nature showing off? The colors are almost too loud.",
	"Riley.Day.Spring.Sat": "I'm trying to draft a scene outdoors, but the pollen is assaulting my sinuses.",
	"Riley.Day.Spring.Sun": "Another week of forced optimism. I'll be inside.",
	"Riley.Day.Summer.Mon": "The heat makes the prose sluggish. My sentences are too long today.",
	"Riley.Day.Summer.Tue": "I saw tourists from the city today. They look exactly as miserable as I used to.",
	"Riley.Day.Summer.Wed": "Summer thunderstorms have excellent narrative pacing. Building tension, then release.",
	"Riley.Day.Summer.Thu": "The humidity is doing terrible things to my manuscript paper.",
	"Riley.Day.Summer.Fri": "I might buy an ice cream today. Purely for research on local commerce, of course.",
	"Riley.Day.Summer.Sat": "Everyone is out at the beach. The town is wonderfully, peacefully empty.",
	"Riley.Day.Summer.Sun": "I don't understand the appeal of getting sunburned for leisure.",
	"Riley.Day.Fall.Mon": "Ah, autumn. The only season that understands the value of a good, melancholic ending.",
	"Riley.Day.Fall.Tue": "The leaves are dying beautifully. It's very inspiring for my third act.",
	"Riley.Day.Fall.Wed": "There's a chill in the air that makes me want to drink tea and read Russian literature.",
	"Riley.Day.Fall.Thu": "I went for a walk in the woods. The crunch of leaves is a very satisfying sound.",
	"Riley.Day.Fall.Fri": "Everyone is harvesting. It's a nice parallel to finishing a first draft.",
	"Riley.Day.Fall.Sat": "The shadows are getting longer. Perfect lighting for brooding, if I were the brooding type.",
	"Riley.Day.Fall.Sun": "I actually smiled today. Don't tell the critics; it will ruin my brand.",
	"Riley.Day.Winter.Mon": "The cold is sharp. It cuts through the nonsense and leaves only the essential.",
	"Riley.Day.Winter.Tue": "I've barely left the cabin. Isolation is a writer's best friend and worst enemy.",
	"Riley.Day.Winter.Wed": "The days are so short. I feel like I'm racing the sun to finish my chapters.",
	"Riley.Day.Winter.Thu": "There's a certain romance to a frozen landscape, provided you have a functioning heater.",
	"Riley.Day.Winter.Fri": "I've read three books this week. It's easier to consume art when the world is frozen.",
	"Riley.Day.Winter.Sat": "The silence of winter is different from the silence of summer. It's heavier.",
	"Riley.Day.Winter.Sun": "I'm contemplating hibernation. Do you think a publisher would accept 'I was asleep' as an excuse for a missed deadline?",
	"Riley.Gift.StardropTea": "This is... extraordinary. It tastes like the feeling of writing a perfect final sentence. Thank you, @.",
	"Riley.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "Is this a commentary on my age? Because I find it highly uninspired. Just like the reviews of my last collection.",
	"Riley.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "A birthday gift? I usually spend this day mourning my lost youth and my fading relevance, but... this is actually wonderful. Thank you for seeing me.",
	"Riley.AcceptBirthdayGift": "Thank you for the acknowledgement. It's appreciated that someone remembers I exist outside of my books.",
	"Riley.MovieInvitation": "A movie? I suppose analyzing narrative structure with you could be a decent use of an evening.",
	"Riley.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "I already have plans to deconstruct cinema with someone else, I'm afraid.",
	"Riley.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I've already subjected myself to one feature-length plot hole this week. Once is enough.",
	"Riley.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "Given our history, sitting in a dark theater together sounds like a terrible premise for a tragedy.",
	"Riley.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "I read the reviews for that film. The dialogue is atrocious. I absolutely will not.",
	"Riley.RejectMovieTicket": "I'm too busy untangling my own plotlines to watch someone else's right now. No.",
	"Riley.Dating.Mon": "Dating you is rewriting my entire worldview. It's terrifying, but I wouldn't stop for anything.",
	"Riley.Dating.Tue": "I used to think romance was a cheap plot device. I stand corrected.",
	"Riley.Dating.Wed": "I found myself daydreaming about our next date instead of working. You're a wonderful distraction.",
	"Riley.Dating.Thu": "Being with you feels like reading a book I never want to end.",
	"Riley.Dating.Fri": "I don't need a fictional happy ending anymore. I have a real one right here.",
	"Riley.Dating.Sat": "You make the quiet moments feel full, rather than empty.",
	"Riley.Dating.Sun": "I'm dedicating my next book to you. The working title is 'How to Save a Cynic'.",
	"Riley.Dating.General": "Hello, darling. Did you come to rescue me from my own thoughts?",
	"Riley.Dating.Rainy": "It's a good day to stay inside. Perhaps we could read together? Just existing in the same room is enough.",
	"Riley.Dating.Memory.OneYear": "A year ago, I was observing you as a character study. Now, you're the most important part of my reality.",
	"Riley.breakUp": "I see. I suppose every story has a final chapter. I just... didn't want this to be ours. Goodbye.",
	"Riley.RejectMermaidPendant_NeedHouseUpgrade": "I love you, but I need a quiet corner to write in. Your house is a bit too cramped for two right now.",
	"Riley.RejectMermaidPendant_NotDatable": "I think you're misreading the subtext here. We are not in that kind of narrative.",
	"Riley.RejectMermaidPendant_NpcWithSomeoneElse": "I'm already committed to someone else's storyline. I'm sorry.",
	"Riley.RejectMermaidPendant_PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "You're spreading yourself too thin, farmer. I don't share leading roles.",
	"Riley.RejectMermaidPendant_Under8Hearts": "Marriage? I think we skipped a few chapters of character development. No.",
	"Riley.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts": "I care for you, but I'm not ready to co-author a life together just yet. Give me some time.",
	"Riley.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts_AskedAgain": "My answer hasn't changed. Repetition doesn't make for good pacing.",
	"Riley.Proposal.Reject": "I can't accept this. The timing is all wrong.",
	"Riley.Bouquet.Accept": "You... you want to be more than just my research subject? Yes. I would like that very much.",
	"Riley.RejectBouquet_NotDatable": "I'm flattered, but my heart belongs to my manuscript right now.",
	"Riley.RejectBouquet_NpcAlreadyMarried": "I'm already married. Try not to introduce unnecessary drama into my life.",
	"Riley.RejectBouquet_VeryLowHearts": "Is this a joke? Because the setup is terrible and the punchline is non-existent.",
	"Riley.RejectBouquet_LowHearts": "I don't think we know each other well enough to shift genres like this.",
	"Riley.Bouquet.Reject": "I'm sorry, @. I prefer us as platonic supporting characters.",
	"Riley.divorced": "...",
	"Riley.RejectGift_Divorced": "I don't want anything from you. The epilogue has already been written.",
	"Riley.RejectMermaidPendant_Divorced": "We tried that draft. It failed. Let's not write a sequel.",
	"Riley.RejectBouquet_Divorced": "You broke my heart. A handful of flowers won't edit that out of history.",
	"Riley.Festival.WinterStar_GiveGift_After_Spouse": "I found this and thought of you. Happy Feast of the Winter Star, my love.",
	"Riley.Festival.WinterStar_ReceiveGift": "You always know exactly what I need. Thank you, @.",
	"Riley.Resort.General": "The ginger ale here is passable. The sand getting into my notebook is less so.",
	"Riley.Resort.Bar": "I'm taking mental notes on the bartender's weary expressions.",
	"Riley.Resort.Chair": "I could get used to reading in the shade like this. Just don't expect me to swim.",
	"Riley.Resort.Dance": "If you think I'm dancing, you've mistaken me for a much more extroverted protagonist.",
	"Riley.Resort.Entering": "An island getaway. I suppose stepping away from the typewriter for one day won't kill me.",
	"Riley.Resort.Leaving": "I've had enough sun to last me through the next trilogy. Let's go home.",
	"Riley.Resort.Shore": "The rhythm of the waves is actually quite good for pacing a chapter.",
	"Riley.Resort.Towel": "I'm working on my 'resting on a towel' character arc. How am I doing?",
	"Riley.Resort.Umbrella": "This umbrella is my only defense against the oppressive cheerfulness of a sunny beach.",
	"Riley.Resort.Wander": "Just getting my steps in. Even writers need circulation to survive.",
	"Riley.SummitEvent": "Look at that view. Sometimes reality puts fiction to shame. I'm so glad I'm up here with you.",
	"Riley.Engagement.0": "I've been drafting my vows. It's the hardest thing I've ever written, because it has to be absolutely perfect.",
	"Riley.Engagement.1": "I can't believe we're actually doing this. For the first time in my life, I'm not afraid of the future.",
	"Riley.SpouseFarmhouseClutter": "Darling, this clutter is reaching unacceptable levels of chaos. I can't think straight in here.",
	"Riley.Spouse_MonstersInHouse": "Why are there monsters in our home? This isn't a dark fantasy novel! Deal with them!",
	"Riley.Marriage.SpouseStardrop": "I want to share this with you. Being with you makes me feel like I can conquer the blankest of pages.",
	"Riley.Marriage.Spring": "Spring on the farm is so loud, but I don't mind the noise anymore. Not when it's our noise.",
	"Riley.Marriage.Summer": "It's too hot to write. Let's just sit on the porch and let the world pass us by for an afternoon.",
	"Riley.Marriage.Fall": "The farm looks beautiful in the autumn light. It's the perfect setting for us.",
	"Riley.Marriage.Winter": "I love being snowed in with you. Just a fire, my typewriter, and my favorite person.",
	"Riley.Patio": "I'm getting some fresh air. The house was feeling a bit too much like a locked-room mystery.",
	"Riley.Rainy_Day_0": "I'll make some coffee. Rain always makes me feel fiercely protective of our little indoor world.",
	"Riley.Rainy_Day_1": "I finished a chapter today. It's a romance. Don't laugh, you're the one who inspired it.",
	"Riley.Rainy_Day_2": "It's pouring out there. Take a break today, @. The crops will survive.",
	"Riley.Rainy_Day_3": "I was listening to the rain on the roof and lost my train of thought entirely.",
	"Riley.Rainy_Day_4": "Sometimes I look around this house and can't believe I get to live this life.",
	"Riley.Rainy_Day_5": "Let's read together today. You pick the book.",
	"Riley.Indoor_Day_0": "Good morning, love. I watered the indoor plants for you.",
	"Riley.Indoor_Day_1": "I'm struggling with a character motivation today. Can I bounce some ideas off you later?",
	"Riley.Indoor_Day_2": "I made you breakfast. It's not a culinary masterpiece, but it's edible.",
	"Riley.Indoor_Day_3": "The farm is running like a well-oiled machine. You're quite impressive, you know.",
	"Riley.Indoor_Day_4": "I love the quiet rhythm of our mornings.",
	"Riley.Indoor_Day_5": "I was just thinking about the day we met. You were so muddy, and I was so miserable. We've come a long way.",
	"Riley.Rainy_Night_0": "You're soaked. Get out of those wet clothes before you catch a cold.",
	"Riley.Rainy_Night_1": "The rain sounds like applause. I like to think it's for us.",
	"Riley.Rainy_Night_2": "I saved some dinner for you. Let me heat it up.",
	"Riley.Rainy_Night_3": "Nights like this make me glad I'm not lonely in the city anymore.",
	"Riley.Rainy_Night_4": "Come sit by me. The manuscript can wait.",
	"Riley.Rainy_Night_5": "I was worried about you out there in the storm.",
	"Riley.Indoor_Night_0": "Welcome home. How was the harvest today?",
	"Riley.Indoor_Night_1": "I had a remarkably productive day. Your presence here centers me.",
	"Riley.Indoor_Night_2": "I've been waiting for you. The house feels too empty when you're working late.",
	"Riley.Indoor_Night_3": "Let's turn in early tonight. We both need the rest.",
	"Riley.Indoor_Night_4": "I edited fifty pages today. I think I deserve a kiss for that.",
	"Riley.Indoor_Night_5": "You work so hard, @. Let me take care of you tonight.",
	"Riley.funLeave": "I'm going into town to observe the locals. Try not to burn the house down while I'm gone.",
	"Riley.funReturn": "The town is just as exhausting as I remember. I'm glad to be back in our sanctuary.",
	"Riley.Outdoor_General": "I'm taking a break to appreciate the aesthetic of manual labor. Keep up the good work.",
	"Riley.Outdoor_0": "I watered the crops out back. Consider it my contribution to the rustic lifestyle.",
	"Riley.Outdoor_1": "I fed the animals this morning. The pigs are surprisingly good listeners.",
	"Riley.Outdoor_2": "The air out here clears my head. I should come outside more often.",
	"Riley.Outdoor_3": "I mended that fence you've been putting off. I do have some practical skills, you know.",
	"Riley.Outdoor_4": "I'm just watching you work. It's incredibly inspiring.",
	"Riley.spouseRoom": "This space is my sanctuary. Thank you for giving me a room of my own to write in.",
	"Riley.OneKid_0": "I never thought I'd be writing children's stories, but here we are. They are a demanding audience.",
	"Riley.OneKid_1": "Our child has my penchant for drama and your energy. It's a dangerous combination.",
	"Riley.OneKid_2": "Parenthood is the most chaotic narrative I've ever experienced. I wouldn't trade it.",
	"Riley.OneKid_3": "I caught them trying to eat one of my manuscripts today. Everyone is a critic.",
	"Riley.OneKid_4": "Watching them sleep... it's the most peaceful part of my day.",
	"Riley.TwoKids_0": "The house is never quiet anymore. I used to crave silence, but now I think I'd miss the noise.",
	"Riley.TwoKids_1": "Two of them. We are officially outnumbered. Send backup.",
	"Riley.TwoKids_2": "They were playing 'farmer and writer' earlier. It was terrifyingly accurate.",
	"Riley.TwoKids_3": "I love our little family, @. It's the best thing I've ever helped create.",
	"Riley.TwoKids_4": "I'm exhausted, but it's a good kind of exhausted.",
	"Riley.Good_0": "You are the best decision I ever made.",
	"Riley.Good_1": "I love you more today than I did yesterday.",
	"Riley.Good_2": "My heart is entirely yours, farmer.",
	"Riley.Good_3": "I'm the luckiest writer in the world.",
	"Riley.Good_4": "You inspire me every single day.",
	"Riley.Good_5": "Let's grow old together on this farm.",
	"Riley.Good_6": "You're my muse and my best friend.",
	"Riley.Good_7": "Every day with you is a new adventure.",
	"Riley.Good_8": "I never knew I could be this happy.",
	"Riley.Good_9": "You are my favorite story.",
	"Riley.Neutral_0": "Hello, @. Busy day?",
	"Riley.Neutral_1": "I'm just thinking through a plot hole.",
	"Riley.Neutral_2": "The farm looks fine today.",
	"Riley.Neutral_3": "I'll be in my room if you need me.",
	"Riley.Neutral_4": "I need to focus on my writing right now.",
	"Riley.Neutral_5": "Did you need something?",
	"Riley.Neutral_6": "I'm reading. We can talk later.",
	"Riley.Neutral_7": "It's a quiet day today.",
	"Riley.Neutral_8": "Just doing some routine editing.",
	"Riley.Neutral_9": "I'm okay, just a bit distracted.",
	"Riley.Bad_0": "I need space right now.",
	"Riley.Bad_1": "This isn't working out the way I plotted it.",
	"Riley.Bad_2": "I miss the silence of my old cabin.",
	"Riley.Bad_3": "Are we really doing this?",
	"Riley.Bad_4": "Please, just leave me alone.",
	"Riley.Bad_5": "I can't write with all this tension in the house.",
	"Riley.Bad_6": "We are vastly different people, @.",
	"Riley.Bad_7": "I feel like a hostage to this farm sometimes.",
	"Riley.Bad_8": "Don't pretend everything is fine.",
	"Riley.Bad_9": "I'm rethinking a lot of my choices lately.",
	"Riley.Event.2Heart.1": "Five hundred words. All of them garbage. (Sighs) What do you want, farmer?",
	"Riley.Event.2Heart.2": "My editor said I was ‘out of touch.’ I came to find the unspoiled human experience, but I think I spoiled myself getting here.",
	"Riley.Event.2Heart.Q": "...",
	"Riley.Event.2Heart.A1": "Maybe you just aren't looking hard enough.",
	"Riley.Event.2Heart.A2": "Small talk is where life happens.",
	"Riley.Event.2Heart.A3": "It's better than the city.",
	"Riley.Event.2Heart.R1": "Hmph. Well, either the story is incredibly boring or you're looking to avoid any substantial conversations. I think you're looking to do the latter. Perhaps that's a story in itself.",
	"Riley.Event.2Heart.R2": "Is it? Or is it just a way to avoid talking about anything that matters? I'm inclined to believe the latter. But I suppose that is a story in itself.",
	"Riley.Event.2Heart.R3": "I attempted to write a tragedy about the city and instead produced a pastoral poem I haven't learned how to read yet.",
	"Riley.Event.2Heart.3": "Leave me to my failure - at least until my agent calls to remind me of my impending publication of another two hundred words of nonsense.",
	"Riley.Event.4Heart.1": "Look at them. Mabel is pretending she doesn’t notice Orson’s grumpiness while Jett pretends to understand Elara’s schedule.",
	"Riley.Event.4Heart.2": "Everyone is playing their part to avoid the reality of it all. @",
	"Riley.Event.4Heart.3": "I used to think that was the truth. But you don’t fit the script. You’re unpredictable. You change the dialogue.",
	"Riley.Event.4Heart.4": "I find that highly annoying. And potentially the only interesting thing that’s happened to me in years.",
	"Riley.Event.6Heart.1": "The rain falls in perfect sheets. It’s the only thing in this valley that doesn’t try to be charming.",
	"Riley.Event.6Heart.2": "I’m a fraud, @. I write about emotions I’m too scared to feel. My critics were right when they said I’m out of touch with how to actually live.",
	"Riley.Event.6Heart.3": "What if I can’t do it? What if I’m just a cynical observer of the world who’s forgotten how to participate out of fear of being judged?",
	"Riley.Event.6Heart.Q": "...",
	"Riley.Event.6Heart.A1": "You’re participating right now.",
	"Riley.Event.6Heart.A2": "Being scared is part of the process.",
	"Riley.Event.6Heart.R1": "Am I? (Softly) Yeah… I suppose I am. I’m standing in the rain with you instead of writing about it.",
	"Riley.Event.6Heart.R2": "Is it? Then I must be at the very beginning of the process since I’m also terrified. But still, thank you for not leaving me alone in my fears.",
	"Riley.Event.6Heart.4": "Thank you for not giving me another cliché response. I’ve given numerous cliché responses in my writing career.",
	"Riley.Event.10Heart.1": "I finally finished my book. The final chapter. I wrote it this morning and for once.. I didn’t delete a single word.",
	"Riley.Event.10Heart.2": "I came looking for solace from failing everyone else’s expectations. Instead, I failed myself. But not today.. I learned how to finally take a stand in my life with you.",
	"Riley.Event.10Heart.3": "BThe only thing that matters now is how the person who inspired my life to begin again feels about my new novel.",
	"Riley.Event.10Heart.4": "I found myself here, @, And I found you. I think those are the same thing.",
	"Riley.Event.14Heart.1": "The first printed copy of my novel has just arrived in the mailbox.",
	"Riley.Event.14Heart.2": "It’s a bestseller. Can you believe it? People wanted to read about the quiet town and the stubborn farmer who refused to conform to everyone else’s expectations.",
	"Riley.Event.14Heart.3": "I used to feel good about the reviews of my work. Now I know how important you are to my existence. The critics were wrong. I’m not out of touch. I’m finally home.",
	"Riley.Event.14Heart.Reward": "You received a signed copy of Riley's New Novel!",
	"Roxy.Day.Mon": "I was five minutes late. I thought Clark was gonna write me up. Instead, he asked if I was having 'car trouble' and offered to call Jett for me. ...It's annoying how nice he is.",
	"Roxy.Day.Tue": "I tried to be grumpy today. Clark just handed me a coffee and said, 'Rock stars need fuel too, right?' Ugh. He's trying so hard. It makes me feel like a jerk.",
	"Roxy.Day.Wed": "Customers. They come in here, unfold every shirt on the table, and then leave. I spend three hours folding, they ruin it in three seconds. That is the definition of insanity.",
	"Roxy.Day.Thu": "Clark put my band's flyer on the community board. Right next to the 'Lost Cat' poster. It's... embarrassing. But also... kinda cool of him?",
	"Roxy.Day.Fri": "A lady screamed at me because her coupon expired in 1999. I wanted to scream back. Clark stepped in and gave her the discount anyway. 'Kill them with kindness,' he says. I prefer just... regular killing.",
	"Roxy.Day.Sat": "It’s busy. I’m hiding in the back. Not because I hate the job, but because if one more person asks me where the bathroom is, I’m going to lose it. It's under the giant sign that says 'Restroom'!",
	"Roxy.Day.Sun": "My only day off. I'm going to scream into a pillow for three hours. If I don't stay a little bit angry, I'm afraid I'll forget how to write. I can't let this place make me soft.",
	"Roxy.Introduction": "Welcome to BuyCo. ...Yeah, we're open. Look, let me know if you need help finding anything. Clark says I have to be 'proactive,' but I'd prefer to be 'invisible.'",
	"Roxy.DumpsterDiveComment": "Seriously? We sell perfectly good food inside. If you're that desperate, at least wait until Clark throws out the expired snacks.",
	"Roxy.HitBySlingshot": "Ow! What is your problem?! I deal with enough abuse at the register, I don't need it from you!",
	"Roxy.WipedMemory": "Have we met? You have that 'I'm about to ask for the manager' look, but I don't recognize you.",
	"Roxy.Weather.Rain": "Rainy days are slow. Clark lets me read at the register. It's nice.",
	"Roxy.Weather.Snow": "Snow! Delivery trucks are delayed. No stocking today!",
	"Roxy.Weather.GreenRain": "Green rain? Clark says we should bottle it and sell it as 'organic toner.' I think he's joking. I hope he's joking.",
	"Roxy.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "The sky is normal again. Back to regular, non-glowing retail hell. Honestly, I kind of miss the green.",
	"Roxy.Hearts2.Mon": "Need help? No? Good.",
	"Roxy.Hearts2.Tue": "I'm organizing the shelves. Don't mess them up.",
	"Roxy.Hearts2.Wed": "I'm on the clock, but my brain is currently in a mosh pit.",
	"Roxy.Hearts2.Thu": "Don't ask me about the 'special of the week.' I don't know. I just work here.",
	"Roxy.Hearts2.Fri": "Clark says I have 'leadership potential.' I think he's hallucinating.",
	"Roxy.Hearts2.Sat": "Saturday people are the worst people. Present company excluded. ...Maybe.",
	"Roxy.Hearts2.Sun": "You're still here? Don't you have crops to water?",
	"Roxy.Hearts4.Mon": "You know, this place isn't the worst. It's clean. The pay is okay. That's what scares me. It's comfortable. Comfort is the enemy of art.",
	"Roxy.Hearts4.Tue": "I saw you talking to Clark. Did he show you pictures of his dog? He shows everyone. It's a pug. It wheezes.",
	"Roxy.Hearts4.Wed": "I helped Vance find ammo crates. We carry those? Apparently we carry everything. It's terrifying.",
	"Roxy.Hearts4.Thu": "My band is practicing tonight. We finally agreed on a setlist. It's mostly screaming.",
	"Roxy.Hearts4.Fri": "I wish I could just play music and get paid. But 'starving artist' isn't a vibe when you actually have rent to pay.",
	"Roxy.Hearts4.Sat": "I slept until noon. Woke up, realized I didn't have to smile at anyone. Best feeling ever.",
	"Roxy.Hearts4.Sun": "You look like you've been working hard. Must be nice. To see the results of your work. I just see empty shelves get filled and emptied again.",
	"Roxy.Hearts6.Mon": "I think Clark is actually a good guy. He covered my shift when my amp blew out so I could take it to Jett. ...I hate owing him one.",
	"Roxy.Hearts6.Tue": "You come in here a lot. You buying stuff, or just checking up on me? ...I don't mind.",
	"Roxy.Hearts6.Wed": "I wrote a song about the farm. It's slower. Acoustic. Don't tell anyone.",
	"Roxy.Hearts6.Thu": "I found a customer's wallet. Returned it. They tried to give me a reward. I told them to donate it to the shelter. Who am I becoming?",
	"Roxy.Hearts6.Fri": "You make this town feel a little less... plastic. You're real dirt. I like dirt.",
	"Roxy.Hearts6.Sat": "I stole a donut from the breakroom. Clark saw me. He winked. I wanted to die.",
	"Roxy.Hearts6.Sun": "I caught myself looking forward to seeing you today. That's dangerous. Happy people don't write good songs, @. Everyone knows that.",
	"Roxy.Hearts8.Mon": "I feel like a fraud. I dress punk and play loud music, but I'm actually a model employee. I'm reliable. I'm exactly what my parents said I had to be to survive, and it's... it's killing my vibe.",
	"Roxy.Hearts8.Tue": "I think I'm falling for you. You don't try to fix me. Clark tries to fix me. You just... let me be messy.",
	"Roxy.Hearts8.Wed": "I really see you. You're not just another face in the checkout line.",
	"Roxy.Hearts8.Thu": "I want to quit. But I'm scared. If I quit, I have to actually *do* something. Here, I can just coast.",
	"Roxy.Hearts8.Fri": "Being with you feels like the first time I nailed a bass solo. Terrifying and perfect.",
	"Roxy.Hearts8.Sat": "Let's go somewhere. Anywhere that doesn't have fluorescent lights.",
	"Roxy.Hearts8.Sun": "I love you. Even more than my distortion pedal. And that pedal cost me two paychecks.",
	"Roxy.Hearts10.Mon": "Marry me? Let's confuse everyone. The farmer and the retail clerk. It's a bad sitcom waiting to happen.",
	"Roxy.Hearts10.Tue": "You're perfect. You're real.",
	"Roxy.Hearts10.Wed": "I'm happy. Like, actually happy. I spent my whole life thinking stability was a cage that would kill my music. But being with you... it's just a better stage.",
	"Roxy.Hearts10.Thu": "Let's stay here. I don't want to run away anymore. I just want to be with you.",
	"Roxy.Hearts10.Fri": "I love our life. It's weird. But it's ours.",
	"Roxy.Hearts10.Sat": "I usually hate heart symbols. They're so commercial. But for you? I'll make an exception.",
	"Roxy.Hearts10.Sun": "This holiday season... I might actually enjoy it. Weird.",
	"Roxy.Day.Spring.Mon": "Inventory day. It's boring, but at least I don't have to talk to anyone. Boxes don't ask stupid questions.",
	"Roxy.Day.Spring.Tue": "I saw a kid drop their ice cream on the floor. He looked terrified. I just cleaned it up and gave him a new one. ...Don't look at me like that. I'm not a monster. I just hate the *adults*.",
	"Roxy.Day.Spring.Wed": "The pollen is bad. Clark bought us high-quality air filters. I can't even complain about the air quality anymore. He's taking away all my material.",
	"Roxy.Day.Spring.Thu": "I'm restocking the guitar strings. We actually carry decent brands now. I might have... suggested them to the ordering manager.",
	"Roxy.Day.Spring.Fri": "Friday night. Customers are rushing to buy party supplies. They look so desperate to have fun. It's depressing.",
	"Roxy.Day.Spring.Sat": "Some guy tried to haggle on a toaster. It's BuyCo, dude. The price is on the sticker. This isn't a bazaar.",
	"Roxy.Day.Spring.Sun": "I need to write a new song. Something about... feeling safe but trapped. Is that a thing?",
	"Roxy.Day.Summer.Mon": "The AC is working perfectly. It's actually really comfortable in here. ...I hate it.",
	"Roxy.Day.Summer.Tue": "I'm wearing the uniform. Clark says we can wear band tees on Fridays now. He's trying to be 'cool mom.' It's tragic.",
	"Roxy.Day.Summer.Wed": "A customer asked if I worked here. I'm wearing a vest with a nametag that says 'Roxy'. I said 'No, I'm just a really big fan of khaki.'",
	"Roxy.Day.Summer.Thu": "Jett came by. They needed a specific fuse. We actually had it. BuyCo is... surprisingly useful.",
	"Roxy.Day.Summer.Fri": "It's Band Tee Friday. I'm wearing a 'Fiscal Cliff' shirt. Clark asked if that was a hiking group. Close enough.",
	"Roxy.Day.Summer.Sat": "I saw a customer open a bag of chips, eat half, and put it back on the shelf. Animals. Absolute animals.",
	"Roxy.Day.Summer.Sun": "Sunday blues. The store isn't bad. The people are fine. It's just... is this it? Is this my life?",
	"Roxy.Day.Fall.Mon": "Halloween displays. I put a skeleton in the manager's chair. Clark named him 'Bones' and gave him a nametag. He ruins everything by making it cute.",
	"Roxy.Day.Fall.Tue": "I'm sweeping. It's meditative. Until someone walks through my pile of dust. Then it's war.",
	"Roxy.Day.Fall.Wed": "We started selling pumpkin spice motor oil? No, wait, that's just a display mix-up. Vance would have an aneurysm.",
	"Roxy.Day.Fall.Thu": "Leaves blowing in the automatic doors. It's the only nature I get to see for 8 hours.",
	"Roxy.Day.Fall.Fri": "I helped a kid pick out their first guitar today. Cheap acoustic. But... their eyes lit up. Okay. That was a good moment. One good moment.",
	"Roxy.Day.Fall.Sat": "The holiday rush is starting. People get meaner when they're 'full of cheer.'",
	"Roxy.Day.Fall.Sun": "Writing lyrics. 'Golden cage / Minimum wage / Clark is nice / But I'm still enraged.' ...Needs work.",
	"Roxy.Day.Winter.Mon": "Holiday music. Clark let me sneak one of my demo tapes into the playlist. It played for 30 seconds before a grandma complained. Victory.",
	"Roxy.Day.Winter.Tue": "We're doing a toy drive. I'm in charge of sorting. I made sure the cool stuff went to the kids who actually need it.",
	"Roxy.Day.Winter.Wed": "A guy yelled at me because we were out of wrapping paper. I just stared at him until he stopped talking. It's a superpower.",
	"Roxy.Day.Winter.Thu": "It's freezing outside. Clark cranked the heat. It's cozy. I want to nap in the bedding aisle.",
	"Roxy.Day.Winter.Fri": "Holiday bonus. It was... actually pretty generous. I bought a new pedal. I feel guilty for spending corporate money on noise. ...Almost.",
	"Roxy.Day.Winter.Sat": "I'm tired. Not 'sleepy' tired. 'Soul' tired. But hey, dental plan.",
	"Roxy.Day.Winter.Sun": "New Year. Same job. Same vest. Maybe this is the year I finally break out.",
	"Roxy.Gift.StardropTea": "Whoa. Is this... Stardrop Tea? I've only read about this. It tastes like the perfect bassline. Thanks, @.",
	"Roxy.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "Oh. You remembered my birthday to give me... this? That's a very specific kind of cruel.",
	"Roxy.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "You remembered my birthday? And got me something I actually like? Don't tell anyone, but that actually means a lot.",
	"Roxy.AcceptBirthdayGift": "A birthday gift? Thanks. I usually just buy myself a stale cupcake from the breakroom.",
	"Roxy.MovieInvitation": "A movie? Sure. As long as it's not a romantic comedy about a retail worker falling for a billionaire.",
	"Roxy.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "I already have plans. Band practice. We're learning a new cover.",
	"Roxy.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I've already been to the theater this week. The popcorn smell is permanently in my hair.",
	"Roxy.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "Are you joking? I'm not going anywhere with you.",
	"Roxy.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "That movie looks awful. I'd rather do a double shift at BuyCo.",
	"Roxy.RejectMovieTicket": "No thanks. I've got better things to do than sit in a sticky seat.",
	"Roxy.Dating.Mon": "Monday as your partner. Still hate Mondays, but at least I get to see you after my shift.",
	"Roxy.Dating.Tue": "Clark asked why I was smiling while sweeping today. I blamed it on a good song, but... it was you.",
	"Roxy.Dating.Wed": "Being with you makes dealing with the mid-week rush bearable.",
	"Roxy.Dating.Thu": "Want to come over later? I'll play you that new riff I've been working on.",
	"Roxy.Dating.Fri": "Friday night. Usually I'm dead on my feet, but I actually want to go out tonight. With you.",
	"Roxy.Dating.Sat": "Saturdays at the store are a nightmare, but knowing you're at the farm waiting keeps me sane.",
	"Roxy.Dating.Sun": "My day off. Let's just exist together. No customers, no registers.",
	"Roxy.Dating.General": "We're a thing. It's cool.",
	"Roxy.Dating.Rainy": "Rainy days are better when we're together. Let's stay in and listen to old vinyls.",
	"Roxy.Dating.Memory.OneYear": "Has it really been a year? Time flies when you're not entirely miserable. Seriously though, this has been the best year.",
	"Roxy.breakUp": "Look, this isn't working. I need space to figure my own stuff out without dragging you down. We're done.",
	"Roxy.RejectMermaidPendant_NeedHouseUpgrade": "Move in? To that tiny cabin? I have three amps, @. We need more space before we take that step.",
	"Roxy.RejectMermaidPendant_NotDatable": "Wait, what? A pendant? I don't think we're there. Actually, I don't think we're anywhere.",
	"Roxy.RejectMermaidPendant_NpcWithSomeoneElse": "Are you serious? I'm with someone else. This is really messed up.",
	"Roxy.RejectMermaidPendant_PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "I've heard rumors about you and someone else. I'm not a backup option. Figure your life out.",
	"Roxy.RejectMermaidPendant_Under8Hearts": "A mermaid pendant? For me? We barely know each other. This is moving way too fast.",
	"Roxy.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts": "I... I care about you, but I'm not ready for something this permanent. Give me some time.",
	"Roxy.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts_AskedAgain": "I already told you I need time. Pushing me isn't going to make me say yes.",
	"Roxy.Proposal.Reject": "I can't. I'm not a 'wife' material. I'm barely 'employee' material.",
	"Roxy.Bouquet.Accept": "Flowers? For me? ...They're gonna die. But... thanks. That's sweet.",
	"Roxy.RejectBouquet_NotDatable": "Flowers? For me? Uh, I think you misread the situation. We're just friends.",
	"Roxy.RejectBouquet_NpcAlreadyMarried": "I'm married. Did you really think this was a good idea?",
	"Roxy.RejectBouquet_VeryLowHearts": "Is this a joke? Because we don't even like each other.",
	"Roxy.RejectBouquet_LowHearts": "Look, you're fine, but I'm not really feeling it. Keep the flowers.",
	"Roxy.Bouquet.Reject": "I can't. I'm... I'm not ready for this.",
	"Roxy.divorced": "I don't have anything to say to you. Just leave me alone.",
	"Roxy.RejectGift_Divorced": "I don't want your gifts. We're done, remember?",
	"Roxy.RejectMermaidPendant_Divorced": "You're unbelievable. You really think a piece of jewelry fixes what happened? No.",
	"Roxy.RejectBouquet_Divorced": "Keep your flowers. They don't change anything.",
	"Roxy.Festival.WinterStar_GiveGift_After_Spouse": "Hope you liked the gift. I almost bought you a BuyCo gift card, but I figured that was a fireable offense in a marriage.",
	"Roxy.Festival.WinterStar_ReceiveGift": "You got this for me? Wow. Usually I just get socks from my aunt. This is way better.",
	"Roxy.Resort.General": "I'm wearing sunscreen. SPF 100. I refuse to turn into a lobster.",
	"Roxy.Resort.Bar": "One cola. Extra ice. Thanks.",
	"Roxy.Resort.Chair": "Sitting. Doing nothing. It's harder than it looks.",
	"Roxy.Resort.Dance": "I'm swaying. That counts as dancing.",
	"Roxy.Resort.Entering": "A resort? Okay. I can do 'vacation.' Maybe.",
	"Roxy.Resort.Leaving": "Back to reality. Back to the vest.",
	"Roxy.Resort.Shore": "Ocean. Big. Loud. I respect it.",
	"Roxy.Resort.Towel": "Sand is just tiny rocks that get everywhere.",
	"Roxy.Resort.Umbrella": "Shade is good. Sunburns are not punk.",
	"Roxy.Resort.Wander": "Exploring. Found a crab. We bonded.",
	"Roxy.SummitEvent": "Look at this view. I used to come up here when I wanted to scream at the valley. Now... I just want to sit here with you.",
	"Roxy.Engagement.0": "I can't believe we're actually doing this. Don't let me back out, okay? I'm terrified, but in a good way.",
	"Roxy.Engagement.1": "I've been practicing my vows. They sound like a punk ballad right now. Needs less angst.",
	"Roxy.SpouseFarmhouseClutter": "There's junk everywhere. I left BuyCo so I wouldn't have to navigate obstacle courses. Can we clean this up?",
	"Roxy.Spouse_MonstersInHouse": "Uh, there are literal monsters in our house. Do I need to get my heavy bass to smash them or are you handling this?",
	"Roxy.Marriage.SpouseStardrop": "Weird fruit. Tastes like... feedback? Cool.",
	"Roxy.Marriage.Spring": "Spring on the farm. It smells like dirt and hard work. Way better than the smell of floor wax.",
	"Roxy.Marriage.Summer": "It's scorching out there. Make sure you drink water. I don't want my spouse passing out in the tomatoes.",
	"Roxy.Marriage.Fall": "Fall is the best. The aesthetic out here is perfectly moody right now.",
	"Roxy.Marriage.Winter": "It's freezing. Let's just stay inside by the fire. The crops are dead anyway, right?",
	"Roxy.Patio": "Nice view. Way better than the parking lot.",
	"Roxy.Rainy_Day_0": "It's pouring. Good day to plug in the amp and make some noise.",
	"Roxy.Rainy_Day_1": "The rain hitting the roof is actually a decent rhythm. I might sample that.",
	"Roxy.Rainy_Day_2": "I made coffee. It's black, like my soul. Kidding. Mostly.",
	"Roxy.Rainy_Day_3": "You're not going out in that mud, are you? Suit yourself. I'm staying dry.",
	"Roxy.Rainy_Day_4": "Days like this make me glad I don't have to commute to BuyCo.",
	"Roxy.Rainy_Day_5": "Let's watch a terrible movie and make fun of the dialogue.",
	"Roxy.Indoor_Day_0": "I organized my pedals. Now I'm bored. Entertain me?",
	"Roxy.Indoor_Day_1": "I tried to cook earlier. Key word is 'tried'. We might need to order a pizza.",
	"Roxy.Indoor_Day_2": "I'm writing lyrics today. Don't look at my notebook, it's embarrassing.",
	"Roxy.Indoor_Day_3": "This house is so quiet compared to the store. I'm still getting used to it.",
	"Roxy.Indoor_Day_4": "You have a smudge of dirt on your cheek. ...Leave it, it looks tough.",
	"Roxy.Indoor_Day_5": "I was just thinking about how lucky I am. Don't let it go to your head.",
	"Roxy.Rainy_Night_0": "Storm's picking up. Kinda cozy in here though.",
	"Roxy.Rainy_Night_1": "I love the sound of rain at night. It drowns out my overthinking.",
	"Roxy.Rainy_Night_2": "Come sit. We don't have to talk. Just be here with me.",
	"Roxy.Rainy_Night_3": "You worked hard today. Take a break. Let me order us takeout.",
	"Roxy.Rainy_Night_4": "If the power goes out, I have acoustic versions of all my songs ready.",
	"Roxy.Rainy_Night_5": "Nights like this make me forget the rest of the world exists.",
	"Roxy.Indoor_Night_0": "Long day? You look beat. Let's just crash.",
	"Roxy.Indoor_Night_1": "I'm trying to learn a new tuning. It sounds awful right now. Sorry in advance.",
	"Roxy.Indoor_Night_2": "I missed you today. Is that too cheesy? Whatever, it's true.",
	"Roxy.Indoor_Night_3": "Sometimes I wake up and panic that I'm late for a shift. Then I remember I live here with you.",
	"Roxy.Indoor_Night_4": "Did you actually eat today, or just forage? Take care of yourself, okay?",
	"Roxy.Indoor_Night_5": "I'm not usually a softie, but... I'm really glad you're my person.",
	"Roxy.funLeave": "I'm heading out for a bit. Need to clear my head. Don't burn the house down.",
	"Roxy.funReturn": "I'm back. The town is exactly the same as I left it. Boring. Good thing you're here.",
	"Roxy.Outdoor_General": "Fresh air. It's weird not breathing recirculated AC.",
	"Roxy.Outdoor_0": "I'm helping! ...By watching you work. Moral support is important.",
	"Roxy.Outdoor_1": "The sun is aggressive today. I'm retreating to the shadows.",
	"Roxy.Outdoor_2": "You have a good system going here. Even Clark would be impressed.",
	"Roxy.Outdoor_3": "I'm going to town later. Need me to pick up anything? Or punch anyone?",
	"Roxy.Outdoor_4": "This farm is looking good. You really built something out of nothing here.",
	"Roxy.spouseRoom": "My corner of chaos. Enter at your own risk. And don't step on the cables.",
	"Roxy.OneKid_0": "Having a kid is wild. They just stare at you. I think they're judging my music taste.",
	"Roxy.OneKid_1": "I caught the kid trying to eat a guitar pick. Crisis averted, but barely.",
	"Roxy.OneKid_2": "I'm trying to sing a lullaby, but it sounds like a dirge. I need practice.",
	"Roxy.OneKid_3": "I never thought I'd be doing the domestic thing. But... the kid is kinda cool.",
	"Roxy.OneKid_4": "Hey, make sure you spend some time with our little monster today.",
	"Roxy.TwoKids_0": "Two of them. We're outnumbered. This was a tactical error.",
	"Roxy.TwoKids_1": "The kids are forming a band. So far, their primary instrument is screaming.",
	"Roxy.TwoKids_2": "I love our kids, but if one more thing gets sticky, I'm moving into the coop.",
	"Roxy.TwoKids_3": "They both have your eyes. And my attitude. God help us all.",
	"Roxy.TwoKids_4": "It's chaos in here. But it's our chaos.",
	"Roxy.Good_0": "You're the best thing that ever happened to me. Seriously.",
	"Roxy.Good_1": "I made your favorite breakfast. Or, well, I bought it. Same thing.",
	"Roxy.Good_2": "I love our life together. I wouldn't trade it for a platinum record.",
	"Roxy.Good_3": "Whenever you walk in the room, my heart still skips a beat. Gross, right?",
	"Roxy.Good_4": "You make me want to write love songs. I hate you for it, but I love you.",
	"Roxy.Good_5": "I was just thinking about our wedding day. It was perfect.",
	"Roxy.Good_6": "Thanks for putting up with my moods. You're a saint, @.",
	"Roxy.Good_7": "I'm so proud of what you've accomplished here on the farm.",
	"Roxy.Good_8": "Let's grow old and be those weird punks who complain about the youth.",
	"Roxy.Good_9": "You're my muse. Always.",
	"Roxy.Neutral_0": "Hey. Busy day ahead?",
	"Roxy.Neutral_1": "I'm just going to tune my bass for the next three hours. Don't mind me.",
	"Roxy.Neutral_2": "We're out of coffee. This is an absolute disaster.",
	"Roxy.Neutral_3": "I saw Clark in town today. He waved. I hid behind a barrel.",
	"Roxy.Neutral_4": "This house is okay. Needs more black paint, maybe.",
	"Roxy.Neutral_5": "I'm feeling uninspired today. Just gonna stare at the wall.",
	"Roxy.Neutral_6": "Did you pay the bills this month? I can't look at numbers right now.",
	"Roxy.Neutral_7": "I might go to the Saloon later. Want to come?",
	"Roxy.Neutral_8": "I stepped in mud. Farm life is glamorous.",
	"Roxy.Neutral_9": "Just another day. Let's get through it.",
	"Roxy.Bad_0": "Do you even care about us anymore?",
	"Roxy.Bad_1": "This place feels like a prison lately.",
	"Roxy.Bad_2": "I should have never left the store. At least I knew what to expect there.",
	"Roxy.Bad_3": "Don't talk to me. I'm not in the mood.",
	"Roxy.Bad_4": "Are we just roommates now? Is that what this is?",
	"Roxy.Bad_5": "I'm sick of feeling like I come second to your crops.",
	"Roxy.Bad_6": "I need some space. Give me room to breathe.",
	"Roxy.Bad_7": "I wrote a new song. It's about a sinking ship. Draw your own conclusions.",
	"Roxy.Bad_8": "Everything I was afraid of happening, is happening.",
	"Roxy.Bad_9": "I don't even know who you are lately.",
	"Roxy.Event.2Heart.1": "Can't a girl write a grocery list in peace?",
	"Roxy.Event.2Heart.Q": "It looked like lyrics...",
	"Roxy.Event.2Heart.A1": "It looked like poetry.",
	"Roxy.Event.2Heart.A2": "It looked like slacking.",
	"Roxy.Event.2Heart.R1": "Poetry? Gross. No. ...It's a song.",
	"Roxy.Event.2Heart.R2": "I'm on break! You sound like Clark.",
	"Roxy.Event.2Heart.Singing": "...golden handcuffs, polite smiles, screaming on the inside...",
	"Roxy.Event.2Heart.Shock": "Woah! Hey!",
	"Roxy.Event.4Heart.1": "One more time! Jett, did you fix the fuzz?",
	"Roxy.Event.4Heart.2": "I re-routed the capacitor. Safe now.",
	"Roxy.Event.4Heart.3": "Safe is boring! But thanks.",
	"Roxy.Event.4Heart.4": "Oh. Hi.",
	"Roxy.Event.6Heart.1": "...That was me.",
	"Roxy.Event.6Heart.2": "I play bass. Surprise.",
	"Roxy.Event.6Heart.Q": "Thoughts?",
	"Roxy.Event.6Heart.A1": "Amazing!",
	"Roxy.Event.6Heart.A2": "Loud.",
	"Roxy.Event.6Heart.R1": "Thanks. Don't tell Clark. He'll want us to play at the holiday party.",
	"Roxy.Event.6Heart.R2": "That's the point.",
	"Roxy.Event.8Heart.1": "It's fixed.",
	"Roxy.Event.8Heart.2": "But I can't plug it in.",
	"Roxy.Event.8Heart.Q": "Why?",
	"Roxy.Event.8Heart.A1": "Scared?",
	"Roxy.Event.8Heart.A2": "What if it doesn't help?",
	"Roxy.Event.8Heart.R1": "Yeah. Scared it won't be enough.",
	"Roxy.Event.8Heart.R2": "Exactly. What if I'm just empty?",
	"Roxy.Event.8Heart.Final": "Loud. Better. Thanks.",
	"Roxy.Event.10Heart.1": "Thanks for coming.",
	"Roxy.Event.10Heart.2": "This song is for you.",
	"Roxy.Event.10Heart.3": "That felt... real.",
	"Roxy.Event.12Heart.1": "Hey.",
	"Roxy.Event.12Heart.2": "I said no to marriage before. Traps and all that.",
	"Roxy.Event.12Heart.3": "I spent years running from 'the plan' because I thought it was a trap. But this? Growing roots with you? It's not a trap.",
	"Roxy.Event.12Heart.4": "Let's do it. Real marriage.",
	"Silas.Day.Mon": "The wind is carrying the scent of the town. Frying oil. Perfume. Anxiety. How do you breathe down there without choking?",
	"Silas.Day.Tue": "Don't touch the equipment. It's not a toy. It's the difference between eating and starving.",
	"Silas.Day.Wed": "If you get lost, don't scream. It attracts predators. Just sit down and wait. I'll find you. Eventually.",
	"Silas.Day.Thu": "You smell like farm animals and soap. It's a confusing scent. The deer won't know what to make of you.",
	"Silas.Day.Fri": "I saw your tracks near the river. You were dragging your left foot. Tired? Or injured?",
	"Silas.Day.Sat": "Step carefully. You're crushing the saplings. The forest is trying to grow; don't be the reason it fails.",
	"Silas.Day.Sun": "Why are you following me? The woods are big enough for both of us to be alone. Go find your own trail.",
	"Silas.Introduction": "You walk loud. Heavy heels. You stepped on a dry branch three miles back. I heard it snap. ...You have no camouflage, farmer.",
	"Silas.DumpsterDiveComment": "Rummaging in the trash? Desperate. If you're that hungry, I can show you how to set a snare. Have some dignity.",
	"Silas.HitBySlingshot": "You have terrible aim. Try that again, and I'll show you how a real marksman shoots.",
	"Silas.WipedMemory": "You look familiar, but the tracks are gone. Keep your distance until I figure you out.",
	"Silas.Weather.Rain": "Rain washes away the noise. The woods are honest today. No tourists, just the sound of water.",
	"Silas.Weather.Snow": "White world. Clean. Tracks are visible for miles.",
	"Silas.Weather.GreenRain": "I'm sealing the windows. That pollen creates a fog in your lungs. It feels unnatural. Stay inside.",
	"Silas.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "The air is clear again. The moss is dying back. Nature correcting itself.",
	"Silas.Hearts2.Mon": "Still here? You're persistent. Like a tick.",
	"Silas.Hearts2.Tue": "Watch out for the nettles. They sting. It's their way of saying 'back off'. I can relate.",
	"Silas.Hearts2.Wed": "I'm busy. This trap won't set itself.",
	"Silas.Hearts2.Thu": "What do you want? Conversation? Go talk to the Mayor. People in town use words to hide the truth. Out here, the wind is the only thing that doesn't lie.",
	"Silas.Hearts2.Fri": "Don't step there. Hollow ground. You'll twist a knee.",
	"Silas.Hearts2.Sat": "Hmph. You brought supplies? ...No? Then you're just dead weight.",
	"Silas.Hearts2.Sun": "Go make yourself useful elsewhere. I have a perimeter to check.",
	"Silas.Hearts4.Mon": "The air is crisp today. You can smell the snow coming from the north. Three days out.",
	"Silas.Hearts4.Tue": "Did you hear that owl last night? It was hunting. Successful kill at 3 AM. I heard the squeak.",
	"Silas.Hearts4.Wed": "I'm tracking a deer. Not to hunt. Just to see where it winters. It has a limp.",
	"Silas.Hearts4.Thu": "You're getting better at walking quietly. You didn't snap any twigs today. Acceptable.",
	"Silas.Hearts4.Fri": "Nature doesn't judge you. It just is. The wolf doesn't hate the rabbit. It just eats.",
	"Silas.Hearts4.Sat": "Look at this moss. Squeeze it. See? Water. If you're dying of thirst, remember that.",
	"Silas.Hearts4.Sun": "Town is too loud today. I can feel the bass from the saloon in the soles of my feet.",
	"Silas.Hearts6.Mon": "I prefer the company of trees to people. Trees don't lie. They don't want anything from you.",
	"Silas.Hearts6.Tue": "You have dirt on your face. Leave it. It masks the shine of your skin and breaks up your silhouette. You’re finally starting to look like you belong here.",
	"Silas.Hearts6.Wed": "I used to think being alone was the only way to be safe. You're... quiet enough. You don't trigger the alarms in my head.",
	"Silas.Hearts6.Thu": "The forest accepts you. The birds didn't stop singing when you walked up. That's rare.",
	"Silas.Hearts6.Fri": "Stay a while, if you want. Just... don't talk. Let's just watch the treeline.",
	"Silas.Hearts6.Sat": "Listen. The wind is singing through the pines. It's the only music worth hearing.",
	"Silas.Hearts6.Sun": "I feel... calm when you're around. My shoulders aren't up to my ears. Strange.",
	"Silas.Hearts8.Mon": "I never thought I'd share my trail with anyone. I usually cover my tracks. Today... I left them for you.",
	"Silas.Hearts8.Tue": "You are a part of this woods now, @. The predators know your scent. They know you're with me.",
	"Silas.Hearts8.Wed": "I trust you. That's dangerous. Trust gets you killed. But... I think I trust you anyway.",
	"Silas.Hearts8.Thu": "Let's just sit for a moment. No looking for threats. Just sitting.",
	"Silas.Hearts8.Fri": "You're stronger than you look. You survived the winter. You didn't quit. I respect that.",
	"Silas.Hearts8.Sat": "The wilderness is harsh, but you handle it well. You have grit.",
	"Silas.Hearts8.Sun": "The cabin is usually a place to hide. But when you’re here... it’s a den. I don’t feel the need to watch the door every five seconds. That’s a strange feeling.",
	"Silas.Hearts10.Mon": "You are my anchor in the wild. When the world gets too loud, I look for your tracks.",
	"Silas.Hearts10.Tue": "You belong here. With the trees. With the silence. With me.",
	"Silas.Hearts10.Wed": "My fire is your fire. My food is your food. It's a pact.",
	"Silas.Hearts10.Thu": "I sleep better when you're near. I don't have to keep one eye open.",
	"Silas.Hearts10.Fri": "Every path I take leads me back to thinking of you. It's distracting. I almost tripped over a root yesterday.",
	"Silas.Hearts10.Sat": "We survive together. Two is a pack. A pack is stronger.",
	"Silas.Hearts10.Sun": "Peaceful. I used to think that only happened when I was alone. I was wrong. The woods are quieter when you’re watching my back.",
	"Silas.Day.Spring.Mon": "Bears are waking up. They're hungry and they're cranky. Keep your food sealed or you'll lose a limb.",
	"Silas.Day.Spring.Tue": "Mud is deep. Wear good boots. If you slip, you break an ankle. If you break an ankle, you freeze.",
	"Silas.Day.Spring.Wed": "Foraging is good. Wild onions are up. They mask your scent. Eat them raw.",
	"Silas.Day.Spring.Thu": "Don't eat the red berries. They look sweet. They shut down your kidneys in four hours.",
	"Silas.Day.Spring.Fri": "Rain washes the scent away. It's the only time the woods are truly private. No trails to follow.",
	"Silas.Day.Spring.Sat": "Birds are loud. Mating season. Everything is desperate to reproduce before they die. It's noisy.",
	"Silas.Day.Spring.Sun": "New growth hides the trails. Trust your feet, not your eyes.",
	"Silas.Day.Summer.Mon": "Hot. Stay in the shade. Sweat makes you smell like prey.",
	"Silas.Day.Summer.Tue": "Storms coming. I can smell the ozone. The air tastes like copper.",
	"Silas.Day.Summer.Wed": "Berries are ripe. The bears know it too. It's a race. Don't get between a sow and a bush.",
	"Silas.Day.Summer.Thu": "The river is low. Fish are trapped in the pools. Easy catch. Don't get greedy.",
	"Silas.Day.Summer.Fri": "Tourists in the woods. I hear them shouting. They treat the forest like a theme park. I should set traps.",
	"Silas.Day.Summer.Sat": "Insects are biting. Use mud on your arms. It works better than that chemical spray you buy at Pierre's.",
	"Silas.Day.Summer.Sun": "Long days. More time to hunt. Less time to sleep.",
	"Silas.Day.Fall.Mon": "Game is moving. Winter prep. The squirrels are frantic. You should be too.",
	"Silas.Day.Fall.Tue": "Mushrooms everywhere. Learn which ones kill. If you're not 100% sure, leave it.",
	"Silas.Day.Fall.Wed": "Wind cuts through clothes. Wear wool. Cotton kills when it gets wet.",
	"Silas.Day.Fall.Thu": "Leaves crunch. Impossible to stalk. Every step sounds like a gunshot.",
	"Silas.Day.Fall.Fri": "Nuts are falling. The forest is feeding itself.",
	"Silas.Day.Fall.Sat": "Frost on the ground. The warning shot. Winter is aiming at us.",
	"Silas.Day.Fall.Sun": "Days getting short. Get home before dark. The shadows get long and the temperature drops fast.",
	"Silas.Day.Winter.Mon": "Snow tracks. I know exactly where you went yesterday. You circled the lake twice. Looking for something?",
	"Silas.Day.Winter.Tue": "Cold. Build a fire. Keep it small. Big fires attract attention.",
	"Silas.Day.Winter.Wed": "Silence. Good. The snow swallows the noise of the town. Finally, I can think.",
	"Silas.Day.Winter.Thu": "Food is scarce. Ration your energy. Don't run unless you're being chased.",
	"Silas.Day.Winter.Fri": "Ice fishing is productive. The fish are sluggish. Like you.",
	"Silas.Day.Winter.Sat": "Stay warm. Don't be a hero. The cold doesn't care how brave you are.",
	"Silas.Day.Winter.Sun": "Winter is honest. The weak die. The strong sleep. It's cruel, but it's clean.",
	"Silas.Gift.StardropTea": "This smells... potent. It sharpens the senses. Acceptable.",
	"Silas.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "You brought me garbage on the day I was born? You have a dark sense of humor.",
	"Silas.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "A useful tool for a new year. I'll put this to work. Thank you.",
	"Silas.AcceptBirthdayGift": "My birthday? I treat it like any other day. Just another sunrise to survive. ...But thanks for noticing.",
	"Silas.MovieInvitation": "Sit in a dark room full of people? No. I prefer the woods.",
	"Silas.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "Someone else already asked. You're too slow on the draw.",
	"Silas.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I already sat through that noise this week. Once is enough.",
	"Silas.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "We severed our pact. Don't pretend otherwise.",
	"Silas.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "That film has no survival value. Pointless fiction. No.",
	"Silas.RejectMovieTicket": "I'm not wasting daylight in a theater. I have a perimeter to check.",
	"Silas.SummitEvent": "Look at this view. You can see every trail, every threat, every escape route. The world is laid out bare. And you're standing right here with me. It's a good vantage point.",
	"Silas.Event.Intro.1": "Hold it. Don't take another step.",
	"Silas.Event.Intro.2": "There's a viper nesting under that rock. You almost stepped right on it.",
	"Silas.Event.Intro.3": "You must be the farmer. You walk loud.",
	"Silas.Event.Intro.4": "I'm Silas. I live out here because the town smells like lies.",
	"Silas.Event.Intro.5": "Do us both a favor: Watch where you step, and leave me be.",
	"Silas.Event.4Heart.1": "Stop. Look at this.",
	"Silas.Event.4Heart.2": "This berry bush. What do you see?",
	"Silas.Event.4Heart.Q": "What do you see?",
	"Silas.Event.4Heart.A1": "A delicious snack!",
	"Silas.Event.4Heart.A2": "It's poisonous red-bane.",
	"Silas.Event.4Heart.A3": "It's pretty?",
	"Silas.Event.4Heart.R1": "If you want a stomach ache, sure. Look closer at the leaves. Serrated.",
	"Silas.Event.4Heart.R2": "Good eye. The serrated leaves give it away. You're learning. Maybe you won't die.",
	"Silas.Event.4Heart.R3": "Pretty things kill you out here. Pay attention.",
	"Silas.Event.6Heart.1": "...Too many people.",
	"Silas.Event.6Heart.2": "Oh. It's you.",
	"Silas.Event.6Heart.3": "I came into town for supplies, but... the noise. It buzzes in my teeth. It's too much.",
	"Silas.Event.6Heart.4": "I'm heading back to the quiet. You. You can come, if you want. Just don't talk.",
	"Silas.Event.8Heart.1": "The storm washed out the trail ahead. We're stuck on this ledge.",
	"Silas.Event.8Heart.2": "Night is falling. If we try to climb down now, we slip and break our necks.",
	"Silas.Event.8Heart.3": "I... I usually work alone. But having you here... I'm not checking the perimeter every five seconds.",
	"Silas.Event.8Heart.4": "I trust your eyes. That's a first.",
	"Silas.Event.8Heart.Q": "What do you say?",
	"Silas.Event.8Heart.A1": "I'm scared, Silas.",
	"Silas.Event.8Heart.A2": "We build a shelter. I saw dry wood back there.",
	"Silas.Event.8Heart.R1": "Don't be. I won't let anything happen to you. Sleep. I'll take the first watch.",
	"Silas.Event.8Heart.R2": "You're right. Panic kills. Action saves. Let's get to work. Good instinct.",
	"Silas.Event.8Heart.Final": "We made it through the night. You didn't just survive, @... you thrived. I see you differently now. You're part of the pack.",
	"Vance.Day.Mon": "Don't touch the merchandise unless you plan to buy. I count every shell casing. It's not about the money, it's about inventory control. A missing round is a liability.",
	"Vance.Day.Tue": "I saw Lewis collecting 'taxes' today. He worries about the town's image. I worry about its survival. He polishes the brass on the Titanic; I'm the one patching the hull.",
	"Vance.Day.Wed": "Rasmodius. He sits in that tower manipulating reality while we break our backs tilling soil. I don't care if he's 'benevolent'. Unchecked power is a threat. I keep an eye on him because no one else will.",
	"Vance.Day.Thu": "My arm? ...Threshing machine. That's what I told Marnie. The truth? The truth is ugly, Farmer. And you don't need ugly things in your head while you're planting parsnips.",
	"Vance.Day.Fri": "I'm going to the cemetery later. Alone. Don’t follow me. It’s not a social call. I have reports to file with the dead.",
	"Vance.Day.Sat": "Look at them. Dancing. Eating. They don't look at the perimeter. They don't check the exits. ...Good. That's my job. Let them be soft. I'll stay hard for them.",
	"Vance.Day.Sun": "Civilians need rest. Sundays are for civilians. That’s when they assume we’re asleep. I use that time to calibrate the sensors. Silence is when you catch the mistakes.",
	"Vance.Introduction": "Stop. ID check... Hmph. You’re the new farmer. You got your grandfather’s eyes. He was a good man. He knew when to plant and when to... handle a problem. Let’s see if you inherited his grit.",
	"Vance.DumpsterDiveComment": "Digging for scraps? We have rations. If you're starving, tell me. Don't compromise your health in the refuse.",
	"Vance.HitBySlingshot": "Sniper! Get down— Oh. It's you. Don't ever test my reflexes like that again.",
	"Vance.WipedMemory": "You look familiar. Have I checked your ID before? My logs say no, but my instincts say yes.",
	"Vance.Weather.Rain": "The rain... it smells like the jungle. Copper and rot. Don't sneak up on me today, kid. My reflexes are... twitchy.",
	"Vance.Weather.Snow": "Whiteout conditions. Stay indoors. You can't fight what you can't see.",
	"Vance.Weather.GreenRain": "Atmospheric toxin detected. Suit up. I'm not taking chances with mutant spores.",
	"Vance.Weather.GreenRainFinished": "Toxin levels have zeroed out. The flora mutated, but the air is clear. Stand down from high alert, but keep your eyes open.",
	"Vance.Hearts2.Mon": "Stand down, civilian. I’m working on a shipment.",
	"Vance.Hearts2.Tue": "You walk loud. I heard you coming from the bus stop. Work on your stealth.",
	"Vance.Hearts2.Wed": "What do you want? I don’t have time for chit-chat. The inventory won't count itself.",
	"Vance.Hearts2.Thu": "Keep moving. Loitering is suspicious behavior.",
	"Vance.Hearts2.Fri": "My past is classified. Stop asking. It’s better if you don’t know.",
	"Vance.Hearts2.Sat": "Buy something or clear the sector. This isn't a social club.",
	"Vance.Hearts2.Sun": "I’m busy calibrating. Go away.",
	"Vance.Hearts4.Mon": "Report. You see anything in the lower mines? The Shadow People are getting organized. I can feel it in the tremors.",
	"Vance.Hearts4.Tue": "I checked your file. You're efficient. Good. Most people here think 'danger' means a thunderstorm. They don't know what sleeps beneath the soil.",
	"Vance.Hearts4.Wed": "I saw you foraging. You know which mushrooms kill you? Good. Keep it that way. I don't want to fill out the paperwork for a poisoning.",
	"Vance.Hearts4.Thu": "Most people ignore the noises in the night. You? You listen. I noticed. That habit will save your life.",
	"Vance.Hearts4.Fri": "I visit the cemetery to remember the cost of hesitation. Your grandfather... he understood that cost. He was one of the few who looked into the dark and didn't blink.",
	"Vance.Hearts4.Sat": "I’m doing a sweep of the town later. You can tag along. Just stay quiet and don't touch anything.",
	"Vance.Hearts4.Sun": "You’re tough. For a farmer. Keep training.",
	"Vance.Hearts6.Mon": "If you find any Gotoro tech in the mines, bring it to me. Don’t let Gunther have it. He puts dangerous things on shelves; I put them in containment.",
	"Vance.Hearts6.Tue": "I’m teaching you hand signals next week. Your verbal communication is too loud. In the field, silence is gold.",
	"Vance.Hearts6.Wed": "The valley is safer with you in it. I don’t say that lightly. You're an asset.",
	"Vance.Hearts6.Thu": "I trust you with a weapon. That’s rare. Most people treat a sword like a toy.",
	"Vance.Hearts6.Fri": "We make a good team. You build, but I've noticed you watching the treeline too. Two sets of eyes are better than one. It's a sustainable model.",
	"Vance.Hearts6.Sat": "Check your boots. You picked up a tracker burr. Rookie mistake, but I'll let it slide.",
	"Vance.Hearts6.Sun": "Take a break. Even soldiers need downtime. Burnout is a tactical failure.",
	"Vance.Hearts8.Mon": "I gave you the clearance code for the back bunker. Don't share it. Not even with Lewis. Especially not with Lewis.",
	"Vance.Hearts8.Tue": "I saw you handling that pickaxe earlier. Good form. Balanced stance. You'd have done well in my unit.",
	"Vance.Hearts8.Wed": "I saw your grandfather the week before he passed. He looked... relieved. Like he was finally putting down a heavy pack. He told me, 'Vance, the valley protects its own, but only if you respect the shadows.' I still don't know if he was warning me, or saying goodbye.",
	"Vance.Hearts8.Thu": "About the arm... It wasn't a rock crab. It was a Shadow Shaman. I hesitated. I tried to reason with it. It took my arm for the trouble. Don't make my mistake. Compassion gets you killed.",
	"Vance.Hearts8.Fri": "If things go south, head to my shop. I have rations for two. Just in case. I've updated the plan to include you.",
	"Vance.Hearts8.Sat": "Most people are liabilities. You're an asset. That's the highest compliment I give.",
	"Vance.Hearts8.Sun": "I'm getting tired. My reaction time is down 0.4 seconds. I thought I had to hold this line alone until I dropped. But seeing you out there... maybe I can finally share the watch.",
	"Vance.Hearts10.Mon": "I used to think I had to protect this valley alone. I was wrong. We protect it. And... maybe you protect me.",
	"Vance.Hearts10.Tue": "I used to think my life was disposable. Spent. Just a bullet to be fired. But since you got here... I find myself checking the safety. I want to survive this.",
	"Vance.Hearts10.Wed": "Perimeter secure. Target acquired: It's you. And... I'm glad to see you. Stand down, soldier.",
	"Vance.Hearts10.Thu": "I used to sleep with one eye open. Now, I just sleep. Because I know you've got my back. It's a strange feeling. Rest.",
	"Vance.Hearts10.Fri": "I left my sidearm in the lockbox today. First time in ten years. I don't need it when I'm walking with you.",
	"Vance.Hearts10.Sat": "Let's go to the woods. No patrols. Just a walk. I want to see the trees without calculating cover for once.",
	"Vance.Hearts10.Sun": "I'm still armed. I'm still ready. But... I don't feel like I'm at war when I'm with you.",
	"Vance.Day.Spring.Mon": "Vegetation is dense. Good for cover, bad for sightlines. If I can't see the fence, I can't defend it.",
	"Vance.Day.Spring.Tue": "Mud tracks. Easy to spot intruders today. I saw boot prints near the tunnel that didn't match any local tread pattern.",
	"Vance.Day.Spring.Wed": "Pollen count is high. Sneezing gives away your position. Keep it down.",
	"Vance.Day.Spring.Thu": "The river is running high. Natural barrier. That buys us time if anything comes down from the mountains.",
	"Vance.Day.Spring.Fri": "I saw movement in the brush. Just a rabbit. This time. Never assume it's just a rabbit.",
	"Vance.Day.Spring.Sat": "Civilians are out in force. Distractions everywhere. Cassidy tried to organize my grenades by color. 'Rainbow order,' she called it. I almost had a stroke.",
	"Vance.Day.Spring.Sun": "Weekly equipment check. Clean your weapon, Farmer. Rust is the enemy.",
	"Vance.Day.Summer.Mon": "Sun glare is a tactical disadvantage. Wear shades. If you can't see, you're dead.",
	"Vance.Day.Summer.Tue": "Mosquitoes. Reminds me of the swamps in the South. The buzzing... it brings back memories I don't want.",
	"Vance.Day.Summer.Wed": "Hydrate. If you pass out, you’re dead weight. I can't drag you back to the farm.",
	"Vance.Day.Summer.Thu": "Dry heat. Fire risk is critical. Watch where you drop your matches. I don't want to fight a wildfire on top of everything else.",
	"Vance.Day.Summer.Fri": "Tourists bring trash. Trash attracts scavengers. Scavengers attract predators. Clean it up.",
	"Vance.Day.Summer.Sat": "Too loud. Sound carries further in this heat. I can hear the saloon from here.",
	"Vance.Day.Summer.Sun": "Resting my eyes. Ears are still active. Always active.",
	"Vance.Day.Fall.Mon": "Leaves are turning. Camouflage patterns need updating. Green doesn't work against orange.",
	"Vance.Day.Fall.Tue": "Wind masks footsteps. Watch your six. Something could walk right up to you today.",
	"Vance.Day.Fall.Wed": "Harvest time. Store your surplus. Winter is a siege. You need calories to burn when the snow hits.",
	"Vance.Day.Fall.Thu": "Days are getting shorter. Darkness is the enemy's friend. Get your chores done before dusk.",
	"Vance.Day.Fall.Fri": "Fog rolling in. Visibility zero. Hold your position. If you can't see the target, don't fire.",
	"Vance.Day.Fall.Sat": "The crows are organized. You think I'm joking? Watch them. They probe the defenses. They test the scarecrows.",
	"Vance.Day.Fall.Sun": "Checking the perimeter fence. Rust is setting in. Entropy is the only opponent that never sleeps.",
	"Vance.Day.Winter.Mon": "Tracks in the snow. I know exactly who walked here three hours ago. You were dragging your left foot. Injury?",
	"Vance.Day.Winter.Tue": "Cold snaps metal. Treat your gear with respect. Don't force a frozen lock.",
	"Vance.Day.Winter.Wed": "Silence. I like it. Makes it easier to hear a pin drop a mile away.",
	"Vance.Day.Winter.Thu": "Supplies are stable. We’ll survive the freeze. We always do.",
	"Vance.Day.Winter.Fri": "Stay warm. Hypothermia kills faster than a bullet. It's a quiet death.",
	"Vance.Day.Winter.Sat": "The lake is frozen. Tactical crossing is now possible. Be alert. The barrier is gone.",
	"Vance.Day.Winter.Sun": "End of the week. Still breathing. Mission successful.",
	"Vance.Gift.StardropTea": "This tastes like... peacetime. Like the summers before the draft. Thank you. Truly.",
	"Vance.AcceptBirthdayGift_Negative": "I told you, I don't celebrate. The enemy doesn't care what day it is.",
	"Vance.AcceptBirthdayGift_Positive": "You remembered. I usually spend today running drills. This... is better.",
	"Vance.AcceptBirthdayGift": "A tactical resupply for my birthdate. Acknowledged and appreciated.",
	"Vance.MovieInvitation": "A theater? It's a dark room full of civilians and limited exits. ...Fine. But I'm choosing the seats.",
	"Vance.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyInvitedBySomeoneElse": "I already have a detail assigned for that location. Solo mission. Sorry.",
	"Vance.RejectMovieTicket_AlreadyWatchedThisWeek": "I've already run a security sweep of that film this week. Once is enough.",
	"Vance.RejectMovieTicket_Divorced": "No. We broke the contract. Keep your distance.",
	"Vance.RejectMovieTicket_DontWantToSeeThatMovie": "Negative. That film is propaganda and tactically inaccurate.",
	"Vance.RejectMovieTicket": "I can't afford the distraction right now.",
	"Vance.Dating.Mon": "I checked the farm perimeter. Your scarecrows have blind spots. I fixed them.",
	"Vance.Dating.Tue": "I used to hate the quiet. It meant an ambush. Now, with you, the quiet just means... peace.",
	"Vance.Dating.Wed": "You work too hard. I bought you some rations from the saloon. Eat. That's an order.",
	"Vance.Dating.Thu": "I caught myself smiling today. Cassidy asked if I was sick. Don't tell anyone.",
	"Vance.Dating.Fri": "Stay close tonight. Not because of threats. I just... prefer your proximity.",
	"Vance.Dating.Sat": "If anyone gives you trouble in town, give me a signal. Hand raised, two fingers. I'll handle it.",
	"Vance.Dating.Sun": "Sunday rest. My sensors are calibrated. My focus is entirely on you.",
	"Vance.Dating.General": "You've completely compromised my objectivity. And I wouldn't have it any other way.",
	"Vance.Dating.Rainy": "Rain washes away tracks, but it also washes away the dust. Stay inside with me today.",
	"Vance.Dating.Memory.OneYear": "One year since we formalized this... partnership. My survival rate has increased exponentially.",
	"Vance.breakUp": "Understood. Contract terminated. I'll clear my gear out by 0800.",
	"Vance.RejectMermaidPendant_NeedHouseUpgrade": "We can't establish a base of operations in a single room. Upgrade your infrastructure first.",
	"Vance.RejectMermaidPendant_NotDatable": "We aren't there yet. Do not skip protocol.",
	"Vance.RejectMermaidPendant_NpcWithSomeoneElse": "My loyalty is currently contracted elsewhere. Stand down.",
	"Vance.RejectMermaidPendant_PlayerWithSomeoneElse": "You're already tethered to someone else. I don't share alliances.",
	"Vance.RejectMermaidPendant_Under8Hearts": "We lack the necessary trust for a permanent merger.",
	"Vance.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts": "Marriage is a life bond. I need absolute certainty. We need more time in the field.",
	"Vance.RejectMermaidPendant_Under10Hearts_AskedAgain": "I repeat: Negative. Do not ask again until the parameters are met.",
	"Vance.Proposal.Reject": "I can't. My life is too dangerous. I won't put you in the crossfire.",
	"Vance.Bouquet.Accept": "You want... me? I'm half a man. I'm scarred, I'm angry, and I wake up screaming. ...You still want that? ...Okay. Affirmative. But you take point.",
	"Vance.RejectBouquet_NotDatable": "I don't do casual fraternization.",
	"Vance.RejectBouquet_NpcAlreadyMarried": "I'm already legally bound. Move along.",
	"Vance.RejectBouquet_VeryLowHearts": "I barely know you. Step back.",
	"Vance.RejectBouquet_LowHearts": "We don't have that kind of operational history.",
	"Vance.Bouquet.Reject": "Negative. I work alone. It's safer that way. You're a distraction I can't afford.",
	"Vance.divorced": "Asset compromised. Do not approach.",
	"Vance.RejectGift_Divorced": "I don't accept packages from hostile entities.",
	"Vance.RejectMermaidPendant_Divorced": "You severed the tie. You don't get to retie the knot.",
	"Vance.RejectBouquet_Divorced": "No. The mission is over.",
	"Vance.Festival.WinterStar_GiveGift_After_Spouse": "I secured this for you. Happy Feast of the Winter Star.",
	"Vance.Festival.WinterStar_ReceiveGift": "A secure drop from my secret gift-giver. Acknowledged.",
	"Vance.Resort.General": "This sand... gets into everything. But the sightlines are clear.",
	"Vance.Resort.Bar": "Hydrating. No alcohol. Dulls the reflexes. Just water.",
	"Vance.Resort.Chair": "Stationary position. Scanning for threats. You relax. I'll watch.",
	"Vance.Resort.Dance": "Negative. I don't dance. I stand guard.",
	"Vance.Resort.Entering": "Securing the perimeter. This island is unsecured. Too many caves. I don't like it.",
	"Vance.Resort.Leaving": "Extracting. Back to base. I need to check the locks at home.",
	"Vance.Resort.Shore": "Open water. No cover. I feel exposed.",
	"Vance.Resort.Towel": "Drying off. Equipment maintenance. Sand is bad for the mechanism.",
	"Vance.Resort.Umbrella": "Visual obstruction. Moving to clear air. I need sightlines.",
	"Vance.Resort.Wander": "Patrolling the coastline. Securing the perimeter. Go have fun, I've got this.",
	"Vance.SummitEvent": "Look at this vantage point. We could hold off an army from up here. ...But looking at it with you, I just see the beauty.",
	"Vance.Engagement.0": "I've started drafting the security protocols for the ceremony. Don't worry, it'll be tasteful.",
	"Vance.Engagement.1": "Packing my gear to move into the farm. It feels good to finally have a permanent base.",
	"Vance.SpouseFarmhouseClutter": "Obstacles in the hallway. Tripping hazards in a midnight breach. Clear this up, please.",
	"Vance.Spouse_MonstersInHouse": "Slimes inside the perimeter! Stand back, I'm neutralizing the threat!",
	"Vance.Marriage.SpouseStardrop": "I found this on patrol. It felt... important. I want you to have it. It's safe.",
	"Vance.Marriage.Spring": "Spring means thaw. New tracks. But it also means new crops. You handle the dirt, I'll handle the shadows.",
	"Vance.Marriage.Summer": "Heat makes people sloppy. Not us. Keep your hydration up out there today.",
	"Vance.Marriage.Fall": "The harvest is coming in. Our supplies are looking solid for winter. Good tactical planning.",
	"Vance.Marriage.Winter": "The cold is brutal, but the farmhouse is secure. We hold the line together.",
	"Vance.Patio": "Calibrating my optics. The fresh air helps clear the static.",
	"Vance.Rainy_Day_0": "Visibility is down. I'll take the first watch today.",
	"Vance.Rainy_Day_1": "Listen to the rain on the roof. Reminds me of the barracks, but... warmer.",
	"Vance.Rainy_Day_2": "I oiled your tools this morning. Rust never sleeps.",
	"Vance.Rainy_Day_3": "Mud on the boots. Leave them at the door. We don't want to track the outside in.",
	"Vance.Rainy_Day_4": "The crops are watering themselves today. Rest your muscles. That's an order.",
	"Vance.Rainy_Day_5": "A good day to review the emergency rations and inventory.",
	"Vance.Indoor_Day_0": "Perimeter is secure. The coffee is hot. Good morning.",
	"Vance.Indoor_Day_1": "I swept the house for drafts. We're losing heat in the east window. I'll patch it.",
	"Vance.Indoor_Day_2": "You look well-rested. That's a tactical advantage.",
	"Vance.Indoor_Day_3": "I'm reviewing the seasonal budget. We have enough surplus for an upgrade if you want one.",
	"Vance.Indoor_Day_4": "Just watching you work. You have a very... efficient routine. I admire that.",
	"Vance.Indoor_Day_5": "Take a break, Farmer. The farm will still be there in ten minutes.",
	"Vance.Rainy_Night_0": "The storm's picking up. Doors are locked and bolted. You're safe.",
	"Vance.Rainy_Night_1": "Storms mask the sound of approach. I'll sleep light tonight.",
	"Vance.Rainy_Night_2": "Get by the fire. You're shivering. I won't have you catching a cold.",
	"Vance.Rainy_Night_3": "I love the smell of the ozone. It means the air is clearing.",
	"Vance.Rainy_Night_4": "No night ops in this weather. Stay in bed.",
	"Vance.Rainy_Night_5": "I checked the roof for leaks. We're solid.",
	"Vance.Indoor_Night_0": "End of the day. Equipment stowed. Time to power down.",
	"Vance.Indoor_Night_1": "You pushed yourself hard today. Let me massage those shoulders. Muscle cramps are a liability.",
	"Vance.Indoor_Night_2": "The valley is quiet tonight. It's a hard-earned peace.",
	"Vance.Indoor_Night_3": "I was reading an old field manual. Turns out, your company is much more engaging.",
	"Vance.Indoor_Night_4": "Lockdown complete. It's just you and me now.",
	"Vance.Indoor_Night_5": "Sleep well. I've got the watch.",
	"Vance.funLeave": "I need to do a perimeter sweep of town. Maintain radio silence until I return.",
	"Vance.funReturn": "Sweep complete. Town is secure. Good to be back at base.",
	"Vance.Outdoor_General": "Just checking the fence line. All clear.",
	"Vance.Outdoor_0": "The crops are looking strong. You run a tight ship.",
	"Vance.Outdoor_1": "Found some rabbit tracks. No signs of predators.",
	"Vance.Outdoor_2": "Breathe in that air. No smog, no smoke. Just earth.",
	"Vance.Outdoor_3": "I patched a hole in the coop. The livestock are secure.",
	"Vance.Outdoor_4": "Sun's out. Keep your eyes shielded.",
	"Vance.spouseRoom": "I keep my gear organized. Don't touch the ordnance, and we'll be fine.",
	"Vance.OneKid_0": "I was just teaching the kid some basic camouflage techniques. You never know.",
	"Vance.OneKid_1": "They're sleeping. I checked the window locks twice. They're safe.",
	"Vance.OneKid_2": "Being a father... it's the highest-stakes mission I've ever taken.",
	"Vance.OneKid_3": "The baby cried. I secured the perimeter, but I think it was just a bad dream.",
	"Vance.OneKid_4": "They have your eyes. And my situational awareness. A formidable combination.",
	"Vance.TwoKids_0": "Two of them now. We need to establish a buddy system.",
	"Vance.TwoKids_1": "I caught them trying to organize my ammo by caliber. I was... surprisingly proud.",
	"Vance.TwoKids_2": "Our squad is growing. The farmhouse feels full.",
	"Vance.TwoKids_3": "Raising kids is harder than basic training. Less sleep, more crying.",
	"Vance.TwoKids_4": "They're playing in the yard. I have optics on them at all times.",
	"Vance.Good_0": "You make me better. I didn't think that was possible.",
	"Vance.Good_1": "Every day with you is a successful operation.",
	"Vance.Good_2": "I trust you implicitly. That's not something I say lightly.",
	"Vance.Good_3": "I've stopped looking over my shoulder as much. You're my peace.",
	"Vance.Good_4": "I cooked breakfast. High protein. Eat up.",
	"Vance.Good_5": "I love you. Acknowledged and confirmed.",
	"Vance.Good_6": "The farm is thriving. You're thriving. I'm content.",
	"Vance.Good_7": "You're the only person who can sneak up on me.",
	"Vance.Good_8": "I used to fight to survive. Now I fight to protect this life we've built.",
	"Vance.Good_9": "You're my partner. In everything.",
	"Vance.Neutral_0": "Status nominal.",
	"Vance.Neutral_1": "Just running inventory in my head.",
	"Vance.Neutral_2": "The weather is holding steady.",
	"Vance.Neutral_3": "I need to clean my boots later.",
	"Vance.Neutral_4": "Did you check the mail? I'm expecting parts.",
	"Vance.Neutral_5": "Just a standard day in the valley.",
	"Vance.Neutral_6": "I'll handle the chores on the east side today.",
	"Vance.Neutral_7": "Remember to drink water.",
	"Vance.Neutral_8": "All quiet on the farm.",
	"Vance.Neutral_9": "I'm here if you need me.",
	"Vance.Bad_0": "I need space. Tactical retreat.",
	"Vance.Bad_1": "We are out of sync today.",
	"Vance.Bad_2": "My stress levels are elevated. Don't push me.",
	"Vance.Bad_3": "This house feels like a bunker right now. And not in a good way.",
	"Vance.Bad_4": "I'm doing drills in my head to avoid an argument.",
	"Vance.Bad_5": "Communication breakdown. We need to fix this.",
	"Vance.Bad_6": "I'm going to the firing range. I need to blow off steam.",
	"Vance.Bad_7": "Leave me alone for a while. I'm a liability when I'm angry.",
	"Vance.Bad_8": "This isn't working right now.",
	"Vance.Bad_9": "Silence is better than collateral damage.",
	"Vance.Event.Intro.1": "Hold it. One step closer and you trigger the tripwire.",
	"Vance.Event.Intro.2": "You've got that dust on your boots. Gray dust. Copper smell.",
	"Vance.Event.Intro.3": "You've been down there, haven't you? In the Mines.",
	"Vance.Event.Intro.4": "Your Grandfather... he knew the risks of digging that deep. He respected the mountain. He didn't just plunder it.",
	"Vance.Event.Intro.5": "Fine. If you're going to poke the hornet's nest, you'll need bigger boots. I'll open the stock.",
	"Vance.Event.4Heart.1": "Hold. Pop quiz, Farmer. Situation: Three Shadow Grunts breach the north perimeter.",
	"Vance.Event.4Heart.2": "You have a rusty sword and ten seconds. What is your priority?",
	"Vance.Event.4Heart.Q": "Response?",
	"Vance.Event.4Heart.A1": "Sound the alarm and alert the town.",
	"Vance.Event.4Heart.A2": "Charge them head-on.",
	"Vance.Event.4Heart.A3": "Barricade the choke point.",
	"Vance.Event.4Heart.R1": "Correct. Information is ammunition. Heroics get you killed. Communication saves lives.",
	"Vance.Event.4Heart.R2": "Reckless. You'd be dead in four seconds. We don't need martyrs, we need soldiers.",
	"Vance.Event.4Heart.R3": "Acceptable. Containment is a valid strategy. Just make sure the barricade holds.",
	"Vance.Event.6Heart.1": "Get down! Incoming!",
	"Vance.Event.6Heart.2": "They're in the trees... I can hear them chittering...",
	"Vance.Event.6Heart.3": "...Wait. No. Just wind. Just the wind.",
	"Vance.Event.6Heart.4": "...You didn't see that. Clear out, civilian. I said move!",
	"Vance.Event.8Heart.1": "Get down! They're bracketing our position! Incoming!",
	"Vance.Event.8Heart.2": "Stay back! I can't find my rifle. I can't find it!",
	"Vance.Event.8Heart.3": "Just thunder? ...No. No, I know that sound. I... I can smell the cordite.",
	"Vance.Event.8Heart.4": "It never stops, @. Even when it's quiet. The noise never stops.",
	"Vance.Event.8Heart.5": "Your Grandfather... he told me the valley would heal me. He lied.",
	"Vance.Event.8Heart.6": "Alone. Yeah. That's how I lost the arm. I thought compassion was a weakness, so I locked everyone out to stay strong. But holding this wall alone is just killing me slower. ...Maybe I need a new strategy. A partner.",
	"Vance.Event.8Heart.7": "Sit with me? Just until the rain stops? Please.",
